<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PSA" style="id">ISHP Agwara Kambari [asg]</book>
  <para style="toc3">Ishp</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ishipa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ishipa</para>
  <para style="mt2">KATAGARDA</para>
  <para style="mt">ISHIPA</para>
  <para style="imt">KUƁA̱YUWA̱</para>
  <para style="im">Katagarda ki Ishipa, ɗaɗa katagarda ki i ishipa n ka avasa a katagarda ka ciɗa. Uma kakau ɗa a ɗanai a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka makyan n a̱bunda̱i. Ishipa i nampa n avasa a, aza a Isaraila o ɓolongu ta̱ i ɗa a̱ ka̱na̱i kuyaꞋan ulinga n i ɗa a̱ ubuta̱ u kucikpa u le. A ukocishi, o ɓolongi i ɗa n atagarda o kutoni.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ishipa yi uɗani i nampa n ya avasa i ta̱ u pecekushi. Ishipa i kucikpa Ka̱shile yi ta̱ lo, n yi una̱singai u Ka̱shile. Avasa a̱ kula̱nsa̱ uɓa̱nki i ta̱ lo, n a̱ kula̱nsa̱ ukeɗi n wishi. Avasa a̱ kula̱nsa̱ kucinukpa ku unushi, n a̱ kula̱nsa̱ a takacika irala. Avasa a̱ kula̱nsa̱ ugboji wi ida̱shi i ta̱ lo. Avasa a nwalu a kubana a̱ ubuta̱ u kucikpa i ta̱ lo n a kuzuwa ku mogono.</para>
  <para style="ip">Avasa a nampa ra̱ka̱ adama a vuma te n uma ra̱ka̱ ɗa. Aza o yoku a kudana tsu na vuma wi a kupana a̱ ka̱ɗu ka̱ ni, aza o yoku tankpamu a kudana ili i na uma a̱ Ka̱shile i a kuciga n tsu na uma i a kupana.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yesu u yaꞋan ta̱ ulinga n ishipa. Aza a na a ɗanai uzuwakpani u savu a yaꞋan ta̱ ulinga n i ɗa, kpamu a yaꞋan ta̱ ulinga n i ɗa a iɗanishi i le. Ili i na i ɗikai a makyan ma na a̱ ciya̱i aza o kutoni, ɗa katagarda ka ishipa ko okpoi katagarda ka tsugbayin n ka kucikpa.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ili i na yi punu</para>
  <para style="ip">Ishipa amangatawun n amangerenkupa i ɗa, ɗa kpamu e peciki katagarda ka ugboku u tawun, tsu na i ugeri ɗanna.</para>
  <para style="io1">Ishipa 1-41</para>
  <para style="io1">Ishipa 42-72</para>
  <para style="io1">Ishipa 73-89</para>
  <para style="io1">Ishipa 90-106</para>
  <para style="io1">Ishipa (107-150)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PSA 1" />
  <para style="ms">Katagarda ka iyain</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="PSA 1-41">Ishp 1--41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s1">Ma̱za̱nga̱ ma mayun</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 1:1" />Vuza vu ma̱za̱nga̱ ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:1">vuza na u tsu tono odoki a uma a gbani-gbani ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 1:1">ko u tono uye wa aza a unushi ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:1">ko u gbaɓa kaci n aza ulami ba.<verse eid="PSA 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 1:2" />Ama wi ta̱ a kupana uyoꞋo u tono wila̱ u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:2">wi ta̱ e kusheshe ku wila̱ wa a̱ ka̱ɗu ka̱ ni kanna n kayin.<verse eid="PSA 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 1:3" />Wi ta̱ tsu maɗanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:3">ma na a̱ shikpa̱i a̱ iga̱Ꞌin i mini,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 1:3">ma na ma tsu matsa a makyan ma̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:3">kpamu a̱vuku a̱ ni e ci ɗekpe ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 1:3">u tsu ciya̱ ta̱ ulyaꞋi a ili i na u yaꞋin dem.<verse eid="PSA 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 1:4" />Ama uma a gbani-gbani i nannai ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:4">I ta̱ tsu kopo ka na wunla̱i u tsu pura̱ngu.<verse eid="PSA 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 1:5" />Ka̱shile ta na ki ta̱ a kutakacika uma a gbani-gbani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:5">aza a unushi tamkpamu u pece le n uma a singai.<verse eid="PSA 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 1:6" />Adama a na Vuzavaguɗu wi ta̱ a̱ kula̱na̱ ukuna u uma a usuɓi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:6">Ama ulinga u uma a gbani-gbani wi ta̱ a kubanka le a̱ ukpisa̱.<verse eid="PSA 1:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PSA 2" />
  <para style="s1">Mogono ma na Ka̱shile ka zagbai</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 2:1" />Yiɗa̱i i zuwai uduniyan wi e kusheshe ka gbani-gbani?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:1">Yiɗa̱i i zuwai ɗa uma i o kufoɓuso ka a gbani-gbani ka na a̱ kuciya̱ ili ba?<verse eid="PSA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 2:2" />Yiɗa̱i i zuwai ɗa ngono ma aduniyan o foɓusoi kuvon?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:2">Yiɗa̱i i zuwai ɗa aza o tsugono o ɓolongi ka̱ci ke le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:2">a kuyaꞋanka Vuzavaguɗu ugbami u kaci m mogono ma na wu erengi.<verse eid="PSA 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 2:3" />A danai,&lt;&lt;YaꞋan tsu uta̱ka̱ ka̱ci ka̱ tsu o tsugono ci le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:3">n tsugono tsu Vuzavaguɗu koɓolo n mogono ma na u zagbai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:3">tsu fa̱ta̱tsa̱ ekiye e le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 2:4" />Ama ɗa Vuzavaguɗu u zoꞋosoi le ɗe gaɗi a kakuba ko tsugono ci ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:4">u bonokoi le ili yi izoshi.<verse eid="PSA 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 2:5" />Ɗa u ɓarangi le n wupa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:5">wupa u ni u zuwai le a̱ rikpa̱i.<verse eid="PSA 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 2:6" />U danai, &lt;&lt;A Sihiyona kusan ku ciɗa ku va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:6">ɗa n zuwai mogono ma̱ va̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 2:7" />Ɗa mogono ma, ma danai, mi ta̱ a kusala ili i na Vuzavaguɗu u danai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:7">U danai mu,&lt;&lt;Avu maku ma̱ va̱ maꞋa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:7">anana mo okpo ta̱ esheku a̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 2:8" />Folono mu, mi ta̱ e kuneke wu iɗika ra̱ka̱ yi okpo ili yi uka̱ni i nu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 2:8">Ka̱ta̱ aduniyan okpo upecu u nu. <verse eid="PSA 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 2:9" />Vi ta̱ a kulyaꞋaka le tsugono n kalangu ka̱ viyum,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:9">vu ɓoso le miri-miri tsu mogbodo ma̱ ciꞋin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 2:10" />Adama a nannai, yaꞋin cicoꞋo, a̱ɗa̱ ngono,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:10">i vaꞋanku a̱ɗu a̱ ɗa̱, a̱ɗa̱ aza o tsugono.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:10">I bonoko a̱ɗu a̱ ɗa̱ ubuta̱ u te,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:10">a̱ɗa̱ aza o tsugono tsa aduniyan.<verse eid="PSA 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 2:11" />YaꞋankai Vuzavaguɗu tsugbashi n wovon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:11">i yaꞋan ma̱za̱nga̱ n i jeꞋekei ikyamba,<verse eid="PSA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 2:12" />Kuɗa̱ngi i lyaꞋaka maku ma<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">maku ma </char><char style="ft" closed="false">N kelentsu ka Yahuda kakuna ka ka̱ uta̱ e keteshe ba</char></note> kayala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:12">adama a na ka̱ta̱ u yaꞋan wupa i kuwa̱ ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:12">adama a na wupa u ni wi ta̱ a kufuɗa kuɗa̱nga̱ n kute,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 2:12">Aza a̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ a ɗa aza a na a banai wa̱ a̱ ni kula̱nsa̱ ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku.<verse eid="PSA 2:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PSA 3" />
  <para style="s1">Avasa a usana a̱ kula̱nsa̱ uɓa̱nki</para>
  <para style="d">Vishipa vu Dawuda a makyan ma na u sumai a̱ a̱shi a Abusalom kolobo ka̱ ni.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 3:1" />Vuzavaguɗu, irala i va̱ yi ta̱ n a̱bunda̱i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:1">aza a na i a tsurala nu mpa a yimkpa ta̱.<verse eid="PSA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 3:2" />n a̱bunda̱i i ta̱ a kadanshi ka̱ va̱, a kudana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:2">&lt;&lt;Ka̱shile ka ku isa yi ba.&gt;&gt;<char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 3:3" />Ama avu Vuzavaguɗu, avu ɗa vi a̱ kula̱na̱ mu a̱ ubuta̱ dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:3">avu ɗa vi ci neke mu ulyaꞋi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:3">vi kpamu e kuneke mu utsura u ka̱ɗu.<verse eid="PSA 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 3:4" />N ci yaꞋan ta̱ meɗevile u Vuzavaguɗu adama a̱ uɓa̱nki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:4">u tsu ushuki mu ta̱ ta na a kusan ku ciɗa ku ni.<char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 3:5" />N tsu vaku ta̱ n lata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:5">ka̱ta̱ n ɗa̱nga̱ gbaga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:5">adama a na Vuzavaguɗu ɗa wi a̱ kula̱na̱ mu.<verse eid="PSA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 3:6" />Mi a kupana wovon u uma a̱kpa̱n-a̱kpa̱n ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:6">aza a na i a tsurala nu mpa ukambu dem.<verse eid="PSA 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 3:7" />Ɗa̱nga̱, Vuzavaguɗu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:7">Vu isa mu Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 3:7">Vu lyaꞋa irala i va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:7">vu una uma a gbani-gbani ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 3:8" />Wishi u tsu ta̱wa̱ ta̱ u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:8">yaꞋan u zuwaka uma a̱ ni una̱singai.<char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 3:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PSA 4" />
  <para style="s1">Avasa a̱ kulivi adama a uɓa̱nki</para>
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: A yaꞋan vu ɗa n aꞋin a umolu. Vishipa vu Dawuda</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 4:1" />Ushuku mu a ayin a na baci n yaꞋin meɗevile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:1">Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 4:1">Makyan ma na mi a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka atakaci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:1">vu okpo ka̱ɓa̱nki ka̱ va̱.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:1">YaꞋanka mu kasingai, vu pana avasa a̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 4:2" />A̱ɗa̱ uma a nampa, wannai ɗai i ku ka̱sukpa̱ kula̱nga̱sa̱ kula ku va̱?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:2">Ali n wannai ɗai i ku ka̱sukpa̱ ku ciga ili gbani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:2">n kutono ki ili ya aꞋuwa? <char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 4:3" />I yeve a na Vuzavaguɗu ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:3">u zagbakai ka̱ci ka̱ ni aza a usuɓi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:3">Vuzavaguɗu wi ta̱ a kupana ka mu ayin a na baci n ɗekei ni.<verse eid="PSA 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 4:4" />I yaꞋan baci wupa, ka̱ta̱ i ka̱sukpa̱ u zuwa ɗa̱ i yaꞋan unushi ba.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:4">i sheshe mayin a̱ɗu a̱ ɗa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:4">a makyan ma na baci i vaki a ivaꞋamkpatsu i ɗa̱.<char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 4:5" />Nekei Vuzavaguɗu alyuka a na o yotsoi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:5">ka̱ta̱ i zuwa a̱ɗu a̱ ɗa̱ wa̱ a̱ ni.<verse eid="PSA 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 4:6" />Uma n a̱bunda̱i i ta̱ lo a kudansa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:6">&lt;&lt;Ishi baci a ku zuwaka tsu una̱singai?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:6">Vuzavaguɗu, indana tsu n asuvayali a̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 4:7" />Ma̱za̱nga̱ ma na vu nekei mu mi ta̱ n a̱bunda̱i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:7">ali ma laꞋi aza a na i n ilikulya n ma̱kya̱n n a̱bunda̱i.<verse eid="PSA 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 4:8" />Mi ta̱ a kuvaku, n lata m ma̱ta̱na̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:8">adama a na avu ɗa koci Vuzavaguɗu vi e ku ere mu.<verse eid="PSA 4:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="PSA 5" />
  <para style="s1">Avasa a̱ kula̱nsa̱ uɓa̱nki</para>
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: Vishipa vu Dawuda: a kubana u ma̱zuɓi ma kulika̱ igbala.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 5:1" />Vuzavaguɗu, zuwa atsuvu vu pana kadanshi ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:1">Ka̱ta̱ vu la̱na̱ kusheshe ku ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 5:2" />Mogono ma̱ va̱ n Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:2">pana ma̱shi ma̱ va̱ ma̱ kula̱nsa̱ uɓa̱nki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:2">adama a na wa̱ a̱ nu u ɗa mi a kuyaꞋan avasa.<verse eid="PSA 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 5:3" />Mi ta̱ a kuyaꞋan avasa wa̱ a̱ nu Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:3">m kpasani vi ta̱ a kupana avasa a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:3">n kanna vi ta̱ a kupana ufolu u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:3">ka̱ta̱ n vana wu ushuki.<verse eid="PSA 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 5:4" />Adama a na avu Ka̱shile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:4">vu tsu pana uyoꞋo u ka gbani-gbani ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:4">vu tsu ka̱sukpa̱ uma a gbani-gbani a̱ ta̱wa̱ wa̱ a̱ nu ba.<verse eid="PSA 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 5:5" />Aza a̱ra̱ɗi a kushamgba e kelime ka̱ nu ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:5">vu tsu iwan ta̱ aza a kuyaꞋan kagbanigbani.<verse eid="PSA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 5:6" />Vu tsu una ta̱ aza aꞋuwa dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:6">vu tsu ene ta̱ unata wa aza a munuka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:6">n aza o modoruko.<verse eid="PSA 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 5:7" />Ama mpa, adama a ucigi u nu u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:7">mi ta̱ a kuꞋuwa a kpaꞋa ku nu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 5:7">n uwa A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin a ciɗa a̱ nu n cikpa wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:7">n kuɗa̱ngu e kelime ka̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 5:8" />Vuzavaguɗu, tono nu mpa a uye wu usuɓi u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:8">adama a na irala i va̱ i yimkpa ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:8">yotsongu mu uye u nu e keteshe ciya̱ n tono.<verse eid="PSA 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 5:9" />I n kamayun a una̱ u le ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:9">a̱ɗu e le i ta̱ tukpa n ukuna u munuka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 5:9">ogboroli e le asaun a ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:9">elentsu e le kpamu kadanshi ka aꞋuwa kaꞋa koci.<verse eid="PSA 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 5:10" />Ka̱shile, kece le aza a unushi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:10">yaꞋan kagbanigbani ke le ko bono a kaci ke le.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 5:10">Loko le kelime ka̱ nu, adama a unushi wa̱ a̱bunda̱i u le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:10">adama a na a yaꞋanka wu ta̱ ugbamukaci.<verse eid="PSA 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 5:11" />YaꞋan aza a na e sheɗeki wa̱ a̱ nu, a yaꞋan ma̱za̱nga̱.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:11">yaꞋan a̱ ka̱na̱ kuyaꞋan ishipa adama a̱ ma̱za̱nga̱.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 5:11">Vu inda le n ka̱ci ka̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:11">adama aza a na a cigai kula ku nu dem</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:11">a yaꞋan ma̱za̱nga̱ adama a̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 5:12" />Mayun, Vuzavaguɗu vu zuwaka ta̱ aza a usuɓi una̱singai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:12">kasingai ka̱ nu kaꞋa ka kanzai le tsu ma̱ra̱ga̱.<verse eid="PSA 5:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="PSA 6" />
  <para style="s1">Avasa a̱ kula̱nsa̱ uɓa̱nki a makyan ma atakaci</para>
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: A yaꞋan vu ɗa n aꞋin a umolu. A yaꞋan vu ɗa n ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ka Shimenitu. Vishipa vu Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 6:1" />Vuzavaguɗu ka̱ta̱ vu ɓarangu mu a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka wupa u nu ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:1">ka̱ta̱ vu gbara mu a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka wupa wu usuɗukpi u nu ba.<verse eid="PSA 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 6:2" />Pana asuvayali a̱ va̱ adama a na mo oꞋwo ta̱ ka̱u,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:2">neke mu utsura adama a na mo okpo ta̱ luɓa̱.<verse eid="PSA 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 6:3" />Vuzavaguɗu, ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ ko voɗotso ta̱ ka̱u,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:3">ali wannai ɗai n kuka̱na̱ kuvana wu?<verse eid="PSA 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 6:4" />Ta̱wa̱, Vuzavaguɗu vu isa mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:4">isa mu adama ucigi u nu u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba.<verse eid="PSA 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 6:5" />A̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka̱ a̱kpisa̱ yayi u kuciɓa n avu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:5">Ko vuza u kucikpa wu a kasaun ba.<verse eid="PSA 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 6:6" />Mo oꞋwo ta̱ ka̱u adama una̱mgbi u ka̱tsuma̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:6">Kayin dem ivaꞋamkpatsu i va̱ i tsu ta̱na̱ ta̱ adama a̱ ma̱shi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:6">ubuta̱ u ku gbasatangu kaci ka̱ va̱ u ta̱na̱i adama a kujilya.<verse eid="PSA 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 6:7" />A̱shi a̱ va̱ a shitasa ta̱ adama a̱ ma̱shi ma̱ a̱bunda̱i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:7">ali a̱shi a̱ va̱ o doku ene uye ba, adama a irala i va̱.<verse eid="PSA 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 6:8" />Ka̱sukpa̱i mu, a̱ɗa̱ aza a ka gbani-gbani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:8">adama a na Vuzavaguɗu u pana ta̱ ma̱shi ma̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 6:9" />Vuzavaguɗu u pana ta̱ ufolu u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:9">wu isa ta̱ avasa a̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 6:10" />Irala i va̱ ra̱ka̱ i ta̱ a kupana wono ali e jeꞋeke ikyamba.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:10">I ta̱ a kukpatala n kafura, adama o wono wa̱ a̱bunda̱i.<verse eid="PSA 6:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="PSA 7" />
  <para style="s1">Avasa a̱ kula̱nsa̱ afada a usuɓi.</para>
  <para style="d">A yaꞋan vu ɗa n ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ka Shigiyonotu. Vishipa vu Dawuda vu na u yaꞋankai Vuzavaguɗu adama a̱ Kushi vuza vu aza a Bayami.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 7:1" />Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱, wa̱ a̱ nu u ɗa mi a̱ kula̱nsa̱ ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:1">Wawa mu ka̱ta̱ vu isa mu ekiye aza a na i a̱ kula̱nsa̱ wuma u va̱,<verse eid="PSA 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 7:2" />Ta baci nannai ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:2">i ta̱ a kubanka mu a̱ ubuta̱ u na babu vuza na u ku isa mu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:2">Ta ɗe a ku sazasa mu tsu na kawu u tsu saza vuma.<verse eid="PSA 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 7:3" />Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱, ɗa baci n yaꞋin ili i ite a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ki ili i nampa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:3">ali a̱ ciya̱ mu n unushi,<verse eid="PSA 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 7:4" />ko n yaꞋankai ka̱ja̱Ꞌa̱ ka̱ va̱ ka gbani-gbani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:4">ko ɗa baci n lyaꞋi utsura u vurala vu va̱ babu unushi.<verse eid="PSA 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 7:5" />YaꞋan Irala i va̱ i guva mu ali a̱ ka̱na̱ mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:5">ka̱ta̱ a dasa mu a iɗika,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:5">a̱ ka̱sukpa̱ mu punu a iɗika ya ukpa̱.<char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 7:6" />Vuzavaguɗu, ɗa̱nga̱ n wupa u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:6">vu yaꞋan tsurala n wupa wu irala i va̱.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:6">Ɗa̱nga̱ vu isa mu, vu yaꞋan afada a usuɓi.<verse eid="PSA 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 7:7" />YaꞋan o ɓolongu uduniyan ra̱ka̱ wa̱ a̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:7">vu lyaꞋa tsugono tsu le ɗe gaɗi.<verse eid="PSA 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 7:8" />Vuzavaguɗu avu ɗa vu ci yaꞋanka uma afada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:8">Vuzavaguɗu yaꞋanka mu afada tsu usuɓi u va̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:8">adama a na mi n unushi ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:8">mi ta̱ kpamu n ma̱riki.<verse eid="PSA 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 7:9" />Avu Ka̱shile ka ciɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:9">avu na vu tsu la̱na̱ kusheshe ku vuma n ka̱ɗu ka̱ ni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 7:9">Vu shamgbatangu ka gbani-gbani ka uma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:9">ka̱ta̱ vu zuwa uma a̱ usuɓi a tsurukpa.<verse eid="PSA 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 7:10" />Ka̱shile kaꞋa ma̱ra̱ga̱ ma̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:10">u tsu isa ta̱ aza a na o tsu tono yi.<verse eid="PSA 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 7:11" />Ka̱shile kayaꞋinkafada ka̱ usuɓi kaꞋa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:11">u tsu takacika ta̱ uma a gbani-gbani makyan dem.<verse eid="PSA 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 7:12" />Ɗa baci uma a̱ kpa̱ɗa̱i kushika̱ unushi u le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:12">Ka̱shile ki ta̱ e ku temgbe kotokobi ka̱ ni.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:12">u lapula ta̱ ɗe utan u ni.<verse eid="PSA 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 7:13" />U foɓuso ta̱ ɗe ucanuku u kuvon u ni u tsukono,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:13">Ɗa u gisanki ayaꞋa akina a̱ ni.<verse eid="PSA 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 7:14" />La̱na̱ tsu na uma a gbani-gbani e kusheshe a̱ɗu e le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:14">O kufoɓuso ukuna wa atakaci kpamu a kuyaꞋan aꞋuwa.<verse eid="PSA 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 7:15" />A̱ ga̱va̱ ta̱ kpenle ku uga̱vi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:15">ɗa a kucikpa a̱ yikpa̱i punu.<verse eid="PSA 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 7:16" />O foɓusokoi aza o yoku kawuya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:16">ama ɗa ko bonoi a kaci ke le.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:16">o foɓusoi vishili, ɗanna vu bonoi a kaci ke le.<verse eid="PSA 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 7:17" />N cikpa ta̱ Vuzavaguɗu adama afada e mejege a̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:17">mi ta̱ a kuyaꞋan ishipa i kucikpa u Vuzavaguɗu MalaꞋimili.<verse eid="PSA 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="PSA 8" />
  <para style="s1">Tsugbayin tsu Ka̱shile n vuma</para>
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: Vishipa vu Dawuda: a kubana u ma̱zuɓi a yaꞋan vu ɗa tsu na &lt;&lt;Giti.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 8:1" />Vuzavaguɗu, Vuzavaguɗu tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:1">e yeve ta̱ tsugbayin tsu nu a̱ ubuta̱ dem aduniyan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 8:1">avu na ucikpi u nu u yawai ɗe gaɗi,<verse eid="PSA 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 8:2" />Muku nu nreɓu a kucikpa wu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 8:2">ucikpi u nu wo okpo ta̱ mashilya a irala i nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:2">adama a na a shamgbatangu irala i nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:2">n aza a na i a kuciga kutsupa.<verse eid="PSA 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 8:3" />Ana mi indai gaɗi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:3">ulinga we ekiye a̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:3">wotoi n azangata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:3">a na vu zuwai a̱ ubuta̱ wi ida̱shi i le.<verse eid="PSA 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 8:4" />Ɗa n danai, yayi vuma ali vi a̱ kusa̱Ꞌa̱ yi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:4">Yayi vuma vu lima̱ ali vi a̱ kula̱na̱ yi?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 144:3">Ishp 144:3</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 2:6">A Ib 2:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="PSA 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 8:5" />N nannai dem, avu ɗa baci ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:5">babu ili i na i laꞋi vuma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:5">ali vu nekei ni tsugbayin n ucikpi.<verse eid="PSA 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 8:6" />Vu zuwai ni u lyaꞋa tsugono ci ili i na vu yaꞋin dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:6">Vu zuwai ili ra̱ka̱ yi okpoi ekiye a vuma,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:27">1 Kor 15:27</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 1:22">Af 1:22</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 2:8">A Ib 2:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="PSA 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 8:7" />nu nlala n anaka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:7">nu nnama n kakamba feu,<verse eid="PSA 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 8:8" />nu nnu n adan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:8">ni ili i wuma i mini ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 8:9" />Vuzavaguɗu, Vuzavaguɗu tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:9">e yeve ta̱ tsugbayin tsu nu a̱ ubuta̱ dem aduniyan.<verse eid="PSA 8:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="PSA 9" />
  <para style="s1">Ucikpi u Ka̱shile adama afada a mayun.</para>
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: Vishipa vu Dawuda: a kubana u ma̱zuɓi, a yaꞋan vu ɗa tsu ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ka &lt;&lt;Ukpa̱ u maku ma̱ va̱.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 9:1" />Vuzavaguɗu, mi ta̱ a kucikpa wu n ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:1">mi ta̱ a kudansa ili i mereve i na vu yain.<verse eid="PSA 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 9:2" />MalaꞋimili dem, mi ta̱ a kuyaꞋan ma̱za̱nga̱ adama a̱ nu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:2">Mi ta̱ a kuyaꞋan ishipa n cikpa kula ku nu.<verse eid="PSA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 9:3" />Irala i va̱ i bono ta̱ n ka̱ca̱pa̱ ana ene nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:3">a̱ yikpa̱i ɗa a̱ kuwa̱i.<verse eid="PSA 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 9:4" />Avu na vi kayaꞋinkafada ka usuɓi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:4">vu da̱sa̱ngi a kakuba ko tsugono ka̱ nu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:4">vu yaꞋin afada a na a yaꞋin mu derere.<verse eid="PSA 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 9:5" />Vu ɓarangi uduniyan.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:5">ɗa vu unai uma a gbani-gbani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:5">vu urai ula e le ko wannai.<verse eid="PSA 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 9:6" />Unai irala i tsu ko wannai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:6">vu mutsukpa̱i likuci-likuci i le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:6">a cinukpai n ula e le gbende-gbende.<verse eid="PSA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 9:7" />Ama Vuzavaguɗu mogono maꞋa ko wannai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:7">u zuwa ta̱ kakuba ko tsugono ci ni adama afada.<verse eid="PSA 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 9:8" />Wi ta̱ a kuyaꞋanka aduniyan afada a usuɓi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:8">a kukiɗaka uduniyan afada derere.<verse eid="PSA 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 9:9" />Vuzavaguɗu ɗa ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku wa aza a na a takacikai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:9">ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku u ɗa a makyan ma atakaci.<verse eid="PSA 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 9:10" />Vuzavaguɗu, aza a na e yevei nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:10">i ta̱ a kuzuwa a̱ɗu e le wa̱ a̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:10">vu tsu varuku vuza na u ta̱wa̱i wa̱ a̱ nu ba.<verse eid="PSA 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 9:11" />Cikpai Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:11">vuza na wi o tsugono tsu Sihiyona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:11">danai uduniyan ili i na u yain.<verse eid="PSA 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 9:12" />Ka̱shile ki ta̱ a kuciɓa n aza a na i atakaci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:12">u tsu cinukpa m ma̱shi me le ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:12">ama u tsu takacika ta̱ aza a na i o kudoro le.<verse eid="PSA 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 9:13" />Vuzavaguɗu, pana asuvayali a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:13">la̱na̱ tsu na irala i va̱ yi a kuyaꞋanka mu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:13">Isa mu a̱ ubuta̱ wu ukpa̱, Vuzavaguɗu,<verse eid="PSA 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 9:14" />adama a na n cikpa wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:14">e kelime ka uma a Sihiyona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:14">ka̱ta̱ n yaꞋan ma̱za̱nga̱ adama a wishi u nu.<verse eid="PSA 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 9:15" />Uma a̱ ga̱va̱ ta̱ kpenle, ɗa a̱ yikpa̱i punu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:15">a dasai ayakuru e le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:15">ɗa ene e le a̱ cila̱i punu.<verse eid="PSA 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 9:16" />Vuzavaguɗu u zuwa ta̱ e yeve ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:16">a̱ ubuta̱ u kuyaꞋan ka afada a usuɓi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:16">uma a gbani-gbani a̱ ka̱na̱i ka̱ci ke le n ka na a yaꞋin.<char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 9:17" />Uma a gbani-gbani i ta̱ a̱ gida̱la̱ a kubana asaun e le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:17">ta feu nannai uduniyan u na u iwain Ka̱shile.<verse eid="PSA 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 9:18" />Makyan dem ɗa a kucinukpa n aza na i a kuciga uɓa̱nki ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:18">e kupece vuza vu u unambi n kukeɗe a̱pa̱Ꞌa̱ ba, ko wannai.<verse eid="PSA 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 9:19" />Vuzavaguɗu, ɗa̱nga̱!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:19">adama a na ka̱ta̱ uma a̱ ciya̱ ulyaꞋi wa̱ a̱ nu ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:19">yaꞋan a yaꞋanka uma a gbani-gbani afada e kelime ka̱ nu,<verse eid="PSA 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 9:20" />Vuzavaguɗu, zuwa le e jeꞋeke ikyamba adama o wovon.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:20">vu zuwa le e yeve a na e le uma a ɗa koci. <char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 9:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="PSA 10" />
  <para style="s1">Ma̱shi adama uma a gbani-gbani</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 10:1" />Vuzavaguɗu yiɗa̱i i zuwai vu shamgbai daꞋin?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:1">Yiɗa̱i i zuwai ɗa vu sokongi ka̱ci ka̱ nu a makyan ma na ci atakaci?<verse eid="PSA 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 10:2" />Uma a gbani-gbani i ta̱ a̱ra̱ɗi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:2">a kutakacika aza a unambi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:2">zuwa ka gbani-gbani ka na o foɓusoi ko bono a kaci ke le.<verse eid="PSA 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 10:3" />Uma a gbani-gbani a̱ra̱ɗi n kawuya ka na e sheshei a̱ɗu e le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:3">aza a ulyopi a tsu shika ta̱ Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:3">kpamu o tsu goyo yi ta̱.<verse eid="PSA 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 10:4" />Uma a gbani-gbani i ta̱ ugbamukaci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:4">a tsu ciɓa n Ka̱shile ba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 10:4">E kusheshe ku le dem, a tsu dana ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:4">&lt;&lt;Ka̱shile kilo ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 10:5" />Uma a gbani-gbani a ci lyaꞋa ta̱ kelime a ili i na i a kuyaꞋan dem.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:5">E kuyeve afada a̱ Ka̱shile ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:5">o tsu goyo ta̱ irala i le.<verse eid="PSA 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 10:6" />E kusheshe ku le a tsu dana ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:6">&lt;&lt;Kawuya ka̱ kuciya̱ tsu ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:6">ci tana a kutakacika ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 10:7" />Una̱ u le wi ta̱ tukpa n ishikushi, n aꞋuwa n mavura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:7">elentsu e le i ta̱ n ufa̱ka̱ u kadanshi ka gbani-gbani n kavama.<verse eid="PSA 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 10:8" />O tsu bopo ta̱ a n likuci n wawaꞋa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:8">una aza a babu unushi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 10:8">A̱shi e le i ta̱ a̱ ubuta̱ wa aza a babu utsura.<verse eid="PSA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 10:9" />A tsu vana ta̱ a̱ ubuta̱ u na o bopoi tsu kawu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 10:9">a kuvana aza a babu utsura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:9">n ayakuru e le a ɗa a̱ tsu ka̱na̱ aza a babu utsura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:9">ka̱ta̱ a laza n e le.<verse eid="PSA 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 10:10" />A tsu dasa ta̱ aza a babu utsura e kpete le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:10">o yotsongu le utsura ali a lyaꞋa le.<verse eid="PSA 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 10:11" />E ci sheshe ta̱ a dana, &lt;&lt;Kabura Ka̱shile ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:11">u pala ta̱ a̱shi a̱ ni wi e kene tsu ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 10:12" />Vuzavaguɗu, ta̱wa̱ vu wawa mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:12">Ka̱shile, ka̱ta̱ vu cinukpa n aza a na i a kutakacika ba.<verse eid="PSA 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 10:13" />Yiɗa̱i i zuwai ɗa uma a gbani-gbani o ogoyoi Ka̱shile?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:13">Ali i e kusheshe n a danai, &lt;&lt;Wi a kutakacika tsu ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 10:14" />Ama Vuzavaguɗu vi ta̱ e kene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:14">vi ta̱ kpamu a̱ kula̱na̱ aza atakaci n aza a una̱mgbi u ka̱tsuma̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:14">a makyan dem vi ta̱ ufoɓushi vu ɓa̱nka̱.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 10:14">Wa̱ a̱ nu u ɗa aza a babu utsura a tsu zuwa a̱ɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:14">avu ɗa vu tsu ɓa̱nka̱ mkpaꞋan.<verse eid="PSA 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 10:15" />Jebe utsura u uma a gbani-gbani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:15">takacika le adama a unushi u na a yaꞋin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:15">ali uta̱ka̱ ka gbani-gbani ke le e keteshe.<verse eid="PSA 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 10:16" />Vuzavaguɗu, mogono maꞋa ko wannai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:16">uduniyan u na u tonoi a̱ma̱li,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:16">i ta̱ a ku una le a iɗika ya.<verse eid="PSA 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 10:17" />Vuzavaguɗu, pana ma̱shi ma aza a babu utsura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:17">pana avasa e le, vu neke le utsura u ka̱ɗu.<verse eid="PSA 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 10:18" />Vu pana ta̱ ma̱shi ma mkpaꞋan n aza na i n utsura ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:18">vu yaꞋanka le afada a usuɓi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:18">adama a na ka̱ta̱ uma o doku e neke le wovon ba.<verse eid="PSA 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="PSA 11" />
  <para style="s1">Ku zuwa ku ka̱ɗu u Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: Vishipa vu Dawuda: a kubana u ma̱zuɓi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 11:1" />Vuzavaguɗu ɗa ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:1">adama a̱ n yiɗa̱i va ku dana mu:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:1">&lt;&lt;Imkpa tsu manunu a kubana a nsasan,<verse eid="PSA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 11:2" />Uma a gbani-gbani a lapula ta̱ utan u le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:2">kpamu a gisangi ayaꞋa e le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:2">adama a na a tawa uma a̱ ma̱riki punu a̱ ka̱yimbi.<verse eid="PSA 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 11:3" />Aza a usuɓi i a kufuɗa kuyaꞋan ili ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:3">Ɗa baci ili dem i na̱mgba̱i.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 11:4" />Vuzavaguɗu wi ta̱ A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin a ciɗa a̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:4">kakuba ko tsugono ci ni ki ta̱ ɗe gaɗi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 11:4">a̱shi a̱ ni a kindana uma a̱ ubuta̱ dem,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 11:4">a̱ kula̱na̱ ili i na uma i a kuyaꞋan dem.<verse eid="PSA 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 11:5" />Vuzavaguɗu u tsu kondo ta̱ vuza vu usuɓi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:5">n vuza gbani-gbani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:5">u tsu iwan ta̱ aza a na a cigai kawuya,<verse eid="PSA 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 11:6" />Wi ta̱ a̱ kusuku akina n Farinwuta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:6">u uma a gbani-gbani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:6">wunla̱i wu usuɗukpi u ɗa u ko okpo upecu u le.<verse eid="PSA 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 11:7" />Adama a na Vuzavaguɗu vuza vu usuɓi ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:7">u ciga ta̱ ulinga wu usuɓi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:7">uma a usuɓi i ta̱ e kene a̱shi a̱ ni.<verse eid="PSA 11:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="PSA 12" />
  <para style="s1">Avasa a̱ kula̱nsa̱ uɓa̱nki</para>
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: Vishipa vu Dawuda: a kubana u ma̱zuɓi, a yaꞋan vu ɗa tsu ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ka&lt;&lt;Shiminitu&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 12:1" />Wawa tsu Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:1">babu aza a̱ ma̱riki a na a buwai tsu Ka̱shile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:1">aza a usuɓi o kotso ta̱ a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka aduniyan.<verse eid="PSA 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 12:2" />Yaba dem a kuyaꞋanka toku aꞋuwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:2">o modoronoi n una̱ wa singai.<verse eid="PSA 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 12:3" />Vuzavaguɗu, zuwa elentsu aza o modoruko a paɗa bini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:3">vu zuwa una̱ wa aza a̱ra̱ɗi u paɗa bini.<verse eid="PSA 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 12:4" />Aza a na a tsu dana, &lt;&lt;Ci ta̱ a̱ kuciya̱ ulyaꞋi n elentsu a̱ tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:4">ci ta̱ a kudansa ili i na tsu cigai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:4">yayi u kusa̱nka̱ tsu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 12:5" />Vuzavaguɗu u danai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:5">&lt;&lt;Mi ta̱ a̱ kuta̱wa̱ gogo na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:5">adama a na i ta̱ o kudoro aza a unambi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:5">aza a na a takacikai kpamu a̱ yura̱ adama atakaci.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:5">Mi ta̱ e kuneke le ida̱shi i ma̱ta̱na̱ i na i a̱ kula̱nsa̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 12:6" />Kadanshi ka Vuzavaguɗu ki ta̱ ciɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:6">kadanshi ka̱ ni ki ta̱ tsa azurufa koci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:6">azurufa a na a̱ luwa̱i n akina ali kucindere.<verse eid="PSA 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 12:7" />Vuzavaguɗu ere tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:7">ere tsu ekiye a uma a gbani-gbani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:7">vu ere tsu ko wannai<verse eid="PSA 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 12:8" />Adama a na uma a gbani-gbani i ta̱ lo a̱ kuka̱ra̱Ꞌa̱ a̱ ubuta̱ dem,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 12:8">a kucikpa ili i na yi i gbani-gbani.<verse eid="PSA 12:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="PSA 13" />
  <para style="s1">Avasa a̱ kula̱nsa̱ uɓa̱nki</para>
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: Vishipa vu Dawuda: a kubana u ma̱zuɓi.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 13:1" />Vuzavaguɗu, ali n wannai ɗai va kucinukpa nu mpa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:1">Ali n wannai ɗai va ku sokongu ku mu a̱shi a̱ nu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:1">Ali ko wannai ɗa?<verse eid="PSA 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 13:2" />Ali n wannai ɗai n kugbama asuvu n atakaci a nampa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:2">Kanna dem o kuyongo n una̱mgbi u ka̱tsuma̱.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:2">Ali wannai ɗai irala i va̱ i kuka̱na̱ kuciya̱ ulyaꞋi?<verse eid="PSA 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 13:3" />Indana mu Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:3">zuwa mu n yongo n wuma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:3">ka̱ta̱ vu ka̱sukpa̱ mu n kuwa̱ ba.<verse eid="PSA 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 13:4" />Ka̱ta̱ vu ka̱sukpa̱ irala i va̱ a dana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:4">&lt;&lt;Ci lyaꞋa ta̱ kelime ka̱ ni.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 13:4">Ka̱ta̱ vu ka̱sukpa̱ a yaꞋan ma̱za̱nga̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:4">adama a uyikpi u va̱ ba.<verse eid="PSA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 13:5" />Ama mpa n neke ta̱ ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:5">a ucigi u nu u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 13:5">ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ ki ta̱ m ma̱za̱nga̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:5">adama a na vu isa mu ta̱.<verse eid="PSA 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 13:6" />Mi ta̱ a kuyaꞋan ishipa, u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:6">adama a kasingai ka na wi a kuyaꞋanka mu.<verse eid="PSA 13:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="PSA 14" />
  <para style="s1">Kagbanigbani ka uma n tsulau tsu le</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="PSA 53:1-6">Ishp 53:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: Vishipa vu Dawuda: a kubana u ma̱zuɓi.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 14:1" />Alau a tsu dansa ta̱ a̱ɗu e le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:1">&lt;&lt;Babu Ka̱shile.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 14:1">A̱ na̱mgba̱ ta̱ ra̱ka̱ vu le, ulinga u le ili yi unata i ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:1">babu vuza na u ci yaꞋan ili i na yi derere.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 10:4">Ishp 10:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="PSA 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 14:2" />Vuzavaguɗu wu indanai uma ɗe gaɗi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 14:2">we ene ko aza e kuyeve i ta̱ punu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:2">vuza a na wi a̱ kula̱nsa̱ u yeve Ka̱shile.<verse eid="PSA 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 14:3" />Ra̱ka̱ vi le a̱ ka̱sukpa̱ ta̱ uye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:3">dem vi le a̱ puwa̱nka̱ ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:3">babu vuza na wi a kuyaꞋan ka̱ ma̱riki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:3">ko vuza te.<verse eid="PSA 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 14:4" />Ko i n kuyeve ba?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:4">Aza a na i kuyaꞋan ka gbani-gbani ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:4">i n kuyeve ba?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 14:4">A tsu takuma ta̱ uma tsu boroji,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:4">kpamu a ci yaꞋan avasa u Vuzavaguɗu ba.<verse eid="PSA 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 14:5" />Ama a̱ rikpa̱ ta̱ adama o wovon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:5">adama a na Ka̱shile ki ta̱ koɓolo n uma a usuɓi.<verse eid="PSA 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 14:6" />A̱ɗa̱ uma a gbani-gbani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:6">i tsu la̱nga̱sa̱ ta̱ ulinga wa aza a unambi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:6">ama Vuzavaguɗu ɗa ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku u le.<verse eid="PSA 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 14:7" />Ishi baci a dana wishi wi Isaraila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:7">wu uta̱ ta̱ a Sihiyona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 14:7">ayin ana Vuzavaguɗu u bonokoi uma a̱ ni una̱singai u le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:7">ntsukaya n Yakubu mi ta̱ a kuyaꞋan ma̱za̱nga̱.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:7">aza a Israila a pana u yoꞋo.<verse eid="PSA 14:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="PSA 15" />
  <para style="s1">Aza a na i a̱ idashi a kusan ku ciɗa ku Ka̱shile</para>
  <para style="d">Vishipa vu Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 15:1" />Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:1">yayi u ku uwa a̱ Ma̱va̱li mo oɓolo ma̱ nu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 15:1">Yayi u kuda̱sa̱ngu a Sihiyona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:1">kusan ku ciɗa?<verse eid="PSA 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 15:2" />Sai vuza na wi a kuyaꞋan kamayu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:2">vuza na wi a kuyaꞋan ili yi usuɓi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 15:2">vuza na kpamu wi a kudansa kamayu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:2">a̱ ka̱ɗu ka̱ni,<verse eid="PSA 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 15:3" />Vuza na u tsu la̱nga̱sa̱ kula ku vuza yoku ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:3">Vuza na u ci yaꞋanka a̱ja̱Ꞌa̱ a̱ ni ka gbani-gbani ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:3">ko u yaꞋan kadanshi ka gbani-gbani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:3">adama vuza na i a̱ ida̱shi ɗeɗevu ba.<verse eid="PSA 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 15:4" />Vuza na u tsu goyo aza a na Ka̱shile ka inwai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:4">ama u tsu neke ta̱ tsugbayin wa aza na o kutono Vuzavaguɗu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:4">U tsu shatangu ta̱ uzuwakpani u ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:4">ko niniɗai baci ka yaꞋin,<verse eid="PSA 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 15:5" />Vuza na u tsu neke okopu babu kodokpotsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:5">u ci isa kalyaꞋa adama a na wo okpo magan ma aꞋuwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:5">u vuza babu unushi ba.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:5">Vuza na baci u yaꞋin nannai wi ta̱ a kushamgba mayin ko wannai.<verse eid="PSA 15:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="PSA 16" />
  <para style="s1">Kuzuwa ka̱ɗu u Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="d">Vishipa vu Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 16:1" />Ere mu Ka̱shile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:1">adama a na avu ɗa ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku u va̱.<verse eid="PSA 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 16:2" />Ɗa n danai Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:2">&lt;&lt;Avu ɗa Vuzavaguɗu vu va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:2">ili i singai i na mi n i ɗa ra̱ka̱, wa̱ a̱ nu u ɗa yi uta̱i.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 16:3" />Adama aza a ciɗa a iɗika ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:3">ele ɗa i n tsugbayin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:3">ele ɗa a zuwai mu ma̱za̱nga̱.<verse eid="PSA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 16:4" />Aza a na a zagbai o tono a̱ma̱li o yoku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:4">o tsu ronoko ta̱ ka̱ci ka̱ le atakaci ka̱u.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 16:4">Mi o kuɓolongu n e le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:4">a̱ ubuta̱ u kuyaꞋan ka alyuka ba.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:4">Mi a kucikpa a̱ma̱li e le ba. <verse eid="PSA 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 16:5" />Vuzavaguɗu avu ɗa ili i na mi n i ɗa koci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:5">avu ɗa vu nekei mu ili i na n cigai dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:5">wuma u va̱ wi ta̱ ekiye a̱ nu. <verse eid="PSA 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 16:6" />KuneꞋe ku na vu yaꞋankai mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:6">ki ta̱ n ugain ka̱u,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:6">mayun ku singai ku ɗa. <verse eid="PSA 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 16:7" />N cikpa ta̱ Vuzavaguɗu, a na wi o kutono nu mpa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:7">n kayin kpamu ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ ke ci neke mu ta̱ kadanshi.<verse eid="PSA 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 16:8" />N yeve ta̱ makyan dem Vuzavaguɗu wi ta̱ nu mpa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:8">Adama a na wi ta̱ e kukiye ku singai ku va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:8">mi a̱ kurikpa̱ ba. <verse eid="PSA 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 16:9" />Adama a nannai ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ ki ta̱ m ma̱za̱nga̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:9">wuma u va̱ kpamu wi ta̱ a̱ ma̱za̱nga̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:9">ikyamba i va̱ feu yi ta̱ a kuyongo babu koyoku.<verse eid="PSA 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 16:10" />Adama a na va̱ ku ka̱sukpa̱ mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:10">n yongo a kasaun ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:10">ko vu ka̱sukpa̱ vuza vu usuɓi u shama ba.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:35">Azu 13:35</ref></char></note><verse eid="PSA 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 16:11" />Vi ta̱ a̱ ku yotsongu mu uye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:11">uye u na u kubana a̱ ubuta̱ u wuma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 16:11">kuyongo ku nu koɓolo nu mpa ili i ma̱za̱nga̱ i ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:11">ida̱shi e kukiye ku usingai ku nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:11">uyoꞋo u ɗa ko wannai.<verse eid="PSA 16:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="PSA 17" />
  <para style="s1">Ma̱shi ma vuza vu babu unushi</para>
  <para style="d">Avasa a Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 17:1" />Vuzavaguɗu pana ufolu u va̱ a̱ kula̱nsa̱ kamayun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:1">pana ma̱shi ma̱ va̱, ma̱ kula̱nsa̱ uɓa̱nki.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:1">Zuwa atsuvu vu pana avasa a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:1">adama a na mpa vuza va aꞋuwa ɗa ba.<verse eid="PSA 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 17:2" />YaꞋan afada a na va kuyaꞋan o yotsongu mi ta̱ n usuɓi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:2">adama a na vi yeve ta̱ ili i na yi derere.<verse eid="PSA 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 17:3" />Vu la̱na̱ baci ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:3">ɗa vu ta̱wa̱i wa̱ a̱ va̱ n kayin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:3">vu kondo mu ba ci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:3">vi a kuciya̱ ili i gbani-gbani wa̱ a̱ va̱ ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:3">n sheshe ta̱ a̱ ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ una̱ uva̱ wi a ku nusaka wu ba.<verse eid="PSA 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 17:4" />Tsu na uma o yoku a ci yaꞋan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:4">mpa n tono ta̱ kadanshi ka̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:4">n tono uye u uma a kavama ba.<verse eid="PSA 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 17:5" />Ene a̱ va̱ i ta̱ o kutono uye u nu makyan dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:5">n saꞋwa kukatsukpa ba.<verse eid="PSA 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 17:6" />N yaꞋan ta̱ avasa wa̱ a̱ nu Ka̱shile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:6">adama a na avu vu tsu ushuku mu ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 17:6">zuwa atsuvu vu pana avasa a̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 17:7" />Yotsongu ucigi u mereve u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:7">ucigi u nu u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 17:7">avu ɗa vu tsu isa aza a na i a̱ kula̱nsa̱ ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:7">aza a na i a̱ kula̱nsa̱ ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku e kukiye ku usingai ku nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:7">a̱ ubuta̱ wi irala i le.<verse eid="PSA 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 17:8" />Ere mu tsu maku ma̱ ka̱shi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:8">sokongu mu a ɗaka ve evelyu a̱ nu,<verse eid="PSA 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 17:9" />wa aza a gbani-gbani a na a cigai ku una mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:9">n irala i va̱ aza a na i uka̱ra̱Ꞌi nu mpa.<verse eid="PSA 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 17:10" />I na asuvayali a̱ɗu e le ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:10">una̱ u le sai kadanshi ka̱ a̱ra̱ɗi.<verse eid="PSA 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 17:11" />Gogo na i ta̱ uka̱ra̱Ꞌi nu mpa a̱ ubuta̱ u na n vadalukpai dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:11">a̱ kula̱nsa̱ ka̱ba̱nga̱ adama a na o polo mu a iɗika.<verse eid="PSA 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 17:12" />Ana ikawu a̱ kula̱nsa̱ mu adama a na a sazasa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 17:12">a na ikawu yi utsura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:12">a kuvana a̱ ubuta̱ u na i ubopi.<verse eid="PSA 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 17:13" />Ta̱wa̱, Vuzavaguɗu vu yaꞋan kuvon n irala i va̱, vu lyaꞋa le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:13">vu isa mu n kotokobi ka̱ nu wa aza a gbani-gbani. <verse eid="PSA 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 17:14" />Vuzavaguɗu, isa mu n kukiye ku nu a icuꞋu i uma a nanlo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:14">isa mu a̱ ubuta̱ u uma aduniyan a nampa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:14">a na i n ili i na a cigai dem,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 17:14">takacika le n ili i na vu zuwakai le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:14">ya muku n le feu n takacika,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:14">ali a kubana a n tsukaya n le.<verse eid="PSA 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 17:15" />Mi ta̱ e kene wu, adama a na mpa vuza vu usuɓi ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:15">ɗa baci n jimgbai dem n ci yaꞋan ta̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ adama a na vi ta̱ koɓolo nu mpa.<verse eid="PSA 17:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="PSA 18" />
  <para style="s1">Vishipa vu ulyaꞋi vu Dawuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 22:1-51">2 Sam 22:1-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: Vishipa vu Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 18:1" />N ciga wu ta̱ Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:1">avu ɗa utsura u va̱.<verse eid="PSA 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 18:2" />Vuzavaguɗu, avu ɗa katali ke kusheɗeku ka̱ va̱, mashilya ma̱ va̱ n kishi ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:2">Ka̱shile kaꞋa katali ke kusheɗeku ka̱ va̱, wa̱ a̱ ni u ɗa n tsu sheɗeku.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:2">ma̱ra̱ga̱ ma̱ va̱ n kishi ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:2">ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku u va̱ kpamu.<verse eid="PSA 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 18:3" />N tsu ɗeke ta̱ Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:3">a̱yi na u yotsoi kucikpa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:3">kpamu u tsu wawa mu ta̱ ekiye a irala i va̱.<verse eid="PSA 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 18:4" />Ukpa̱ u shiya mu ta̱ kpankpaꞋan n awin a̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:4">ka gbani-gbani ka aya ta̱ ali ka laꞋi utsura u va̱.<verse eid="PSA 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 18:5" />Kasaun ka shiya mu ta̱ n awin a̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:5">ukpa̱ u zuwaka mu ta̱ maza.<verse eid="PSA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 18:6" />A̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka atakaci a̱ va̱, n ɗeke ta̱ Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:6">N ɗeke ta̱ Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱ adama a̱ kula̱nsa̱ uɓa̱nki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 18:6">A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin a̱ ni u panai ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:6">ma̱shi ma̱ va̱ ma uwa ta̱ atsuvu a̱ ni.<verse eid="PSA 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 18:7" />Aduniyan ejeꞋi ali a̱ gba̱ɗa̱i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:7">ɗa a̱miꞋin a nsasan ejeꞋi ɗa a̱ gba̱ɗa̱i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:7">adama a wupa u Ka̱shile.<verse eid="PSA 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 18:8" />Ka̱nga̱ ka̱ ka̱na̱i ku uta̱ a̱ vunu vi ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:8">melentsu ma akina n a̱ga̱ruwa̱shi a̱ ku uta̱ una̱ u ni,<verse eid="PSA 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 18:9" />U ɓa̱yuwa̱i gaɗi, ɗa u cipa̱i a iɗika,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:9">eleshu a̱ lima̱ ka̱u a ɗaka vu ene a̱ ni.<verse eid="PSA 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 18:10" />U kumbai gaɗi ve evelyu i Corobi u imkpai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:10">a̱ kucipa̱ n ilaɗi.<verse eid="PSA 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 18:11" />U zuwai ka̱yimbi ko okpoi kapalatsu ka̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:11">u sheɗeki eleshu a̱ lima̱.<verse eid="PSA 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 18:12" />Ɗa ulaɗi wu uta̱i eleshu a̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:12">ɗa mini ma atali n melentsu ma akina,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:12">uta̱i e kelime ka̱ ni.<verse eid="PSA 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 18:13" />Vuzavaguɗu u lapai ɗe kakpanga gaɗi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:13">ɗa a panai ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ka MalaꞋimili.<verse eid="PSA 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 18:14" />U tawai ayaꞋa a̱ ni, u wacuwai irala ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:14">n ulaɗi u ni u ɗa u lokoi le.<verse eid="PSA 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 18:15" />A palukpai kumiꞋi ku mala e keteshe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:15">kumiꞋi ka aduniyan ku uta̱i e keteshe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 18:15">ana vu ɓarangi irala i va̱, Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:15">ana kpamu vu ɓarangi le n wupa.<verse eid="PSA 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 18:16" />Vuzavaguɗu u ba̱rukpa̱i kukiye ku ni ɗe gaɗi u ɗikai mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:16">wu utuka̱i mu a̱ mini mu uga̱vi.<verse eid="PSA 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 18:17" />Wu isa mu ekiye a irala i va̱ yi utsura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:17">n wa aza a na o kovoi mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:17">adama a na a laꞋa ta̱ utsura u va̱.<verse eid="PSA 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 18:18" />A kanna ka atakaci a̱ va̱, ɗa a̱ ta̱wa̱i a̱ shilika̱i nu mpa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:18">ama ɗa vuzavaguɗu u wawai mu.<verse eid="PSA 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 18:19" />Wu utuka̱i mu a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka atakaci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:19">ɗa wi isai mu adama a na wi ta̱ a kupana uyoꞋo u va̱.<verse eid="PSA 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 18:20" />Vuzavaguɗu u tsu tsupa mu ta̱, adama a na mpa vuza vu usuɓi ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:20">ɗa u zuwakai mu una̱singai adama a usuɓi u va̱.<verse eid="PSA 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 18:21" />N tono ta̱ uye u Vuzavaguɗu, n ka̱sukpa̱ Vuzaguɗu Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱, adama a kuyaꞋan ka gbani-gbani ba.<verse eid="PSA 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 18:22" />N tono ta̱ wila̱ u ni ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:22">n kpa̱ɗa̱ kutono ili i na u dansai ba.<verse eid="PSA 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 18:23" />Ɗa mo okpoi vuza vu babu unushi a̱ ubuta̱ ni.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:23">Ɗa kpamu me erei ka̱ci ka̱ va̱ a̱ ubuta̱ u kuyaꞋan unushi.<verse eid="PSA 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 18:24" />Adama a nannai ɗa Vuzavaguɗu u nekei mu katsupu adama a usuɓi u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:24">adama a na u yeve ta̱ mi na unushi a̱ ni ba.<verse eid="PSA 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 18:25" />Vuzavaguɗu avu vuza vu uneki u ka̱ɗu ɗa, wa aza a na e nekei u a̱ɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:25">vuza vu ma̱riki ɗa kpamu wa aza a̱ ma̱riki.<verse eid="PSA 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 18:26" />Wa aza a̱ɗu a ciɗa, vu tsu yotsongu le ta̱ vi ta̱ ciɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:26">ama vi ta̱ a tsurala n aza a ka gbani-gbani.<verse eid="PSA 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 18:27" />Vu tsu isa ta̱ aza a na o goyoi ka̱ci ka̱ le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:27">ama vu tsu goyo ta̱ aza a̱ra̱ɗi.<verse eid="PSA 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 18:28" />Vuzavaguɗu, avu ɗa vu tsu neke mu kutashi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:28">avu ɗa vu lokoi ka̱yimbi ka̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 18:29" />N utsura u nu, mi ta̱ a ku una ka̱tsura̱ ko osoji,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:29">n utsura u Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱ mi ta̱ a kupasa mashilya dem.<verse eid="PSA 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 18:30" />Uye u Ka̱shile wi ta̱ derere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:30">uzuwakpani u Vuzavaguɗu mayun ɗa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:30">a̱yi ma̱ra̱ga̱ maꞋa wa aza a na e sheɗeki wa̱ a̱ ni.<verse eid="PSA 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 18:31" />Vuzavaguɗu koci, a̱yi ɗa Ka̱shile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:31">Ka̱shile kaꞋa koci ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku u tsu.<verse eid="PSA 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 18:32" />A̱yi ɗa Ka̱shile ka na ke ci neke mu utsura u ka̱ɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:32">u tsu ere mu ta̱ a uye wu nwalu n va̱.<verse eid="PSA 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 18:33" />U tsu zuwa mu ta̱ n wala n ilaɗi ko ma̱ta̱ɗa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:33">tsu mesheun e kere mu a gaɗi vu nsasan.<verse eid="PSA 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 18:34" />U tsu gbara mu adama o kuvon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:34">ciya̱ n fuɗa kuyaꞋan ulinga n utan u viyum vi shili.<verse eid="PSA 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 18:35" />Vuzavaguɗu vu ere mu ta̱, ɗa vu isai mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:35">mo okpoi vuzagbayin, adama a na vu la̱na̱ mu ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:35">utsura u nu kpamu we erei mu,<verse eid="PSA 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 18:36" />Vu zuwa mu ta̱ a̱ ubuta̱ u na wi n ma̱ta̱ɗa̱ ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:36">n saꞋwa kuyikpa̱ ba.<verse eid="PSA 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 18:37" />N guvai irala i va̱ ali n remei le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:37">mi a kushamgba ba sai mu una le ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 18:38" />Ɗa n lapai le ali a iɗika, a fuɗa a̱ ɗa̱nga̱ ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:38">a̱ yikpa̱i a ɗaka vu ene a̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 18:39" />Avu ɗa vu nekei mu utsura u kuyaꞋan kuvon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:39">vu zuwai irala i va̱ a ɗaka vu va̱.<verse eid="PSA 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 18:40" />Vu zuwai irala i va̱ a kpatalai a sumai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:40">ɗa mu unai aza a na i a tsurala nu mpa.<verse eid="PSA 18:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 18:41" />A̱ shika̱i, ama babu vuza na wa ku isa le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:41">e ɗekei Vuzavaguɗu, ama ɗa u kpa̱ɗa̱i ku ushuku le.<verse eid="PSA 18:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 18:42" />Ɗa n lapai le luɓa̱ luɓa̱ ali okpoi tsu kubuta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:42">n dasai le tsu kolyoꞋo ku uye.<verse eid="PSA 18:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 18:43" />Vu isai mu a̱ ubuta̱ wa aza a ugbamiwasuvu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:43">vu zuwai mu mo okpo vuza vu kelime vu uduniyan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:43">uma a na n saꞋwai kuyeve ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:43">okpoi aza a ulinga a̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 18:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 18:44" />Ɗa baci a panai ukuna u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:44">o tsu tono mu ta̱.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:44">Omoci a̱ kuta̱wa̱ n e nekei mu tsugbayin,<verse eid="PSA 18:44" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 18:45" />a nambai utsura u ka̱ɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:45">n kujeꞋe ki ikyamba ɗa a̱ uta̱i a̱ ubuta̱ u na e sheɗeki.<verse eid="PSA 18:45" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 18:46" />Vuzavaguɗu wi ta̱ n wuma, una̱singai u katali ke kusheɗeku ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:46">ucikpi a kubana a̱ Ka̱shile kishi ka̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 18:46" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 18:47" />A̱yi ɗa Ka̱shile ka na ka kutsupaka mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:47">a̱yi ɗa u zuwai uduniya wo okpoi ɗaka vu va̱,<verse eid="PSA 18:47" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 18:48" />u tsu isa mu ta̱ e kiye a irala i va̱.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 18:48">u tsu neke mu ta̱ tsugbayin a̱ ubuta̱ wi irala i va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:48">u tsu isa mu ta̱ ekiye a uma a kavama.<verse eid="PSA 18:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 18:49" />Adama a nannai, Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:49">mi ta̱ a kucikpa wu a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ku uduniyan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:49">mi ta̱ a kuyaꞋan ishipa n cikpa kula ku nu.<verse eid="PSA 18:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 18:50" />Makyan dem Ka̱shile ke ci neke ta̱ mogono ma na u zagbai ulyaꞋi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:50">u tsu yotsongu ta̱ ucigi u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba u mazagbi ma̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:50">u Dawuda nu ntsukaya n ni ko wannai.<verse eid="PSA 18:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="PSA 19" />
  <para style="s1">Ulinga u Ka̱shile n afada a̱ ni</para>
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: Vishipa vu Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 19:1" />La̱na̱ biꞋi tsu na gaɗi a̱da̱nga̱shile i a kusala tsugbayin tsu Ka̱shile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:1">la̱na̱ biꞋi kpamu tsu na eleshu i o kuyotsongu ulinga u na u yaꞋin e keteshe.<verse eid="PSA 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 19:2" />Kanna dem ka tsu dana ta̱ kanna ke ire tsugbayin ci ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:2">kayin dem ko tsu tonuko ta̱ kayin ke ire kuyeve ku ni.<verse eid="PSA 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 19:3" />Babu ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ko kadanshi ka na a dansai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:3">babu ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ka na a panai.<verse eid="PSA 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 19:4" />Ama akaka e le a̱ ka̱ra̱Ꞌa̱ ta̱ aduniyan dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:4">kadanshi ke le ka̱ ka̱ra̱Ꞌa̱ ta̱ a̱ ubuta̱ dem aduniyan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 10:18">Rom 10:18</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 19:4">Ka̱shile ka yaꞋanka ta̱ kanna kpaꞋa ɗe gaɗi,<verse eid="PSA 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 19:5" />Kuta̱ ku kanna ki ta̱ tsu vali vu savu a̱ ku uta̱ a̱ kunu ku ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:5">n ma̱za̱nga̱ tsu vuza vu na u ciya̱i ulyaꞋi a ugulani u malamanai.<verse eid="PSA 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 19:6" />U tsu uta̱ ta̱ a uteku wa̱ a̱da̱nga̱shile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:6">ka̱ta̱ u ka̱ra̱Ꞌa̱ a kubana a kapashi ka nan ɗe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:6">ko ili i kusheɗeku adama a usuɗukpi u ni ba.<verse eid="PSA 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 19:7" />Wila̱ u Vuzavaguɗu wi ta̱ derere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:7">u tsu bonoko ta̱ wuma u savu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 19:7">Kadanshi ka Vuzavaguɗu ili i kutono i ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:7">ke tsu neke ta̱ kuyeve u vuza na wi n kuyeve ba.<verse eid="PSA 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 19:8" />Wila̱ u Vuzavaguɗu wi ta̱ mejege,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:8">u tsu tuka̱ ta̱ m ma̱za̱nga̱ a̱ ka̱ɗu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 19:8">Kadanshi ka Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:8">ki n kadama ke kuyeve ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:8">ka tsu zuwa ta̱ ka̱ɗu kuyeve.<verse eid="PSA 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 19:9" />Wovon u Vuzavaguɗu u tsu zuwa ta̱ ka̱ɗu ko yongo ciɗa ko wannai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 19:9">Wila̱ u Vuzavaguɗu mayun ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:9">makyan dem wi ta̱ mejege.<verse eid="PSA 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 19:10" />U laꞋa ta̱ azanariya ugaꞋin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:10">ali a laꞋi azanariya a na a̱ luwa̱i koci,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 19:10">a laꞋa ta̱ ishigi uyoꞋo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:10">ali a laꞋi ishigi i na a pishai.<verse eid="PSA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 19:11" />We e le u ɗa kagbashi ka̱ nu ka̱ tsu ciya̱ odoki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:11">kutono ku wila̱ ki ta̱ n katsupu ka̱ a̱bunda̱i.<verse eid="PSA 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 19:12" />Yayi u kuyeve unushi u ni?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:12">Cinukpaka mu unushi u na n yevei n e le ba.<verse eid="PSA 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 19:13" />Ere mu ka̱ta̱ n yaꞋan unushi wu ucigi u ka̱ɗu ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:13">ka̱ta̱ vu ka̱sukpa̱ lyaꞋaka mu tsugono ba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 19:13">Ta m ko okpo vuza vu babu unushi nannai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:13">ka̱ta̱ n laꞋaka n kuyaꞋan ka gbani-gbani.<verse eid="PSA 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 19:14" />YaꞋan kadanshi ka̱ va̱ n kusheshe ku va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:14">ko okpo ili i ku isa wa̱ a̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:14">Vuzavaguɗu, ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku u va̱ n ka̱shibi ka̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 19:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="PSA 20" />
  <para style="s1">Avasa a̱ kula̱nsa̱ ulyaꞋi</para>
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: Vishipa vu Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 20:1" />YaꞋan Vuzavaguɗu wu ushuku wu a ayin atakaci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:1">yaꞋan kula ku Ka̱shile ka Yakubu ke ere wu,<verse eid="PSA 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 20:2" />YaꞋan u suꞋuku n uɓa̱nki ɗe a̱ ubuta̱ u ciɗa u ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:2">ka̱ta̱ u zuwaka wu kukiye a Sihiyona.<verse eid="PSA 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 20:3" />YaꞋan u ciɓa n alyuka a̱ nu ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:3">ka̱ta̱ kpamu u pana uyoꞋo u kuneꞋe ku kusongu ku nu. <char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 20:4" />YaꞋan u neke wu ili i na ka̱ɗu ka̱ nu ka cigai dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:4">ka̱ta̱ u zuwa vu lyaꞋa kelime n ili i na vu sheshei kuyaꞋan dem.<verse eid="PSA 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 20:5" />A̱tsu ci ta̱ a kuyaꞋan yoroli i ma̱za̱nga̱ adama a ulyaꞋi u kelime u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:5">ci yaꞋan ka̱ɗiva̱ adama a ulyaꞋi u kelime u nu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 20:5">n kucikpa ku Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:5">Ka̱shile ka isa ta̱ ufolu u nu.<verse eid="PSA 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 20:6" />Gogo na n yeve ta̱ Vuzavaguɗu u tsu ere ta̱ mogono ma na u zagbai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:6">u tsu ushuki yi ta̱ ɗe gaɗi a̱ ubuta̱ u ciɗa u ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:6">n utsura u gbayin u ni u ɗa u tsu zuwa yi u lyaꞋa kelime.<verse eid="PSA 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 20:7" />Aza o yoku a tsu zuwa ta̱ a̱ɗu e le wu ekeke odoku e le.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:7">aza o yoku wu odoku e le</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:7">Ama a̱tsu tsu zuwa ta̱ a̱ɗu a̱ tsu u Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu.<verse eid="PSA 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 20:8" />IcuꞋu i uma a nanlo i ta̱ a̱ kuta̱ɗa̱tsa̱ a̱ yikpa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:8">ama a̱ tsu ci ta̱ a̱ kuɗa̱nga̱ ci shamgba n utsura.<verse eid="PSA 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 20:9" />Vuzavaguɗu ɓa̱nka̱ mogono adama a na u ciya̱ ulyaꞋi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:9">yaꞋan vu panaka tsu a makyan ma na ci ɗekei.<verse eid="PSA 20:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="PSA 21" />
  <para style="s1">Ucikpi adama a ulyaꞋi</para>
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: Vishipa vu Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 21:1" />Vuzavaguɗu, adama a utsura u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:1">mogono ma yaꞋan ta̱ a̱ ma̱za̱nga̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:1">wi ta̱ a̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ n a̱bunda̱i adama a na vu neke yi ta̱ ulyaꞋi.<verse eid="PSA 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 21:2" />Vu neke yi ta̱ ili i na ka̱ɗu ka̱ ni ka cigai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:2">vu kpa̱ɗa̱ ku ushuku yi ufolu u ni ba. <char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 21:3" />Vu tuka̱i ni n ili i singai n a̱bunda̱i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:3">ɗa vu zuwakai ni oroliko azanariya a kaci ka̱ ni.<verse eid="PSA 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 21:4" />U folono wu ta̱ wuma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:4">ɗa vu nekei ni wuma, n wuma wu ugaɗi.<verse eid="PSA 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 21:5" />Adama a̱ uɓa̱nki u nu, u ciya̱ ta̱ ucikpi u gbayin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:5">ucikpi n tsugbayin tsu na vu nekei ni.<verse eid="PSA 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 21:6" />Vu zuwai ni wo okpoi vuza una̱singai ko wannai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:6">kuyongo ku nu n a̱yi u tsu zuwa yi ta̱ ma̱za̱nga̱.<verse eid="PSA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 21:7" />Adama a na mogono ma, ma zuwa ta̱ ka̱ɗu wa̱ a̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:7">Vuzavaguɗu MalaꞋimili.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 21:7">Adama a ucigi u nu u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:7">wi ta̱ o ko okpo mogono ko wannai.<verse eid="PSA 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 21:8" />Kukiye ku nu ki ta̱ e kureme irala i nu ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:8">kukiye ku usingai ku nu ki ta e kureme aza a na a iwain nu.<verse eid="PSA 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 21:9" />Vi ta̱ a kulyaꞋa le tsu melentsu ma akina,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:9">ayin a na baci vu yotsongi ka̱ci ka̱ nu, Vuzavaguɗu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 21:9">vi ta̱ a ku una le a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka wupa u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:9">akina i ta̱ o kusongu le ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 21:10" />Mogono mi ta̱ a ku una ntsukaya n le aduniyan ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:10">n muku n le a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ku uduniyan.<verse eid="PSA 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 21:11" />Ko ishi baci e sheshe kuyaꞋanka wu ka gbani-gbani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:11">ko o foɓusoi kuyaꞋanka wu kawuya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 21:11">i a̱ kuciya̱ ulyaꞋi ba.<verse eid="PSA 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 21:12" />Adama a na vi ta̱ a kuzuwa le a kpatala a suma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:12">a makyan ma na baci vu taɗuki ayaꞋa a̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 21:13" />YaꞋan a cikpa wu adama a utsura u nu, Vuzavaguɗu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:13">Ci ta̱ a kuyaꞋan ishipa tsu cikpa utsura u nu.<verse eid="PSA 21:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="PSA 22" />
  <para style="s1">Ma̱shi ma̱ una̱mgbuka̱tsuma̱ n ishipa i kucikpa</para>
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: Vishipa vu Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 22:1" />Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱, Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱, yiɗa̱i i zuwai ɗa vu ka̱sukpa̱i mu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:1">N shika̱ ta̱ ka̱u adama a̱ kula̱nsa̱ uɓa̱nki, ama ali n gogo na vu ta̱wa̱ ba.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:46">Mat 27:46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:34">Mar 15:34</ref></char></note><verse eid="PSA 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 22:2" />Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱ n ɗeke wu ta̱ n kanna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:2">vu ushuku mu ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:2">n ɗeke wu ta̱ n kayin, n nannai dem asuvu a̱ va̱ i a̱ ida̱shi ba.<verse eid="PSA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 22:3" />Ama n nannai dem avu vuza ciɗa ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:3">vuza na aza a Isaraila i a kucikpa.<verse eid="PSA 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 22:4" />Ikaya i tsu a zuwa ta̱ a̱ɗu ele wa̱ a̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:4">a zuwa ta̱ a̱ɗu e le wa̱ a̱ nu, ɗa tana vu wawai le.<verse eid="PSA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 22:5" />A banka ta̱ n ma̱shi me le wa̱ a̱ nu, ɗa vu wawai le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:5">wa̱ a̱ nu u ɗa a zuwai a̱ɗu e le, tana vu neke le wono ba.<verse eid="PSA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 22:6" />Ama mpa vuma ɗa ba, mpa kazun kaꞋa koci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:6">mu okpoi ili yi izoshi n ili i ma̱ka̱n u yaba dem.<verse eid="PSA 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 22:7" />Vuza na baci wu enei mu dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:7">ka̱ta̱ u bonoko mu ili yi izoshi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:7">o tsu goyo mu ta̱ n a̱ gba̱ɗa̱i aci e le,<verse eid="PSA 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 22:8" />a dana,&lt;&lt;Vu zuwa ta̱ ka̱ɗu ka̱ nu u Vuzavaguɗu ba̱ya̱?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:8">YaꞋan wi isa wu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 22:8">yaꞋan Vuzavaguɗu u wawa wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:8">wi baci a kupana uyoꞋo u nu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 22:9" />N nannai dem avu ɗa vu utuka̱i mu a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka̱ a̱na̱ku a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:9">avu ɗa vu zuwai n yongoi n ma̱ta̱na̱ ali mpa a ku apa mani.<verse eid="PSA 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 22:10" />Ili i na i ɗikai a kanna ka na a matsai mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:10">ɗa mi a kuzuwa ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ wa̱ a̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 22:10">avu ɗa Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:10">ali a kanna ka na a̱na̱ku a̱ va̱ a matsai mu.<verse eid="PSA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 22:11" />Ka̱ta̱ vu yaꞋan daꞋangi nu mpa ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:11">adama a na atakaci i ta̱ ɗevu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:11">kpamu ko ka̱ɓa̱nki ki lo ba.<verse eid="PSA 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 22:12" />Irala i va̱ i ka̱ra̱Ꞌa̱ mu ta̱ tsu obomburon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:12">a na obomburon a utsura a iɗika i Bashan.<verse eid="PSA 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 22:13" />Apukai una̱ u le a na i kawu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:13">ci i kawu i na yi a̱ yura̱ a̱ kula̱nsa̱ mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:13">adama a na a karasa mu.<verse eid="PSA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 22:14" />Utsura u va̱ u kotsoi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:14">mo okpoi tsu mini ma na ma̱ va̱ma̱i a iɗika,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 22:14">etele a̱ va̱ dem a̱ shirikpa̱ ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:14">ka̱ɗu ka va̱ ke derikpei a na abashi ishigi<verse eid="PSA 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 22:15" />Gboroli vu va̱ vu ɗekpe ta̱ tsu kubuta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:15">kelentsu ka̱ va̱ ka paɗai punu a kalakpani ka̱ va̱.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:15">Vu ka̱sukpa̱i mu ukpa̱ a iɗika.<verse eid="PSA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 22:16" />Ka̱tsura̱ ki irala i va̱ ka̱ ka̱ra̱Ꞌi mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:16">tsu koɓolo ke nsheꞋe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:16">ɗa e wejelei ekiye a̱ va̱ n ene a̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 22:17" />Ali etele dem okpoi e keteshe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:17">Irala i va̱ i goyo mu ta̱, ɗa a zuwakai mu a̱shi.<verse eid="PSA 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 22:18" />Ɗa a yaꞋin kazagba n akashi a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:18">ɗa e pecekei ka̱ci ke le akashi a̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 22:19" />Vuzavaguɗu, ka̱ta̱ vu shamgba daꞋin nu mpa ba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:19">ta̱wa̱ gogoꞋo vi isa mu, avu kawawi ka̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 22:20" />Wawa a̱ ubuta̱ u kotokobi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:20">isa a̱ ubuta̱ wu nsheꞋe n nampa.<verse eid="PSA 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 22:21" />Isa mu ekiye a irala i va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:21">isa mu adama a na i ta̱ a̱ kusuwa̱n mu n avana e le tsu njuma.<verse eid="PSA 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 22:22" />Mi ta̱ a kudana uma a̱ va̱ ili i na vu yaꞋin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:22">mi ta̱ a kucikpa wu a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ko koɓolo ka uma.<verse eid="PSA 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 22:23" />Cikpai ni, a̱ɗa̱ na yi a kupana wovon u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:23">nekei ni tsugbayin a̱ɗa̱ kumaci ku Yakubu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:23">cikpai ni, a̱ɗa̱ aza a Isaraila ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 22:24" />Adama a na u goyo aza a unambi wu utsura ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:24">ko u kpa̱ɗa̱ kula̱na̱ le ba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 22:24">U zuwaka le kucina̱ ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:24">ama u tsu ushuku le ta̱ ɗa baci e ɗekei ni.<verse eid="PSA 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 22:25" />Mi ta̱ a ku cikpa wu e kelime ko koɓolo ka uma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:25">adama ili i na vu yaꞋin.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 22:25">E kelime ka aza na i o kutono wu ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:25">Ka̱ta̱ n shatangu uzuwakpani u na n yaꞋin.<verse eid="PSA 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 22:26" />Aza a unambi i ta̱ a kulyaꞋa ali a̱ cuwa̱.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:26">Aza a na i a̱ kula̱nsa̱ Vuzavaguɗu i ta̱ a kucikpa yi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 22:26">a̱ɗu e le i ta̱ a̱ okpo m ma̱za̱nga̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:26">ko wannai.<verse eid="PSA 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 22:27" />Aduniyan i ta̱ a kuciɓa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:27">i ta̱ o kubono a̱ ubuta̱ u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 22:27">kumaci ku uma ra̱ka̱ i ta̱ a kucikpa yi.<verse eid="PSA 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 22:28" />adama a na tsugono tsu Vuzavaguɗu tsu ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:28">Wi ta̱ o tsugono tsu uma ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 22:29" />Aza a uciyi ra̱ka̱ i ta̱ a̱ ku kuɗa̱nki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:29">n aza a na i o kubono kubuta̱ ki iɗika,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 22:29">n aza a na a kufuɗa kuɓa̱na̱ wuma u le ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:29">i ta̱ a̱ ku kuɗa̱ngu kelime ka̱ni.<verse eid="PSA 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 22:30" />kumaci ku na ka̱ kuta̱wa̱ ki ta̱ a kucikpa yi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:30">Ntsukaya n na mi a̱ kuta̱wa̱ i ta̱ a kupana arabali a Vuzavaguɗu.<verse eid="PSA 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 22:31" />ele feu ta̱ a kusala ukuna u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:31">wa aza a na ka̱ta̱ a matsai ba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 22:31">i ta̱ a kudana le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:31">Vuzavaguɗu ɗa u wawai uma a̱ ni.<verse eid="PSA 22:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="PSA 23" />
  <para style="s1">Vuzavaguɗu ɗa maguɓi ma̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="d">Vishipa vu Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 23:1" />Vuzavaguɗu maguɓi ma̱ va̱ maꞋa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:1">mi a ku namba ili ba.<verse eid="PSA 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 23:2" />U tsu zuwa mu ta̱ n yongo a̱ ubuta̱ u na wi n ijanu i ta̱ku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:2">u tsu tono ta̱ nu mpa a uɓon wu nyeneke n na mi e ku yene sawu.<verse eid="PSA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 23:3" />U tsu doku mu ta̱ utsura.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 23:3">U tsu tono ta̱ nu mpa a uye wu usuɓi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:3">adama a na a cikpa kula ku ni.<verse eid="PSA 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 23:4" />Ko ɗa baci n tonoi n kpenle ku ka̱yimbi ku ukpa̱,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 23:4">mi a kupana wovon ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:4">adama a na vi ta̱ koɓolo nu mpa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 23:4">kalangu ka nwalu ka̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 23:4">n kalangu ka kaguɓa ka̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:4">i ta̱ a̱ kula̱na̱ mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:4">i ta̱ e ku ere wuma u va̱.<verse eid="PSA 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 23:5" />Vu foɓuso ko mu ta̱ ka̱ɗiva̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:5">e kelime ki irala i va̱,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 23:5">vu erengu mu ta̱ n maniꞋin me kerengu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:5">meyelyu ma̱ va̱ ma shanai ali ma ɓarakpai.<verse eid="PSA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 23:6" />Mayun, kasingai ka̱ nu n ucigi u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:6">wi ta̱ o kuyongo nu mpa a ayin a wuma u va̱ dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:6">ka̱ta̱ n da̱sa̱ngu a kpaꞋa ku Vuzavaguɗu ko wannai.<verse eid="PSA 23:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="PSA 24" />
  <para style="s1">Mogono ma gbayin</para>
  <para style="d">Vishipa vu Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 24:1" />Iɗika i Vuzavaguɗu i ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:1">n ili na yi punu dem,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 24:1">aduniyan a̱ ni a ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:1">n aza a na i punu ida̱shi dem.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 10:26">1 Kor 10:26</ref></char></note><verse eid="PSA 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 24:2" />Adama a na u maꞋa ta̱ a ɗa a gaɗi vu mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:2">u varai kumiꞋi ku ni a gaɗi vu mini.<verse eid="PSA 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 24:3" />Yayi u yawai u kumba kusan ku Vuzavaguɗu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:3">Yayi u yawai u uwa a̱ Ma̱va̱li mo oɓolo ma̱ ni?<verse eid="PSA 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 24:4" />Sai vuza na ulinga we ekiye a̱ ni u ciɗa u ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 24:4">kpamu ka̱ɗu ka̱ ni ki ta̱ ciɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:4">n vuza na u tsu tono oboci ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:4">ko u yaꞋan akucina a uwa ba.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:8">Mat 5:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="PSA 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 24:5" />Vuzavaguɗu wi ta̱ a kuzuwaka yi una̱singai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:5">Ka̱shile kawawi ka̱ ni ki ta̱ a ku isa yi.<verse eid="PSA 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 24:6" />IcuꞋu i uma a nanlo a ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:6">a̱ tsu la̱nsa̱ e yeve Ka̱shile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:6">aza a na a tsu bana e kelime ka̱ Ka̱shile ka Yakubu.<char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 24:7" />Ɓa̱yuwa̱i utsutsu wa n wanshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:7">ɓa̱yuwa̱i utsutsu u cau,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:7">Adama a na mogono ma gbayin mi ta̱ a kuꞋuwa punu.<verse eid="PSA 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 24:8" />Yayi mogono ma gbayin ma nampa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:8">A̱yi ɗa Vuzavaguɗu, vuza vu utsura m MalaꞋimili,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:8">Vuzavaguɗu ɗa kalyaꞋi ko kuvon.<verse eid="PSA 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 24:9" />Ɓa̱yuwa̱i utsutsu wa n wanshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:9">ɓa̱yuwa̱i utsutsu u cau,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:9">Adama a na mogono ma gbayin mi ta̱ a kuꞋuwa, <verse eid="PSA 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 24:10" />Yayi mogono ma gbayin ma nampa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:10">A̱yi ɗa Vuzavaguɗu, vuza vu utsura MalaꞋimili,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:10">a̱yi ɗa mogono ma gbayin ma. <char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 24:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="PSA 25" />
  <para style="s1">Avasa a̱ kula̱nsa̱ ucunukpi wu unushi<optbreak /> n we eri</para>
  <para style="d">Vishipa vu Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 25:1" />Vuzavaguɗu, n neke ta̱ wuma u va̱ wa̱ nu. <verse eid="PSA 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 25:2" />Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱, wa̱ a̱ nu u ɗa n zuwai ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 25:2">ka̱ta̱ vu ka̱sukpa̱ mu m pana wono ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:2">ka̱ta̱ vu ka̱sukpa̱ irala i va̱ i yaꞋanka mu kindi ku kugoyi ba.<verse eid="PSA 25:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 25:3" />Aza a na a zuwai a̱ɗu e le wa̱ a̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:3">i kupana wono ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 25:3">ama yaꞋan aza a unambi wu usuɓi a pana wono.<verse eid="PSA 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 25:4" />Vuzavaguɗu vu yotsongu mu uye u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:4">vu piꞋisaka mu ukuna u nu.<verse eid="PSA 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 25:5" />Tono nu mpa tsu na n kuyaꞋan kamayun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:5">ka̱ta̱ vu piꞋisaka mu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 25:5">adama a na avu ɗa Ka̱shile kishi ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:5">makyan dem n tsu zuwa ta̱ ka̱ɗu wa̱ a̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 25:6" />Vuzavaguɗu, ciɓa n kasingai ka̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:6">n ucigi u nu u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:6">u na vu yotsongi ali n ayin a cau ɗe.<verse eid="PSA 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 25:7" />Cinukpa n unushi wu ucigi u ka̱ɗu u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:7">n unushi u na n yaꞋin a ayin a na mi ishi kolobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 25:7">adama a ucigi u nu una u tsu sabaꞋa ba n kasingai ka̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:7">vu ciɓa nu mpa Vuzavaguɗu.<verse eid="PSA 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 25:8" />Vuzavaguɗu vuza vu usuɓi ɗa, n kasingai kpamu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:8">u tsu yotsongu ta̱ aza a unushi uye u na o kutono.<verse eid="PSA 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 25:9" />U tsu tono ta̱ n aza na o ogoyoi ka̱ci ke le, a ukuna u mejege,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:9">wi ta̱ a kupiꞋisaka le tsu na o kutono yi,<verse eid="PSA 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 25:10" />Uye u Vuzavaguɗu ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:10">ucigi u ɗa u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba n usuɓi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:10">wa aza a na i o kutono uzuwakpani u ni n wila̱ u ni.<verse eid="PSA 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 25:11" />Vuzavaguɗu, shatangu uzuwakpani u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:11">vu cinukpaka mu unushi u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:11">adama a na wi ta̱ n a̱bunda̱i.<verse eid="PSA 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 25:12" />Aza a na i a kupana wovon u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:12">wi ta̱ o kuyotsongu le uye u na o kutono.<verse eid="PSA 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 25:13" />I ta̱ a kulyaꞋa kelime makyan dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:13">ntsukaya n e le mi ta̱ a kulyaꞋa uka̱ni wi iɗika ya.<verse eid="PSA 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 25:14" />Vuzavaguɗu wu ushuku ta̱ n aza na i a kupana wovon u ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:14">u tsu zuwa le ta̱ e yeve uzuwakpani u ni.<verse eid="PSA 25:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 25:15" />Makyan dem a̱shi a̱ va̱ i ta̱ a̱ ubuta̱ u Vuzavaguɗu a̱ kula̱nsa̱ uɓa̱nki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:15">adama a na a̱yi ɗa koci u ku ere mu a̱ ubuta̱ u gbani-gbani.<verse eid="PSA 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 25:16" />Vadalukpa uɓon u va̱ Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:16">vu yaꞋanka mu kasingai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 25:16">adama a na mi n vuza ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:16">kpamu ko utsura.<verse eid="PSA 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 25:17" />Una̱mgbuka̱tsuma̱ u ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ o doku ta̱ a̱bunda̱i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:17">wawa mu a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka atakaci a̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 25:18" />Zuwaka n una̱mgbuka̱tsuma̱ u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:18">vu ene atakaci a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:18">ka̱ta̱ vu cinukpaka mu unushi u va̱.<verse eid="PSA 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 25:19" />La̱na̱ ka̱bunda̱i ka irala i va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:19">la̱na̱ tsu na o kovoi mu.<verse eid="PSA 25:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 25:20" />Ere mu ka̱ta̱ vu wawa mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:20">ka̱ta̱ vu ka̱sukpa̱ m pana wono ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:20">adama a na wa̱ a̱ nu u ɗa n ta̱wa̱i kusheɗeku.<verse eid="PSA 25:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 25:21" />YaꞋan kasingai n kamayun ke ere mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:21">adama a na n zuwa ta̱ ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ wa̱ a̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 25:22" />Ka̱shile, shiba̱ aza a Isaraila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:22">a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka atakaci e le.<verse eid="PSA 25:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="PSA 26" />
  <para style="d">Vishipa vu Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 26:1" />Vuzavaguɗu, yotsongu a na mpa mi n unushi ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:1">adama a na n yaꞋan ta̱ ili na yi derere,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 26:1">n neke ta̱ Vuzavaguɗu ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:1">ko munla̱i.<verse eid="PSA 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 26:2" />Vuzavaguɗu, kondo mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:2">vu kondo kusheshe ku ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱,<verse eid="PSA 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 26:3" />Adama a na n yeve ta̱ ucigi u nu u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:3">wi ta̱ o kutono nu mpa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:3">kamayun ka̱ nu kaꞋa mi o kutono ayin tutu.<verse eid="PSA 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 26:4" />N ci yongo n uma a kavama ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:4">kabura mu n aza a kapalaka̱shi ba,<verse eid="PSA 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 26:5" />N kovo ta̱ koɓolo ka uma a gbani-gbani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:5">n tsu yongo n uma a gbani-gbani ba,<verse eid="PSA 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 26:6" />Vuzavaguɗu, n saꞋa ta̱ ekiye a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:6">adama a na n yotsongu mi n unushi ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:6">n kucikpa ku ɗa n tsu dasa n ka̱ra̱Ꞌa̱ katalikalyuka ka̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 26:7" />Mi ta̱ a kucanana ishipa i kucikpa n ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ka̱u,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:7">nu n dansai ili mereve i na vu yaꞋin ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 26:8" />Vuzavaguɗu, n ciga ta̱ kpaꞋa ku na vi a̱ ida̱shi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:8">ubuta̱ u na tsugbayin tsu nu ci a̱ ida̱shi.<verse eid="PSA 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 26:9" />Ka̱ta̱ vu una mu koɓolo n aza a unushi ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:9">ko vu una mu koɓolo n aza a munuka ba,<verse eid="PSA 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 26:10" />Aza a na i a kuyaꞋan ka gbani-gbani a makyan dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:10">i ta̱ ufoɓushi adama a na isa kalyaꞋa.<verse eid="PSA 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 26:11" />Ama mpa, mi ta̱ a kuyaꞋan ili i na yi mejege,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:11">pana asuvayali a̱ va̱ vu shiba̱ mu.<verse eid="PSA 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 26:12" />N laꞋaka ta̱ a̱ ubuta̱ ka gbani-gbani dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:12">a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ko koɓolo ka uma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 26:12">mi ta̱ a kucikpa Vuzavaguɗu.<verse eid="PSA 26:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="PSA 27" />
  <para style="s1">Vuzavaguɗu ɗa kutashi ku va̱ n kishi ka̱ va̱</para>
  <para style="d">Vishipa vu Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 27:1" />Vuzavaguɗu ɗa kutashi ku va̱ n kishi ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:1">wovon u yayi n kupana?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 27:1">Vuzavaguɗu ɗa ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:1">wovon u yayi n kupana?<verse eid="PSA 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 27:2" />Ɗa baci uma a gbani-gbani a̱ ta̱wa̱i wa̱ a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:2">adama a na una mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:2">i ta̱ a̱ kuta̱ɗa̱tsa̱ a̱ yikpa̱.<verse eid="PSA 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 27:3" />Ko ɗa baci ka̱tsura̱ ko osoji ka̱ ka̱ra̱Ꞌi mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:3">mi a kupana wovon ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 27:3">ko ɗa baci irala i va̱ a̱ tuka̱i mu n kuvon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:3">n nannai dem mi ta̱ o kuyongo n ka̱ɗu ida̱shi.<verse eid="PSA 27:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 27:4" />Ili i te i ɗa n folonoi u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:4">ili i na n cigai i ɗanna,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 27:4">ɗaɗa n da̱sa̱ngu a kpaꞋa ku Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:4">a ayin a wuma u va̱ ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 27:4">ka̱ta̱ m pana uyoꞋo u Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:4">ka̱ta̱ kpamu n folono yi ɗe A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin a̱ ni.<verse eid="PSA 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 27:5" />A makyan ma atakaci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:5">wi ta̱ o kufoɓo mu a̱ ubuta̱ wi ida̱shi i ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:5">wi ta̱ a kuzuwa mu gaɗi vu kusan ku ugaɗi.<verse eid="PSA 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 27:6" />Ta n kulyaꞋa kelime ka irala i va̱ i na i ka̱ra̱Ꞌi nu mpa nannai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:6">n ma̱za̱nga̱ maꞋa n kuneke alyuka A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:6">mi ta̱ a kuyaꞋan vishipa, n cikpa Vuzavaguɗu.<verse eid="PSA 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 27:7" />Panaka mu Vuzavaguɗu, makyan ma na baci n ɗekei nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:7">pana asuvayali a̱ va̱, vu ushuku mu.<verse eid="PSA 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 27:8" />Vu danai, &lt;&lt;Ta̱wa̱ wa̱ a̱ va̱.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:8">&lt;&lt;Mi ta̱ ta na a̱ kuta̱wa̱ wa̱ a̱ nu, Vuzavaguɗu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 27:9" />Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:9">ka̱ta̱ vu sokongu ku mu a̱shi a̱ nu ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 27:9">ka̱ta̱ vu loko kagbashi ka̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:9">a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka wupa u nu ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:9">avu ɗa vi a̱ kuɓa̱nka̱ mu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 27:9">ali a makyan ma ɗe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:9">Ka̱ta̱ vu ka̱sukpa̱ mu ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 27:9">ka̱ta̱ vu varuku mu ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:9">Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱ kishi ka̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 27:10" />Ko ɗa baci esheku a̱ va̱ n a̱na̱ku a̱ va̱ a variki mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:10">Vuzavaguɗu wi ta̱ a̱ kula̱na̱ mu.<verse eid="PSA 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 27:11" />PiꞋisaka mu ili i na n kuyaꞋan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:11">Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 27:11">vu tono nu mpa a uye u mejege,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:11">adama a na mi ta̱ n irala na̱ a̱bunda̱i.<verse eid="PSA 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 27:12" />Ka̱ta̱ vu ka̱sukpa̱ mu n yikpa̱ ekiye a irala i va̱ ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:12">aza a na i a kuyaꞋansaka mu kadanshi ka aꞋuwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:12">n kadanshi ka kavama.<verse eid="PSA 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 27:13" />N neke ta̱ ka̱ɗu, mi ta̱ o kuyongo n wuma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:13">adama a na me ene kasingai ka Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:13">ka na u kuyaꞋanka uma a̱ ni.<verse eid="PSA 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 27:14" />Zuwa ka̱ɗu u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:14">vu gbama asuvu, vu yaꞋan utsura u ka̱ɗu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:14">zuwa ka̱ɗu u Vuzavaguɗu.<verse eid="PSA 27:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="PSA 28" />
  <para style="s1">Avasa a ufolu n ucikpi</para>
  <para style="d">Vishipa vu Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 28:1" />Vuzavaguɗu avu ɗa mi a kuɗeke, katali ke kusheɗeku ku va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:1">pana ma̱shi ma̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 28:1">vu ushuku mu baci ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:1">mi ta̱ o kokpo a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka aza a na a̱ gida̱la̱i a kubana ukpisa̱.<verse eid="PSA 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 28:2" />Panaka mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:2">a makyan ma na mi a̱ ma̱shi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 28:2">a̱ kula̱nsa̱ uɓa̱nki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 28:2">ɗa baci n ɗa̱ngusa̱i ekiye a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:2">a kindana A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin a̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 28:3" />Ka̱ta̱ vu una mu n uma a gbani-gbani ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:3">koɓolo n aza a na a ci yaꞋan ka gbani-gbani ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 28:3">aza a na kadanshi ke le adanshi ka̱ ma̱ta̱na̱ kaꞋa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:3">ama a̱ɗu e le i ta̱ tukpa n tsurala.<verse eid="PSA 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 28:4" />Tsupa le derere ci ili i na a yaꞋin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:4">takacika le tsu ka gbani-gbani ke le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:4">neke le i na yi untsai le derere.<verse eid="PSA 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 28:5" />A zuwaka n ulinga u na Vuzavaguɗu u yaꞋin ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:5">n ili i na ekiye a̱ ni a yaꞋin ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 28:5">adama a nannai wi ta̱ a kutakacika le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:5">wu una le ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 28:6" />Cikpai Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:6">adama a na u pana ta̱ ma̱shi ma̱ kula̱nsa̱ uɓa̱nki ma̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 28:7" />Vuzavaguɗu ɗa utsura u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:7">n ma̱ra̱ga̱ ma̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 28:7">n zuwa ta̱ ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ wa̱ a̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:7">u ɓa̱nka̱ mu ta̱, n yaꞋan ta̱ ma̱za̱nga̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:7">n vishipa vu va̱ ɗa n kucikpa yi.<verse eid="PSA 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 28:8" />Vuzavaguɗu ɗa katsura ka uma a̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:8">mashilya ma wishi maꞋa u mogono ma na u zagbai.<verse eid="PSA 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 28:9" />Isa uma a̱ nu Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:9">vu zuwaka uma a̱ uka̱ni a̱ nu una̱singai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:9">vu okpo maguɓi me le,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 28:9">vu la̱na̱ le ko wannai.<verse eid="PSA 28:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="PSA 29" />
  <para style="s1">Ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ka Vuzavaguɗu a uguyi</para>
  <para style="d">Vishipa vu Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 29:1" />Cikpai Vuzavaguɗu, a̱ɗa̱ ili i wuma i gaɗi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:1">cikpai tsugbayin ci ni n utsura u ni.<verse eid="PSA 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 29:2" />Cikpai kula ku gbayin ku Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:2">i kuɗa̱ngu e kelime ka vuza ciɗa ɗa baci uɓa̱tsa̱i.<verse eid="PSA 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 29:3" />A pana ta̱ ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ka Vuzavaguɗu a mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:3">Ka̱shile ka tsugbayin ka̱ giruwa̱ ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:3">ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ka̱ tsugiruwi ka̱ ni ka̱ ɗumgba̱ ta̱ a mala.<verse eid="PSA 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 29:4" />Ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ka Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:4">ki ta̱ n utsura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 29:4">ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ka Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:4">ki ta̱ n tsugbayin.<verse eid="PSA 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 29:5" />Ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ka Vuzavaguɗu ko tsu koɗo ta̱ nɗanga n Sida,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:5">ali nu nɗanga n sida n Lebano.<verse eid="PSA 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 29:6" />U tsu zuwa ta̱ nsansa n Lebano n ɗikpangu tsu ndendem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:6">ka̱ta̱ kpamu u zuwa kusan ku Hamon ku ɗikpangu tsu medendem.<verse eid="PSA 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 29:7" />Ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ka Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:7">ka zuwa ta̱ tsulaɗi tsu akana.<verse eid="PSA 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 29:8" />Ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ka Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:8">ka̱ tsu gba̱ɗa̱ ta̱ kakamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 29:8">ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ka Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:8">ka tsu gba̱ɗa̱ ta̱ kakamba ka Kadeshi.<verse eid="PSA 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 29:9" />Ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ka Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:9">ka zuwa ta̱ nɗanga n gbagbaꞋin n gba̱ɗa̱i,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 29:9">u zuwai nɗanga n kutsu n sa̱ruwa̱i,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 29:9">a na a yaꞋin isali i ma̱za̱nga̱ punu AꞋisa̱ a gbayin a̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:9">a danai,&lt;&lt;Tsugbayin u Ka̱shile.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 29:10" />Vuzavaguɗu wi ta̱ o tsugono tsu mala ma gbayin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:10">wi ta̱ a kulyaꞋa tsugono tsu mogono ko wannai.<verse eid="PSA 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 29:11" />YaꞋan Vuzavaguɗu u neke uma a̱ ni utsura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:11">YaꞋan Vuzavaguɗu u zuwaka le una̱singai n ma̱ta̱na̱.<verse eid="PSA 29:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="PSA 30" />
  <para style="s1">Ishipa i kucikpa adama a kupotsokpo</para>
  <para style="d">Vishipa vu Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 30:1" />Vuzavaguɗu, mi ta̱ a kucikpa wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:1">adama a na vu wawa mu ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:1">ɗa vu sa̱nka̱i irala i va̱ i lyaꞋa mu.<verse eid="PSA 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 30:2" />N folono ta̱ uɓa̱nki wa̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:2">Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:2">ɗa tana vu potsokpoi mu.<verse eid="PSA 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 30:3" />Vuzavaguɗu, vu isa mu ta̱ a̱ ubuta̱ wu ukpisa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:3">adama a na n ka̱na̱ ta̱ ɗe uye a̱ kugida̱la̱ e kpenle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:3">ama ɗa vu isai mu.<verse eid="PSA 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 30:4" />Cananai ishipa i kucikpa Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:4">a̱ɗa̱ uma a̱ ma̱riki.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:4">Ciɓai, n ili i na vuza ciɗa u yaꞋin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:4">i cikpa yi.<verse eid="PSA 30:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 30:5" />Wupa u ni u tsu geshe ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:5">ama kasingai ka̱ ni ki ta̱ lo ko wannai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 30:5">a̱ kushika̱ ta̱ n kayin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:5">ama ka̱ta̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ ma̱ ta̱wa̱ n usana.<verse eid="PSA 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 30:6" />Mpa n ka̱ɗu a̱ ida̱shi, ɗa n danai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:6">&lt;&lt;Ko vuza u kulyaꞋa kelime ka̱ va̱ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 30:7" />Vuzavaguɗu, adama a kasingai ka̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:7">u ɗa vu shikpa̱i mu tsu katali ka gbayin ku utsura.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 30:7">Ama ayin a na baci vu sokongu ki mu a̱shi a̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:7">ka̱ta̱ wovon u ka̱na̱ mu ka̱u.<verse eid="PSA 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 30:8" />N ɗeke wu ta̱, Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:8">n folono ta̱ uɓa̱nki u nu.<verse eid="PSA 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 30:9" />&lt;&lt;Yiɗa̱i a̱ kuciya̱ n kuwa̱ baci?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:9">Kodokpotsu ke ne ka i a̱ kuciya̱,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 30:9">ɗa baci n gida̱la̱i a kubana a kasaun?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:9">A̱kpisa̱ i ta̱ a kufuɗa kucikpa wu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:9">I ta̱ a kusala usuɓi u nu?<verse eid="PSA 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 30:10" />Vuzavaguɗu, panaka mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:10">pana asuvayali a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:10">Ɓa̱nka̱ mu, Vuzavaguɗu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 30:11" />Vu bonokoi una̱mgbuka̱tsuma̱ u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:11">wo okpoi kujeꞋe ku ma̱za̱nga̱,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 30:11">vu foɗoi mu akashi a kpalu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:11">vu ukai mu a̱ ma̱za̱nga̱.<verse eid="PSA 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 30:12" />Adama a nannai, mi a kupaɗa bini ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:12">mi ta̱ a kucikpa wu n ishipa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 30:12">Vuzavaguɗu, avu ɗa Ka̱shile ka̱va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:12">mi ta̱ a kucikpa wu ko wannai.<verse eid="PSA 30:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="PSA 31" />
  <para style="s1">Avasa a uneki u ka̱ɗu u Ka̱shile</para>
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: Vishipa vu Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 31:1" />N ta̱wa̱ ta̱ wa̱ a̱ nu Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:1">adama a na vu ere mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:1">ka̱ta̱ vu ka̱sukpa̱ a̱ ciya̱ ulyaꞋi a̱ va̱ ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:1">avu Ka̱shile ka usuɓi kaꞋa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:1">wawa mu mi ta̱ ufolu u nu.<verse eid="PSA 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 31:2" />Pana ka mu, vu wawa mu gogo na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:2">vu okpo ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:2">mashilya ma utsura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:2">ma na ma ku isa mu.<verse eid="PSA 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 31:3" />Avu ɗa ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku u va̱, n mashilya ma̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:3">tono nu mpa tsu na vu yaꞋin uzuwakpani.<verse eid="PSA 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 31:4" />Ere mu a maza ma na a zuwakai mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:4">adama a na avu ɗa ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku u va̱.<verse eid="PSA 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 31:5" />Ekiye a̱ nu a ɗa n zuwai wuma u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:5">avu ɗa vu shiba̱i mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:5">Vuzavaguɗu, Ka̱shile ku usuɓi.<verse eid="PSA 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 31:6" />N iwan ta̱ aza a na i o kutono a̱ma̱li,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:6">ama n mpa n zuwa ta̱ ka̱ɗu u Vuzavaguɗu.<verse eid="PSA 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 31:7" />Mi ta̱ a kuyaꞋan ma̱za̱nga̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:7">adama a ucigi u nu u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:7">vu ene ta̱ atakaci a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:7">Vu yeve ta̱ mɓa̱la̱ n va̱.<verse eid="PSA 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 31:8" />Vu neke mu ekiye irala i va̱ ba.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:8">ama vu zuwa mu ta̱ a ubuta̱ u singai.<verse eid="PSA 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 31:9" />Vuzavaguɗu pana asuvayali a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:9">adama a na mi ta̱ a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka atakaci.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:9">a̱shi a̱ va̱ a shitasa ta̱ adama a̱ ma̱shi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:9">wuma u va̱ n ikyamba yi oꞋwoi yo okpoi luɓa̱.<verse eid="PSA 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 31:10" />Una̱mgbuka̱tsuma̱ u jebe ta̱ ayin a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:10">ma̱shi kpamu me jebe ta̱ a̱ya̱ a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:10">utsura u va̱ u kotso ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:10">adama a̱ ka̱bunda̱i atakaci a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:10">ali etele a̱ va̱ a̱ kuwa̱i.<verse eid="PSA 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 31:11" />Ɗa mo okpoi ili ma̱ka̱n,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:11">e kelime ki irala i va̱,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:11">ili i kugoyi a̱ ubuta̱ wa aza a na ci ida̱shi ɗeɗevu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:11">ili i wovon wa aza na e yevei mu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:11">ene mu baci a uye, ka̱ta̱ a suma.<verse eid="PSA 31:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 31:12" />A cinukpai nu mpa tsu vuza na u kuwa̱i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:12">mo okpoi ci ili i na a variki.<verse eid="PSA 31:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 31:13" />M pana ta̱ irala i va̱ a̱ kuyun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:13">ɗa wovon u ka̱ra̱Ꞌi mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:13">e kusheshe adama a na a una mu.<verse eid="PSA 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 31:14" />Ama mpa n zuwa ta̱ ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ wa̱ nu, Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:14">&lt;&lt;Avu ɗa Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 31:15" />Makyan dem vi ta̱ a̱ kula̱na̱ mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:15">vu isa mu ta̱ a̱ ubuta̱ wi irala i va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:15">ekiye aza a na i a kutakacika mu.<verse eid="PSA 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 31:16" />Mpa kagbashi ka̱ nu kaꞋa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:16">indana mu n a̱shi a singai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:16">isa mu adama a ucigi u nu u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba.<verse eid="PSA 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 31:17" />Ka̱ta̱ vu ka̱sukpa̱ m pana wono ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:17">Vuzavaguɗu, adama a na n ɗeke wu ta̱.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:17">zuwa uma a gbani-gbani a pana wono,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:17">a̱ gida̱la̱ n ka̱bini a kubana a̱ ubuta̱ wa̱ a̱kpisa̱.<verse eid="PSA 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 31:18" />Kuya̱ngu una̱ wa aza aꞋuwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:18">aza o kugoyi ra̱ka̱ n aza a̱ra̱ɗi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:18">a na i a kuyaꞋanka aza a usuɓi kadanshi ko kugoyi.<verse eid="PSA 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 31:19" />Ka̱bunda̱i ka̱ yiɗa̱i a kugisanku n kasingai ka̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:19">kasingai ka na vu yaꞋankai aza a na i a kupana wovon u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:19">kasingai ka na vu yaꞋin a̱ a̱shi a uma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:19">wa aza a na i a̱ kula̱nsa̱ ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku wa̱ a̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 31:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 31:20" />Vu tsu sokongu le ta̱ a̱ ubuta̱ u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:20">a nsata n uma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:20">Vu tsu zuwa le ta̱ m ma̱ta̱na̱ a̱ ubuta̱ wi ida̱shi i nu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:20">ka̱ta̱ a pana ishikushi i uma ba.<verse eid="PSA 31:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 31:21" />Cikpai Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:21">adama a na u yotsongu mu ta̱ ucigi u ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:21">ucigi u ni u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:21">a makyan ma na a kanji mu n kuvon,<verse eid="PSA 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 31:22" />M panai wovon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:22">mpa n sheshe ta̱ vu loko mu ta̱ wa̱ a̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:22">Ama ɗa vu panai ma̱shi ma̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:22">a makyan ma na n ɗekei nu kula̱nsa̱ uɓa̱nki,<verse eid="PSA 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 31:23" />Cigai Vuzavaguɗu, a̱ɗa̱ uma a usuɓi a̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:23">Vuzavaguɗu wi ta̱ e kere aza a usuɓi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:23">ama u tsu takacika ta̱ aza a̱ra̱ɗi.<verse eid="PSA 31:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 31:24" />tsurukpai ka̱ta̱ i gbama asuvu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:24">ra̱ka̱ vu ɗa̱ na i keɗei a̱pa̱Ꞌa̱ u Vuzavaguɗu.<verse eid="PSA 31:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="PSA 32" />
  <para style="s1">Kushika̱ ku unushi n kucinukpa ku unushi.</para>
  <para style="d">VicuꞋu vu tsuwaꞋi tsu Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 32:1" />Vuza vu ma̱za̱nga̱ ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:1">vuza na a cinukpai unushi u ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:1">vuza na a takpai unushi u ni.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:7-8">Rom 4:7-8</ref></char></note><verse eid="PSA 32:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 32:2" />Vuza vu ma̱za̱nga̱ ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:2">vuza na Vuzavaguɗu wi a ku ula yi n unushi ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:2">kpamu a̱ ciya̱ ka gbani-gbani wa̱ a̱ ni ba.<verse eid="PSA 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 32:3" />Ana n shika̱i unushi u va̱ ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:3">Mo oꞋusoi ka̱ci ka̱ va̱ kanna dem a̱ ma̱shi.<verse eid="PSA 32:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 32:4" />Vuzavaguɗu, vu takacika mu ta̱ kanna n kayin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:4">utsura u va̱ u kotsoi ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 32:4">tsu na mita̱ me ci ɗekpe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:4">adama a usuɗukpi u kanna ka ayin a kpandari. <char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 32:5" />Ɗa n shika̱i unushi u va̱ wa̱ a̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:5">n sokongu unushi u va̱ ba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 32:5">N danai, &lt;&lt;Mi ta̱ a̱ kushika̱ unushi u va̱ u Vuzavaguɗu.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:5">Ɗa tana vu cinukpakai mu unushi u va̱. <char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 32:6" />Adama a nannai yaba dem na wi o kutono wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:6">wi ta̱ a kuvasa wa̱ a̱ nu, a makyan ma atakaci,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 32:6">a makyan ma na kawuya ka̱ ta̱wa̱i le tsu mini ma na ma ayai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:6">mi a kuyawa wu e le ba.<verse eid="PSA 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 32:7" />Avu ɗa ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:7">vi ta̱ a ku wawa mu atakaci,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 32:7">mi ta̱ a kucanana ishipa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:7">adama a wishi u nu.<char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 32:8" />Vuzavaguɗu u danai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:8">mi ta̱ o kuyotsongu wu uye u na vu kutono,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 32:8">mi ta̱ e kuneke wu kadanshi n neke wu odoki kpamu.<verse eid="PSA 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 32:9" />Ka̱ ta̱ vo okpo n tsulau tsu kodoku ko makparagi ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:9">ele na sai n iryangama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:9">ka̱ta̱ yeve o tono wu.<verse eid="PSA 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 32:10" />Mayun ɗa aza a gbani-gbani a takacika,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:10">ama aza a na e nekei ka̱ɗu u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:10">ucigi u ni u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba wi ta̱ e kere le.<verse eid="PSA 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 32:11" />YaꞋin ma̱za̱nga̱, a̱ɗa̱ aza a usuɓi ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:11">yaꞋin ma̱za̱nga̱ adama a ili i na Vuzavaguɗu u yaꞋin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:11">ra̱ka̱ vu ɗa̱ na yi o kutono yi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 32:11">yaꞋin isali i ma̱za̱nga̱.<verse eid="PSA 32:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="PSA 33" />
  <para style="s1">Vishipa vu ucikpi</para>
  <para style="d">Vishipa vu Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 33:1" />YaꞋin ma̱za̱nga̱, a̱ɗa̱ aza a usuɓi ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:1">adama a ili i na Vuzavaguɗu u yaꞋin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:1">cikpai ni a̱ɗa̱ na yi o kutono yi.<verse eid="PSA 33:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 33:2" />Cikpai Vuzavaguɗu n umolu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:2">yaꞋankai ni ishipa n umolu u na wi n anꞋin kupa.<verse eid="PSA 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 33:3" />YaꞋankai ni vishipa vu savu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:3">waꞋakai ni umolu mayin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:3">i yaꞋan ishipa i ma̱za̱nga̱ n kacaꞋa!<verse eid="PSA 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 33:4" />Adama a na kadanshi ka Vuzavaguɗu mayun ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:4">kpamu ulinga u ni ra̱ka̱ wu usuɓi u ɗa.<verse eid="PSA 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 33:5" />Vuzavaguɗu u tsu ciga ta̱ kamayun n usuɓi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:5">aduniyan a shana ta̱ n ucigi u Vuzavaguɗu u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba.<verse eid="PSA 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 33:6" />N uneki u kadanshi kaꞋa Vuzavaguɗu u yaꞋin gaɗi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:6">n kadanshi ka̱ ni kaꞋa, u yaꞋin kanna, wotoi n azangata.<verse eid="PSA 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 33:7" />U ɓolongi mini ma mala a̱ ubuta̱ ute,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:7">u zuwai mala ma uga̱vi ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:7">tsu vuza na u foɓoi ishina o mopon,<verse eid="PSA 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 33:8" />YaꞋan aduniyan ra̱ka̱ a pana wovon u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:8">panai wovon u ni uma aduniyan.<verse eid="PSA 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 33:9" />N kadanshi kaꞋa u yaꞋin aduniyan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:9">kadanshi kaꞋa u nekei ɗa ili ra̱ka̱ i shamgbai.<verse eid="PSA 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 33:10" />Vuzavaguɗu u tsu la̱nga̱sa̱ ta̱ ofoɓuso a uma aduniyan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:10">u tsu sabaꞋasaka ta̱ kusheshe ku uma.<verse eid="PSA 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 33:11" />Ama kusheshe ku Vuzavaguɗu ki ta̱ lo ko wannai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:11">kusheshe ku ka̱ɗu ku ni kpamu a makyan dem.<verse eid="PSA 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 33:12" />Uduniyan u ma̱za̱nga̱ u ɗa u na Vuzavaguɗu ɗa Ka̱shile ka̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:12">uma a na u zagbai okpo uma uka̱ni a̱ ni.<verse eid="PSA 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 33:13" />Ɗe gaɗi ɗa Vuzavaguɗu u tsu indana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:13">ka̱ta̱ wene uma dem.<verse eid="PSA 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 33:14" />Ɗe a̱ ubuta̱ wi ida̱shi i ni u ɗa u tsu indana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:14">u tsu ene ta̱ uma a na i a̱ ida̱shi aduniyan ra̱ka̱,<verse eid="PSA 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 33:15" />a̱yi ɗa u yaꞋin a̱ɗu e le dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:15">kpamu u tsu yeve ta̱ i na a ci yaꞋansa dem.<verse eid="PSA 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 33:16" />Mogono ma tsu ciya̱ wishi adama ovonshi a̱bunda̱i a̱ ni ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:16">keyevi ko kuvon ka tsu laꞋaka adama a utsura u gbayin u ni ba.<verse eid="PSA 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 33:17" />Kuneke ku ka̱ɗu o kodoku ko kuvon, ili gbani i ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:17">n utsura u ni ra̱ka̱, wi a ku isa vuma ba.<verse eid="PSA 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 33:18" />Ama a̱shi a Vuzavaguɗu i ta̱ a ku inda aza a na i a kupana wovon u ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:18">aza a na e keɗei a̱pa̱Ꞌa̱ e le</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:18">a ucigi u ni u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba.<verse eid="PSA 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 33:19" />U tsu isa le ta̱ a̱ ubuta̱ wu ukpa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:19">ka̱ta̱ u zuwa le o yongo n wuma a ayin a kambulu.<verse eid="PSA 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 33:20" />U Vuzavaguɗu u ɗa tsu keɗei a̱pa̱Ꞌa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:20">a̱yi ɗa ma̱ra̱ga̱ ma̱ tsu n ka̱ɓa̱nki ka̱ tsu.<verse eid="PSA 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 33:21" />Adama a̱ ni a ɗa ci a̱ ma̱za̱nga̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:21">adama a na tsu neke ta̱ a̱ɗu a̱ tsu a kula ku ciɗa ku ni.<verse eid="PSA 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 33:22" />Vuzavaguɗu yaꞋan ucigi u ni u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba u yongo n a̱ tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:22">a na tsu keɗei a̱pa̱Ꞌa̱ a̱ tsu wa̱ a̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 33:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="PSA 34" />
  <para style="s1">Ucikpi adama a wishi</para>
  <para style="d">Vishipa vu Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 34:1" />Mi ta̱ a kucikpa Vuzavaguɗu makyan dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:1">ucikpi u ni wi ta̱ o kuyongo a̱ una̱ u va̱ makyan dem.<verse eid="PSA 34:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 34:2" />Mi ta̱ a kucikpa Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:2">yaꞋan aza ayali a pana ka̱ta̱ a yaꞋan ma̱za̱nga̱.<verse eid="PSA 34:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 34:3" />Salai tsugbayin tsu Vuzavaguɗu nu mpa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:3">tsu cikpa kula ku ni koɓolo.<verse eid="PSA 34:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 34:4" />N folonoi Vuzavaguɗu, ɗa tana wu ushuki mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:4">ɗa wu utuka̱i mu a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ko wovon u va̱ dem.<verse eid="PSA 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 34:5" />Aza a na i o kudoro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:5">a zuwai a̱shi e le wa̱ a̱ ni, a yaꞋin ma̱za̱nga̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:5">i o kudoku ku na̱mgba̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ba.<verse eid="PSA 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 34:6" />Aza a unambi a yaꞋin meɗevile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:6">ɗa ta na Vuzavaguɗu u panakai le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:6">ɗa wi isai le a̱ ka̱tsa̱ma̱ ka atakaci e le.<verse eid="PSA 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 34:7" />Kalingata ka̱ ni ki ta̱ e kere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:7">aza a na i a kupana wovon u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:7">wu isai le a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka atakaci e le.<verse eid="PSA 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 34:8" />Kondoi yene n ka̱ci ka̱ ɗa̱ Vuzavaguɗu vuza kasingai ɗa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:8">vuza vu una̱singai ɗa a̱yi na u ciya̱i ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku wa̱ a̱ ni.<verse eid="PSA 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 34:9" />Yevei n ka̱ci ka̱ ɗa̱ tsu na</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:9">Vuzavaguɗu wi n kasingai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:9">vuza vu ma̱za̱nga̱ vuza na u ciya̱i</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:9">ida̱shi i ma̱ta̱na̱ wa̱ ni.<verse eid="PSA 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 34:10" />Ali ikawu feu, i tsu namba ta̱ ilikulya a pana kambulu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:10">ama aza a na i o kutono Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:10">i a kunamba ili i singai ba.<verse eid="PSA 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 34:11" />Ta̱wa̱i, a̱ɗa̱ muku n va̱, i panaka mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:11">mi ta̱ o kuyotsongu ɗa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:11">tsu na i kupana wovon u Vuzavaguɗu.<verse eid="PSA 34:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 34:12" />Yayi wi a kuciga u pana u yoꞋo u wuma u ni?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:12">Yayi u cigai wu ene ayin a singai?<verse eid="PSA 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 34:13" />Sai, u ka̱na̱ kelentsu ka̱ ni a̱ ubuta̱ u ka gbani-gbani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:13">ka̱ta̱ kpamu u ka̱na̱ una̱ u ni a̱ ubuta̱ u kuyaꞋan ka aꞋuwa.<verse eid="PSA 34:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 34:14" />U ka̱sukpa̱ ka gbani-gbani ka̱ ni, u yaꞋan kasingai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:14">u la̱nsa̱ ma̱ta̱na̱ n ka̱ɗu ka̱ ni ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 34:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 34:15" />A̱shi a Vuzavaguɗu i ta̱ a kinda aza a usuɓi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:15">atsuvu a̱ ni kpamu i ta̱ a kupana ma̱shi me le.<verse eid="PSA 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 34:16" />A̱shi a Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:16">i ta̱ a tsurala n aza a na a ci yaꞋan ka gbani-gbani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 34:16">adama a na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:16">i ta̱ a kucinukpa n ukuna u le punu aduniyan ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 34:17" />Aza a usuɓi a̱ tsu shika̱ ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:17">Vuzavaguɗu tana u tsu panaka le ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 34:17">ka̱ta̱ wi isa le</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:17">a̱ ka̱tsa̱ma̱ ka atakaci e le dem.<verse eid="PSA 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 34:18" />Vuzavaguɗu u tsu yongo ta̱ ɗevu n aza a ugushi u ka̱ɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:18">u tsu isa ta̱ aza a na utuka̱i a̱ɗu.<verse eid="PSA 34:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 34:19" />Vuma vu usuɓi vu tsu takacika ta̱ ka̱u,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:19">ama Vuzavaguɗu u tsu isai ta̱ a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ke le dem.<verse eid="PSA 34:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 34:20" />Adama a na Vuzavaguɗu u tsu ere le ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:20">ko ketele ke le ke te ka na o kukoɗo.<verse eid="PSA 34:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 34:21" />Ka gbani-gbani ki ta̱ a ku una vuma gbani-gbani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:21">i ta̱ a kutakacika aza a na i a kuꞋiwan aza a usuɓi.<verse eid="PSA 34:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 34:22" />Vuzavaguɗu wi ta̱ a̱ kushiba̱ wuma wa agbashi a̱ ni.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:22">aza a na a banai wa̱ a̱ ni kula̱nsa̱ ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku, i ta̱ a̱ ku ka̱sukpa̱ le n wuma.<verse eid="PSA 34:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="PSA 35" />
  <para style="s1">Avasa a̱ kula̱nsa̱ uɓa̱nki</para>
  <para style="d">Vishipa vu Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 35:1" />Vuzavaguɗu, yaꞋan vu shilika̱ n aza a na i a̱ vishili nu mpa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:1">yaꞋan kuvon n aza a na i o kuvon nu mpa.<verse eid="PSA 35:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 35:2" />Vu ɗika ma̱ra̱ga̱ n ucanuku u kuvon u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:2">vu ta̱wa̱ vu ɓa̱nka̱ mu.<verse eid="PSA 35:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 35:3" />Ɗa̱ngusa̱ masara ma̱ nu n kabata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:3">vu shilika̱ n aza a na i a ku guva mu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 35:3">yaꞋan m panaka wu a kudana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:3">&lt;&lt;Mpa ɗa kishi ka̱ nu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 35:4" />YaꞋan aza a na i a̱ kula̱nsa̱ wuma u va̱, a pana wono,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:4">zuwa aza a na i a kuyaꞋanka mu nsata a lukanasa le okpo n wono a̱ ripula̱.<verse eid="PSA 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 35:5" />Zuwa le okpo kopo ka na wunla̱i u tsu pura̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:5">tsu aza a na kalingata ka Vuzavaguɗu ki o kuloko.<verse eid="PSA 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 35:6" />YaꞋan uye u le wo okpo ka̱yimbi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:6">wo okpo n kederi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:6">a makyan ma na kalingata ka Vuzavaguɗu ki a ku guva le.<verse eid="PSA 35:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 35:7" />Adama a na babu unushi ɗa a zuwakai mu maza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:7">a̱ ga̱va̱ka̱i mu kpenle ku uga̱vi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:7">adama a na n yikpa̱ punu.<verse eid="PSA 35:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 35:8" />YaꞋan atakaci a cinika le babu uyevi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 35:8">Ka̱sukpa̱ maza ma na azuki ma aza le.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:8">ka̱ta̱ kpamu a̱ yikpa̱ punu e kpenle ka ali a ukpisa̱.<verse eid="PSA 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 35:9" />Ka̱ta̱ n yaꞋan ma̱za̱nga̱ adama a Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:9">mi ta̱ a kuyaꞋan ma̱za̱nga̱ adama a na wi isa mu ta̱.<verse eid="PSA 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 35:10" />N ka̱ɗu kete mi ta̱ a kudana Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:10">&lt;&lt;Vuza wi lo tsu nu ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 35:10">vu tsu wawa ta̱ aza a unambi wa aza a utsura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:10">aza a unambi n ofoloni ekiye aza a na i o kudoro le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 35:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 35:11" />Uma a gbani-gbani a kuyaꞋan aꞋuwa adama a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:11">a bankai n kadanshi ka unushi u na n yevei ba.<verse eid="PSA 35:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 35:12" />A kutsupa kasingai ka̱ va̱ n ka gbani-gbani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:12">ali ɗa n nambai i na n kuyaꞋan n wuma.<verse eid="PSA 35:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 35:13" />Ama a makyan ma na i a mɓa̱la̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:13">mpa n tsu uka ta̱ akashi a kpalu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:13">n iwain kulyaꞋa ilikulyaꞋa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 35:13">n vasai n kaci ka̱ va̱ uza̱liki,<verse eid="PSA 35:13" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 35:14" />tsu na n kuyaꞋanka ka̱ja̱Ꞌa̱ ko vuza va̱ avasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:14">mu uta̱i a̱shi u la̱nga̱shi adama a una̱mgbi u ka̱tsuma̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:14">tsu vuza na wi a̱ ma̱shi ma̱ a̱na̱ku a̱ ni.<verse eid="PSA 35:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 35:15" />Ama ɗa baci n ta̱ɗa̱tsa̱i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:15">o ɓolongu a̱ ma̱za̱nga̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:15">irala i va̱ o ɓolongi ka̱ci ke le adama a̱ va̱ n yeve ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:15">a̱ ka̱na̱i ku zoꞋoso mu babu kuka̱sukpa̱.<verse eid="PSA 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 35:16" />Tsu aza a na i kupana wovon u Ka̱shile ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:16">a yaꞋankai mu ma̱ka̱n ka̱u,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 35:16">n a lunganai mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:16">adama tsurala tsu na i a tsu ɗa nu mpa.<verse eid="PSA 35:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 35:17" />Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:17">ali wannai ɗa va̱ ka̱na̱ kinda le koci?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 35:17">Isa mu ekiye e le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:17">wawa wuma u va̱ a̱ ubuta̱ wi ikawu i nampa.<verse eid="PSA 35:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 35:18" />Ka̱ta̱ n cikpa wu o koɓolo ka uma ka̱ a̱bunda̱i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:18">e kelime ka uma a̱bunda̱i mi ta̱ a kucikpa wu.<verse eid="PSA 35:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 35:19" />Ka̱ta̱ vu ka̱sukpa̱ irala i va̱, aza aꞋuwa a nan lo, ene uyikpi uva̱ ba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 35:19">ka̱ta̱ vu ka̱sukpa̱ irala i va̱ i babu unushi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:19">n cigipi tsu a̱shi a yaꞋan ma̱za̱nga̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:19">a pana uyoꞋo adama atakaci a̱ va̱ ba.<verse eid="PSA 35:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 35:20" />A ci yaꞋan kadanshi kasingai ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:20">ama ka̱ta̱ a kucikpa a yaꞋan kadanshi ka aꞋuwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:20">wa aza a na i a̱ ida̱shi i ma̱ta̱na̱.<verse eid="PSA 35:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 35:21" />Ɗa a shikai mu a danai, &lt;&lt;Ehen! Ehen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:21">tsu ene wu ta̱ n a̱shi a̱ tsu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 35:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 35:22" />Ama avu Vuzavaguɗu vu ene ta̱ ili nampa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:22">adama a nannai, ka̱ta̱ vu ka̱sukpa̱ le ba.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:22">Vuzavaguɗu ka̱ta̱ vu bana daꞋangi nu mpa ba.<verse eid="PSA 35:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 35:23" />Vuzavaguɗu ɗa̱nga̱, vu ere mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:23">Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱, isa ka mu ili i na yi i va̱.<verse eid="PSA 35:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 35:24" />Avu vuza vu usuɓi ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:24">Vuzavaguɗu yotsongu le unambi wu unushi u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 35:24">ka̱ta̱ vu ka̱sukpa̱ irala i va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:24">a yaꞋan ma̱za̱nga̱ adama a̱ va̱ ba.<verse eid="PSA 35:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 35:25" />Ka̱ta̱ vu ka̱sukpa̱ le a danaka ka̱ci ke le, &lt;&lt;Ehen! ili i na tsu cigai i ɗanna.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:25">Ka̱ta̱ vu ka̱sukpa̱ le a dana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:25">&lt;&lt;Tsu fuɗa yi ta̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 35:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 35:26" />Ka̱sukpa̱ yaba dem na u yaꞋin ma̱za̱nga̱ adama atakaci a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:26">a fuɗa le ali a̱ ripula̱,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 35:26">yaꞋan aza a na i a kuɗika a laꞋa mu ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:26">okpo n wono n kugoyi.<verse eid="PSA 35:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 35:27" />YaꞋan aza a na i a̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ adama a wishi u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:27">a sala m ma̱za̱nga̱, n a danai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 35:27">&lt;&lt;Vuzavaguɗu vuza gbayin ɗa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:27">wi ta̱ a̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ adama ulyaꞋi u kagbashi ka̱ ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 35:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 35:28" />Ka̱ta̱ n sala ukuna wu usuɓi u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:28">kanna lakam mi ta̱ a kucikpa wu.<verse eid="PSA 35:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="PSA 36" />
  <para style="s1">Ka gbani-gbani ka vuma</para>
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: Vishipa vu Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 36:1" />Unushi wu ucigi u ka̱ɗu u tsu yaꞋan ta̱ kadanshi n uma a gbani-gbani a̱ɗu e le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:1">i n wovon u Ka̱shile a̱ a̱shi e le ba,<verse eid="PSA 36:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 36:2" />Adama a na i ta̱ a kuɗika ka̱ci ke le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:2">ele ili i yoku i ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 36:2">e kene ku le,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 36:2">unushi u le wi a̱ ku uta̱ e keteshe ba.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:2">ali e neke le unushi.<verse eid="PSA 36:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 36:3" />Kadanshi ke le ki ta̱ tukpa n ka gbani-gbani n aꞋuwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:3">a buwa n ugboji u na a kuyaꞋan kasingai ba.<verse eid="PSA 36:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 36:4" />E ci sheshe ta̱ ka gbani-gbani a makyan ma na i a ivaꞋin ajiba ele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:4">kuyongo kugaꞋan le ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:4">a ci iwan ka gbani-gbani ba.<verse eid="PSA 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 36:5" />Vuzavaguɗu ucigi u nu u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:5">u yawa ta̱ ali gaɗi a̱da̱nga̱shile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:5">usuɓi u nu u yawa ta̱ a gaɗi vu eleshu.<verse eid="PSA 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 36:6" />Usuɓi u nu wi ta̱ tsu nsasan n Ka̱shile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:6">afada a̱ nu i ta̱ tsu uga̱vi u mala magbayin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:6">Vuzavaguɗu a vu ɗa vi a̱ kula̱na̱ uma nu nnama dem.<verse eid="PSA 36:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 36:7" />Ka̱shile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:7">nu n yiɗa̱i a ku gisanku ugain wu ucigi u nu u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:7">Uma a̱ tsu ciya̱ ta̱ ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku a ɗaka vu evelyu a̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 36:8" />A ci yaꞋan ta̱ ka̱ɗiva̱ n ka̱bunda̱i ki ilikulyaꞋa i na yi A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin a̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:8">vu tsu neke le ta̱ mini moku soꞋo o kuɗolu ku kasingai ku nu.<verse eid="PSA 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 36:9" />Avu ɗa a̱shi a̱ mini a na e ci neke wuma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:9">n kutashi ku nu ku ɗa tsu ce ene kutashi.<verse eid="PSA 36:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 36:10" />LyaꞋa kelime n ucigi u nu u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:10">wa aza a na e yevei nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:10">lyaꞋa kelime n kasingai ka̱ nu wa aza a na i n kamayun a̱ɗu.<verse eid="PSA 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 36:11" />Ka̱ta̱ vu ka̱sukpa̱ ene aza a ugbamukaci a dasa mu ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:11">ko kpamu vu ka̱sukpa̱ ekiye aza a gbani-gbani o loko mu ba.<verse eid="PSA 36:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 36:12" />La̱na̱ ubuta̱ u na aza a gbani-gbani a̱ yikpa̱i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:12">ta ɗe a vaki a fuɗa a̱ ɗa̱nga̱ ba.<verse eid="PSA 36:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="PSA 37" />
  <para style="s1">Ukocishi wa aza a gbani-gbani n aza a usuɓi</para>
  <para style="d">Vishipa vu Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 37:1" />Ka̱ta̱ vu na̱mgba̱ ka̱tsuma̱ adama a uma a gbani-gbani ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:1">ko kpamu vu yaꞋan cisheꞋe tsa aza a na i a kuyaꞋan ka gbani-gbani ba.<verse eid="PSA 37:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 37:2" />Adama a na, megeshe kenu i ta̱ a̱ kupuwa̱nka̱ tsu mita̱ ma na me ɗekpei</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:2">i ta̱ a ku lumba tsu mita̱ ma savu,<verse eid="PSA 37:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 37:3" />Neke ka̱ɗu u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:3">ka̱ta̱ vu yaꞋan kasingai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:3">ka̱ta̱ vu da̱sa̱ngu a iɗika ya, vu ciya̱ ma̱ta̱na̱.<verse eid="PSA 37:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 37:4" />La̱nsa̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:4">a̱yi tana wi ta̱ e kuneke wu i na ka̱ɗu ka̱ nu ka cigai.<verse eid="PSA 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 37:5" />Neke ka̱ci ka̱ nu u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:5">vu neke ka̱ɗu ka̱ nu wa̱ a̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:5">wi ta̱ tana a̱ kuɓa̱nka̱ wu.<verse eid="PSA 37:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 37:6" />Wi ta̱ a kuzuwa kasingai ka̱ nu ka tasa tsu kutashi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:6">usuɓi u nu kpamu wa akana tsu kanna a kaci.<verse eid="PSA 37:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 37:7" />Shamgba shiriri u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:7">ka̱na̱ ka̱ɗu ka̱ nu vu vana yi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 37:7">ka̱ta̱ vu na̱mgba̱ ka̱tsuma̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:7">adama a ulyaꞋi u kelime u vuza ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 37:7">ko u vuza vu ulyaꞋi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:7">a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka̱ a ubuta̱ wo ofoɓuso a ka gbani-gbani ka̱ ni ba.<verse eid="PSA 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 37:8" />Ka̱ta̱ vu yaꞋan wupa, ko vu na̱mgba̱ ka̱ɗu ba.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:8">ka̱ta̱ vu na̱mgba̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 37:8">adama a na, nannai va u tsu tuka̱ n koyoku ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:8">sai ka gbani-gbani.<verse eid="PSA 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 37:9" />Aza a na a zuwai a̱ɗu u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:9">i ta̱ a kuyaꞋan ida̱shi i le m ma̱ta̱na̱ a iɗika ya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 37:9">ama i ta̱ o kuloko aza a gbani-gbani,<verse eid="PSA 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 37:10" />M megeshe kenu, uma a gbani-gbani i ta̱ a̱ kupuwa̱nka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:10">vi ta̱ a̱ kula̱nsa̱ le, ama vi a̱ ku ciya̱ le ba.<verse eid="PSA 37:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 37:11" />Ama aza a na a ɗikai ka̱ci ke le ili ba, i ta̱ a kulyaꞋa uka̱ni wi iɗika ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:11">a pana uyoꞋo u ma̱ta̱na̱ mayin.<verse eid="PSA 37:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 37:12" />Vuma vu gbani-gbani u tsu foɓusoko ta̱ vuma vu usuɓi kawuya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:12">ka̱ta̱ u ka̱na̱ ku lungana yi adama a tsurala,<verse eid="PSA 37:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 37:13" />ama Vuzavaguɗu u tsu zoꞋoso ta̱ vuza vu gbani-gbani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:13">adama a na u yeve ta̱ makyan ma na a ku una yi, mi ta̱ lo a̱ kuta̱wa̱.<verse eid="PSA 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 37:14" />Aza a gbani-gbani a tsu tala ta̱ otokobi ele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:14">o rono ta̱ utan u le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:14">adama a na a una aza a unambi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:14">una aza a usuɓi.<verse eid="PSA 37:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 37:15" />ama otokobi ele i ta̱ a ku una le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:15">i ta̱ kpamu o koɗoso utan u le.<verse eid="PSA 37:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 37:16" />Ili i kenu i na vuza vu usuɓi wi n i ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:16">i laꞋa ta̱ uciyi u vuma vu gbani-gbani.<verse eid="PSA 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 37:17" />Adama a na Vuzavaguɗu wi ta̱ o kukoɗo utsura u vuza vu gbani-gbani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:17">ama u tsu ere ta̱ vuza vu usuɓi.<verse eid="PSA 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 37:18" />Vuzavaguɗu u tsu la̱na̱ ta̱ aza a na i o kutono yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:18">iɗika ya yi ta̱ okpo ili yi uka̱ni i le ko wannai,<verse eid="PSA 37:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 37:19" />I a kupana wono a makyan ma atakaci ba.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:19">i ta̱ a̱ kuciya̱ ilikulyaꞋa ba̱ri a ayin a kambulu.<verse eid="PSA 37:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 37:20" />Ama uma gbani-gbani i ta̱ a̱ ku kuwa̱.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:20">aza na a iwain Vuzavaguɗu i ta̱ a̱ kupuwa̱nka̱ tsu a̱pa̱lu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:20">i ta̱ kupuwa̱nka̱ an ka̱nga̱ a laza.<verse eid="PSA 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 37:21" />Vuza vu gbani-gbani u ci lyaꞋa ta̱ kutan ka̱ta̱ u iwan ku tsupa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:21">ama vuza vu usuɓi vuza kasingai ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:21">vuza na u ci neke n ka̱ɗu ba̱ri.<verse eid="PSA 37:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 37:22" />Aza a na Vuzavaguɗu u zuwakai una̱singai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:22">i ta̱ a̱ kuciya̱ ida̱shi i ma̱ta̱na̱ a iɗika ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:22">ama aza a na u yaꞋankai una̱wuya i ta̱ o kuloko le.<verse eid="PSA 37:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 37:23" />Vuzavaguɗu u tsu tono ta̱ n vuma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:23">a uye u na u gaꞋin u tono,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:23">u tsu pana ta̱ uyoꞋo u kuyongo ku ni,<verse eid="PSA 37:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 37:24" />ko u ta̱ɗa̱tsa̱ baci, wi a̱ kuyikpa̱ a iɗika ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:24">adama a na Vuzavaguɗu u tsu ka̱na̱ yi ta̱ n kukiye ku ni,<verse eid="PSA 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 37:25" />Ali ayin a na mi ishi maku, ama gogo na n kutsa ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:25">n saꞋawa kene Vuzavaguɗu u vakangi vuza vu usuɓi ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:25">ko ene muku n ni ufolu wi ilikulya ba.<verse eid="PSA 37:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 37:26" />Makyan dem u tsu neke ta̱ ili ba̱ri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:26">u tsu neke ta̱ okopu wa aza o yoku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:26">muku n ni una̱singai u ɗa,<verse eid="PSA 37:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 37:27" />Ka̱sukpa̱i ka gbani-gbani i yaꞋan kasingai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:27">yi ta̱ o kuyongo a iɗika ya ko wannai.<verse eid="PSA 37:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 37:28" />Adama a na Vuzavaguɗu u ciga ta̱ ili i na yi derere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:28">u tsu ka̱sukpa̱ uma a usuɓi a̱ ni ba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 37:28">e kere le makyan dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:28">ama kumaci ku uma a gbani-gbani i ta̱ o kuloko le.<verse eid="PSA 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 37:29" />Aza a usuɓi i ta̱ a kulyaꞋa uka̱ni wi iɗika ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:29">ka̱ ta̱ a̱ da̱sa̱ngu punu i ɗa ko wannai.<verse eid="PSA 37:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 37:30" />Una̱ u vuza vu usuɓi u tsu dansa ta̱ kakuna ke kuyeve,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:30">kelentsu ka̱ ni ka tsu dansa ta̱ ili i na yi derere.<verse eid="PSA 37:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 37:31" />Wila̱ u Ka̱shile ka̱ ni wi ta̱ a̱ ka̱ɗu ka̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:31">u tsu ka̱sukpa̱ u ɗa ba ko wannai.<verse eid="PSA 37:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 37:32" />Aza a gbani-gbani a̱ tsu puta̱ ta̱ aza a usuɓi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:32">a̱ tsu la̱nsa̱ le ta̱ adama a na a una le.<verse eid="PSA 37:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 37:33" />Ama Vuzavaguɗu wi a̱ ku ka̱sukpa̱ le ekiye i irala i le ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:33">ko kpamu u ka̱sukpa̱ a yaꞋanka le afada a gbani-gbani ba.<verse eid="PSA 37:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 37:34" />Neke ka̱ɗu u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:34">ka̱ ta̱ kpamu vu yongo a uye u ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:34">a̱yi tana wi ta̱ a kuzuwa wu vu ciya̱ uka̱ni wi iɗika ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:34">vi ta̱ e kene o kuloko uma a gbani-gbani.<verse eid="PSA 37:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 37:35" />Me ene ta̱ vuma gbani-gbani ko asuvayali,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:35">u laꞋa ta̱ yaba dem ugaɗi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:35">a na nɗanga n Lebano.<verse eid="PSA 37:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 37:36" />Ama makyan kenu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:36">a na m bonoi, me ene yi ba.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:36">n la̱nsa̱ ni, ama me ene yi ba.<verse eid="PSA 37:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 37:37" />Indana uma a̱ ma̱riki, vu la̱na̱ uma a usuɓi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:37">vuza vu ma̱ta̱na̱ u tsu ciya̱ ta̱ ntsukaya.<verse eid="PSA 37:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 37:38" />Ama i ta̱ a ku una aza a unushi gbende,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:38">ka̱ta̱ a̱ pura̱ngu ntsukaya n le.<verse eid="PSA 37:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 37:39" />Vuzavaguɗu u tsu isa ta̱ aza a usuɓi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:39">a̱yi ɗa ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku u le a ayin atakaci.<verse eid="PSA 37:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 37:40" />Vuzavaguɗu u tsu ɓa̱nka̱ le ta̱ ka̱ta̱ kpamu wu isa le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:40">u tsu isa le ta̱ ekiye aza a gbani-gbani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:40">adama a na a̱ la̱nsa̱ ta̱ ubuta̱ u ku sheɗeku wa̱ a̱ ni.<verse eid="PSA 37:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="PSA 38" />
  <para style="s1">Avasa a vuza va atakaci</para>
  <para style="d">Vishipa vu Dawuda. Adama a ku ciɓasa.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 38:1" />Vuzavaguɗu, ka̱ta̱ vu ɓarangu mu a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka wupa u nu ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:1">ka̱ta̱ vu takacika mu n asuvu a usuɗukpi a̱ nu ba,<verse eid="PSA 38:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 38:2" />Vu yaꞋanka mu ta̱ usa̱n n ayaꞋa a̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:2">ɗa feu vu lapai mu ali a iɗika.<verse eid="PSA 38:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 38:3" />Adama a wupa u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:3">ikyamba i va̱ yi ta̱ a̱ mɓa̱la̱.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 38:3">ikyamba i va̱ ra̱ka̱ i ka̱ na̱ ta̱ mɓa̱la̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:3">adama a unushi u va̱.<verse eid="PSA 38:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 38:4" />Unushi u va̱ u laꞋa ta̱ utsura u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:4">an nu ucanuku wa̱ a̱miki, u na u laꞋi utsura u va̱.<verse eid="PSA 38:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 38:5" />Adama a tsulau tsu va̱ n yaꞋin unushi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:5">untsu a̱ va̱ a shamai ali a̱ ku uta̱ ushami,<verse eid="PSA 38:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 38:6" />Mɓa̱la̱ n va̱ n yaꞋan ta̱ a̱bunda̱i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:6">ali m poloi mu, kanna ka̱ɓula̱ mpa a̱ ma̱shi.<verse eid="PSA 38:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 38:7" />Ma̱vuna̱ ma̱ ka̱na̱ mu ta̱ wuya-wuya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:7">mi ta̱ ka̱ mɓa̱la̱ ka̱u.<verse eid="PSA 38:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 38:8" />Mo oꞋwoi ka̱u,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:8">ali mo okpoi luɓa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:8">ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ ka̱ na̱mgba̱i ka̱u,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:8">ɗa n ka̱na̱i yura̱ adama a usuɗukpi.<verse eid="PSA 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 38:9" />Vuzavaguɗu, vu yeve ta̱ ili i na mi a kuciga.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:9">vi ta̱ kpamu a kupana yura̱ i va̱ ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 38:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 38:10" />Ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ ki ta̱ a̱ ku muɗa̱sa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:10">utsura u va̱ u kotsoi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:10">ɗa a̱shi a̱ va̱ a̱ ka̱na̱i kene yimbi-yimbi.<verse eid="PSA 38:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 38:11" />A̱ja̱Ꞌa̱ a̱ va̱ n aza a na ci a̱ ida̱shi ɗeɗevu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:11">o doku a yawa ɗevu nu mpa ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:11">adama a̱ untsu a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:11">ali muku n va̱ dem n sumai mu.<verse eid="PSA 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 38:12" />Aza a na a cigai ku una mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:12">azuki mu maza.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:12">aza a na kpamu a cigai o doro mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:12">e kusheshe a yaꞋanka mu koli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:12">kanna ka̱ɓula̱ o kufoɓuso ka gbani-gbani adama a̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 38:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 38:13" />Mi ta̱ tsu kagulani n tsu pana ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:13">mi ta̱ tsu kebebe n tsu fuɗa n dansa ba.<verse eid="PSA 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 38:14" />Mo okpoi tsu kagulani n tsu pana ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:14">adama a na n tsu ushuku n kadanshi ba.<verse eid="PSA 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 38:15" />Vuzavaguɗu, n zuwa ta̱ ka̱ɗu wa̱ a̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:15">Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱, avu ɗa va̱ ku ushuku mu.<verse eid="PSA 38:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 38:16" />&lt;&lt;Ka̱ta̱ vu ka̱sukpa̱ irala i va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:16">a yaꞋan ma̱za̱nga̱ adama atakaci a̱ va̱ ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 38:16">ka̱ta̱ vu ka̱sukpa̱ le a lapa ma̱ka̱nga̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:16">adama a uyikpi u va̱ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 38:17" />Mi ta̱ ɗevu n kuyikpa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:17">mi ta̱ a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka atakaci ayin dem.<verse eid="PSA 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 38:18" />N shika̱ ta̱ u nushi u va̱.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:18">unushi u va̱ u zuwa mu ta̱ atakaci.<verse eid="PSA 38:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 38:19" />Aza a tsurala nu mpa ko unushi i ta̱ n utsura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:19">aza a na a iwain mu ko unushi i ta̱ lo n a̱bunda̱i.<verse eid="PSA 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 38:20" />Aza a na a tsu tsupa kasingai n ka gbani-gbani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:20">i ta̱ a tsurala nu mpa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:20">adama a na n ciga ta̱ kuyaꞋan kasingai.<verse eid="PSA 38:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 38:21" />Vuzavaguɗu, ka̱ta̱ vu ka̱sukpa̱ mu ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:21">Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱, ka̱ta̱ vu yaꞋan daꞋin nu mpa ba.<verse eid="PSA 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 38:22" />YaꞋan gogoꞋo vu ɓa̱nka̱ mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:22">Vuzavaguɗu kishi ka̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 38:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="PSA 39" />
  <para style="s1">Ma̱shi ma asuvayali</para>
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: A yaꞋan vu ɗa n ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ka Jedutun. Vishipa vu Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 39:1" />Ɗa n danai, &lt;&lt;Mi ta̱ a ku zuwaka n ili i na mi a kuyaꞋan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:1">adama a na ka̱ta̱ kelentsu ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:1">ka yaꞋan unushi ba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 39:1">mi e kukeɓece ukuna ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:1">a makyan ma na uma a gbani-gbani i ɗevu nu mpa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 39:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 39:2" />M paɗai bini, n dansa ukuna ba.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:2">ko a ili i na yi i singai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 39:2">ama n nannai dem atakaci a̱ va̱ o kudokusu.<verse eid="PSA 39:2" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 39:3" />Ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ ka shanai n atakaci.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 39:3">tsu ka̱bunda̱i ka aciɓa a̱ va̱, ta atakaci a̱ va̱ okpoi nannai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:3">mayun ɗa n yaꞋan kadanshi.<verse eid="PSA 39:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 39:4" />&lt;&lt;Vuzavaguɗu, ayin a yain a ɗai n kuyongo aduniyan?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:4">Wanai ɗai n kukuwa̱?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:4">Yotsongu mu n yeve tsu na ayin a̱ va̱ i a kulaza gogoꞋo lo.<verse eid="PSA 39:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 39:5" />La̱na̱, vu jebe ta̱ ka̱bunda̱i ka ayin a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:5">ka̱bunda̱i ayin a̱ va̱ wa̱ a̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:5">adanshi ili i yoku i ɗa ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 39:5">mayun wuma u vuza dem u laꞋa ayinviki ba.<char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 39:5" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 39:6" />Wuma u vuma dem wi ta̱ a ku vadalukpasa tsu kulu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:6">kubana n kubono ku ni dem gbani ɗa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:6">u tsu ɓolongu ta̱ uciyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:6">ama u tsu yeve ko yayi u kulyaꞋa uyoꞋo wu uɗa ba.<verse eid="PSA 39:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 39:7" />Vuzavaguɗu, gogo na a̱ yiɗa̱i n kuzuwa ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:7">Wa̱ a̱ nu u ɗa n zuwai ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 39:8" />Wawa mu a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka unushi u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:8">Ka̱ta̱ vu ka̱sukpa̱ alau o zoꞋoso mu ba̱.<verse eid="PSA 39:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 39:9" />Mi ta̱ a kupaɗa bini. mi a kudansa ukuna ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:9">adama a na vu zuwa mu ta̱ n takacikai tsu nampa.<verse eid="PSA 39:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 39:10" />Ka̱ta̱ vu doku vu takacika mu ba.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:10">n yaꞋan ta̱ ɗevu n ku kuwa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:10">adama a ulapi u na vi a kuyaꞋanka mu.<verse eid="PSA 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 39:11" />Vu tsu ɓarangu ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:11">ka̱ ta̱ kpamu vu takacika vuma adama a unushi u ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 39:11">tsu kayan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:11">vu tsu la̱nga̱sa̱ ta̱ ili i na vuma u laꞋi n kuciga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:11">mayun, vuza vu wuma dem wi ta̱ tsu wunla̱i u na u tsu laza.<char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 39:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 39:12" />Vuzavaguɗu, pana avasa a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:12">vu pana ma̱shi ma̱ va̱ kpamu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:12">ura ma̱shi ma̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:12">adama a na mi ta̱ koɓolo n avu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:12">tsu komoci ka na ka kulaza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 39:12">mpa komoci kaꞋa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:12">tsu na ikaya i va̱ yi ishi cau.<verse eid="PSA 39:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 39:13" />Ka̱sukpa̱ mu ko ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ ki ta̱ a kuvaku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:13">kafu n laza, n ka̱sukpa̱ ubuta̱ u nampa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 39:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="PSA 40" />
  <para style="s1">Vishipa vu kucikpa</para>
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: Vishipa vu Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 40:1" />N vana ta̱ uɓa̱nki u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:1">u zuwakai mu atsuvu a̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:1">ɗa u panai ma̱shi ma̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 40:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 40:2" />Wu utuka̱i mu e kpenle ku kederi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:2">a̱ ciꞋin n kolyoꞋo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:2">u kiyangi ene a̱ va̱ a gaɗi vu katali,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:2">u takpakai mu wovon.<verse eid="PSA 40:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 40:3" />U zuwai n cananai vishipa vu savu a̱ una̱ u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:3">vishipa vu kucikpa u Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:3">Uma n a̱bunda̱i ene baci nannai, i ta̱ kupana wovon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:3">ka̱ta̱ e neke a̱ɗu e le u Vuzavaguɗu.<verse eid="PSA 40:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 40:4" />Vuza vu una̱singai ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:4">vuza na u zuwai ka̱ɗu u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:4">vuza na u tsu tono a̱ma̱li ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:4">ko u gbaɓa kaci n aza a na a̱ tsu tono a̱ma̱li ba.<verse eid="PSA 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 40:5" />Vu yaꞋanka tsu ta̱ ili n a̱bunda̱i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:5">Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:5">vuza wi lo tsu nu ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:5">n dana baci n dansa ili i mereve i nu ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:5">i laꞋa ta̱ utsura u kudansa.<verse eid="PSA 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 40:6" />Vu ciga kuneꞋe n alyuka ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:6">vu ciga tana e neke wu alyuka o kusongu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:6">a nnama a gaɗi vu katalikalyuka ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:6">ko kuneꞋe adama a kutakpa unushi ba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:6">kucikpa ɗa vu nekei mu atsuvu a na n ku panaka wu.<verse eid="PSA 40:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 40:7" />Ɗa n danai,&lt;&lt;Mpa ɗa na, kadanshi ka̱ nu adama a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:7">ki ta̱ a katagarda ka̱ wila̱.<verse eid="PSA 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 40:8" />Ka̱shile n ciga ta̱ kutono ku sheshe ku nu ka̱u,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:8">n zuwa ta̱ wila̱ u nu a̱ ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 40:9" />Vuzavaguɗu, o koɓolo ka uma a usuɓi a̱ nu ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:9">n dansa ta̱ ukuna wu usuɓi u nu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:9">Vu yeve ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:9">mi a̱ kukpa̱ɗa̱ kudansa ukuna u nu ba.<verse eid="PSA 40:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 40:10" />M ɓa̱na̱ arabali a wishi a̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:10">adama a̱ ka̱ci ka̱ va̱ koci ba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:10">makyan dem n tsu dansa ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:10">kamayun ka̱ nu n wishi u nu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:10">o koɓolo ka uma usuɓi a̱ nu dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:10">n tsu paɗa bini ba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:10">ama n tsu dansa ta̱ kamayun ka̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:10">n ucigi u nu u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba.<verse eid="PSA 40:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 40:11" />Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:11">ka̱ta̱ vu ka̱sukpa̱ kupana asuvayali a̱ va̱ ba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:11">ucigi u nu u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba n kamayun ka̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:11">i ta̱ e ku ere mu makyan dem.<verse eid="PSA 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 40:12" />Adama a na atakaci a̱ ka̱ra̱Ꞌa̱ mu ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:12">a laꞋa ta̱ ku kece.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:12">unushi u va̱ u laꞋa ta̱ utsura u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:12">ali n doku n fuɗa me ene ubuta̱ ba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:12">u laꞋa ta̱ ka̱nji ka kaci ka̱ va̱ a̱bunda̱i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:12">ali n takpai ka̱ɗu.<verse eid="PSA 40:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 40:13" />Vuzavaguɗu, wawa mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:13">yaꞋan gogoꞋo vu ɓa̱nka̱ mu.<verse eid="PSA 40:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 40:14" />YaꞋan aza a na a cigai ku una mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:14">a yaꞋan wono a̱ ripula̱.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:14">yaꞋan kpamu aza a na i a̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ adama atakaci a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:14">okpo n wono.<verse eid="PSA 40:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 40:15" />YaꞋan aza a na i a kuyaꞋanka mu ma̱ka̱n,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:15">&lt;&lt;A namba ili i kudansa adama o wono.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 40:16" />YaꞋan aza a na a̱ ta̱wa̱i wa̱ a̱ nu ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:16">a yaꞋan ma̱za̱nga̱, babu una̱mgbuka̱tsuma̱,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:16">yaꞋan aza a na a cigai wishi u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:16">makyan dem a dana, &lt;&lt;Vuzavaguɗu vuzagbayin ɗa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 40:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 40:17" />Neke mu utsura, mi n ka̱ɓa̱nki ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:17">Vuzavaguɗu ta̱wa̱ wa̱ a̱ va̱ gogoꞋo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:17">avu ɗa kishi ka̱ va̱ n ka̱ɓa̱nki ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:17">Vuzavaguɗu vu va̱, ka̱ta̱ vu geshe ba.<verse eid="PSA 40:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="PSA 41" />
  <para style="s1">Avasa a̱ kula̱nsa̱ upotsokpi</para>
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: Vishipa vu Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 41:1" />Vuza vu ma̱za̱nga̱ ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:1">vuza na u tsu la̱na̱ aza a unambi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:1">Vuzavaguɗu wi ta̱ a ku wawa yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:1">a makyan ma atakaci.<verse eid="PSA 41:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 41:2" />Vuzavaguɗu wi ta̱ e ku ere yi, u foɓo wuma u ni.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:2">Vuzavaguɗu wi ta̱ a kuzuwa yi u pana uyoꞋo a iɗika ya.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:2">wi a̱ ku ka̱sukpa̱ yi ekiye a irala i ni ba.<verse eid="PSA 41:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 41:3" />Vuzavaguɗu wi ta̱ a̱ kuɓa̱nka̱ yi a ayin a na wi a̱ mɓa̱la̱.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:3">wi ta̱ o ku bonoko yi n ma̱ta̱na̱ mi ikyamba ma̱ ni mayin.<verse eid="PSA 41:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 41:4" />N danai, &lt;&lt;Vuzavaguɗu, n yaꞋanka wu ta̱ unushi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:4">pana asuvayali a̱ va̱ ka̱ ta̱ vu potsokpo mu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 41:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 41:5" />Irala i va̱ yi ta̱ a kuyaꞋansa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:5">kadanshi ka gbani-gbani adama a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 41:5">A kudana, &lt;&lt;Wannai ɗai u ku kuwa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:5">a cinukpa n a̱yi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 41:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 41:6" />Aza a na a̱ tsu ta̱wa̱ n a̱ kya̱sa̱i mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:6">n ka̱ɗu kete kaꞋa a̱ tsu ta̱wa̱ ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:6">o tsu ɓolongu su ta̱ arabali aꞋuwa adama a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:6">ka̱ta̱ a bana a̱ ka̱na̱ kudansa kaꞋa a̱ ubuta̱ dem.<verse eid="PSA 41:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 41:7" />Irala i va̱ ra̱ka̱ i ta̱ a̱ kuyun n otoku ele adama a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:7">e kusheshe ku le n laꞋa ta̱ yaba dem ka gbani-gbani.<verse eid="PSA 41:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 41:8" />A kudansa, &lt;&lt;Mɓa̱la̱ n ka̱na̱ yi ta̱ gbani-gbani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:8">wi a kufuɗa ku ɗa̱nga̱ a̱ ubuta̱ mɓa̱la̱ n ni ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 41:9" />Ali ka̱ja̱Ꞌa̱ ke ɗevu ka̱ va̱, vuza na n laꞋi kuneke ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:9">vuza na tsu ci lyaꞋa koɓolo, u bonoi a tsurala nu mpa.<verse eid="PSA 41:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 41:10" />Vuzavaguɗu, pana asuvayali a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:10">vu bonoko mu m ma̱ta̱na̱ mi ikyamba ma̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:10">adama a na n tsupa ili i na irala i va̱ i yaꞋankai mu.<verse eid="PSA 41:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 41:11" />Mi ta̱ e kuyeve vi ta̱ a kupana uyoꞋo u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:11">adama a na i a kufuɗa kulyaꞋa kelime ka̱ va̱ ba.<verse eid="PSA 41:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 41:12" />Vi ta̱ a̱ kuɓa̱nka̱ mu adama a na mi ta̱ a kuyaꞋan ili i na yi derere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:12">Vi ta̱ a ku zuwa mu n yongo e kelime ka̱ nu ko wannai.<verse eid="PSA 41:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 41:13" />YaꞋan tsu cikpa Vuzavaguɗu, Ka̱shile ka aza Israila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:13">cikpa ni gogo na a kubana ko wannai Tanannai, Tanannai.<verse eid="PSA 41:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="PSA 42" />
  <para style="ms">Katagarda ke ire</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="PSA 42-72">Ishp 42--72</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s1">Ma̱shi ma aza a na i a ugbashi</para>
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: VicuꞋu vu tsuwaꞋi tsu muku n Kora,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 42:1" />Tsu na mereꞋe mi a mali ma̱ mini mo kuɗolu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:1">ta feu wuma u va̱ wi a mali ma̱ nu nannai, Ka̱shile.<verse eid="PSA 42:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 42:2" />Mi ta̱ a kakuli ka̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:2">Ka̱shile, Ka̱shile ka wuma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 42:2">Wannai ɗai n kubana e kelime ka̱ nu n cikpa wu?<verse eid="PSA 42:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 42:3" />Kanna n kayin dem mi ta̱ a̱ ma̱shi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:3">kujilya ku ɗa koci ili kulyaꞋa i va̱,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 42:3">makyan dem irala i va̱ e ku ece mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:3">&lt;&lt;Te ɗai Ka̱shile ka̱ nu ka?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 42:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 42:4" />Ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ ka̱ tsu na̱mgba̱ ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:4">n ciɓa baci n ili i na i lazai ɗe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 42:4">a makyan ma na n tsu bana koɓolo n uma A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:4">mi o kutono n e le ugeri.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 42:4">koɓolo ka uma aza a̱ ma̱za̱nga̱, a ku canana i ishipa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:4">a̱ kuɗa̱ngusa̱ a̱la̱ka̱tsu a kucikpa Ka̱shile.<verse eid="PSA 42:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 42:5" />Yiɗa̱i i zuwai mi una̱mgbi ka̱tsuma̱ tsu nampa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:5">Yiɗa̱i i zuwai mi a atakaci nannai?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 42:5">Mi ta̱ a kuzuwa ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ u Ka̱shile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:5">mi ta̱ o kudoku kucikpa yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:5">kishi ka̱ va̱ n Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 42:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 42:6" />N na̱mgba̱ ta̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka̱u,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 42:6">adama nannai mi ta̱ a kuciɓa n kasingai ka̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 42:6">a uɓon u Urdu, n kusan kugbayi Hamon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:6">n kusan ku Miza.<verse eid="PSA 42:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 42:7" />Atakaci a̱ va̱ i ta̱ tsu mini ma̱ uga̱vi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:7">mini ma o kuɓolongu adama a na ma̱ pura̱ mu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 42:7">aɓau ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:7">a kulyaꞋa utsura u va̱.<verse eid="PSA 42:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 42:8" />Vuzavaguɗu u yotsongu ta̱ ucigi u ni u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba kanna lakam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:8">mpa feu n canana ishipa i kucikpa yi kayin dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:8">n yaꞋan avasa u Ka̱shile, vuza na u nekei mu wuma.<verse eid="PSA 42:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 42:9" />N danai Ka̱shile, ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:9">&lt;&lt;Yiɗa̱i i zuwai vu cinukpai nu mpa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 42:9">Yiɗa̱i i zuwai n kulyaꞋa kelime n una̱mgbuka̱tsuma̱?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:9">Adama ka gbani-gbani ka irala i va̱?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 42:10" />Kadanshi ki irala i va̱, ka sapa mu tsu kotokobi a etele a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:10">a makyan ma na i a kudana mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:10">&lt;&lt;Teɗei Ka̱shile ka̱ nu ka?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 42:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 42:11" />Yiɗa̱i i zuwai mi una̱mgbi ka̱tsuma̱ tsu nampa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:11">Yiɗa̱i i zuwai mi a atakaci nannai?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 42:11">Mi ta̱ a kuzuwa ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ u Ka̱shile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:11">mi ta̱ o kudoku kucikpa yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:11">kishi ka̱ va̱ n Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 42:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="PSA 43" />
  <para style="s1">Avasa a vuza a bankai ugbashi</para>
  <para style="d">Vishipa vu Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 43:1" />Ka̱shile, yotsongu unambi wu unushi u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:1">vu isaka mu ili i na yi i va̱,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 43:1">wa aza a na a̱ kpa̱ɗa̱i kupana wovon u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:1">isa mu a ekiye aza o modoruko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:1">n aza a gbani-gbani<verse eid="PSA 43:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 43:2" />Ka̱shile avu ɗa vi a ku inda mu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:2">yiɗa̱i i zuwai ɗa vu variki mu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 43:2">Yiɗa̱i i zuwai mi o kusoꞋo atakaci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:2">adama a ka gbani-gbani ka irala i va̱?<verse eid="PSA 43:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 43:3" />Suku kutashi ku nu n kamayun ka̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:3">o tono nu mpa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 43:3">vu zuwa o bono nu mpa a ka kaginda ka ciɗa ka̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:3">o bono nu mpa a̱ ubuta̱ wi ida̱shi i nu.<verse eid="PSA 43:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 43:4" />Ka̱ta̱ m bana a katalikalyuka ka̱ nu Ka̱shile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:4">Ka̱shile, wa̱ a̱ nu ɗa, ugiti u ma̱za̱nga̱ u va̱.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 43:4">mi ta̱ a cikpa wu n umolu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:4">Ka̱shile, Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 43:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 43:5" />Yiɗa̱i i zuwai mi una̱mgbi ka̱tsuma̱ tsu nampa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:5">Yiɗa̱i i zuwai mi a atakaci nannai?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 43:5">Mi ta̱ a kuzuwa ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ u Ka̱shile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:5">mi ta̱ o kudoku kucikpa yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:5">kishi ka̱ va̱ n Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 43:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="PSA 44" />
  <para style="s1">Avasa a̱ kula̱nsa̱ wishi</para>
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: VicuꞋu vu tsuwaꞋi tsu muku n Kora.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 44:1" />Ka̱shile, tsu pana ta̱ na atsuvu a̱ tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:1">ikaya i tsu i dana tsu ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 44:1">ili i gbagbaꞋin i na vu yaꞋin a makyan me le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:1">a ayin a cau.<verse eid="PSA 44:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 44:2" />Tsu na avu n ka̱ci ka̱ nu vu lokoi aza o kutono a̱ma̱li,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:2">ɗa vu zuwai uma a̱ nu a iɗika i le.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 44:2">tsu na vu lokoi uduniyan u na u buwai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:2">ama ɗa vu zuwai uma a̱ nu o yongo ba̱ri.<verse eid="PSA 44:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 44:3" />N otokobi e le a ɗa a lyaꞋi iɗika ya ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:3">n utsura u le u ɗa a lyaꞋi iɗika ya ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 44:3">ama n utsura u nu u ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:3">tsu na vu yotsongi le vi ta̱ koɓolo n ele,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 44:3">vi o kuyotsongu le vu ciga le ta̱.<verse eid="PSA 44:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 44:4" />Avu ɗa mogono ma̱ va̱ n Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:4">vu zuwai uma a Yakubu a̱ ciya̱i ulyaꞋi.<verse eid="PSA 44:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 44:5" />N utsura u nu u ɗa tsu unai irala i tsu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:5">N kula ku nu ku ɗa tsu dasasai irala i tsu.<verse eid="PSA 44:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 44:6" />N zuwa ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ a utan u va̱ ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:6">kotokobi ka̱ va̱ ki a ku isa mu ba.<verse eid="PSA 44:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 44:7" />Ama vu isa tsu ta̱ ekiye a irala i tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:7">vu lokoi aza a na a iwain tsu.<verse eid="PSA 44:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 44:8" />Ka̱shile, ci ta̱ a ku cikpa wu makyan dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:8">ka̱ta̱ kpamu tsu cikpa kula ku nu ko wannai.<char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 44:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 44:9" />Ama gogo na Ka̱shile vu vakangu tsu ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:9">vu ka̱sukpa̱i o lokoi tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:9">vu doku vu uta̱ vu yaꞋan nwalu n osoji a̱ tsu ba.<verse eid="PSA 44:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 44:10" />Vu zuwai tsu sumai e kelime ka irala i tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:10">ɗa isai ili i na ci ni i ɗa yo okpoi i le.<verse eid="PSA 44:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 44:11" />Vu ka̱sukpa̱i a kiɗai tsu tsu nlala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:11">ɗa vu wacuwai tsu a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka iɗika i yoku.<verse eid="PSA 44:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 44:12" />Vu dengei uma a̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:12">n ikebe kenu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:12">vu ciya̱ kodokpotsu ka tsulaga tsa ba.<verse eid="PSA 44:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 44:13" />Aza a na ci ida̱shi ɗeɗevu o ku zoꞋoso tsu adama a̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:13">a kuyaꞋanka tsu ulami, o bonokoi tsu ili yi ugulani,<verse eid="PSA 44:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 44:14" />Vu zuwai tsu tsu okpoi ili ya agisana a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ku uduniyan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:14">uduniyan a̱ kugba̱ɗa̱sa̱ ka̱ tsu aci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:14">n o goyoi tsu,<verse eid="PSA 44:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 44:15" />Makyan dem mi ta̱ a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ko wono,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:15">wono u kimba̱ mu ta̱ ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 44:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 44:16" />Adama aza a kadanshi ka gbani-gbani n ishikushi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:16">n adama a irala i va̱ aza a na a tsu ciga ku tsupa kutan.<verse eid="PSA 44:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 44:17" />Ili i nampa ya ra̱ka̱ i gita̱ ta̱ n a̱tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:17">ko a na wo okpoi tsu cinukpa n avu ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:17">tsu koɗo kpamu uzuwakpani u na vu yaꞋin n a̱tsu ba.<verse eid="PSA 44:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 44:18" />Tsu yaꞋanka wu unambi wu usuɓi ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:18">tsu ka̱sukpa̱ tana kutono kadanshi ka̱ nu ba.<verse eid="PSA 44:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 44:19" />N nannai dem vu kpa̱ɗa̱i kuɓa̱nka̱ tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:19">a nnama n kakamba n nanlo ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:19">vu ka̱sukpa̱i tsu a̱ ka̱yimbi ka kpaɓam.<verse eid="PSA 44:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 44:20" />Ishi baci tsu ka̱sukpa̱ ta̱ kutono Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:20">ci yaꞋin avasa wa̱ a̱ma̱li,<verse eid="PSA 44:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 44:21" />mayun vi ta̱ e kuyeve,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:21">adama a na vu yeve ta̱ kusheshe ku uma.<verse eid="PSA 44:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 44:22" />Ka̱shile, adama a̱ nu a ɗa i a ku una tsu makyan dem.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:22">o bonokoi tsu a na nkyon n na a kukiɗa.<verse eid="PSA 44:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 44:23" />Ɗa̱nga̱! Vuzavaguɗu, yiɗa̱i ɗa vi alavu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:23">Ɗa̱nga̱! Ka̱ta̱ vu iwan tsu ko wannai ba.<verse eid="PSA 44:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 44:24" />Yiɗa̱i i zuwai ɗa vi o ku sokongu a̱shi a̱ nu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:24">Yiɗa̱i i zuwai ɗa vi a kucinukpa n atakaci a̱ tsu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:24">Adama a̱ yiɗa̱i vu zuwaka n tsu na i a kutakacika tsu ba.<verse eid="PSA 44:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 44:25" />Ci yikpa̱ ta̱, ɗa a tsugbai tsu a iɗika</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:25">a̱ ka̱sukpa̱i tsu ivaꞋin a̱ kubuta̱.<verse eid="PSA 44:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 44:26" />Ɗa̱nga̱, vu ɓa̱nka̱ tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:26">vu shiba̱ tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:26">adama a ucigi u nu una u tsu sabaꞋa ba.<verse eid="PSA 44:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="PSA 45" />
  <para style="s1">Vishipa vu kushiya ku yolo i mogono</para>
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: A yaꞋan vu ɗa n ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ka &lt;&lt;Lili&gt;&gt; Vishipa vu muku n Kora. VicuꞋu vu tsuwaꞋi tsu vishipa vu yolo.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 45:1" />Ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ ka shana ta̱ n kadanshi ka singai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:1">Makyan ma na mi a̱ ku zuɓa̱ vishipa vu mogono.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:1">Kelentsu ka̱ va̱ tsu kayakiɗani kaꞋa u kaɗani.<verse eid="PSA 45:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 45:2" />A̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka uma ra̱ka̱ avu ɗa vu laꞋi n ugaꞋin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:2">avu vuza vu ufuɗi u kadanshi kasingai kaꞋa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:2">Ka̱shile ka zuwaka wu ta̱ una̱singai makyan dem.<verse eid="PSA 45:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 45:3" />Shiya kotokobi ka̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:3">mogono ma tsugbayin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:3">avu vuza vu utsura ɗa.<verse eid="PSA 45:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 45:4" />A̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka tsugbayin tsu nu yaꞋan nwalu n kulyaꞋa kelime,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:4">vu shamkpa kamayun n ku usuɓi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:4">adama a utsura u nu, vi ta̱ a kulyaꞋa kelime.<verse eid="PSA 45:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 45:5" />AyaꞋa a̱ nu i ta̱ lyalyaꞋan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:5">a tsu sapa ta̱ a̱ɗu a irala i nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:5">uma a̱ ku yikpa̱sa̱ a ɗaka vu e ene a̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 45:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 45:6" />Ka̱shile, kakuba ko tsugono ka̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:6">ki ta̱ o kuyongo ko wannai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 45:6">Vi ta̱ a kulyaꞋa tsugono tsu uma a̱ nu n usuɓi.<verse eid="PSA 45:6" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 45:7" />Vu tsu ciga ta̱ ili i na yi mejege,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:7">vu ci iwan ta̱ ili i gbani-gbani.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 45:7">Adama a nannai Ka̱shile, Ka̱shile ka̱ nu ka zagba wu ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:7">ɗa u tsunki nu n maniꞋin me kerengu m ma̱za̱nga̱ ma̱ a̱bunda̱i ali vu laꞋa yaba dem.<verse eid="PSA 45:7" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 45:8" />Akashi a̱ nu a̱ ku uta̱ ma̱gula̱ni mi ili ma̱gula̱ni i Mariti n aloyes n kashiya kpamu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:8">tsuwaꞋi a iꞋuwa yi ngono,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 45:8">a iꞋuwa i na a kalai n anga a kagiwa dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:8">a kuzuwa wu ma̱za̱nga̱.<verse eid="PSA 45:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 45:9" />Muku mu nkere mo ngono,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:9">i ta̱ punu a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka̱ a̱ma̱ci a na a̱ ciya̱i tsugbayin,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 45:9">e kukiye ku usingai ku kakuba ko tsugono tsu nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:9">egbere wi ta̱ kisani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 45:9">a uki na u canuku u singai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:9">wa azanariya u na u laꞋi nu ugaꞋin ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 45:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 45:10" />Pana ili i na n kudansa, avu vuka vu savu vu mogono,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:10">vu cinukpa n uma a̱ nu n kumaci ku nu.<verse eid="PSA 45:10" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 45:11" />Adama a na avu vi ta̱ n ugaꞋin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:11">mogono mi ta̱ a kuciga wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:11">a̱yi ɗa vali vu nu, ka̱ta̱ vu tono yi.<verse eid="PSA 45:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 45:12" />Uma a Taya i ta̱ a̱ kutuka̱ wu n kuneꞋe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:12">aza a̱ uciyi i ta̱ a̱ kuta̱wa̱ a̱ la̱nsa̱ mapasa ma singai wa̱ a̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 45:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 45:13" />Vuka vu savu vu mogono,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:13">wi ta̱ a ku uwa a kpaꞋa ku mogono,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:13">yiɗa̱i a kugisanku n ugaꞋin u ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:13">n tsugbere tsa azanariya tsu ɗa a caꞋi motogu ma̱ ni,<verse eid="PSA 45:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 45:14" />A bankai ni a̱ ubuta̱ u mogono u uki na aminya a singai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:14">a̱ja̱Ꞌa̱ ni nkere o kutono, a̱ tuka̱i le a̱ ubuta̱ u mogono.<verse eid="PSA 45:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 45:15" />N ma̱za̱nga̱ maꞋa a̱ ta̱wa̱i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:15">a uwai e kefeku ko mogono.<verse eid="PSA 45:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 45:16" />Vi ta̱ a kumatsa muku n ali n a̱bunda̱i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:16">aza a na a̱ ku ka̱na̱ tsugbayin ci ikaya i nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:16">vi ta̱ a kuzuwa le a lyaꞋa tsugono tsa aduniyan dem.<verse eid="PSA 45:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 45:17" />Vishipa vu va̱ vi ta̱ a kuzuwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:17">a̱ ka̱na̱ kuciɓasa n kula ku nu ko wannai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:17">ka̱ta̱ uma ra̱ka̱ a cikpa wu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 45:17">ali a tsukaya tsu na tsa̱ kuta̱wa̱.<verse eid="PSA 45:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="PSA 46" />
  <para style="s1">Ka̱shile kaꞋa ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku n katsura ka̱ tsu</para>
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: Vishipa vu muku n Kora.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 46:1" />Ka̱shile kaꞋa ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku u tsu n katsura ka̱ tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:1">a makyan dem ufoɓushi u ɗa wi u ɓa̱nka̱ tsu a ayin atakaci.<verse eid="PSA 46:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 46:2" />Adama nannai ci a kupana wovon ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:2">ko ɗa baci aduniyan i a̱ kugba̱ɗa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:2">atali kpamu a̱ yikpa̱i a mala mu uga̱vi,<verse eid="PSA 46:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 46:3" />Ko a dana baci mala mi ta̱ a kuyaꞋan yura̱ ma̱ putsuwa̱i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:3">ko ɗa baci n sansan m gba̱ɗa̱i adama ugba̱ɗi u mala.<char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 46:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 46:4" />Kuɗolu ki ta̱ lo ku na ku tsu tuka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:4">n ma̱za̱nga̱ a̱ likuci i Ka̱shila̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:4">n ubuta̱ wa̱ A̱Ꞌisa̱ a ciɗa a MalaꞋimili.<verse eid="PSA 46:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 46:5" />Ka̱shile ki ta̱ a̱ ida̱shi punu a̱ likuci ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:5">mayun, i tana a ku una likuci ya ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:5">n kpasani Ka̱shile ki ta̱ a̱ kutuka̱ le n uɓa̱nki.<verse eid="PSA 46:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 46:6" />Uduniyan u panai wovon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:6">tsugono tsu gba̱ɗa̱i,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 46:6">a na Ka̱shile ka lapai kakpanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:6">aduniyan e derikpei<verse eid="PSA 46:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 46:7" />Vuzavaguɗu MalaꞋimili wi ta̱ koɓolo n a̱ tsu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:7">Ka̱shile ka Yakubu kaꞋa ubuta̱ u ku sheɗeku u tsu. <char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 46:8" />Ta̱wa̱i yi ene ili i na Vuzavaguɗu u yaꞋin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:8">indana biꞋi ili mereve i na u yaꞋin aduniyan.<verse eid="PSA 46:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 46:9" />U sa̱nka̱i kuvon ubuta̱ dem aduniyan.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:9">u koɗosoi utan dem, ɗa u la̱nga̱sa̱i nsara.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:9">o kusongu ekeke o odoku n akina.<verse eid="PSA 46:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 46:10" />&lt;&lt;U danai, paɗai bini, i yeve mpa Ka̱shile kaꞋa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:10">MalaꞋimili maꞋa a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka aduniyan a na a buwai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:10">MalaꞋimili kpamu aduniyan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 46:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 46:11" />Vuzavaguɗu MalaꞋimili wi ta̱ koɓolo n a̱tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:11">Ka̱shile ka Yakubu, a̱yi ɗa ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku u tsu. <char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 46:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="PSA 47" />
  <para style="s1">Ka̱shile mogono ma aduniyan ra̱ka̱</para>
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: Vishipa vu muku n Kora.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 47:1" />Ɓasai ekiye, adama a̱ ma̱za̱nga̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:1">a̱ɗa̱ uma ra̱ka̱!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:1">YaꞋin ishipa n utsura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:1">cikpai Ka̱shile.<verse eid="PSA 47:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 47:2" />Vuzavaguɗu MalaꞋimili,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:2">ili i wovon i ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:2">a̱yi mogono ma gbayin maꞋa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:2">vuza vu tsugono tsa aduniyan ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 47:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 47:3" />U nekei tsu ulyaꞋi a̱ ubuta̱ u uma ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:3">u zuwai uduniyan a ɗaka vu ene a̱ tsu.<verse eid="PSA 47:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 47:4" />U zagbakai tsu iɗika yi uka̱ni i tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:4">i ɗaɗa ili ya̱ a̱ra̱ɗi i uma a̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:4">kumaci ku yakubu ku na wi a kuciga. <char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 47:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 47:5" />Ka̱shile ka kumba ta̱ a gaɗi vu kakuba ko tsugono ci ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:5">a̱ ka̱na̱i yoroli i ma̱za̱nga̱ n a̱ lika̱i ishari,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:5">a makyan ma na Ka̱shile ki a ku kumba.<verse eid="PSA 47:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 47:6" />Cananai ishipa i kucikpa Ka̱shile.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:6">cananai ishipa i kucikpa mogono ma̱ tsu.<verse eid="PSA 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 47:7" />Ka̱shile mogono ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:7">aduniyan maꞋa ra̱ka̱.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:7">canana ka yi ni ishipa i kucikpa.<verse eid="PSA 47:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 47:8" />Ka̱shile ki ta̱ ida̱shi a kakuba ko tsugono ka ciɗa ka̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:8">Ka̱shile ki ta̱ a kulyaꞋa tsugono tsa aduniyan.<verse eid="PSA 47:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 47:9" />Aza e kelime a kumaci ka aduniyan o ɓolongi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:9">a gasai koɓolo n a̱ tsu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 47:9">a̱ tsu uma a̱ Ka̱shile ki Ibirahi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:9">adama a na ngono ma aduniyan ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:9">n Ka̱shile n ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 47:9">Ka̱shile ka na i a kucikpa mayin.<verse eid="PSA 47:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="PSA 48" />
  <para style="s1">Sihiyona likuci i Ka̱shile</para>
  <para style="d">Vishipa vu muku n Kora.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 48:1" />Vuzavaguɗu vuza gbayin ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:1">u yawa ta̱ a cikpa yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:1">a̱ likuci i gbayin Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 48:1">a kusan ku ciɗa.<verse eid="PSA 48:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 48:2" />Kusan ku Sihiyona ki ta̱ n ugaɗi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 48:2">ili i ma̱za̱nga̱ ma aduniyan ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:2">likuci i mogono ma gbayin,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 48:2">tsu kusan ku uɓon u gaɗi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:2">ku na ku laꞋi nu mgbayin.<verse eid="PSA 48:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 48:3" />Ka̱shile ki ta̱ punu a̱ likuci yi nshilya ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:3">adama a na a̱yi n ka̱ci ka̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:3">ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku u ɗa.<verse eid="PSA 48:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 48:4" />Ɗa ngono n gbaɓai aci e le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:4">adama a na a̱ tuka̱ n kuvon a kusan ku Sihiyona.<verse eid="PSA 48:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 48:5" />Ama a na enei ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 48:5">a̱ rikpa̱i ɗa a yaꞋin mereve,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:5">a panai wovon, ɗa a sumai.<verse eid="PSA 48:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 48:6" />E jeꞋekei ikyamba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:6">ɗa a takacikai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:6">tsu vuka vu na vi a̱ga̱nda̱ a limata.<verse eid="PSA 48:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 48:7" />Tsu wunla̱i u kasana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:7">u na u tsu ɓososo antsu a̱ mini a Tarishi.<verse eid="PSA 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 48:8" />Tsu na tsu panai arabali ili i nanlo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:8">gogo na tana tsu ene ta̱ i ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:8">a̱ likuci i Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu MalaꞋimili,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 48:8">wi ta̱ a ku ere likuci ya m ma̱ta̱na̱ ko wannai, <char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 48:9" />Ka̱shile, punu A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin a̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:9">ci ta̱ a kusheshe ucigi u nu u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba,<verse eid="PSA 48:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 48:10" />Ka̱shile, tsu na kula ku nu ki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:10">ucikpi u nu u ka̱ra̱Ꞌa ta̱ aduniyan ra̱ka̱.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 48:10">Kukiye ku usingai ku nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:10">ki ta̱ a kuyaꞋan afada a usuɓi.<verse eid="PSA 48:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 48:11" />YaꞋan uma a Sihiyona a yaꞋan ma̱za̱nga̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:11">likuci i wawaꞋa i Yahuda i yaꞋan ma̱za̱nga̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:11">adama afada a usuɓi.<verse eid="PSA 48:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 48:12" />Banai i ka̱ra̱Ꞌa̱ likuci i Sihiyona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:12">ka̱ta̱ i kece nshilya mu ugaɗi n ni,<verse eid="PSA 48:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 48:13" />I la̱na̱ asaka a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:13">ka̱ta̱ kpamu i coꞋoko n nshilya ma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 48:13">adama a na i ciya̱ i na i ku dana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:13">ntsukaya n ɗa̱ n na n kuta̱wa̱.<verse eid="PSA 48:13" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 48:14" />Ta Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu ki nannai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 48:14">Ka̱shile ka ko wannai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:14">vuza na u tsu tono n a̱ tsu ko wannai.<verse eid="PSA 48:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="PSA 49" />
  <para style="s1">Kuzuwa ku ka̱ɗu a̱ uciyi tsulau tsu ɗa</para>
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: Vishipa vu muku n Kora.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 49:1" />Panai ili i nampa, yaba dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:1">zuwai atsuvu uma a̱ ubuta̱ dem,<verse eid="PSA 49:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 49:2" />Aza a̱ gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ n muku,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 49:2">aza a uciyi n aza a unambi ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 49:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 49:3" />Mi ta̱ a kuyaꞋan kadanshi n kuyeve,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:3">mi ta̱ a kuyaꞋan kusheshe ku singai.<verse eid="PSA 49:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 49:4" />Mi ta̱ o kubonoko ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:4">a̱ ubuta̱ u asan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 49:4">ka̱ta̱ n dana ili i na asan a i a kadanshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:4">a makyan ma na mi a kuwaꞋa umolu.<verse eid="PSA 49:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 49:5" />Adama a̱ yiɗa̱i ɗa n kupana wovon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:5">a makyan ma atakaci?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:5">A makyan ma na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:5">uma a gbani-gbani a̱ ka̱ra̱Ꞌi mu,<verse eid="PSA 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 49:6" />uma a na a zuwai a̱ɗu a̱ uciyi u le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:6">aza a na i a̱ra̱ɗi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:6">adama a̱ ka̱bunda̱i ka̱ uciyi u le?<verse eid="PSA 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 49:7" />Mayun, vuza wi lo a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ke le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:7">vuza na wi a kufuɗa kushiba̱ vuza ni ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:7">ko u fuɗa u tsupa Ka̱shile ikebe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:7">adama a̱ ka̱ci ka̱ ni ba.<verse eid="PSA 49:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 49:8" />Adama a na ikebe i kushiba̱ wuma u vuma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:8">i laꞋa ta̱ agisana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:8">a ili i na vuma u kufuɗa ku tsupa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:8">ko i ɗa yi a kuyawa ba,<verse eid="PSA 49:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 49:9" />Yi tana kuzuwa yi u yongo n wuma ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:9">ko i sa̱nka̱ yi ukpa̱ u ko wannai ba.<verse eid="PSA 49:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 49:10" />U tsu zuwa ta̱ aza e kuyeve a̱ kuwa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:10">ta feu nannai alau n uma a kavama a̱ ku kuwa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:10">a̱ ka̱sukpa̱ uciyi u le wu ntsukaya n le.<verse eid="PSA 49:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 49:11" />Asaun e le i ta̱ o kokpo le iꞋuwa ko wannai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:11">ta punu o kuyongo ayin dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:11">ko a na wo okpoi n tsu cau,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:11">ishi ta̱ n iɗika i ka̱ci ke le.<verse eid="PSA 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 49:12" />Tsugbayin tsu vuma ci a̱ ku sa̱nka̱ yi ku kuwa̱ ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:12">wi ta̱ a̱ ku kuwa̱ tsu manama.<verse eid="PSA 49:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 49:13" />La̱na̱ ili i na i kuciya̱ aza a na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:13">zuwakai ka̱ci ke le a̱ɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:13">n aza a na a̱ cuwa̱i n uciyi u le. <char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 49:14" />Tsu nlala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:14">i ta̱ o kurono le a kubanka a̱ ubuta̱ wi ida̱shi wa̱ a̱kpisa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:14">ukpa̱ uɗa maguɓi me le,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 49:14">n usana aza a usuɓi a ɗa a kulyaꞋaka le tsugono,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:14">Ikyamba i le kpamu yi ta̱ a kushama a kasaun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:14">a̱ ubuta̱ wi ida̱shi wa̱ a̱kpisa̱ u ɗa wi o ko okpo kpaꞋa ku le.<verse eid="PSA 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 49:15" />Ama Ka̱shile ki ta̱ a̱ kushiba̱ mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:15">wi ta̱ a ku isa mu a utsura wu ukpa̱.<char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 49:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 49:16" />Ka̱ta̱ vu na̱mgba̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:16">ɗa baci vuza wo okpoi vuza vu uciyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:16">ko kpamu uciyi u ni u yimkpa baci.<verse eid="PSA 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 49:17" />Adama a na wi a kuɗika u ɗa ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:17">a makyan ma na u kuwa̱i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:17">uciyi u ni wi a ku uwa a kasaun n a̱yi ba.<verse eid="PSA 49:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 49:18" />Ko ishi baci vuma ciya̱ ili ba̱ri a wuma u nampa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:18">ana i a kcikpa yi adama a ulyaꞋi u ni.<verse eid="PSA 49:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 49:19" />N nannai dem wi ta̱ a ku cina ikaya i ni i na i kuwa̱i ɗe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:19">a̱ ubuta̱ u na ka̱yimbi ki ko wannai.<verse eid="PSA 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 49:20" />Tsugbayin tsu vuma ci a ku sa̱nka̱ yi ku kuwa̱ ba.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:20">wi ta̱ a̱ ku kuwa̱ tsu manama.<verse eid="PSA 49:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="PSA 50" />
  <para style="s1">Ka̱shile kaꞋa vuza va afada</para>
  <para style="d">Vishipa vu Asafa.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 50:1" />Ka̱shile MalaꞋimili, Vuzavaguɗu u yaꞋin kadanshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:1">e kuɗeke aduniyan ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:1">a kasana a kubana a̱ ka̱livi.<verse eid="PSA 50:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 50:2" />Ka̱shile ki ta̱ a ku akana a Sihiyona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:2">a̱ likuci i singai i Sihiyona.<verse eid="PSA 50:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 50:3" />Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu ka̱ ta̱wa̱ ta̱, u sokongi u ɗa wi ba.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:3">akina a munuka a̱ kuta̱wa̱ e kelime ka̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:3">uguyi u gbayin kpamu u ka̱ra̱Ꞌi n a̱yi.<verse eid="PSA 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 50:4" />U ɗekei gaɗi n aduniyan okpo ngan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:4">ene tsu na wi a kuyaꞋanka uma a̱ ni afada.<verse eid="PSA 50:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 50:5" />U danai, &lt;&lt;Ɓolongu ku mu uma a usuɓi a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:5">aza a na a shatangi uzuwakpani u na mi nu u ɗa n ele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:5">a̱ ubuta̱ u kuneꞋe ka alyuka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 50:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 50:6" />Gaɗi a̱da̱nga̱shile a kusala usuɓi u Ka̱shile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:6">adama a na a̱yi ɗa wi a kuyaꞋan afada. <char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 50:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 50:7" />&lt;&lt;Panai, a̱ɗa̱ uma a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:7">mi ta̱ a kuyaꞋan kadanshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:7">mi ta̱ a kuyaꞋan kadanshi n dana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 50:7">Isaraila yi ta̱ n unushi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:7">Mpa ɗa Ka̱shile, Ka̱shile ka̱ ɗa̱.<verse eid="PSA 50:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 50:8" />M ɓarangu ɗa̱ adama alyuka a̱ ɗa̱ ba.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:8">ko adama e kuneꞋe ku kusongu ku na yi e kuneke mu makyan dem ba.<verse eid="PSA 50:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 50:9" />Mi a kuciga kobomburon ushiga u ɗa̱ ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:9">ko nlala a ushiga u ɗa̱ ba.<verse eid="PSA 50:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 50:10" />Adama a na nnama n kakamba dem n va̱ n ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:10">a̱kpa̱n anaka a na i aginda ra̱ka̱ a̱ va̱ a ɗa.<verse eid="PSA 50:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 50:11" />Nnu n na mi a ciɗinkpi gaɗi dem n va̱ n ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:11">n ili i wuma i na yi a iɗika ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 50:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 50:12" />&lt;&lt;Ko ishi baci mi ta̱ a kupana kambulu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:12">mi a kudana ɗa̱ ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:12">adama a na aduniyan n ili i na yi punu dem i va̱ i ɗa.<verse eid="PSA 50:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 50:13" />n tsu takuma ta̱ inyama yi obomburon ɗa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:13">Ko n tsu soꞋo ta̱ mpasa mu nraɗika?<verse eid="PSA 50:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 50:14" />YaꞋan i neke Ka̱shile kuneꞋe ku kucikpa ku ɗa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:14">ka̱ta̱ i neke malaꞋimili kuneꞋe ra̱ka̱ ku na i yaꞋin uzuwakpani.<verse eid="PSA 50:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 50:15" />YaꞋin meɗevile wa̱ a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:15">a makyan ma atakaci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:15">mi ta̱ a ku isa ɗa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:15">a̱ɗa̱ kpamu yi ta̱ a kucikpa mu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 50:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 50:16" />Ama Ka̱shile ka dana ta̱ uma a gbani-gbani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:16">&lt;&lt;Yiɗa̱i i zuwai yi e kukece wila̱ uva̱?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:16">Yiɗa̱i ɗa yi a kuyaꞋan kadanshi ka uzuwakpani u va̱?<verse eid="PSA 50:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 50:17" />I iwain m ɓarangu ɗa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:17">ɗa kpamu i variki kadanshi ka̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 50:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 50:18" />Yi ene baci koboki, i ci yaꞋan ta̱ cija̱Ꞌa̱ n a̱yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:18">i tsu gbaɓa ta̱ kaci n aza a tsugbani.<verse eid="PSA 50:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 50:19" />&lt;&lt;Makyan dem yi ta̱ foɓushi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:19">i dansa ka gbani-gbani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:19">i tsu pana munla̱i ma kudansa aꞋuwa ba.<verse eid="PSA 50:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 50:20" />A ufoɓushi u ɗa yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:20">i dansa ka gbani-gbani wa̱ aza a̱ ɗa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:20">i neke le unushi.<verse eid="PSA 50:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 50:21" />I yaꞋan ta̱ ili i nanlo dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:21">ama mpa n keɓecei ukuna ba.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:21">adama a nannai i zuwa ta̱ tsu ɗa̱ tsu ɗa mi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 50:21">ama gogo na mi ta̱ a ku ɓarangu ɗa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:21">mu utuka̱ n unushi u ɗa̱ e keteshe.<verse eid="PSA 50:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 50:22" />&lt;&lt;Panai na, a̱ɗa̱ na i cinukpai nu mpa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:22">ta baci nannai ba, mi ta̱ a ku karasa ɗa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:22">ko vuza wi a ku isa ɗa̱ ba.<verse eid="PSA 50:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 50:23" />Vuza na u tsu cikpa mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:23">a makyan ma na wi e kuneke alyuka a̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 50:23">wi ta̱ e kuneke mu tsugbayin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:23">n vuza na kpamu wi o kutono kadanshi ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:23">mi ta̱ o kuyotsongu yi wi ishi u va̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 50:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 50" />
  <chapter number="51" style="c" sid="PSA 51" />
  <para style="s1">Avasa adama a kucinukpa unushi</para>
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: Vishipa vu Dawuda ana keneki Natan u banai wa̱ ni a makyan ma na Dawuda u vaki n Besheba vuka vu Uriya.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 51:1" />Ka̱shile pana asuvayali a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:1">adama a ucigi u nu u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 51:1">adama a kasingai ka̱ a̱bunda̱i ka̱ nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:1">vu cinukpa n unushi u va̱.<verse eid="PSA 51:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 51:2" />Vu SaꞋa ka gbani-gbani ka̱ va̱ ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:2">vu bonoko mu ciɗa<verse eid="PSA 51:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 51:3" />Adama a na n yeve ta̱ unushi u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:3">makyan dem unushi u va̱ wi ta̱ e kelime ka̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 51:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 51:4" />Avu ɗa koci n nusakai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:4">n yaꞋan ta̱ ka gbani-gbani a̱ a̱shi a̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 51:4">derere ɗa afada a na vu kiɗakai mu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:4">derere ɗa vu takacika mu.<verse eid="PSA 51:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 51:5" />Mayun mpa vuza vu unushi ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:5">ali a makyan ma na a̱na̱ku a̱ va̱ a ɗikai ka̱tsuma̱ ka̱ va̱.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 51:5">Mayun mpa vuma vu gbani-gbani ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:5">ili i na i ɗikai a makyan ma na a matsai mu.<verse eid="PSA 51:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 51:6" />Mayun ka̱ɗu kamayun ka̱ va̱ kaꞋa vu cigai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:6">shatangu ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ n kuyeve ku nu.<verse eid="PSA 51:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 51:7" />Vu za̱Ꞌa̱ ta̱ unushi u va̱ n hisop<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">51:7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">hisop </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A̱vuku a ɗa a na aza a Yahuda a tsu zuwa a̱ mini adama a na ma̱ kira̱.</char></note>, mi ta̱ o kokpo ciɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:7">vu za̱Ꞌa̱ mu, mi ta̱ a ku laꞋa tsukongoi wa̱ri.<verse eid="PSA 51:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 51:8" />Ka̱ta̱ m pana uyoꞋo n ma̱za̱nga̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:8">yaꞋan etele a na vu yokumoi a yaꞋan ma̱za̱nga̱.<verse eid="PSA 51:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 51:9" />Takpa unushi u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:9">ka̱ta̱ vu pura̱ngu ka gbani-gbani ka̱ va̱ ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 51:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 51:10" />Ka̱shile, zuwaka mu ka̱ɗu ka ciɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:10">vu sabaꞋaka mu ayinviki a savu o kutoni.<verse eid="PSA 51:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 51:11" />Ka̱ta̱ vu loko mu kelime ka̱ nu ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:11">ka̱ta̱ vu takpa ayinviki a ciɗa a̱ nu wa̱ va̱ ba.<verse eid="PSA 51:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 51:12" />Zuwa mu ma̱za̱nga̱ tsu na vu yaꞋin ana vu wawai mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:12">ka̱ ta̱ vu neke mu kadanshi n ka̱ɗu ka na n kutono wu.<verse eid="PSA 51:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 51:13" />N piꞋisaka aza a unushi wila̱ u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:13">ka̱ta̱ aza a unushi o bono wa̱ a̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 51:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 51:14" />Wawa wuma u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:14">a̱ ubuta̱ unushi u ku tsuwa̱n ku mpasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:14">Ka̱shile kishi ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:14">mi ta̱ tana a kusala kamayun ka̱ nu n ma̱za̱nga̱.<verse eid="PSA 51:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 51:15" />Vuzavaguɗu, ɓa̱nka̱ mu adama a na n yaꞋan kadanshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:15">ka̱ta̱ n cikpa wu.<verse eid="PSA 51:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 51:16" />Alyuka a na n kuneke wu i a kuyawa wu ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:16">vi tana a kupana uyoꞋo u, kuneꞋe ku kusongu ba.<verse eid="PSA 51:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 51:17" />Ka̱shile, alyuka a̱ va̱ ɗaɗa ka̱ɗu ku usuɓi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:17">ka̱ɗu ko kutoni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:17">Ka̱shile vi a ku iwan a ɗa ba.<verse eid="PSA 51:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 51:18" />Ka̱shile yaꞋanka Sihiyona kasingai, vu ɓa̱nka̱ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:18">vu maꞋasaka nshilya n Urushelima.<verse eid="PSA 51:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 51:19" />Ka̱ta̱ vu pana uyoꞋo wa alyuka a usuɓi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:19">n alyuka o kusongu ra̱ka̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:19">i ta̱ ku kuneke obomburon kuneꞋe ka alyuka a katalikalyuka ka̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 51:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 51" />
  <chapter number="52" style="c" sid="PSA 52" />
  <para style="s1">Afada a̱ Ka̱shile n kasingai ka̱ ni</para>
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: VicuꞋu vu tsuwaꞋi tsu Dawuda. A makyan ma na Dowegi vuza va aza a Edom u banai u mogono Shawulu a na Ahimeleki ganu sokongi Dawuda a kpaꞋa ku ni.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 52:1" />Yiɗa̱i i zuwai ɗa vi a̱ra̱ɗi n kawuya ka na vi a kuyaꞋan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:1">avu vuzagbayin?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:1">Yiɗa̱i i zuwai vi a̱ra̱ɗi makyan dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:1">a̱ɗa̱ na i yaꞋin ili i wono a̱ a̱shi a̱ Ka̱shile?<verse eid="PSA 52:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 52:2" />Kelentsu ka̱ nu e kusheshe ka gbani-gbani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:2">adama a na vu la̱nga̱sa̱ aza o yoku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:2">ki ta̱ an kutanu ka alyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:2">makyan dem a kuyaꞋan aꞋuwa.<verse eid="PSA 52:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 52:3" />Vu laꞋa ta̱ n ku ciga kawuya n kasingai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:3">vu laꞋa ta̱ n ku ciga ka aꞋuwa n kamayun. <char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 52:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 52:4" />Vu tsu ciga ta̱ kudoro uma n kadanshi ka̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:4">avu kayaꞋin ka aꞋuwa.<verse eid="PSA 52:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 52:5" />Adama a nannai Ka̱shile ki ta̱ a̱ kula̱nga̱sa̱ wu ko wannai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:5">wi ta̱ e kureme wu ka̱ta̱ wu utuka̱ wu a kpaꞋa ku nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:5">wi ta̱ kpamu a kutakpa wu a iɗika i wuma.<char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 52:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 52:6" />Aza a usuɓi ene baci ili i wovon i nanlo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:6">i ta̱ o ku zoꞋoso wu, a dana,<verse eid="PSA 52:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 52:7" />&lt;&lt;Inda biꞋi vuza na u kpa̱ɗa̱i kula̱nsa̱ ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku u Ka̱shile,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 52:7">adama a na u ciya̱ ida̱shi i ma̱ta̱na̱ ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:7">kucikpa u zuwai ka̱ɗu a̱ ubuta̱ wu uciyi u ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:7">a̱ kula̱nsa̱ ida̱shi i ma̱ta̱na̱ a ka gbani-gbani ka̱ ni&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 52:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 52:8" />Ama mpa mi ta̱ tsu maɗanga ma zaitu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:8">ma na mo topoi mayin a kpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:8">N neke ta̱ ka̱ɗu a ucigi u ni u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba ko wannai.<verse eid="PSA 52:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 52:9" />Mi ta̱ a kucikpa wu Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:9">adama ili na vu yaꞋin.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 52:9">mi ta̱ e kuneke ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ wa̱ a̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:9">mi ta̱ a ku sala kula ku nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:9">e kelime ka uma a usuɓi a̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:9">adama a na avu vuza vu kasingai ɗa.<verse eid="PSA 52:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 52" />
  <chapter number="53" style="c" sid="PSA 53" />
  <para style="s1">Kawuya ka vuma</para>
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: A yaꞋan vu ɗa n ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ka &lt;&lt;Mahalatu.&gt;&gt; VicuꞋu vu tsuwaꞋi tsu Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="PSA 14:1-7">Ishp 14:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 53:1" />Alau a tsu dansa ta̱ a̱ɗu e le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:1">&lt;&lt;Ka̱shile ki lo ba.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 53:1">A̱ na̱mgba̱ ta̱ ra̱ka̱ vu le, ulinga u le ili yi unata i ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:1">babu vuza na u ci yaꞋan ili i na yi derere.<verse eid="PSA 53:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 53:2" />Vuzavaguɗu wu indanai uma ɗe gaɗi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:2">we ene ko aza e kuyeve i ta̱ punu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:2">vuza a na wi a̱ kula̱nsa̱ u yeve Ka̱shile.<verse eid="PSA 53:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 53:3" />Ra̱ka̱ vi le a̱ ka̱sukpa̱ ta̱ uye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:3">dem vi le a̱ puwa̱nka̱ ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:3">babu vuza na wi a kuyaꞋan ka̱ ma̱riki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:3">ko vuza te.<verse eid="PSA 53:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 53:4" />Aza a na i a kuyaꞋan ka gbani-gbani ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:4">i n kuyeve ba?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:4">A tsu takuma ta̱ uma tsu boroji,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:4">kpamu a ci yaꞋan avasa u Vuzavaguɗu ba.<verse eid="PSA 53:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 53:5" />Ama i ta̱ a̱ kurikpa̱ ka̱u,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:5">tsu na a saꞋwai kuyaꞋan ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:5">Ka̱shile ki ta̱ a ku wacuwa etele i irala i uma a̱ ni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 53:5">aza a Isaraila i ta̱ o kuloko le, adama a na u iwan le ta̱.<verse eid="PSA 53:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 53:6" />Ishi baci a dana wishi wi Isaraila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:6">wu uta̱ ta̱ a Sihiyona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 53:6">ana Ka̱shile ko bonokoi uma a̱ ni una̱singai u le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:6">Yakubu wi ta̱ a kuyaꞋan ma̱za̱nga̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:6">ka̱ta̱ Isaraila a̱ za̱nga̱na̱.<verse eid="PSA 53:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 53" />
  <chapter number="54" style="c" sid="PSA 54" />
  <para style="s1">Avasa a̱ kula̱nsa̱ uɓa̱nki ekiye a irala i va̱</para>
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: A yaꞋan vu ɗa n aꞋin a umolu. VicuꞋu vu tsuwaꞋi tsu Dawuda. Ana vuza va aza a Zefata u banai u danai Shawulu &lt;&lt;Dawuda ɗa wi usheɗeki wa̱ tsu ba?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 54:1" />Ka̱shile, wawa mu n utsura u kula ku nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:1">vu bonuko mu vuza vu babu unushi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:1">n utsura u nu.<verse eid="PSA 54:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 54:2" />Ka̱shile, Pana avasa a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:2">vu pana kadanshi ka una̱ ka̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 54:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 54:3" />Omoci a̱ tuka̱ mu ta̱ n kuvon.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:3">uma a gbani-gbani i ta̱ a̱ kula̱nsa̱ mu una.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:3">ele ɗa aza a na e yevei a na Ka̱shile ki lo ba. <char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 54:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 54:4" />N yeve ta̱ Ka̱shile kaꞋa ka̱ɓa̱nki ka̱ va̱.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:4">Vuzavaguɗu ɗa wi a̱ kula̱na̱ mu.<verse eid="PSA 54:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 54:5" />Ka̱shile ki ta̱ a kutakacika irala i va̱ tsu ka gbani-gbani ke le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:5">Wi ta̱ a ku una le adama a na a̱yi vuza vu usuɓi ɗa.<verse eid="PSA 54:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 54:6" />N ucigi u ka̱ɗu mi ta̱ e kuneke wu alyuka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:6">mi ta̱ a kucikpa wu, Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:6">adama a na ta ugaꞋin nannai.<verse eid="PSA 54:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 54:7" />Adama a na wu ere mu ta̱ a̱ ubuta̱ wa atakaci a̱ va̱ ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:7">ɗa me enei o lokoi irala i va̱.<verse eid="PSA 54:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 54" />
  <chapter number="55" style="c" sid="PSA 55" />
  <para style="s1">Avasa a̱ kula̱nsa̱ uɓa̱nki</para>
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: A yaꞋan vu ɗa n aꞋin a umolu. VicuꞋu vu tsuwaꞋi tsu Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 55:1" />Ka̱shile, pana avasa a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:1">ka̱ ta̱ vu iwan kupana ufolu u va̱ ba.<verse eid="PSA 55:1" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 55:2" />Panaka mu, vu ushuku mu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 55:2">adama a na una̱mgbuka̱tsuma̱ u va̱ woꞋuso mu ta̱ ka̱u,<verse eid="PSA 55:2" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 55:3" />Ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ ka̱ ɗa̱nga̱ ta̱, adama kacaꞋa ka irala i va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:3">adama o modoruko ma uma a gbani-gbani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 55:3">o tsu ronoko mu ta̱ atakaci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:3">a kupana wupa u va̱ i a ku iwan mu.<verse eid="PSA 55:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 55:4" />ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ ki ta̱ tukpa n una̱mgbuka̱tsuma̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:4">wovon wu ukpa̱ u ka̱na̱i mu.<verse eid="PSA 55:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 55:5" />Wovon u ka̱na̱i mu ka̱u, n kujeꞋeke ki ikyamba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:5">n rikpa̱i ka̱u.<verse eid="PSA 55:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 55:6" />Ɗa n danai, &lt;&lt;Ishi baci mi ta̱ n evelyu tsu moɗoi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:6">mi shi ta̱ a ku imkpa m bana n la̱nsa̱ ubuta̱ u kuvuka.<verse eid="PSA 55:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 55:7" />m bana daꞋangi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:7">n yaꞋan ɗe kpaꞋa ku va̱ e meremune. <char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 55:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 55:8" />Mi ta̱ a kuyaꞋan moloko n la̱nsa̱ ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:8">a gaɗi daꞋangi n wunla̱i wu utsura n uguyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 55:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 55:9" />Vuzavaguɗu, la̱nga̱sa̱ kusheshe ku le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:9">ka̱ ta̱ kpamu vu ripula̱ kadanshi ke le.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:9">adama a na me ene ta̱ ugbamukaci a̱ kuɗa̱nga̱ a̱ likuci ya.<verse eid="PSA 55:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 55:10" />Kanna n kayin a̱ kuka̱ra̱Ꞌa̱sa̱ a nshilya n likuci ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:10">likuci ya tana yi ta̱ tukpa n unushi n ka gbani-gbani.<verse eid="PSA 55:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 55:11" />Ukuna u kula̱nga̱su u shana ta̱ a̱ ubuta̱ dem a̱ likuci ya.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:11">modoruko n kawuya ka shana ta̱ a̱ ubuta̱ dem.<verse eid="PSA 55:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 55:12" />Ishi baci vurala vu va̱ ɗa vi o ku zoꞋoso mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:12">mi shi ta̱ a ku gbama asuvu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 55:12">ishi baci a dana a̱yi ɗa vuza kelime vu va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:12">mi shi ta̱ a kukpaꞋwan adama a̱ ni.<verse eid="PSA 55:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 55:13" />Ama avu ɗa ka̱ja̱Ꞌa̱ ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:13">vuma va̱, ka̱ja̱Ꞌa̱ ka gbagu ka̱ va̱ kpamu.<verse eid="PSA 55:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 55:14" />Cau ci ishi ta̱ tsu ci yongo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:14">tsu tsu bana ta̱ A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin koɓolo.<verse eid="PSA 55:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 55:15" />Ka̱shile ka zuwa ukpa̱ u ta̱wa̱ wi irala i va̱ babu uyevi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:15">yaꞋan a bana iɗika yi ukpisa̱ n wuma u le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:15">ka gbani-gbani ki ta̱ aꞋuwa i le n unata̱ u le.<verse eid="PSA 55:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 55:16" />Ama n ɗeke ta̱ Ka̱shile ka̱ ɓa̱nka̱ mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:16">Vuzavaguɗu tana wi ta̱ a ku wawa mu.<verse eid="PSA 55:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 55:17" />Kanna n kayin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:17">n shika̱i n mavura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:17">ɗa tana u panai ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ka̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 55:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 55:18" />Wi ta̱ a̱ kushiba̱ mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:18">a̱ ubuta̱ u kuvon ku na n ci yaꞋan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:18">n irala i va̱ ya̱ a̱bunda̱i.<verse eid="PSA 55:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 55:19" />Ka̱shile, vuza na wi o tsugono ali n tsu cau,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:19">wi ta̱ a kupanaka mu, ka̱ta̱ u loko le, <char style="qs">Kuvuka</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 55:19">uma a na a tsu sabaꞋa kuyongo ku le ba.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:19">adama a na a tsu pana wovon u Ka̱shile ba.<verse eid="PSA 55:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 55:20" />Ka̱ja̱Ꞌa̱ ka̱va̱, ka banka ta̱ a̱ja̱Ꞌa̱ ni vishili,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:20">u koɗoi uzuwakpani u ni.<verse eid="PSA 55:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 55:21" />Kadanshi ka̱ ni ka laꞋa ta̱ maniꞋin me epeshe n pete,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:21">ama maꞋiwanai mi ta̱ punu a̱ ka̱ɗu ka̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 55:21">Kadanshi ka̱ ni ka laꞋa ta̱ maniꞋin n leku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:21">ama ki ta̱ n alyu tsu una̱ u kotokobi.<verse eid="PSA 55:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 55:22" />Banka Vuzavaguɗu atakaci a̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:22">wi ta̱ a̱ kuɓa̱nka̱ wu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:22">wi a̱ ku ka̱sukpa̱, a lyaꞋa kelime ka vuza vu usuɓi ba.<verse eid="PSA 55:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 55:23" />Ama avu, Ka̱shile vi ta̱ a ku taɗuku aza a gbani-gbani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:23">punu a iɗika a̱ ubuta̱ wu uga̱vi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:23">aza aꞋuwa n aza a̱ kutsuwa̱n ku mpasa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 55:23">babu e pece ayin e le a duniya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:23">ama mpa mi ta̱ e kuneke ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ wa̱ a̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 55:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 55" />
  <chapter number="56" style="c" sid="PSA 56" />
  <para style="s1">Avasa a vuza na u zuwai ka̱ɗu u Ka̱shile</para>
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: A yaꞋan vu ɗa n ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ko &lt;&lt;Moɗoi a gaɗi vu maɗanga ma Oku.&gt;&gt; Vishipa vu Dawuda. Ana aza a Filisitiya e remei ni a Gatu.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 56:1" />Ka̱shile, pana asuvayali a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:1">adama a na uma a̱ tuka̱ mu ta̱ n kuvon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:1">irala i va̱ yi ta̱ a kutakacika mu kanna dem.<verse eid="PSA 56:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 56:2" />Kanna dem irala i va̱ yi ta̱ a ku guva mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:2">n ka̱bunda̱i ke le i ta̱ a̱ vishili nu mpa.<verse eid="PSA 56:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 56:3" />Makyan ma na baci m panai wovon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:3">mi ta̱ a kuzuwa ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ wa̱ a̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 56:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 56:4" />N zuwa ta̱ ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ u Ka̱shile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:4">mi ta̱ a kucikpa uzuwakpani u ni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 56:4">wa̱ a̱ ni u ɗa n zuwai ka̱ɗu, mi a ku pana wovon ba.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:4">Yiɗa̱i vuma vu lima̱ u kuyaꞋanka mu?<verse eid="PSA 56:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 56:5" />Irala i va̱ i tsu oꞋuso mu ta̱ kanna dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:5">makyan dem i ta̱ e kusheshe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:5">tsu na o kudoro mu.<verse eid="PSA 56:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 56:6" />O tsu ɓolongu ta̱ u sokongi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:6">a ku inda nwalu n va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:6">a kuvana tsu na a ku una mu.<verse eid="PSA 56:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 56:7" />Ka̱shile, ka̱ta̱ vu ka̱sukpa̱ le a laꞋaka a ka gbani-gbani ke le ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:7">a wupa u nu una uduniyan u nampa.<verse eid="PSA 56:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 56:8" />Ɗana una̱mgbuka̱tsuma̱ u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:8">kece ka̱bunda̱i ka kujilya ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:8">i a katagarda ka̱ nu ba?<verse eid="PSA 56:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 56:9" />A kanna ka na baci n ɗekei nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:9">irala i va̱ yi ta̱ o kubono n ka̱ca̱pa̱.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:9">adama a na n yeve ta̱ Ka̱shile ki ta̱ koɓolo nu mpa.<verse eid="PSA 56:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 56:10" />Ka̱shile, mi ta̱ a kucikpa kadanshi ka̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:10">Vuzavaguɗu, mi ta̱ a kucikpa kadanshi ka̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 56:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 56:11" />Ka̱shile, wa̱ nu u ɗa n zuwai ka̱ɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:11">mi tana a kupana wovon ba.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:11">Yiɗa̱i vuma vu lima̱ u kuyaꞋan ka mu?<verse eid="PSA 56:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 56:12" />Ka̱shile, mi ta̱ e kuneke wu ili i na n yaꞋin uzuwakpani.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:12">mi ta̱ e kuneke wu kuneꞋe ku kucikpa.<verse eid="PSA 56:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 56:13" />Adama a na vu wawa mu ta̱ a̱ ubuta̱ wu ukpa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:13">vu erei ene a̱ va̱ a̱ ubuta̱ u ma̱ta̱ɗa̱,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 56:13">adama a na n wala e kelime ka̱ Ka̱shile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:13">a kutashi ku na ku tsu neke wuma.<verse eid="PSA 56:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 56" />
  <chapter number="57" style="c" sid="PSA 57" />
  <para style="s1">Avasa a̱ kula̱nsa̱ uɓa̱nki atakaci</para>
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: A yaꞋan vu ɗa n ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ka&lt;&lt;Ka̱ta̱ a yaꞋan munuka ba.&gt;&gt; Vishipa vu Dawuda. Ana u sumai u Shawulu u uwai a kaɓatsu.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="PSA 108:1-5">Ishp 108:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 57:1" />Pana asuvayali a̱ va̱ Ka̱shile, pana asuvayali a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:1">adama a na wa̱ a̱ nu u ɗa n la̱nsa̱i ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 57:1">Mi ta̱ e kusheɗeku a ɗaka vu evelyu a̱ nu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:1">ali mita ra̱ka̱ ma laza.<verse eid="PSA 57:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 57:2" />Mi ta̱ e kuɗeke Ka̱shile, MalaꞋimili,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:2">a̱yi Ka̱shile ka na ka ci shatangu ku mu ili dem.<verse eid="PSA 57:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 57:3" />Ɗe gaɗi Ka̱shile ki ta̱ a̱ ku suꞋuku mu n wishi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:3">o kuloko aza a na i a̱ vishili nu mpa. <char style="qs">Kuvuka</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:3">Ka̱shile ki ta̱ o ku yotsongu mu ucigi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:3">u ni u na tsu sabaꞋa ba n usuɓi u ni.<verse eid="PSA 57:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 57:4" />Wuma u va̱ wi ta̱ e mere ma ikawu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:4">n vaki e mere ma nnama n na n tsu takuma uma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 57:4">anga e le i ta̱ a na osovu n ayaꞋa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:4">elentsu e le i ta̱ n alyu tsu otokobi.<verse eid="PSA 57:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 57:5" />Ka̱shile, yaꞋan a cikpa wu a gaɗi vu eleshu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:5">yaꞋan tsugbayin tsu nu kpamu tsu yongo aduniyan dem.<verse eid="PSA 57:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 57:6" />Irala i va̱ i zuwaka mu ta̱ maza adama a na aza mu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:6">atakaci a laꞋa ta̱ utsura u va̱.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 57:6">A̱ ga̱va̱ka̱i mu kpenle a uye u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:6">ama ɗa a kucikpa o bono a̱ yikpa̱i punu n ka̱ci ka̱le. <char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 57:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 57:7" />Ka̱shile, ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ ka̱ muɗa̱ ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:7">ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ ki ta̱ ida̱shi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 57:7">mi ta̱ a kuyaꞋan ishipa n cikpa wu.<verse eid="PSA 57:7" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 57:8" />Jimgba, wuma u va̱</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 57:8">jimgba umolu u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:8">mi ta̱ a ku jimgba n usana n ishipa i va̱.<verse eid="PSA 57:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 57:9" />Vuzavaguɗu, mi ta̱ a kucikpa wu a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka uduniyan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:9">mi ta̱ a kucanana ishipa i kucikpa wu a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka uma.<verse eid="PSA 57:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 57:10" />Ucigi u gbayin u nu u yawa ta̱ gaɗi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:10">usuɓi u nu u yawa ta̱ eleshu.<verse eid="PSA 57:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 57:11" />Ka̱shile, yaꞋan a cikpa wu a gaɗi vu eleshu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:11">yaꞋan tsugbayin tsu nu kpamu tsu yongo aduniyan dem.<verse eid="PSA 57:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 57" />
  <chapter number="58" style="c" sid="PSA 58" />
  <para style="s1">Avasa adama a na a takacika uma a gbani-gbani</para>
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: A yaꞋan vu ɗa n ka̱la̱ka̱tsu &lt;&lt;Ka̱ta̱ a yaꞋan munuka ba.&gt;&gt; Vishipa vu Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 58:1" />A̱ɗa̱ aza o tsugono yi ta̱ e kuneke kadanshi ka mayun?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:1">Yi ta̱ a kuyaꞋanka uma afada a singai?<verse eid="PSA 58:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 58:2" />A̱Ꞌa̱, a̱ɗu a̱ ɗa̱ kusheshe ku gbani-gbani ku ɗa koci yi a kuyaꞋan.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:2">yi a kuyaꞋan unushi u kuɗa̱ngusa̱ vishili a iɗika.<verse eid="PSA 58:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 58:3" />Ili i na i ɗikai ele punu a̱ ka̱tsuma̱, uma a gbani-gbani a̱ ka̱sukpa̱i uye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:3">babu a matsai le ɗa aza aꞋuwa a̱ ka̱sukpa̱i uye.<verse eid="PSA 58:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 58:4" />I ta̱ tukpa n tsukono a na tsu koko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:4">o tsu votsuku ta̱ atsuvu e le tsu kagulani ka kagbaturu,<verse eid="PSA 58:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 58:5" />ka na ka tsu pana ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ka vuza vu a̱da̱bu ba.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:5">Ko u panaka ma̱zuɓi ma̱ a̱da̱bu ba.<verse eid="PSA 58:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 58:6" />Ka̱shile, koɗoso anga e le ana i a malumuka n aɗa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:6">koɗoso anga i muku mi ikawu ma, Vuzavaguɗu,<verse eid="PSA 58:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 58:7" />YaꞋan a̱ puwa̱nka̱ tsu na mini me ci yene a kulaza.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:7">yaꞋan o koɗoso ayaꞋa e le, ayin a na baci a katsuki a utan u le.<verse eid="PSA 58:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 58:8" />YaꞋan e derikpe tsu na kokoto ke tsu wala u ka̱sukpa̱ kederi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:8">yaꞋan okpo tsu mereɓu ma na a matsai ukpa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:8">ma na u saꞋwai kene kanna ba.<verse eid="PSA 58:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 58:9" />Babu uyevi u le Ka̱shile ki ta̱ a̱ kupura̱ngu le tsu mita̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:9">a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka wupa wu usuɗukpi u ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:9">Ka̱shile ki ta̱ a̱ kupura̱ngu le ele biꞋi n wuma.<verse eid="PSA 58:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 58:10" />Aza a usuɓi i ta̱ a̱ kuyaꞋan ma̱za̱nga̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:10">ayin a na baci enei a takacikai uma a gbani-gbani.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 58:10">i ta̱ a kuyaꞋan ma̱za̱nga̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:10">ayin a na baci a unai irala i le ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 58:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 58:11" />Ka̱ ta̱ uma a dana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:11">&lt;&lt;Mayun katsupu ki ta̱ lo a vuza vu usuɓi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:11">mayun Ka̱shile ki ta̱ lo ka na ki a kuyaꞋanka aduniyan afada.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 58:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 58" />
  <chapter number="59" style="c" sid="PSA 59" />
  <para style="s1">Avasa a̱ kula̱nsa̱ wishi a̱ ubuta̱ wi irala</para>
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: A yaꞋan vu ɗa n ka̱la̱ka̱tsu &lt;&lt;Ka̱ta̱ a yaꞋan munuka ba.&gt;&gt; Vishipa vu Dawuda. Ana Shawulu u suki uma a bana inda kpaꞋa ku Dawuda adama a na una yi.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 59:1" />Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱, wawa mu a̱ ubuta̱ wi irala i va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:1">ere mu wa aza na i a̱ ku tuka̱ mu n vishili makyan dem.<verse eid="PSA 59:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 59:2" />Wawa mu a̱ ubuta̱ uma a na a ci yaꞋan ka gbani-gbani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:2">wawa mu a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka aza a̱ ku tsuwa̱n ku mpasa.<verse eid="PSA 59:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 59:3" />La̱na̱, o bopoi a kuvana adama a na una mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:3">uma a gbani-gbani o tsu ɓolongu ta̱ adama a na a yaꞋan tsurala nu mpa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 59:3">a̱ ma̱ta̱ɗa̱ ko unushi wi ili i yoku ba, Vuzavaguɗu.<verse eid="PSA 59:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 59:4" />N yaꞋan unushi ba, n nannai dem i ta̱ ufoɓushi a̱ shilika̱ nu mpa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:4">ɗa̱nga̱ vu ɓa̱nka̱ mu, vu la̱na̱ atakaci a̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 59:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 59:5" />Avu Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile MalaꞋimili Ka̱shile ki Isaraila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:5">ɗa̱nga̱ vu takacika uduniyan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 59:5">ka̱ ta̱ vu pana asuvayali a uma a gbani-gbani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:5">aza o modoruko a nanlo ba. <char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 59:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 59:6" />O tsu bono ta̱ n kulivi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:6">a̱ ka̱na̱ wali a na nsheꞋe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:6">n na mi a̱ ka̱ ka̱ra̱sa̱ a̱ likuci.<verse eid="PSA 59:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 59:7" />Pana kadanshi ki ishikushi ka na ki a̱ ku uta̱ una̱ u le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:7">kadanshi ke le ki ta̱ a na otokobi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:7">ali, a kudana, &lt;&lt;Yayi, u kupanaka tsu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 59:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 59:8" />Ama avu Vuzavuguɗu, zoꞋoso le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:8">Vu tsu yaꞋanka ta̱ uduniyan dem ulami.<verse eid="PSA 59:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 59:9" />Avu vuza vu utsura u va̱, Ka̱shile, n zuwa ta̱ katsura ka̱va̱ wa̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:9">avu ɗa ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku u va̱.<verse eid="PSA 59:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 59:10" />Ka̱shile vuza vu ucigi u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:10">Ka̱shile ki ta̱ a ku wawa mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:10">ka̱ ta̱ u zuwa mu n zoꞋoso irala i va̱.<verse eid="PSA 59:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 59:11" />Ka̱ta̱ vu una le ba, Vuzavaguɗu ke keɗetsu ka̱ va̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:11">adama a na ka̱ta̱ uma a̱ va̱ a cinukpa ba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 59:11">n utsura u nu zuwa le a̱ ka̱na̱ ka̱ ka̱ra̱sa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:11">ka̱ta̱ vu la̱nga̱sa̱ le,<verse eid="PSA 59:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 59:12" />Unushi wu una̱ u le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:12">n kadanshi ku una̱ u le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:12">yaꞋan e reme le adama a̱ra̱ɗi e le.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 59:12">Adama a ishikushi n aꞋuwa a na a ci yaꞋan,<verse eid="PSA 59:12" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 59:13" />La̱nga̱sa̱ le a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka wupa u nu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:13">la̱nga̱sa̱ le ali o kotso ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 59:13">nannai ɗa e kuyeve a na Ka̱shile kaꞋa ki o tsugono ci Isaraila</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:13">ali a uteku wa aduniyan. <char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 59:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 59:14" />O tsu bono ta̱ n kulivi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:14">a̱ ka̱na̱ wali a na nsheꞋe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:14">n na mi a̱ ka̱ ka̱ra̱sa̱ a̱ likuci,<verse eid="PSA 59:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 59:15" />a̱ ka̱ka̱ra̱sa̱ a̱ ubuta̱ dem a̱ kula̱nsa̱ ilikulyaꞋa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:15">a̱ ka̱na̱ ma̱shi ɗa baci a̱ cuwa̱i ba.<verse eid="PSA 59:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 59:16" />Ama mpa mi ta̱ a kucanana ishipa a ukuna wu utsura u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:16">usana mi ta̱ a kucanana ishipa adama a ucigi u nu u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 59:16">Adama a na avu ɗa ubuta̱ wu ukanji va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:16">ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku u va̱ a makyan ma atakaci.<verse eid="PSA 59:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 59:17" />Mi ta̱ a ku cikpa wu, avu katsura ka̱va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:17">avu Ka̱shile, ubuta̱ wu ukanji uva̱, Ka̱shile ka na ka cigai mu.<verse eid="PSA 59:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 59" />
  <chapter number="60" style="c" sid="PSA 60" />
  <para style="s1">Avasa adama a̱ kula̱nsa̱ uɓa̱nki</para>
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: A yaꞋan vu ɗa n ka̱la̱ka̱tsu &lt;&lt;Lili vu uzuwakpani.&gt;&gt; Vishipa vu Dawuda. Ana u shilika̱i n Aram Naharami n Aram vu Zoba n ayain a na Jowabu u banai wu unai aza a Edom a̱kpa̱n kupa n ere a̱ ka̱ra̱Ꞌa̱ ka mkpaɗi.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 60:1" />Ka̱shile vu iwan tsu ta̱, ali ɗa ka̱sukpa̱i a lyaꞋi utsura u tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:1">vu yaꞋan ta̱ wupa n a̱ tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:1">ama gogo na bonoko tsu.<verse eid="PSA 60:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 60:2" />Vu zuwai iɗika i gba̱ɗa̱i ɗa i ɓatsai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:2">gogo na ciɗa̱ngu enle a, adama a na i tsurukpa kpamu.<verse eid="PSA 60:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 60:3" />Vu zuwa ta̱ uma a̱ nu a takacikai ka̱u,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:3">vu nekei tsu ma̱kya̱n ma na ma lamkpai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:3">ali ma zuwai tsu ku tangala.<verse eid="PSA 60:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 60:4" />Ama vu ɗa̱ngusa̱ ta̱ urotu u kakashi wa aza a na i ku pana wovon u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:4">adama a na a laꞋaka a utan. <char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 60:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 60:5" />Wawa tsu vu ɓa̱nka̱ tsu n utsura u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:5">adama a uma a na vu cigai a̱ ciya̱ wishi u nu,<verse eid="PSA 60:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 60:6" />Ka̱shile ka yaꞋan ta̱ kadanshi a̱ ubuta̱ u ciɗa u ni.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:6">&lt;&lt;N ulyaꞋi mi ta̱ e kupece Shekem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:6">ka̱ta̱ m pecukusu ka̱ra̱Ꞌa̱ ka Sukotu.<verse eid="PSA 60:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 60:7" />Giliyadu vu va̱ vu ɗa, Manasa feu vu va̱ vu ɗa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:7">Ifirayimu ɗa ma̱kuꞋun ma̱ viyum ma̱ va̱.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:7">Yahuda kalangu ko tsugono ka̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 60:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 60:8" />Mi ta̱ o kubonoko Mowabu tsu kasasu ka̱ kuza̱Ꞌa̱ ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:8">Edom wi ta̱ o ko okpo a ɗaka vu ene a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:8">Ka̱ ta̱ n yaꞋan yoroli yi ulyaꞋi wa aza a Filisitiya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 60:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 60:9" />Yayi u kubanka mu a̱ likuci yi u ukanji?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:9">Yayi u kutono nu mpa a kubana a iɗika i Edom?<verse eid="PSA 60:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 60:10" />Ka̱shile avu ɗa vu variki tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:10">Vu kpa̱ɗa̱i kudoku kuwala n osoji a̱ tsu ba?<verse eid="PSA 60:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 60:11" />Ɓa̱nka̱ tsu, tsu shilika̱ ni irala i tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:11">adama a na uɓa̱nki u vuma gbani ɗa.<verse eid="PSA 60:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 60:12" />Ka̱shile ki baci n a̱tsu ci ta̱ a̱ kuciya̱ ulyaꞋi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:12">wi ta̱ a kulyaꞋa irala i tsu.<verse eid="PSA 60:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 60" />
  <chapter number="61" style="c" sid="PSA 61" />
  <para style="s1">Uzuwi u ka̱ɗu a wu eri u Ka̱shile</para>
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: A yaꞋan vu ɗa n anꞋin a umolu. Vishipa vu Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 61:1" />Ka̱shile, pana ma̱shi ma̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:1">zuwa atsuvu wa avasa a̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 61:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 61:2" />A uteku wa aduniyan, n ɗekei nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:2">n ɗeke wu ta̱ ana n takpai ka̱ɗu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 61:2">vu banka mu a̱ ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku u na u laꞋi.<verse eid="PSA 61:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 61:3" />Adama a na avu ɗa ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku ali ɗe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:3">avu ɗa ubuta̱ wu ukanji e kelime ka irala i va̱.<verse eid="PSA 61:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 61:4" />YaꞋan n da̱sa̱ngu a̱ ma̱va̱li ma̱ nu ko wannai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:4">yaꞋan n ciya̱ ubuta̱ wu ida̱shi a ɗaka vu evelyu a̱ nu. <char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 61:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 61:5" />Ka̱shile, vu pana ta̱ akucina a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:5">ɗa vu nekei mu ili yi uka̱ni ya aza a na i a kucikpa wu.<verse eid="PSA 61:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 61:6" />Zuwa wuma u mogono u geshe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:6">vu zuwa yi u yongo n wuma ali a kubana a tsukaya.<verse eid="PSA 61:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 61:7" />YaꞋan u lyaꞋa tsugono e kelime ka̱ nu, Ka̱shile, ko wannai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:7">zuwa ucigi u nu u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba n usuɓi u nu wu ere yi.<verse eid="PSA 61:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 61:8" />Adama a nannai mi ta̱ a kucanana ishipa n cikpa kula ku nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:8">n shatangu uzuwakpani u va̱ u kanna dem.<verse eid="PSA 61:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 61" />
  <chapter number="62" style="c" sid="PSA 62" />
  <para style="s1">Ka̱shile kaꞋa koci ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku</para>
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: A yaꞋan vu ɗa n ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ka Jedutun. Vishipa vu Dawuda</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 62:1" />A̱ Ka̱shile kaꞋa koci wuma u va̱ u ciya̱i kuvuka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:1">wishi u va̱ wu uta̱ ta̱ wa̱ ni.<verse eid="PSA 62:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 62:2" />Ka̱shile kaꞋa koci katali ka̱va̱ n kishi ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:2">a̱yi ɗa ubuta̱ wu ukanji u va̱, mi a kupana wovon ba.<verse eid="PSA 62:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 62:3" />Ali n wannai ɗai ra̱ka̱ vu ɗa̱ i ku shilika̱ n vuma vu te?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:3">Adama a na yi una yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:3">mashilya ma u tsubaki ma nampa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:3">ko an mashilya ma na mi a ukuna u kuyikpa̱?<verse eid="PSA 62:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 62:4" />Kusheshe ku ɗa̱ ku ɗa i cipuka̱ yi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:4">a̱ ubuta̱ u tsugbayin ci ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 62:4">I tsu pana ta̱ uyoꞋo u kuyaꞋan aꞋuwa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:4">i tsu zuwaka ta̱ vuma una̱singai n una̱ u ɗa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:4">ama a̱ɗu a̱ ɗa̱ una̱ u wuya u ɗa. <char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 62:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 62:5" />A̱ Ka̱shile kaꞋa koci wuma u va̱ u ciya̱i kuvuka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:5">wa̱ a̱ ni u ɗa n keɗei a̱pa̱Ꞌa̱.<verse eid="PSA 62:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 62:6" />A̱yi ɗa koci katali ka̱ va̱ n kishi ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:6">a̱yi ɗa ubuta̱ wu ukanji u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:6">mi a kupana wovon ba.<verse eid="PSA 62:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 62:7" />Wishi u va̱ n tsugbayin tsu va̱ tsu uta̱ ta̱ u Ka̱shile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:7">a̱yi ɗa katali ka gbayin ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:7">ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku u va̱.<verse eid="PSA 62:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 62:8" />Uma, zuwai a̱ɗu a̱ ɗa̱ wa̱ ni makyan dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:8">i dana yi ili i na yi a̱ɗu a̱ ɗa̱ ra̱ka̱.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:8">adama a na Ka̱shile kaꞋa ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku u tsu. <char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 62:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 62:9" />Aza a unambi i ta̱ tsu ayinviki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:9">aza a uciyi ukuna wa aꞋuwa u ɗa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 62:9">a gisanku le baci ele ili i ɗa ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:9">ra̱ka̱ vu le ayinviki a ɗa koci.<verse eid="PSA 62:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 62:10" />Ka̱ta̱ i zuwa a̱ɗu a̱ ɗa̱ a ukuna u modoruko ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:10">ko i ka̱na̱ a̱ra̱ɗi n ucanuku wu uboki ba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 62:10">ko a na uciyi u yimkpai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:10">ka̱ta̱ i zuwa a̱ɗu a̱ ɗa̱ a u ɗa ba.<verse eid="PSA 62:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 62:11" />Ili i te i ɗa Ka̱shile kadanai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:11">ama ili i re i ɗa m panai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 62:11">utsura u Ka̱shile u ɗa,<verse eid="PSA 62:11" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 62:12" />n ucigi u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba, Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 62:12">Mayun vi ta̱ a kutsupa yaba dem</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:12">derere vu ulinga u ni.<verse eid="PSA 62:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 62" />
  <chapter number="63" style="c" sid="PSA 63" />
  <para style="s1">Uzuwi u ka̱ɗu a̱ ubuta̱ u Ka̱shile</para>
  <para style="d">Vishipa vu Dawuda. A makyan ma na wi a kakamba ka Yahuda.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 63:1" />Ka̱shile, avu ɗa Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:1">mayun, n la̱nsa̱ wu ta̱.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 63:1">Ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ ki ta̱ a kakuli ka̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:1">ikyamba i va̱ i geshe ta̱ a kuvana wu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 63:1">a iɗika i woꞋi nu uɗekpu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:1">ubuta̱ u na wi n mini ba.<verse eid="PSA 63:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 63:2" />YaꞋan me ene wu a̱ ubuta̱ u ciɗa u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:2">ka̱ta̱ mi inda utsura u nu n tsugbayin tsu nu.<verse eid="PSA 63:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 63:3" />Adama a ucigi u nu u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba u laꞋa ta̱ wuma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:3">adama a nannai mi ta̱ a ku cikpa wu n una̱ u va̱.<verse eid="PSA 63:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 63:4" />Mi ta̱ a kucikpa wu, a ayin a wuma va̱ ra̱ka̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:4">mi ta̱ a̱ kuɗa̱ngusa̱ ekiye mi baci a kuyaꞋan avasa.<verse eid="PSA 63:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 63:5" />Mi ta̱ a̱ kucuwa̱ tsu vuza na u lyaꞋi ilikulyaꞋa i ka̱ɗiva̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:5">ka̱ta̱ n canana ishipa i ma̱za̱nga̱ n cikpa wu.<verse eid="PSA 63:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 63:6" />Mpa a ivaꞋin a kajiba ka̱ va̱ n ciɓai n avu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 63:6">kayin n ka̱ɓula̱ n ka̱na̱i aciɓa a̱ nu,<verse eid="PSA 63:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 63:7" />adama a na avu ɗa ka̱ɓa̱nki ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:7">n ma̱za̱nga̱ mi ta̱ a kuyaꞋan ishipa a ɗaka vu evelyu a̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 63:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 63:8" />Ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ ki ta̱ gbagu n avu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:8">kukiye ku singai ku nu ki ta̱ uɓa̱ni nu mpa.<verse eid="PSA 63:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 63:9" />Aza a na i a̱ kula̱nsa̱ wuma u va̱ i ta̱ a kuyaꞋan wuni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:9">i ta̱ a̱ ku gida̱la̱ a kubana a̱ ubuta̱ wi ida̱shi ya̱ a̱kpisa̱,<verse eid="PSA 63:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 63:10" />i ta̱ a kubana ukpa̱ u kotokobi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:10">ikyamba i le yi ta̱ o kokpo ilikulya yi nsheꞋe n kakamba.<verse eid="PSA 63:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 63:11" />Mogono mi ta̱ a kuyaꞋan ma̱za̱nga̱ n Ka̱shile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:11">aza a na a yaꞋin uzuwakpani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:11">n kula ku Ka̱shile i ta̱ a kucikpa yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:11">Ka̱shile ki ta̱ a̱ kuɓa̱ya̱ngu una̱ wa aza aꞋuwa.<verse eid="PSA 63:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 63" />
  <chapter number="64" style="c" sid="PSA 64" />
  <para style="s1">Avasa adama a uɓa̱nki</para>
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: Vishipa vu Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 64:1" />Ka̱shile, panaka mu, n tuka̱ baci n mavura ma̱ va̱ gogo na</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:1">ere wuma u va̱ a̱ ka̱rikpa̱ni ka irala i va̱ i na yi a kutakacika mu.<verse eid="PSA 64:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 64:2" />Ere mu a nsata n uma a gbani-gbani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:2">n koɓolo ka aza a kawuya.<verse eid="PSA 64:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 64:3" />O tsu gboro ta̱ elentsu e le a na otokobi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:3">ka̱ta̱ a gisanku ayaꞋa e le a na i kadanshi ka una̱mgbi u ka̱tsuma̱,<verse eid="PSA 64:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 64:4" />ka̱ta̱ o bopo a tawa aza babu unushi n ayaꞋa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:4">a tsu tawa vuza gogoꞋo lo ko wovon.<verse eid="PSA 64:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 64:5" />E ci nekpenei ta̱ kadanshi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:5">a̱ ubuta̱ u kuyaꞋan ka gbani-gbani ke le.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 64:5">O ci yongo ta̱ a kadanshi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:5">tsu na a ku azuku ayakuru e le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:5">e kusheshe, &lt;&lt;Ko vuza u kene le ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 64:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 64:6" />A̱ tsu ka̱na̱ ta̱ kusheshe tsu na a kuyaꞋan kawuya, a dana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:6">&lt;&lt;Tsu kotso ta̱ kusheshe mayin.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:6">Ka̱ɗu ka vuma ki ta̱ n awuya e kuyeve.<verse eid="PSA 64:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 64:7" />Ama Ka̱shile ki ta̱ a ku tawa le n kayaꞋa ka̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:7">wi ta̱ a kulapa le gogoꞋo lo.<verse eid="PSA 64:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 64:8" />Kadanshi ke kelentsu ke le, ki ta̱ o kubono a kaci ke le ka una le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:8">Vuzana baci we enei le dem wi ta̱ a̱ ku gba̱ɗa̱ kaci ka̱ ni.<verse eid="PSA 64:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 64:9" />Ka̱ta̱ uma ra̱ka̱ a pana wovon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:9">i ta̱ a kudansa ulinga u Ka̱shile,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 64:9">ka̱ta̱ a̱ ka̱na̱ aciɓa adama ili i na u yaꞋin.<verse eid="PSA 64:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 64:10" />Vuza vu usuɓi wi ta̱ a kuyaꞋan ma̱za̱nga̱ u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:10">wi ta̱ a̱ kuciya̱ ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku wa̱ a̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:10">aza a̱ ma̱riki ra̱ka̱ i ta̱ a̱ kuciya̱ ucikpi.<verse eid="PSA 64:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 64" />
  <chapter number="65" style="c" sid="PSA 65" />
  <para style="s1">Ucikpi n ma̱za̱nga̱</para>
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: Vishipa vu Dawuda. Vishipa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 65:1" />Ka̱shile mayun ɗa uma a cikpa wu a Sihiyona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:1">ka̱ta̱ e neke ili i na a kucinai kuneke.<verse eid="PSA 65:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 65:2" />Uma ra̱ka̱ i ta̱ a̱ kuta̱wa̱ wa̱ a̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:2">avu na vu tsu pana avasa.<verse eid="PSA 65:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 65:3" />Ɗa baci unushi u tsu u laꞋi utsura u tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:3">vu takpaka tsu u ɗa.<verse eid="PSA 65:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 65:4" />Aza a una̱singai a ɗa aza a na vu zagbai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:4">ɗa vu tuka̱i le ɗevu o yongo a ulanga u nu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 65:4">Ci ta̱ a̱ kucuwa̱ n kasingai ka̱ a̱ ubuta̱ wi ida̱shi i nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:4">n una̱singai wa̱ A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin a ciɗa a̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 65:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 65:5" />Ka̱shile kishi ka̱ tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:5">vu ushuku tsu ta̱ a̱ ubuta̱ u kuyaꞋan ili i mereve,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:5">n kuyaꞋan ili yi usuɓi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 65:5">Avu a̱pa̱Ꞌa̱ a uma a̱ ubuta̱ dem aduniyan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:5">ali a upashi u mala.<verse eid="PSA 65:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 65:6" />Avu na vu zuwai nsasan n shamgbai n utsura u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:6">ana vu foɓusoi ka̱ci ka̱ nu n utsura.<verse eid="PSA 65:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 65:7" />Avu na vu tsu vaꞋanka kacaꞋa ka mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:7">n kacaꞋa ka aɓau a mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:7">vu tsu vaꞋanka ta̱ ujari wu uduniyan.<verse eid="PSA 65:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 65:8" />Uma a na i a ida̱shi a uteku wa aduniyan dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:8">a pana ta̱ wovon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:8">adama ili i mereve i na vu yaꞋin.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 65:8">Vu zuwa ta̱ ma̱za̱nga̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:8">u uma a na i a ida̱shi a kasana n aza na i a idashi a̱ ka̱livi.<verse eid="PSA 65:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 65:9" />Vu tsu la̱na̱ ta̱ iɗika ka̱ta̱ vu yoꞋo ko i ɗa mini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:9">vu tsu zuwa ta̱ i ɗa yo okpo n tsuta̱ ka̱u.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 65:9">Nɗolu n Ka̱shile n shanai tukpa m mini.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 65:9">Vu zuwa ta̱ iɗika i nekei uma ili i kashina,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:9">ta vu foɓusoi nannai.<verse eid="PSA 65:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 65:10" />Vu zuwai aɓakanla a̱ ta̱na̱i n mini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:10">ɗa vu ɓosoi yolo ya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 65:10">ɗa vu zuwa i ɗa i ta̱na̱i n ijaꞋashi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:10">vu zuwakai ica̱Ꞌa̱shi una̱singai.<verse eid="PSA 65:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 65:11" />Vu zuwa ta̱ ka̱ya̱ ka ko okpoi ka vukyaꞋa n a̱bunda̱i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:11">mpon n nu n shanai n ili kashina ali n m pasai.<verse eid="PSA 65:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 65:12" />Vu zuwai mita̱ ma̱ uta̱i gbani a kakamba adama a kalina,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:12">ɗa aginda dem a shanai m ma̱za̱nga̱.<verse eid="PSA 65:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 65:13" />Ushiga wu nlala u palai ubuta̱ dem a̱pula̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:13">a̱ra̱Ꞌa̱ a shanai n alkama.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 65:13">O yoroli n cananai ishipa i ma̱za̱nga̱ tsu uma.<verse eid="PSA 65:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 65" />
  <chapter number="66" style="c" sid="PSA 66" />
  <para style="s1">Vishipa vu kucikpa adama a kasingai ka̱ Ka̱shile</para>
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: Vishipa. Ishipa.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 66:1" />A̱ɗa̱ aduniyan ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:1">yaꞋin yoroli i ma̱za̱nga̱ u Ka̱shile.<verse eid="PSA 66:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 66:2" />Cananai ukuna u tsugbayin tsu kula ku ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:2">yaꞋan ucikpi u ni u ciya̱ tsugbayin.<verse eid="PSA 66:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 66:3" />Danai Ka̱shile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:3">&lt;&lt;Yiɗa̱i a ku gisanku n ili mereve i na vi a kuyaꞋansa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 66:3">Adama a utsura ugbayin u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:3">irala i nu yi ta̱ a̱ ku kuɗa̱ngu ku wu adama o wovon.<verse eid="PSA 66:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 66:4" />Uma aduniyan dem a̱ kuɗa̱nku wu ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 66:4">a ku canana ka wu ishipa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:4">a ku canana ishipa i kucikpa kula ku nu.&gt;&gt; <char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 66:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 66:5" />Ta̱wa̱i ye ene ili i na Ka̱shile ka yaꞋin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:5">ili i mereve i na u yaꞋin adama a uma.<verse eid="PSA 66:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 66:6" />U bonokoi mala mokpoi iɗika i ɗekpu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:6">uma a pasai kuyene ka n e ene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:6">ta ɗe tsu kuyaꞋan ma̱za̱nga̱ u Ka̱shile.<verse eid="PSA 66:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 66:7" />Wi ta̱ a kulyaꞋa tsugono n utsura u ni ko wannai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:7">a̱shi a̱ ni i ta̱ a ku inda uduniyan.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:7">ka̱ta̱ aza a ugbamiwasuvu ene i ta̱ n tsugbayin ba. <char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 66:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 66:8" />Cikpai Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu, a̱ɗa̱ uduniyan dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:8">cikpai ni n a̱la̱ka̱tsu ka̱u.<verse eid="PSA 66:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 66:9" />A̱yi ɗa u tsu foɓo wuma u tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:9">u ka̱sukpa̱ ene a̱ tsu e derece ba.<verse eid="PSA 66:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 66:10" />Adama a na avu Ka̱shile, vu kondo tsu ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:10">vu luwa̱ tsu ta̱ tsa azurufa a na a̱ luwa̱i akina.<verse eid="PSA 66:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 66:11" />Vu tuka̱ tsu ta̱ a maza.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:11">Vu zuwaka tsu ta̱ ucanuku wa̱ a̱miki a avangatsu a̱ tsu.<verse eid="PSA 66:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 66:12" />Vu zuwai uma a dasai tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:12">tsu tonoi e mere ma akina m mini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:12">ama gogo na vu utuka̱ tsu ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:12">vu tuka̱i tsu a̱ ubuta̱ wu ida̱shi i ba̱ri.<verse eid="PSA 66:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 66:13" />Mi ta̱ a̱ kuta̱wa̱ a kpaꞋa ku nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:13">n kuneꞋe ku kusongu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:13">ka̱ta̱ n neke ili i na n kucinai,<verse eid="PSA 66:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 66:14" />n danai mi ta̱ e kuneke wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:14">a makyan ma na mi o kusoꞋo atakaci.<verse eid="PSA 66:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 66:15" />Mi ta̱ e ku neke wu kuneꞋe ku kusongu ku nnama mi ikyamba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:15">n ili i ma̱gula̱ i kuneꞋe ku ka̱giri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:15">mi ta̱ a kulyuka obomburon n nga̱ji. <char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 66:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 66:16" />Ta̱wa̱i i pana, a̱ɗa̱ na yi a kupana wovon u Ka̱shile ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:16">yaꞋan n dana ɗa̱ ili i na u yaꞋankai mu.<verse eid="PSA 66:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 66:17" />N banka ta̱ m ma̱shi ma̱ va̱ wa̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:17">n kelentsu ka̱ va̱ n neke wu ta̱ tsugbayin.<verse eid="PSA 66:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 66:18" />Ishi baci n zuwa ta̱ unushi a̱ ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:18">Vuzavaguɗu wishi a kupana ka mu ba,<verse eid="PSA 66:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 66:19" />ama mayun ɗa Ka̱shile ka panakai mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:19">ɗa kpamu u panai avasa a̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 66:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 66:20" />Una̱singai u Ka̱shile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:20">vuza na u iwain avasa a̱ va̱ ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:20">ko u kpa̱ɗa̱i kuyotsongu mu ucigi u ni u na tsu sabaꞋa ba.<verse eid="PSA 66:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 66" />
  <chapter number="67" style="c" sid="PSA 67" />
  <para style="s1">Vishipa vu kucikpa</para>
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: N anꞋin a umolu. Ishipa Vishipa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 67:1" />YaꞋan tsu ciya̱ mapasa ma singai u Ka̱shile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:1">u zuwaka tsu una̱singai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:1">ka̱ta̱ u inda tsu n a̱shi a singai a̱ ni. <char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 67:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 67:2" />Adama a na aduniyan dem e yeve uye u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:2">ka̱ta̱ kpamu uduniyan u yeve wishi u nu.<verse eid="PSA 67:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 67:3" />Ka̱shile, yaꞋan uduniyan u cikpa wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:3">yaꞋan uduniyan ra̱ka̱ u cikpa wu.<verse eid="PSA 67:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 67:4" />YaꞋan uduniyan u yaꞋan ma̱za̱nga̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:4">a canana ishipa i ma̱za̱nga̱.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 67:4">Adama a na vi ta̱ a kuyaꞋanka uduniyan afada a mayun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:4">ka̱ta̱ vu tono n uduniyan ra̱ka̱. <char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 67:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 67:5" />Ka̱shile, yaꞋan uduniyan u cikpa wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:5">yaꞋan uduniyan ra̱ka̱ u cikpa wu.<verse eid="PSA 67:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 67:6" />Iɗika i neke ta̱ ili i kashina.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:6">YaꞋan Ka̱shile, Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu, u zuwaka tsu una̱singai.<verse eid="PSA 67:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 67:7" />YaꞋan Ka̱shile ka zuwaka tsu una̱singai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:7">ka̱ta̱ uma a uteku wa aduniyan ra̱ka̱, a pana wovon u ni.<verse eid="PSA 67:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 67" />
  <chapter number="68" style="c" sid="PSA 68" />
  <para style="s1">Vishipa vu lyaꞋi va aza a Isaraila</para>
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: A yaꞋan vu ɗa n ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ka &lt;&lt;Lili&gt;&gt; Vishipa vu Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 68:1" />YaꞋan Ka̱shile ka̱ ɗa̱nga̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:1">yaꞋan irala i ni i wacuwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:1">ka̱ta̱ aza a na a iwain ni, a suma e kelime ka̱ ni.<verse eid="PSA 68:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 68:2" />Tsu na ka̱nga̱ ka̱ tsu puwa̱nka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:2">yaꞋan vu zuwa le a̱ puwa̱nka̱ nannai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 68:2">Tsu na kabashi ki ishigi ke tsu derikpe akina,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:2">yaꞋan una uma a gbani-gbani nannai e kelime ka̱ Ka̱shile.<verse eid="PSA 68:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 68:3" />Ama aza a usuɓi i ta̱ a kuyaꞋan ma̱za̱nga̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:3">ka̱ta̱ a̱ za̱nga̱na̱ e kelime ka̱ Ka̱shile.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:3">YaꞋan a pana uyoꞋo ka̱u.<verse eid="PSA 68:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 68:4" />Cananai ishipa u Ka̱shile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:4">yaꞋin ishipa i kucikpa kula ku ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:4">lapulai uye adama a̱ ni, vuzana wi e ku wala eleshu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 68:4">Kula ku ni ku ɗa Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:4">i za̱nga̱na̱ e kelime ka̱ ni.<verse eid="PSA 68:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 68:5" />Ka̱shile vuza na wi a ida̱shi a̱ ubuta̱ u ciɗa u ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:5">esheku a mkpaꞋan a ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:5">n ke eri ka agapa a̱ma̱ci.<verse eid="PSA 68:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 68:6" />Ka̱shile ke ci neke ta̱ aza a na i a ida̱shi endeꞋin iꞋuwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:6">u tsu utuka̱ ta̱ aza a ugbashi a kubana a̱ ubuta̱ wu ida̱shi i ba̱ri.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 68:6">Ama aza a ugbamiwasuvu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:6">i ta̱ a̱ kuda̱sa̱ngu a iɗika i na yi lekeɗi.<verse eid="PSA 68:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 68:7" />Ka̱shile, ana vu uta̱i e kelime ka uma a̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:7">ana vu walai a̱ ka̱pula̱ka̱, <char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 68:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 68:8" />aduniya a̱ gba̱ɗa̱i</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:8">ɗa gaɗi u tuka̱i n mini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:8">ali n kusan ku Sinai ku gba̱ɗa̱i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:8">e kelime ka̱ Ka̱shile ki Isaraila.<verse eid="PSA 68:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 68:9" />Ka̱shile vu yoꞋi mini ma̱ a̱bunda̱i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:9">a iɗika yi uka̱ni i nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:9">vu bonokoi ka̱pula̱ka̱ ubuta̱ u tsuta̱.<verse eid="PSA 68:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 68:10" />Ta ɗe uma a̱ nu a̱ da̱sa̱ngi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:10">Ka̱shile, vu yaꞋankai aza a unambi kasingai.<verse eid="PSA 68:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 68:11" />Vuzavaguɗu u nekei kadanshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:11">ka̱kuma̱ ka̱ a̱ma̱ci ka na ka salai ukuna wa ki ta̱ n a̱bunda̱i.<verse eid="PSA 68:11" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 68:12" />&lt;&lt;Ngono mo osoji n sumai kpakaru.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:12">A̱ma̱ci a na i a iꞋuwa e peciki ucanuku u na a̱ pura̱i gbani.<verse eid="PSA 68:12" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 68:13" />A̱ɗa̱ na i tsu asa a ushiga wu nlala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:13">yi ta̱ a kufuɗa kupala ka̱ci ka̱ ɗa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:13">tsu na evelyu o moɗoi a tsu pala yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:13">n ucanuku wa azurufa n azanariya a kutasa.<verse eid="PSA 68:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 68:14" />Makyan ma na MalaꞋimili dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:14">u zuwai ngono a iɗika,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:14">yaꞋan egele sa̱ruwa̱ a kusan ku Zalimonu.<verse eid="PSA 68:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 68:15" />Avu kusan ku gbayin, kusan ku Bashan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:15">kusan ku ugaɗi, kusan ku Bashan!<verse eid="PSA 68:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 68:16" />Yiɗa̱i i zuwai avu kusan ku ugaɗi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:16">vi o kugoyo kusan ku Ka̱shile?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 68:16">Kusan ku na Ka̱shile ki a mali,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:16">adama a̱ ubuta̱ wu ida̱shi i ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:16">ta ɗe Vuzavaguɗu u kuda̱sa̱ngu ko wannai.<verse eid="PSA 68:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 68:17" />Ekeke odoku o kuvon a̱ Ka̱shile</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:17">a laꞋa ta̱ ku kece,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:17">a̱kpa̱n-a̱kpa̱n.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 68:17">Vuzavaguɗu u ta̱wa̱i n e le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:17">a kusan ku Sinai ubuta̱ u ciɗa u ni.<verse eid="PSA 68:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 68:18" />Vu gaɗukpai gaɗi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:18">vu tonoi n ka̱bunda̱i ka agbashi a na vu ka̱na̱i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:18">a ku isa kuneꞋe kakau a̱ ubuta̱ uma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 68:18">ali aza a ugbamiwasuvu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:18">adama a na avu Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile vu kuda̱sa̱ngu ɗe.<verse eid="PSA 68:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 68:19" />Una̱singai u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:19">a̱yi na u ci ɗika a̱miki a̱ tsu a kanna dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:19">a̱yi ɗa Ka̱shile vuza na u wawai tsu. <char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 68:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 68:20" />Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu, Ka̱shile ka wishi kaꞋa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:20">a̱yi ɗa Vuzavaguɗu, Vuzavaguɗu vu tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:20">vuza na u tsu zuwa tsu laꞋaka a̱ ubuta̱ wu ukpa̱.<verse eid="PSA 68:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 68:21" />Mayun Ka̱shile ki ta̱ o kuɓoso aci a irala i ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:21">n okolokolo aza a na a gbagbalai kutono uye wu unushi u le.<verse eid="PSA 68:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 68:22" />Vuzavaguɗu u danai, &lt;&lt;Mi ta̱ a̱ kuta̱wa̱ n irala a Bashan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 68:22">mi ta̱ a̱ ku kuta̱wa̱ n ele a mala ma uga̱vi.<verse eid="PSA 68:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 68:23" />Adama a na i wala a gaɗi va even a ikyamba irala i ɗa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:23">nsheꞋe n ɗa̱ feu m peɗe mpasa tsu na a cigai.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 68:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 68:24" />Ka̱shile uma ene ta̱ nwalu n nu mu ulyaꞋi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:24">nwalu n Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱, mogono ma̱ va̱, a kubana ubuta̱ u ciɗa.<verse eid="PSA 68:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 68:25" />Aza a ishipa e kelime,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:25">aza a tsuwaꞋi tamkpamu ka̱ca̱pa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:25">e mere me le nkere a ku waꞋa nka̱la̱.<verse eid="PSA 68:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 68:26" />&lt;&lt;Cikpai Ka̱shile a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ko koɓolo ka uma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:26">cikpai Vuzavaguɗu a̱ ɗa̱ aza a Isaraila.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 68:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 68:27" />Kumaci ku Bayami, ku na ku laꞋi n kenu ele ɗa kelime,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:27">aza e kelime a Yahuda tankpamu n ka̱tsura̱ ke le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:27">ɗa aza e kelime a Zabalun n aza a Nafutali o kutono le.<verse eid="PSA 68:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 68:28" />Ka̱shile, ɗa̱ngusa̱ utsura u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:28">Ka̱shile yotsongu utsura u nu adama a̱ tsu,<verse eid="PSA 68:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 68:29" />A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin a̱ nu a Urushelima.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:29">Ngono mi ta̱ a̱ kutuka̱ wu n kuneꞋe.<verse eid="PSA 68:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 68:30" />Ɓarangu nnama n na mi a̱ ka̱ga̱Ꞌin ka̱ mini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:30">ɓarangu uduniyan u na u buwai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:30">koɓolo ko obomburon nu ndendem n le.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 68:30">Ali a̱ kuɗa̱ngu ka̱ta̱ e neke wu azurufa e le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:30">vu wacuwa uduniyan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:30">u na u tsu ciga kuvon!<verse eid="PSA 68:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 68:31" />Anan taji uta̱i a Masar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:31">aza a Itopiya i ta̱ a̱ ku ɗa̱ngusa̱ ekiye e le gaɗi u Ka̱shile.<verse eid="PSA 68:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 68:32" />Cananai ishipa u Ka̱shile, a̱ɗa̱ tsugono tsa aduniyan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:32">yaꞋin ishipa i kucikpa Vuzavaguɗu, <char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 68:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 68:33" />a̱yi vu na u kumbai gaɗi vu a̱da̱nga̱shile a ayain a cau,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:33">zuwakai n ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ka utsura ka̱ ni.<verse eid="PSA 68:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 68:34" />Salai utsura u Ka̱shile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:34">vuza na tsugbayin ci ni ci a Isaraila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:34">vuza na utsura u ni wi a gaɗi vu eleshu.<verse eid="PSA 68:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 68:35" />Ka̱shile ili i wovon i ɗa a ubuta̱ u ciɗa u ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:35">Ka̱shile ki Isaraila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:35">ki ta̱ e kuneke utsura a uma a̱ ni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 68:35">Una̱singai u Ka̱shile.<verse eid="PSA 68:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 68" />
  <chapter number="69" style="c" sid="PSA 69" />
  <para style="s1">Wawa mu Ka̱shile</para>
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: Tsu ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ka̱ &lt;&lt;A̱pa̱lu.&gt;&gt;Vishipa vu Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 69:1" />Ka̱shile wawa mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:1">adama a na mini ma yawa mu ta̱ e kuɗeku.<verse eid="PSA 69:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 69:2" />Mi ta̱ a kuliɓa a̱ ubuta̱ o kolyoꞋo ka̱u,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:2">babu ubuta̱ u kudasa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 69:2">n yikpa̱ ta̱ a̱ mini mu uga̱vi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:2">aɓau kpamu i ta̱ a̱ ku kimba̱ mu.<verse eid="PSA 69:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 69:3" />Mo oꞋwo ta̱ m meɗevile, a̱ kula̱nsa̱ uɓa̱nki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:3">ali ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ka̱ va̱ ka paɗai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 69:3">A̱shi a̱ va̱ ra̱ka̱ a̱ ga̱la̱i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:3">adama a na n zuwa ta̱ a̱shi a̱ kula̱nsa̱ Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 69:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 69:4" />Aza a na a iwain mu ko ili,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:4">a laꞋa ta̱ ka̱nji ka kaci ka̱ va̱ a̱bunda̱i.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 69:4">Aza a na a cigai ku una mu ko ili i ta̱ n utsura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:4">a gutsakai mu n tsupa ili i na m bokoi ba.<verse eid="PSA 69:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 69:5" />Ka̱shile, vu yeve ta̱ tsulau tsu va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:5">unushi u va̱ wi usokongi wa̱ a̱ nu ba.<verse eid="PSA 69:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 69:6" />Ka̱ta̱ vu ka̱sukpa̱ mu n neke</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:6">aza a na a zuwai ka̱ɗu wa̱ nu a pana wono ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:6">Vuzaguɗu, Ka̱shile MalaꞋimili,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 69:6">ka̱ta̱ vu ka̱sukpa̱ mu n tuka̱ n ili wono</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:6">wa aza a na i a̱ kula̱nsa̱ Ka̱shile ki Isaraila ba.<verse eid="PSA 69:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 69:7" />Adama a̱ nu a ɗa mo okpoi ili yi ishikushi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:7">ali wono u kimba̱i mu.<verse eid="PSA 69:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 69:8" />Tsu komoci kaꞋa mi wa̱ aza a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:8">ali n aza a kpaꞋa a̱ va̱ dem mo okpoi o limoci we le.<verse eid="PSA 69:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 69:9" />Mali ma A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin a̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:9">ma zuwa mu ta̱ a̱ ku kula̱ tsa akina</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:9">ishikushi i na i a kuyaꞋanka wu yi okpo ta̱ a kaci ka̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 69:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 69:10" />Ana shika̱i n yaꞋin kakuli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:10">ɗa wo okpoi mu ili yi ishikushi.<verse eid="PSA 69:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 69:11" />N ukai akashi a kpalu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:11">ɗa mo okpoi ili ya agivi.<verse eid="PSA 69:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 69:12" />Mo okpoi ili i kadanshi a uye dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:12">osoꞋi kpamu a kuyaꞋanka mu ishipa.<verse eid="PSA 69:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 69:13" />Ama mpa mi ta̱ a kuvasa wa̱ a̱ nu, Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:13">ushuku mu Ka̱shile, a makyan ma na wu untsai nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:13">adama ucigi u gbayin u nu u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:13">adama a na vi ta̱ a kushatangu ukuna u wishi wu usuɓi u nu.<verse eid="PSA 69:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 69:14" />Wawa mu o kolyoꞋo adama a na ka̱ta̱ n liɓa ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:14">wawa mu ekiye aza a na a iwain mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:14">a̱ mini mu uga̱vi ma nampa kpamu.<verse eid="PSA 69:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 69:15" />Ka̱ta̱ vu ka̱sukpa̱ aɓau a̱ kimba̱ mu ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:15">ka̱ta̱ vu ka̱sukpa̱ mini mu uga̱vi ma lyaꞋa mu ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:15">ka̱ta̱ vu ka̱sukpa̱ kpenle ku ukpa̱ ku tsugba mu ba.<verse eid="PSA 69:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 69:16" />Vuzavaguɗu, adama a ucigi u singai u nu u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:16">ushuku mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:16">adama asuvayali a̱bunda̱i a̱ nu, panaka mu.<verse eid="PSA 69:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 69:17" />Ka̱ta̱ vu sokongu ka̱ci ka̱ nu u kagbashi ka̱ nu ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:17">mi ta̱ o kusoꞋo atakaci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:17">yaꞋan gogoꞋo vu ushuku mu.<verse eid="PSA 69:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 69:18" />Ta̱wa̱ ɗevu vu shiba̱ mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:18">adama a irala i va̱.<verse eid="PSA 69:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 69:19" />Vu yeve ta̱ tsu na i a kushika mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:19">n tsu na i a ku lukanasa mu, n tsu na o goyoi mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:19">vu yeve ta̱ aza a na i a kutakaci mu ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 69:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 69:20" />Ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ ka̱ gusa̱ ta̱ adama a ishikushi i na i a kuyaꞋanka mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:20">ali n takpai asuvu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 69:20">N zuwa ta̱ ka̱ɗu i ta̱ a̱ kusa̱Ꞌa̱ mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:20">ama ko vuza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 69:20">N zuwai ka̱ɗu ko mi ta̱ a̱ kuciya̱ vuza na u kuneke mu kadanshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:20">ama n ciya̱ ba.<verse eid="PSA 69:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 69:21" />Makyan ma na m panai kambulu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:21">ɗa e nekei mu yaza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:21">ana kakuli ka̱ ka̱na̱i mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:21">ɗa e nekei mu mini ma kalam.<verse eid="PSA 69:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 69:22" />Ka̱shile, yaꞋan ka̱ɗiva̱ ke le ko okpo le yakuru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:22">yaꞋan ida̱shi i ma̱ta̱na̱ i le yo okpo le maza.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">69:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ubuta̱ wa wi ta̱ a kadanshi ugboku u re, aza a yoku e yevei ta̱, yaꞋan ka̱ɗiva̱ ke le ko okpo maza wa̱ a̱ja̱Ꞌa̱ e le, aza a yoku tankpamu e yevei ta̱, yaꞋan ida̱shi i ma̱ta̱na̱ i le yo okpo le maza.</char></note><verse eid="PSA 69:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 69:23" />Zuwa a̱shi ele a yaꞋan rumbu-rumbu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:23">ali a̱ kukpa̱ɗa̱ ku ene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:23">ka̱ta̱ vu zuwa a̱cina̱ e le o kogo ko wannai.<verse eid="PSA 69:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 69:24" />Tsuwa̱nka̱ le wupa u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:24">yaꞋan asuvu a usuɗukpi a̱ nu a lyaꞋa utsura u le.<verse eid="PSA 69:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 69:25" />Ka̱shile, yaꞋan ka̱tsura̱ ke le ko okpo lekeɗi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:25">ka̱ta̱ vuza u da̱sa̱ngu punu a̱pa̱m e le ba.<verse eid="PSA 69:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 69:26" />Adama a na a takacika ta̱ aza a na vu yaꞋankai usa̱n,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:26">i a kadanshi ka̱ mɓa̱la̱ ma aza a na vu lapai.<verse eid="PSA 69:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 69:27" />Doku le unushi a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka̱ unushi u le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:27">ka̱ta̱ vu ka̱sukpa̱ le a̱ ciya̱ upecu wu ili yi usuɓi i nu ba,<verse eid="PSA 69:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 69:28" />Zuwa a takpa kula ku le a katagarda ka wuma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:28">ka̱ta̱ vu kece le a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka uma a usuɓi ba.<verse eid="PSA 69:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 69:29" />Ama mi ta̱ a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka atakaci nu mɓa̱la̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:29">Ka̱shile, yaꞋan wishi u nu wu ere mu.<verse eid="PSA 69:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 69:30" />Mi ta̱ a kucikpa kula ku Ka̱shile n ishipa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:30">mi ta̱ a kusala tsugbayin ci ni a̱ ubuta̱ u kucikpa yi.<verse eid="PSA 69:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 69:31" />Nannai va wi ta̱ a kuzuwa Vuzavaguɗu u pana uyoꞋo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:31">u laꞋa alyuka e medendem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:31">u laꞋa kuneꞋe ku kobomburon.<verse eid="PSA 69:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 69:32" />Ayin a na baci aza a na o goyoi ka̱ci ke le enei nannai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:32">i ta̱ a kuyaꞋan ma̱za̱nga̱.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 69:32">Aza a na i a̱ kula̱nsa̱ Ka̱shile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:32">i ta̱ a̱ kuciya̱ utsura u ka̱ɗu.<verse eid="PSA 69:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 69:33" />Vuzavaguɗu u panaka ta̱ aza a unambi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:33">u tsu goyo uma a̱ ni a na i a ugbashi ba.<verse eid="PSA 69:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 69:34" />Cikpai Ka̱shile, gaɗi n iɗika, cikpai ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:34">mala n ili i wuma i na yi punu dem.<verse eid="PSA 69:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 69:35" />Adama a na Ka̱shile ki ta̱ a ku wawa Sihiyona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:35">u maꞋasaka likuci ya aza a Yahuda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:35">uma a̱ ni i ta̱ a̱ kuda̱sa̱ngu ɗe a lyaꞋa uka̱ni wi iɗika ya.<verse eid="PSA 69:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 69:36" />Ntsukaya ma agbashi a̱ ni i ta̱ a kulyaꞋa uka̱ni wi i ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:36">aza a na i a kuciga yi i ta̱ a̱ kuyongo ɗe.<verse eid="PSA 69:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 69" />
  <chapter number="70" style="c" sid="PSA 70" />
  <para style="s1">Avasa a̱ kula̱nsa̱ uɓa̱nki</para>
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: Vishipa vu Dawuda. Adama a ku ciɓasa.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="PSA 40:13-17">Ishp 40:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 70:1" />Ka̱shile, yaꞋan moloko vu wawa mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:1">Vuzavaguɗu, yaꞋan moloko vu ɓa̱nka̱ mu.<verse eid="PSA 70:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 70:2" />YaꞋan aza a na i a̱ kula̱nsa̱ wuma u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:2">okpo n wono ali a̱ ripula̱.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 70:2">YaꞋan aza a na a cigai ene mu atakaci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:2">okpo nu nlukana.<verse eid="PSA 70:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 70:3" />YaꞋan aza a na i a kudana, &lt;&lt;U yaꞋan ta̱, u yaꞋan ta̱,&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:3">a kpatala n wono.<verse eid="PSA 70:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 70:4" />Ama yaꞋan aza a na i a̱ kula̱nsa̱ wu ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:4">a pana uyoꞋo a yaꞋan kpamu ma̱za̱nga̱ wu nu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 70:4">YaꞋan aza a na i a kuciga wishi u nu ko wannai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:4">a dana, &lt;&lt;Ka̱shile vuzagbayin ɗa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 70:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 70:5" />Ama mpa vuza vu unambi ɗa, n vuza vu yali,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:5">Ka̱shile, yaꞋan moloko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 70:5">adama a na avu ɗa ka̱ɓa̱nki ka̱ va̱ n kishi ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:5">Vuzavaguɗu ka̱ta̱ vu geshe ba.<verse eid="PSA 70:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 70" />
  <chapter number="71" style="c" sid="PSA 71" />
  <para style="s1">Avasa a vuza vu gba̱ra̱</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 71:1" />Vuzavaguɗu, yaꞋan n sheɗekeu wa̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:1">ka̱ta̱ vu ka̱sukpa̱ mu m pana wono ba.<verse eid="PSA 71:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 71:2" />Uta̱ka̱ mu, vu ɓa̱nka̱ mu n laꞋaka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:2">adama a usuɓi u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:2">zuwaka mu atsuvu, vu wawa mu.<verse eid="PSA 71:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 71:3" />Vu okpo ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:3">ubuta̱ u na n kubansa makyan dem.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 71:3">Neke kadanshi a wawa mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:3">adama a na avu ɗa ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:3">m mashilya me ku ere mu.<verse eid="PSA 71:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 71:4" />Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱, uta̱ka̱ mu e ekiye aza a kawuya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:4">a utsura wa aza asuvawuya n ka gbani-gbani.<verse eid="PSA 71:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 71:5" />Adama a na wa̱ nu ɗa n keɗei a̱pa̱Ꞌa̱, Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:5">Vuzavaguɗu, wa̱ nu ɗa n zuwai ka̱ɗu ali mpa maku me kenu.<verse eid="PSA 71:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 71:6" />N gbasatangu ta̱ wa̱ nu kafu a matsa mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:6">avu ɗa vu utuka̱i mu a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka̱ a̱na̱ku a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:6">mi ta̱ a kucikpa wu makyan dem.<verse eid="PSA 71:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 71:7" />Mo okpoi ili yi urotu a̱ ubuta̱ uma n a̱bunda̱i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:7">adama a na avu ɗa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:7">ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku wu utsura u va̱.<verse eid="PSA 71:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 71:8" />Una̱ u va̱ wi ta̱ a kucikpa wu, kanna ka̱ɓula̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:8">a kusala tsugbayin tsu nu.<verse eid="PSA 71:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 71:9" />Gogo na ana n kutsai na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:9">ka̱ta̱ vu varuku mu ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:9">ana utsura u va̱ u kotsoi na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:9">ka̱ta̱ vu ka̱sukpa̱ mu ba.<verse eid="PSA 71:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 71:10" />Irala i va̱ yi ta̱ a kadanshi ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:10">aza a na cigai ku una mu o ɓolongu ta̱ a nsata adama a̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 71:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 71:11" />A danai, &lt;&lt;Ka̱shile ka̱ ka̱sukpa̱ yi ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:11">yaꞋan tsu guva yi tsu reme yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:11">adama a na vuza u kuɓa̱nka̱ yi u laꞋaka ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 71:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 71:12" />Ka̱shile, ka̱ta̱ vu bana daꞋangi nu mpa ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:12">Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱, ta̱wa̱ gogoꞋo vu ɓa̱nka̱ mu.<verse eid="PSA 71:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 71:13" />YaꞋan aza a na i e ku neꞋeshe mu unushi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:13">okpo n wono ka̱ta̱ a̱ kuwa̱.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 71:13">YaꞋan aza a na a cigai ene mu atakaci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:13">a̱ ciya̱ kugoyi nu nlukana.<verse eid="PSA 71:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 71:14" />Ama mpa mi ta̱ a kuzuwa ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ wa̱ nu makyan dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:14">mi ta̱ a kulyaꞋa kelime n kucikpa wu.<verse eid="PSA 71:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 71:15" />Una̱ u va̱ wi ta̱ a kudansa ukuna wu usuɓi u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:15">kanna ka̱ɓula̱ mpa a kudansa ukuna u wishi u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:15">ko a na wo okpoi mi a kufuɗa kuyeve le dem ba.<verse eid="PSA 71:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 71:16" />Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile, mi ta̱ a̱ kuta̱wa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:16">adama a na n sala ulinga u gbayin u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:16">ka̱ta̱ n ciɓaka uma ukuna wu usuɓi u nu, avu endeꞋin.<verse eid="PSA 71:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 71:17" />Ka̱shile, avu ɗa vu piꞋisakai mu ali mpa maku me kenu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:17">ali n anana mi ta̱ a kudansa ukuna u mereve u nu.<verse eid="PSA 71:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 71:18" />Ko gogoꞋo na ana n kutsai n yaꞋin ka̱nji ka̱ri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:18">Ka̱shile, ka̱ta̱ vu ka̱sukpa̱ mu ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 71:18">ali n dansa ukuna wu utsura u nu n tsugbayin tsu nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:18">a kubana a ntsukaya n na n kuta̱wa̱.<verse eid="PSA 71:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 71:19" />Ka̱shile, usuɓi u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:19">u yawa ta̱ gaɗi vu eleshu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 71:19">Vu yaꞋan ta̱ ili i gbagbaꞋin.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:19">Ka̱shile, vuza wi lo tsu nu ba.<verse eid="PSA 71:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 71:20" />Ko ana wo okpoi vu ka̱sukpa̱ mu ta̱ me enei atakaci m ma̱dukpa̱ ka̱u,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:20">vi ta̱ o kubonoko mu n wuma u va̱ ayin tutu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 71:20">Punu a kasaun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:20">vi ta̱ a̱ kuɗa̱ngusa̱ mu kpamu ayin tutu.<verse eid="PSA 71:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 71:21" />Vi ta̱ o kudoku mu tsugbayin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:21">ka̱ta̱ vu kparasa mu kpamu.<verse eid="PSA 71:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 71:22" />Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱, mi ta̱ kpamu a kucikpa wu n umolu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:22">adama a kamayun ka̱ nu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 71:22">N umolu u va̱ mi ta̱ a kuyaꞋanka wu ishipa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:22">vuza ciɗa vi Isaraila.<verse eid="PSA 71:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 71:23" />Mi ta̱ a̱ ku ɗa̱ngusa̱ ka̱la̱ka̱tsu n isali i ma̱za̱nga̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:23">ayin ana mi a kucikpa wu n ishipa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:23">adama a na vu shiba̱ mu ta̱.<verse eid="PSA 71:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 71:24" />Ka̱ta̱ kelentsu ka̱ va̱ ka dansa ukuna wu usuɓi u nu kanna ka̱ɓula̱.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 71:24">Aza a na a cigai ene mu atakaci</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:24">okpo n wono n kugoyi.<verse eid="PSA 71:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 71" />
  <chapter number="72" style="c" sid="PSA 72" />
  <para style="s1">Mogono ma na Ka̱shile ka zagbai</para>
  <para style="d">Vishipa vu Sulemanu.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 72:1" />Ka̱shile, yotsongu mogono tsu na u kuyaꞋan afada a mayun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:1">vu zuwa maku mo mogono ma yaꞋan ukuna wu usuɓi.<verse eid="PSA 72:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 72:2" />YaꞋan u yaꞋanka uduniyan u nu afada a usuɓi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:2">u yaꞋanka uma u nu aza a unambi ukuna u mayun.<verse eid="PSA 72:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 72:3" />YaꞋan nsasan n tuka̱ n ma̱ta̱na̱ a̱ ubuta̱ u uma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:3">ka̱ta̱ aginda a̱ tuka̱ n ukuna wu usuɓi.<verse eid="PSA 72:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 72:4" />YaꞋan mogono ma yaꞋanka aza a unambi afada a mayun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:4">u ɓa̱nka̱ muku mo ofoloni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:4">ka̱ta̱ u takacika aza o modoruko.<verse eid="PSA 72:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 72:5" />YaꞋan a pana wovon u nu kanna ki baci lo ko wannai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:5">wotoi kpamu wi baci lo tsukaya a kubana a tsukaya.<verse eid="PSA 72:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 72:6" />YaꞋan mogono mo okpo tsu mini ma na o yoꞋi a̱ mita̱ ma na a kiꞋwain,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:6">wo okpo ci ijaꞋashi a iɗika.<verse eid="PSA 72:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 72:7" />YaꞋan aza a usuɓi o gbonguro tsu nɗanga a ayin e le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:7">yaꞋan a̱ ciya̱ ma̱ta̱na̱ ba̱ri ko wannai wotoi wi baci e kuneke kutashi.<verse eid="PSA 72:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 72:8" />YaꞋan tsugono ci ni ci yawa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:8">a mala ma nampa a kubana a ma nanɗe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:8">ili i na i ɗikai e kuyene ku Yufiretu, ali a kubana uteku wa aduniyan.<verse eid="PSA 72:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 72:9" />YaꞋan kumaci ku na ki a kakamba ku kuɗa̱ngu e kelime ka̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:9">yaꞋan irala i ni i ku kuɓa̱ n kubuta̱ ki iɗika.<verse eid="PSA 72:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 72:10" />YaꞋan ngono n Tarishi n na mi o kotogu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:10">a̱ tuka̱ yi n kuneꞋe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 72:10">yaꞋan ngono n Sheba nu n Seba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:10">n neke yi n kuneꞋe.<verse eid="PSA 72:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 72:11" />YaꞋan ngono ra̱ka̱ n ku kuɗa̱nku yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:11">yaꞋan uduniyan ra̱ka̱ a yaꞋanka yi a̱ga̱nda̱.<verse eid="PSA 72:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 72:12" />Adama a na wi ta̱ a ku wawa aza a unambi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:12">ayin a na baci e ɗekei ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:12">aza atakaci, n aza a na i n ka̱ɓa̱nki ba.<verse eid="PSA 72:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 72:13" />Wi ta̱ a̱ kusa̱Ꞌa̱ aza a babu utsura n aza a unambi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:13">ka̱ta̱ u wawa wuma wa aza a na i a kula̱nsa̱ uɓa̱nki.<verse eid="PSA 72:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 72:14" />Wi ta̱ a̱ kushiba̱ le ekiye aza o modoruko n a̱shiliki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:14">wuma u le wi ta̱ n tsuloboi a̱ a̱shi a̱ ni.<verse eid="PSA 72:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 72:15" />YaꞋan wuma u mogono u geshe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:15">yaꞋan e neke yi azanariya a Sheba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 72:15">yaꞋan uma a yaꞋanka yi avasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:15">a zuwaka yi una̱singai makyan dem.<verse eid="PSA 72:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 72:16" />YaꞋan a̱ ciya̱ ishina yi a̱bunda̱i a iɗika ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:16">yaꞋan ishina i gbugba̱ aginda dem.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 72:16">YaꞋan umaci u le u yimkpa tsu nɗanga n Lebano,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 72:16">yaꞋan likuci i shana n uma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:16">tsu mita̱ ma na mi a kakamba.<verse eid="PSA 72:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 72:17" />YaꞋan a ciɓasa n kula ku mogono ko wannai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:17">u lyaꞋa kelime n kuyaꞋan kula, kanna ki baci lo ko wannai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 72:17">yaꞋan uduniyan ra̱ka̱ u ciya̱ una̱singai wa̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:17">ka̱ta̱ e ɗeke yi vuza vu una̱singai.<verse eid="PSA 72:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 72:18" />Una̱singai a kubana u Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile, Ka̱shile ki Isaraila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:18">vuza na a̱yi ɗa koci u ci yaꞋan ili i mereve.<verse eid="PSA 72:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 72:19" />Una̱singai a kubana u kula ku tsugbayin ku ni ko wannai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:19">yaꞋan tsugbayin ci ni ci shana aduniyan ra̱ka̱.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:19">Ta nannai! Ta nannai!<verse eid="PSA 72:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 72:20" />Na ɗa ukocishi wa avasa a Dawuda maku Jesi.<verse eid="PSA 72:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 72" />
  <chapter number="73" style="c" sid="PSA 73" />
  <para style="ms">Katagarda ka tatsu</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="PSA 73-89">Ishp 73--89</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s1">Kasingai ka̱ Ka̱shile</para>
  <para style="d">Vishipa vu Asafa.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 73:1" />Mayun Ka̱shile ki ta̱ a kuyaꞋanka Isaraila kasingai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:1">wa aza a na a̱ɗu e le i ciɗa.<verse eid="PSA 73:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 73:2" />Ama mpa n yaꞋan ta̱ ɗevu n kutakpa asuvu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:2">ali ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ ka yaꞋin ɗevu n ku uta̱.<verse eid="PSA 73:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 73:3" />Adama a na mi ta̱ e cisheꞋe n aza a ugbamukaci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:3">ɗa baci me enei uma a gbani-gbani a lyaꞋi kelime n kuciya̱ ma̱ta̱na̱.<verse eid="PSA 73:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 73:4" />A tsu takacika ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:4">ikyamba i le yi ta̱ gbaga n utsura.<verse eid="PSA 73:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 73:5" />A tsu takacika tsu uma a na a buwai ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:5">kawuya ka̱ tsu ciya̱ le tsu aza a na buwai ba.<verse eid="PSA 73:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 73:6" />Adama a nannai ɗa a ɗikai a̱ra̱ɗi okpoi le itali i kuɗeku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:6">ɗa a zuwai vishili vu okpoi le tsu motogu.<verse eid="PSA 73:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 73:7" />Ka gbani-gbani ka tsu ta̱ a̱ɗu e le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:7">kusheshe ku le dem nsata n ɗa.<verse eid="PSA 73:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 73:8" />O tsu zoꞋoso ta̱ aza o yoku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:8">ka̱ ta̱ a dansa ka gbani-gbani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:8">e kusheshe n a̱ra̱ɗi tsu na o kudoro aza o yoku.<verse eid="PSA 73:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 73:9" />A tsu dansa ta̱ kadanshi ka ishikushi u Ka̱shile ka gaɗi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:9">Elentsu e le i ta̱ a kadanshi ka̱ a̱ra̱ɗi a ili i na a yaꞋin aduniyan.<verse eid="PSA 73:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 73:10" />Adama a na uma a̱ Ka̱shile o bono we le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:10">ushuku n ili i na a dansai.<verse eid="PSA 73:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 73:11" />A tsu dana ta̱, &lt;&lt;Nini ɗai Ka̱shile ke kuyeve?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:11">MalaꞋimili mi ta̱ e kuyeve?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 73:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 73:12" />Ta uma a gbani-gbani i nannai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:12">makyan dem i n kadama ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:12">uciyi u le o kudoku.<verse eid="PSA 73:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 73:13" />Mayun, gbani ɗa m bonokoi ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ ciɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:13">gbani ɗa mu uta̱ka̱i ekiye a̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 73:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 73:14" />Kanna dem mpa e kene kadama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:14">usana lakam mpa atakaci.<verse eid="PSA 73:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 73:15" />Ishi baci n dana ta̱, &lt;&lt;Mi ta̱ a kudansa nannai.&gt;&gt; Mi ishi ta̱ a̱ ku vakangu muku n nu.<verse eid="PSA 73:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 73:16" />Ana n yaꞋin tsu na n kuyaꞋan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:16">adama a na n yeve,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:16">yiɗa̱i i zuwai ɗa uma a gbani-gbani i a kulyaꞋa kelime,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 73:16">ɗa wo okpoi mu n atakaci ka̱u.<verse eid="PSA 73:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 73:17" />Ama ana n uwai ubuta̱ u ciɗa u Ka̱shile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:17">ɗa n yevei ili i na i kuciya̱ uma gbani-gbani.<verse eid="PSA 73:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 73:18" />Mayun ɗa vi ta̱ a kuzuwa le a̱ ubuta̱ u kederi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:18">vu zuwai le a̱ yikpa̱i ɗa a̱ kuwa̱i ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 73:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 73:19" />GogoꞋo lo ɗa unai le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:19">wovon u pura̱ngi le n ku te.<verse eid="PSA 73:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 73:20" />Vuzavaguɗu, i ta̱ o ko okpo tsa alatani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:20">a na a tsu cinukpa n usana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:20">tsu na vuza u tsu cinukpa a ɗa u jimgba baci.<verse eid="PSA 73:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 73:21" />Makyan ma na baci ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ ka̱ na̱mgba̱i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:21">ɗa ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ ka̱ ɗa̱nga̱i,<verse eid="PSA 73:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 73:22" />Ka̱ta̱ yeve a na mpa kalau kaꞋa ko ugboji,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:22">ɗa mo okpoi tsu manama e kelime ka̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 73:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 73:23" />N nannai dem mi ta̱ koɓolo n avu makyan dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:23">vi ta̱ uɓa̱ni n kukiye ku u singai ku va̱.<verse eid="PSA 73:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 73:24" />Vi o kutono nu mpa n odoki a̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:24">a ukocishi kpamu vi ta̱ a ku isa mu n tsugbayin.<verse eid="PSA 73:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 73:25" />Avu ɗa mi n a̱yi koci gaɗi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:25">a na mi n avu, yiɗa̱i kpamu mi a̱ kula̱nsa̱ aduniyan?<verse eid="PSA 73:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 73:26" />Ikyamba n ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:26">i ta̱ a kufuɗa ku kuwa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:26">ama Ka̱shile avu ɗa utsura u ka̱ɗu u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:26">n ili i na mi n i ɗa ko wannai.<verse eid="PSA 73:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 73:27" />Mayun aza a na i daꞋangi n avu i ta̱ a̱ ku kuwa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:27">vi ta̱ a ku una aza a cishakanlai o kutono a̱ma̱li.<verse eid="PSA 73:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 73:28" />Ama n tsu va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:28">u laꞋaka mu ta̱ n kugaꞋan n yongo ɗevu n Ka̱shile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:28">m bonoko ta̱ Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku u vu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:28">adama a na n sala ili i na u yaꞋin ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 73:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 73" />
  <chapter number="74" style="c" sid="PSA 74" />
  <para style="s1">Avasa a̱ kula̱nsa̱ wishi</para>
  <para style="d">VicuꞋu vu tsuwaꞋi tsu Asafa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 74:1" />Ka̱shile, yiɗa̱i i zuwai ɗa vu variki tsu ko wannai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:1">A̱tsu ushiga wu nkyon wu ubuta̱ u kalina u nu u ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:1">yiɗa̱i i zuwai ɗa vi asuvu a usuɗukpi n a̱tsu?<verse eid="PSA 74:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 74:2" />Ciɓa n koɓolo ka uma a̱ nu a na vu tsulai ali n ayin a cau ɗe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:2">a na vu shiba̱i okpo kumaci ku uka̱ni ku nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:2">ciɓa n Kusan ku Sihiyona ubuta̱ u na vu da̱sa̱ngi.<verse eid="PSA 74:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 74:3" />Ta̱wa̱ vu ka̱ra̱Ꞌa̱ ubuta̱ u na a̱ la̱nga̱sa̱i na ra̱ka̱ ra̱ka̱.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:3">Irala i la̱nga̱sa̱ ta̱ ili i na yi punu ra̱ka̱ a̱ ubuta̱ u ciɗa.<verse eid="PSA 74:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 74:4" />Aza a na a iwain nu i ta̱ o yoroli yi ulyaꞋi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:4">a̱ ubuta̱ u na vu tsu gasa n a̱tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:4">a zuwai urotu u le ɗe.<verse eid="PSA 74:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 74:5" />I ta̱ tsu aza a na i a kukapa nɗanga a̱ kutsun</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:5">n ogovu e le.<verse eid="PSA 74:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 74:6" />N ogovu e le nu ntalaka n le</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:6">a̱ la̱nga̱sa̱i ili i na e sheꞋwei.<verse eid="PSA 74:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 74:7" />Ɗa o songi A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin a̱ nu ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:7">a natukpai ubuta̱ wu ida̱shi i kula ku nu.<verse eid="PSA 74:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 74:8" />A danai ka̱ci ke le &lt;&lt;Ci ta̱ a̱ kuka̱na̱ i ɗa gbende,&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:8">ɗa o songi ubuta̱ u na a tsu gasa n Ka̱shile dem, a iɗika ya.<verse eid="PSA 74:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 74:9" />Tsu doku tsu ene urotu ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:9">eneki kpamu a buwa ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:9">kpamu ko vuza a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka̱ tsu u yeve,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:9">ko wannai ɗai ili i nampa i kukotso.<verse eid="PSA 74:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 74:10" />Ka̱shile, ali n wannai ɗai irala i ku ka̱na̱ ku zoꞋoso tsu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:10">I ta̱ a̱ kuka̱na̱ kugoyo kula ku nu ko wannai ɗa?<verse eid="PSA 74:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 74:11" />Yiɗa̱i i zuwai ɗa vu oɓongi ekiye a̱ nu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:11">Ɗa̱ngusa̱ kukiye ku usingai ku nu vu una le.<verse eid="PSA 74:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 74:12" />Ama Ka̱shile, avu ɗa mogono ma̱ va̱ ali n cau ɗe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:12">vu tsu tuka̱ ta̱ n wishi aduniyan.<verse eid="PSA 74:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 74:13" />Avu ɗa vu pecei mala n utsura u tsugbayin u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:13">vu ɓosoi aci oroꞋo a̱ mini.<verse eid="PSA 74:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 74:14" />Avu ɗa vu minjarai kaci ka̱ ka̱di ka mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:14">ɗa vu nekei ni wo okpoi ilikulyaꞋa yi nnama n kakamba.<verse eid="PSA 74:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 74:15" />Avu ɗa vu ta̱sa̱i a̱shi a̱ mini n ayinva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:15">vu zuwai kuyene ku ɗekpei.<verse eid="PSA 74:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 74:16" />Kanna n kayin ka̱nu kaꞋa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:16">avu ɗa vu zuwai wotoi n kanna a̱ ubuta̱ u le.<verse eid="PSA 74:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 74:17" />Avu ɗa vu zuwakai aduniyan kureꞋe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:17">avu ɗa vu yaꞋin lyushi n irana.<verse eid="PSA 74:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 74:18" />Vuzavaguɗu, ciɓa n tsu na irala i nu yi o ku zoꞋoso wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:18">n tsu na kpamu alau i o kugoyo kula ku nu.<verse eid="PSA 74:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 74:19" />Ka̱ta̱ vu neke wuma wu nkyon n nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:19">wa̱ a̱kunzu ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:19">ka̱ta̱ vu cinukpa n uma a̱ nu a na a takacikai ba, ko wannai.<verse eid="PSA 74:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 74:20" />Ciɓa n uzuwakpani u na vu yaꞋankai tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:20">obogozu a na i n ka̱yimbi a iɗika dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:20">i ta̱ tukpa n aza a ujari.<verse eid="PSA 74:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 74:21" />Ka̱ta̱ vu ka̱sukpa̱ aza a na a takacikai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:21">okpo n wono ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 74:21">yaꞋan aza a unambi n aza a̱ kula̱nsa̱ uɓa̱nki</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:21">a cikpa kula ku nu.<verse eid="PSA 74:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 74:22" />Ka̱shile, ɗa̱nga̱ vu utuka̱ ka̱ci ka̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:22">ciɓa tsu na alau i o ku zoꞋoso wu kanna dem.<verse eid="PSA 74:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 74:23" />Ka̱ta̱ vu cinukpa n kadanshi ka kacaꞋa ka aza a na a iwai nu ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:23">ka̱ta̱ vu cinukpa m mololo ma aza a na i a kuyaꞋanka wu ugbamiwasuvu ba.<verse eid="PSA 74:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 74" />
  <chapter number="75" style="c" sid="PSA 75" />
  <para style="s1">Ka̱shile ki ta̱ a kuyaꞋan afada derere</para>
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: Vishipa vu Asafa, a yaꞋan vu ɗa n Ka̱la̱ka̱tsu, &lt;&lt;Ka̱ta̱ a yaꞋan munuka ba.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 75:1" />Ka̱shile, tsu cikpa wu ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:1">tsu cikpa ta̱ kula ku nu adama a na vi ta̱ lo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:1">tsu dansai ili i mereve i na vu yaꞋin.<verse eid="PSA 75:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 75:2" />Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile u danai, &lt;&lt;N zuwa ta̱ makyan ma afada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:2">mi ta̱ tana a kuyaꞋan afada a na i derere.<verse eid="PSA 75:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 75:3" />Ko ɗa baci aduniyan e jengeɗei, ali uma a̱ ni e jeꞋekei ikyamba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:3">mpa ɗa n zuwai kumiꞋi u ni u shamgbai n utsura. <char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 75:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 75:4" />N dana ta̱ aza a̱ra̱ɗi,&lt;Ka̱ta̱ i yaꞋan a̱ra̱ɗi ba.&gt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:4">uma a gbani-gbani kpamu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:4">n danai, &lt;Ka̱ta̱ i yaꞋan ugbamiwasuvu ba.<verse eid="PSA 75:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 75:5" />Ka̱ta̱ i yaꞋanka Ka̱shile ugbamiwasuvu ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:5">ka̱ta̱ i lapa nka̱nga̱ n ɗa̱ ba.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 75:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 75:6" />Ko vuza wi a̱ ku uta̱ a kasana ko a̱ ka̱livi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:6">ko a kakamba u ta̱wa̱ u neke aza o yoku tsugbayin ba.<verse eid="PSA 75:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 75:7" />Ama Ka̱shile kaꞋa kayaꞋinkafada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:7">u tsu goyo ta̱ aza o yoku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:7">ka̱ta̱ u neke aza o yoku tsugbayin.<verse eid="PSA 75:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 75:8" />Vuzavaguɗu wi ta̱ uɓa̱ni n mokoꞋo e kukiye ku ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:8">tukpa n ma̱kya̱n ma kalam ma na mi n kusasu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 75:8">u ɓelei maꞋa, ɗa uma a gbani-gbani aduniyan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:8">o soꞋi maꞋa gbende.<verse eid="PSA 75:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 75:9" />Ama mpa mi ta̱ a kusala ukuna u nampa ko wannai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:9">mi ta̱ a kucanana ishipa n cikpa Ka̱shile ka Yakubu.<verse eid="PSA 75:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 75:10" />A̱yi ɗa u ku goyo aza a ugbamiwasuvu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:10">ama wi ta̱ e kuneke aza a usuɓi tsugbayin.<verse eid="PSA 75:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 75" />
  <chapter number="76" style="c" sid="PSA 76" />
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: N tsuwaꞋi tsu anꞋin a umolu. Vishipa vu Asafa.</para>
  <para style="s1">Yayi u kushamgba e kelime ka̱ nu?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 76:1" />Ka̱shile vuza vu uyevi ɗa a yahuda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:1">kula ku ni ku gbayin ku ɗa a Isaraila.<verse eid="PSA 76:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 76:2" />Ubuta̱ wu ida̱shi i ni yi ta̱ a Urushelima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:2">Sihiyona ɗa ubuta̱ wu ida̱shi i ni.<verse eid="PSA 76:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 76:3" />Taɗe u koɗosoi ayaꞋa a irala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:3">nu nra̱ga̱ n le, n otokobi e le, ali n ucanuku u kuvon u le.<char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 76:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 76:4" />Ka̱shile, avu vuzagbayin ɗa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:4">vi ta̱ tsu mogono ɗa baci vu bonoi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:4">a nsansa a̱ ubuta̱ u na vu lyaꞋi irala i nu.<verse eid="PSA 76:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 76:5" />Una ta̱ osoji a utsura</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:5">ɗa a̱ pura̱i ucanuku u na i n uɗa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 76:5">ko kovonshi ka buwa ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:5">ka na ka kufuɗa ku ɗa̱ngusa̱ kukiye ku ni.<verse eid="PSA 76:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 76:6" />Ka̱shile ka Yakubu, tsu na vu ɓarangi le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:6">ekeke odoku n akumbi e le ra̱ka̱ a̱ yikpa̱i a̱ kuwa̱i.<verse eid="PSA 76:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 76:7" />Avu ɗa koci a kupana wovon u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:7">yayi u kushamgba e kelime ka̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:7">a makyan ma na baci vu yaꞋin wupa?<verse eid="PSA 76:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 76:8" />Ɗe gaɗi ɗa vu kiɗai afada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:8">aduniyan a panai wovon ɗa a paɗai bini,<verse eid="PSA 76:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 76:9" />Ka̱shile, vu ɗa̱nga̱ baci kuyaꞋan afada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:9">adama a na vu wawa aza a na i atakaci aduniyan.<char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 76:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 76:10" />Mayun wupa u nu u vuma wi ta̱ a̱ ku tuka̱ wu n ucikpi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:10">aza a na a lakai a wupa u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:10">i ta̱ a kuyaꞋanka wu a̱ga̱nda̱.<verse eid="PSA 76:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 76:11" />YaꞋin akucina u Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka̱ ɗa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:11">ka̱ta̱ i neke i na i kucinai kuneke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:11">yaꞋan iɗika i na yi ɗeɗevu, a̱ tuka̱ n kuneꞋe ku le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:11">u Vuza na a kupana wovon.<verse eid="PSA 76:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 76:12" />U zuwa ta̱ aza o tsugono tsa̱ a̱ra̱ɗi okpo n wono,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:12">ka̱ta̱ u zuwa ngono ma aduniyan a pana wovon.<verse eid="PSA 76:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 76" />
  <chapter number="77" style="c" sid="PSA 77" />
  <para style="s1">N la̱nsa̱ ta̱ Vuzavaguɗu a ayin atakaci</para>
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: A yaꞋan vu ɗa n ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ka Jedutun. Vishipa vu Asafa.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 77:1" />N shika̱i n ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ka̱u u Ka̱shile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:1">n ɗengusa̱i ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ka̱u n shika̱i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:1">adama a na u panaka mu.<verse eid="PSA 77:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 77:2" />A makyan ma atakaci n tsu vasa ta̱ u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:2">kayin dem n tsu ɗengusa̱ ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:2">ekiye a̱ va̱ gaɗi n yaꞋan a avasa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 77:2">ama ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ ka̱ ciya̱ ma̱ta̱na̱ ba.<verse eid="PSA 77:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 77:3" />Makyan ma na n ciɓai n Ka̱shile ɗa n yaꞋin yura̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:3">a makyan ma na baci mi aciɓa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:3">n ci yaꞋan ta̱ adanshi n takpa asuvu.<char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 77:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 77:4" />U tsu ka̱sukpa̱ mu n lata ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:4">n na̱mgba̱i ka̱tsuma̱ ali n kpa̱ɗa̱i kufuɗa kudansa.<verse eid="PSA 77:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 77:5" />N ciɓasai n ayin a na a lazai ɗe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:5">n tsu ciɓa ta̱ kpamu n a̱ya̱ a na a lazai ɗe m makyan.<verse eid="PSA 77:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 77:6" />N ciɓai n vishipa vu va̱ kayin ka̱ɓula̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:6">n sheshei a̱ ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 77:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 77:7" />Ɗa n danai,&lt;&lt;Ayin tutu ɗa Vuzavaguɗu u ku iwan mu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:7">Wi kpamu o kudoku kupana asuvayali a̱ va̱ ba?<verse eid="PSA 77:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 77:8" />Ucigi u nu u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:8">u kotso ta̱ ko wannai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:8">Wi ta̱ a̱ kukpa̱ɗa̱ kushatangu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:8">uzuwakpani u ni makyan dem?<verse eid="PSA 77:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 77:9" />Ka̱shile ka cinukpa ta̱ kupana asuvayali ɗa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:9">Ko wupa u ni u zuwa yi ta̱ u kpa̱ɗa̱i kusa̱Ꞌa̱ tsu?&gt;&gt;<char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 77:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 77:10" />&lt;&lt;Ili i na i laꞋi n kuɓa̱la̱ mu a̱ ka̱ɗu i ɗaɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:10">kukiye ku MalaꞋimili ku ka̱sukpa̱ ta̱ kuɓa̱nka̱ tsu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 77:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 77:11" />Mi ta̱ a kuciɓa n ulinga u na vu yaꞋansai Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:11">mi ta̱ a kuciɓa n ili mereve i na vu yaꞋin cau ɗe.<verse eid="PSA 77:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 77:12" />Mi ta̱ a̱ kuka̱na̱ kusheshe ili i na vu yaꞋin ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:12">mi ta̱ a̱ ka̱na̱ kusheshe a ukuna wu ulinga u nu.<verse eid="PSA 77:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 77:13" />Ka̱shile, uye u nu u ciɗa u ɗa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:13">Ka̱ma̱li ki lo n tsugbayin tsu Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu ba.<verse eid="PSA 77:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 77:14" />Avu ɗa Ka̱shile ka na ka ci yaꞋan ili mereve,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:14">vu yotsongu ta̱ utsura u nu a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka uma.<verse eid="PSA 77:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 77:15" />N utsura u nu ɗa vu shiba̱i uma a̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:15">ntsukaya n Yakubu nu n Isufu. <char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 77:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 77:16" />Ka̱shile, ana mini me enei nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:16">ana mini me enei nu ɗa ma panai wovon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:16">mala mu uga̱vi ma vuzakpai adama o wovon.<verse eid="PSA 77:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 77:17" />Eleshu o yoꞋi mini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:17">ɗa a lapai kakpanga ɗe gaɗi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:17">ɗa ulaɗi wu akanai ubuta̱ dem.<verse eid="PSA 77:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 77:18" />Izumgbi i kakpanga i nu i ka̱ra̱Ꞌi a̱ ubuta̱ dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:18">kutashi ku ulaɗi ku akanai aduniyan ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:18">aduniyan a panai wovon ɗa a̱ gba̱ɗa̱i.<verse eid="PSA 77:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 77:19" />Vu walai a mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:19">vu pasamgbanai mala mu uga̱vi ka̱u,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:19">ama e ne ura̱Ꞌa̱ u ene a̱ nu ba.<verse eid="PSA 77:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 77:20" />Vu tonoi n uma a̱ nu tsu maguɓi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:20">e kiye a Musa n Haruna.<verse eid="PSA 77:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 77" />
  <chapter number="78" style="c" sid="PSA 78" />
  <para style="s1">Usuɓi u Ka̱shile a uma a̱ ni</para>
  <para style="d">VicuꞋu vu tsuwaꞋi tsu Asafa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 78:1" />Uma a̱ va̱, zuwai atsuvu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:1">i pana kuyotsongusu ku va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:1">zuwakai n ili i na mi a kudansa.<verse eid="PSA 78:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 78:2" />Mi ta̱ a kuyaꞋan kadanshi n asan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:2">n tonuko ɗa̱ ili i na yi usokongi ayin a cau,<verse eid="PSA 78:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 78:3" />Ili i na tsu panai ɗa kpamu tsu yevei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:3">ili i na ikaya i tsu i danai tsu.<verse eid="PSA 78:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 78:4" />Ci o kusokongu ku muku n le i ɗa ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:4">ama ci ta̱ a kudana tsukaya tsu na tsa̱ kuta̱wa̱,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 78:4">Tsugbayin tsu Vuzavaguɗu n ulinga u gbagbaꞋin u ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:4">n ili i mereve i na u yaꞋansai.<verse eid="PSA 78:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 78:5" />U nekei Yakubu ili i kutono</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:5">ɗa u zuwai wila̱ a Isaraila,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 78:5">u na u danai ikaya i tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:5">a piꞋisaka muku n le u ɗa.<verse eid="PSA 78:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 78:6" />Adama a na ntsukaya n na n kuta̱wa̱ e yeve u ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:6">ali n muku n na a kumatsa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:6">e le tamkpamu feu a dana muku n le.<verse eid="PSA 78:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 78:7" />Adama a na a zuwa a̱ɗu e le u Ka̱shile,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 78:7">ka̱ta̱ a cinukpa n ulinga u na u yaꞋin ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:7">ama a̱ ka̱na̱ kutono kadanshi ka̱ ni,<verse eid="PSA 78:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 78:8" />Ka̱ta̱ okpo ci ikaya i le ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:8">ntsukaya mu ugbamukaci n aza a ugbamiwasuvu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 78:8">aza a na e neke Vuzavaguɗu a̱ɗu e le ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:8">aza a na a a̱ɗu e le i m ma̱riki u Ka̱shile ba.<verse eid="PSA 78:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 78:9" />Aza a Ifirayimu, aza a na a uta̱i vishili n ayaꞋa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:9">a kpatalai a sumai a kanna ko kuvon.<verse eid="PSA 78:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 78:10" />A shatangu uzuwakpani u le n Ka̱shile ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:10">a̱ kpa̱ɗa̱i kutono wila̱ u ni.<verse eid="PSA 78:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 78:11" />A cinukpai n ulinga u na u yaꞋin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:11">n ili i mereve i na u yotsongi le dem.<verse eid="PSA 78:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 78:12" />U yaꞋin ili i mereve a̱ a̱shi a ikaya i le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:12">a uɓon u Zowan a iɗika i Masar.<verse eid="PSA 78:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 78:13" />U pecei mala ɗa u tonoi n ele punu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:13">u zuwai mini ma shamgbai tsu mashilya.<verse eid="PSA 78:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 78:14" />N kanna ɗa u tonoi n ele n keleshu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:14">n kayin ka̱ɓula̱ u tonoi n ele n kutashi ka akina.<verse eid="PSA 78:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 78:15" />U ɓatsai atali e meremune,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:15">ɗa̱ u nekei le mini n a̱bunda̱i tsu mala mu uga̱vi.<verse eid="PSA 78:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 78:16" />U zuwai nyeneke mu uta̱i a katali,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:16">u zuwai mini ma̱ ka̱na̱i kuyene tsu kuyene.<verse eid="PSA 78:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 78:17" />Ama ɗa a lyaꞋi kelime</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:17">n kuyaꞋanka yi unushi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:17">a yaꞋankai MalaꞋimili</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:17">ugbamiwasuvu ɗe e kakamba.<verse eid="PSA 78:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 78:18" />N ucigi u ka̱ɗu u le u ɗa o kondoi Ka̱shile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:18">a na a danai u neke le ilikulyaꞋa i na a cigai.<verse eid="PSA 78:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 78:19" />A yaꞋankai Ka̱shile kadanshi ka gbani-gbani, a danai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:19">&lt;&lt;Ko Ka̱shile ki ta̱ o kufoɓuso ka̱ɗiva̱ e meremune?<verse eid="PSA 78:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 78:20" />Ko ana u lapai katali ɗa mini ma̱ uta̱i gbani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:20">ɗa mini ma̱ uta̱i n a̱bunda̱i,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 78:20">ama wi ta̱ kpamu e kuneke tsu ilikulyaꞋa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:20">Wi ta̱ kpamu a̱ kuciya̱ka̱ uma a̱ ni inyama?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 78:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 78:21" />Adama a nannai ana Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:21">u panakai le ɗa u yaꞋin wupa ka̱u,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:21">u suꞋuki uma a Yakubu n akina a usuɗukpi ka̱u,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:21">u va̱sa̱i n wupa wa aza a Isaraila,<verse eid="PSA 78:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 78:22" />Adama a na ushuku n Ka̱shile ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:22">kpamu e neke ka̱ɗu n wishi u ni ba.<verse eid="PSA 78:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 78:23" />N nannai dem u nekei eleshu kadanshi gaɗi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:23">ɗa u zuwai le a̱ ɓa̱yuwa̱i utsutsu u gaɗi.<verse eid="PSA 78:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 78:24" />U tsuwa̱nka̱i le Mana tsu mini a lyaꞋa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:24">ɗa u nekei le ili i kashina i gaɗi.<verse eid="PSA 78:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 78:25" />Ɗa a lyaꞋi ilikulyaꞋa ya alingata a̱ Ka̱shile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:25">Ka̱shile ke nekei le ilikulyaꞋa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:25">n a̱bunda̱i a lyaꞋi ali a̱ cuwa̱i.<verse eid="PSA 78:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 78:26" />U zuwai wunla̱i u vugula̱i ɗe a kasana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:26">n utsura u ni ɗa u zuwai wunla̱i</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:26">wu uɓonɗakai u ɗa̱nga̱i,<verse eid="PSA 78:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 78:27" />u tsuwa̱nka̱i le inyama tsu kubuta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:27">nnunu n ciꞋimkpi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:27">tsu kayala ka̱ iga̱Ꞌin i mala,<verse eid="PSA 78:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 78:28" />U zuwai le a̱ yikpa̱sa̱i e mere ma̱ ka̱tsura̱ ke le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:28">uka̱ra̱Ꞌi n a̱pa̱m e le.<verse eid="PSA 78:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 78:29" />Ɗa uma a takumai ali a̱ cuwa̱i ka̱u,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:29">adama a na u neke le ta̱ ili i na i mali.<verse eid="PSA 78:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 78:30" />Ama babu a̱ cuwa̱ n ili i na i a mali</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:30">i ɗa biꞋi punu a una̱ u le,<verse eid="PSA 78:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 78:31" />ana Ka̱shile ka panai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:31">ɗa wupa u ni u va̱sa̱i wa aza a Isaraila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:31">wu unai uma a utsura a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ke le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:31">ɗa u lapai a̱ɗa̱nga̱ni aza a Israila.<verse eid="PSA 78:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 78:32" />N ili i nampa ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:32">a lyaꞋi kelime n kuyaꞋan unushi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 78:32">n li i mereve i na u yaꞋin dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:32">ushuku n a̱yi ba.<verse eid="PSA 78:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 78:33" />Ta u zuwai ayin e le o kotsoi nannai gbani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:33">a̱ya̱ e le okpoi tukpa n atakaci.<verse eid="PSA 78:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 78:34" />Ana Ka̱shile ka unai aza o yoku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:34">a̱ shika̱i unushi u le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:34">a̱ la̱nsa̱i Ka̱shile o bonoi wa̱ ni kpamu.<verse eid="PSA 78:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 78:35" />A ciɓai a na Ka̱shile kaꞋa ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku u le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:35">a ciɓai a na Ka̱shile MalaꞋimili maꞋa ka̱shibi ke le.<verse eid="PSA 78:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 78:36" />Ama ɗa a̱ ya̱nsa̱i ni kadanshi ka̱ una̱ u le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:36">a kuyaꞋanka yi aꞋuwa n elentsu e le.<verse eid="PSA 78:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 78:37" />A̱ɗu ele o tono kadanshi ka̱ ni ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:37">o tono uzuwakpani u ni ba.<verse eid="PSA 78:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 78:38" />N nannai dem Ka̱shile ka panai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:38">asuvayali a uma a̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:38">u cinukpakai le unushi u le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:38">ɗa u kpa̱ɗa̱i ku una le,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 78:38">makyan dem u tsu reme ta̱ ka̱ɗu ka̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:38">ka̱ta̱ u vaꞋanka wupa u ni.<verse eid="PSA 78:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 78:39" />U tsu ciɓa ta̱ ele uma a gbani ɗa i koci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:39">tsu wunla̱i u na u tsu laza kpamu u tsu bono ba.<verse eid="PSA 78:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 78:40" />A yaꞋansaka yi ta̱ ugbamiwasuvu e meremune,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:40">a zuwai ni una̱mgbuka̱tsuma̱ a kakamba!<verse eid="PSA 78:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 78:41" />Makyan dem a̱ ka̱na̱i kukondo Ka̱shile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:41">ɗa a zuwai vuza ciɗa vi Israila kuyaꞋan wupa.<verse eid="PSA 78:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 78:42" />A ciɓa n utsura u ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:42">a ayin a na u shiba̱i le</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:42">ekiye a irala i le ba,<verse eid="PSA 78:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 78:43" />ana u yaꞋin urotu wi ili i mereve a iɗika i Masar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:43">ili i mereve i na vi yaꞋin a uɓon u Zowan.<verse eid="PSA 78:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 78:44" />U bonokoi nɗolu n le mo okpoi mpasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:44">a fuɗa o soꞋo mini ma nyeneke n le ba.<verse eid="PSA 78:44" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 78:45" />U suꞋuki le n ka̱kuma̱ ka ayun ka takacikai le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:45">opoɗo tamkpamu a̱ la̱nga̱sa̱i iɗika i le.<verse eid="PSA 78:45" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 78:46" />U zuwai akyun takumai ucanuku wa ashina e le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:46">nta̱ɗa̱ma̱ci tamkpamu n la̱nga̱sa̱i ashina e le.<verse eid="PSA 78:46" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 78:47" />U la̱nga̱sa̱i ashina a itacishi e le m mini ma atali,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:47">nɗanga mu mbiri n egele.<verse eid="PSA 78:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 78:48" />Wu unai anaka e le n mini ma atali,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:48">ɗa kpamu wu unai ushiga wu nkyon le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:48">nu nraɗika n le n akpanga.<verse eid="PSA 78:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 78:49" />U tsuwa̱nka̱i le n wupa u ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:49">asuvu a usuɗukpi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:49">n una̱mgbuka̱tsuma̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:49">u zuwai le atakaci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:49">u suꞋuki le n alingata a munuka.<verse eid="PSA 78:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 78:50" />U tsuwa̱nka̱i le n wupa u gbani-gbani u ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:50">wu ere le a̱ ubuta̱ wu ukpa̱ ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:50">ama ɗa wu unai le m ma̱dukpa̱.<verse eid="PSA 78:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 78:51" />Wu unai muku mu ugiti n ali a masar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:51">muku mu ugiti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:51">mu utsura u le a Ham.<verse eid="PSA 78:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 78:52" />Ɗa wu uta̱i n uma a̱ ni tsu ushiga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:52">u tonoi n ele tsu nkyon e meremune.<verse eid="PSA 78:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="PSA 78:53" />U tonoi n ele m ma̱ta̱na̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:53">adama a na ka̱ta̱ a pana wovon ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:53">ama mala ma lyaꞋa ta̱ irala i le.<verse eid="PSA 78:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="PSA 78:54" />U tuka̱i le e kureꞋe ki iɗika i ciɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:54">u tuka̱i le a kusan ku na kukiye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:54">ku utsura ku ni ku lyaꞋi n kuvon.<verse eid="PSA 78:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="PSA 78:55" />U lokoi uduniyan u na wi e kelime ke le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:55">ɗa u pecekei aza a Isaraila iɗika ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:55">yo okpoi ili yi uka̱ni i le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:55">u zuwai uma a Isaraila</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:55">a̱ da̱sa̱ngi punu a iꞋuwa i uma ya.<verse eid="PSA 78:55" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="PSA 78:56" />Ama ɗa o kondoi Ka̱shile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:56">a yaꞋankai MalaꞋimili ugbamiwasuvu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:56">a zuwaka n kadanshi ka̱ ni ba,<verse eid="PSA 78:56" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="PSA 78:57" />a yaꞋan ili i na i gaꞋin ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:57">ci ikaya i le,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 78:57">i n kamayun ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:57">tsu kokondori ka kayaꞋa ka na a taɗuki,<verse eid="PSA 78:57" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="PSA 78:58" />A zuwai ni u yaꞋin wupa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:58">adama a nva̱li ma̱ a̱ma̱li e le,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 78:58">ɗa a zuwai ni cisheꞋe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:58">adama a̱ma̱li e le.<verse eid="PSA 78:58" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="PSA 78:59" />Ana Ka̱shile ka panakai le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:59">ɗa u yaꞋin wupa n ele ka̱u,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:59">u iwain aza a Isaraila ra̱ka̱-ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 78:59" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="PSA 78:60" />U ka̱sukpa̱i Ma̱va̱li mo oɓolo a Shilo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:60">a̱ ubuta̱ u na wi a̱ ida̱shi e mere ma uma.<verse eid="PSA 78:60" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="PSA 78:61" />U ka̱sukpa̱i akpati vu uzuwakpani vu utsura u ni va,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:61">a kubana ugbashi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 78:61">u ka̱sukpa̱i tsugbayin ci ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:61">a kubana wa aza a na a iwain ni.<verse eid="PSA 78:61" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="PSA 78:62" />U yaꞋan ta̱ wupa n ili yi uka̱ni a̱ ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:62">ɗa u nekei le e ekiye a irala i le</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:62">yi unai le n kotokobi.<verse eid="PSA 78:62" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="PSA 78:63" />Akina o songi muku mo olobo n le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:63">nkere tankpamu n nambai ali o ku olo,<verse eid="PSA 78:63" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="PSA 78:64" />Anan ganu e le a banai ukpa̱ u kotokobi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:64">agapa a̱ma̱ci e le tana a̱ shika̱ ba.<verse eid="PSA 78:64" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="PSA 78:65" />Ɗa Vuzavaguɗu u ɗa̱nga̱i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:65">a danshi wishi ta̱ alavu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:65">tsu vuza na u jimgbai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:65">n kagimi ku soꞋi u ma̱ra̱.<verse eid="PSA 78:65" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="PSA 78:66" />U lapai irala i ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:66">ɗa okpoi n wono ko wannai.<verse eid="PSA 78:66" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="PSA 78:67" />Vuzavaguɗu u iwain kefeku ka̱ Isufu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:67">u zagba kefeku ka̱ Ifirayimu ba.<verse eid="PSA 78:67" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="PSA 78:68" />Ama ɗa kucikpa u zagbai kefeku ka̱ Yahuda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:68">kusan ku Sihiyona ku na u cigai ka̱u.<verse eid="PSA 78:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="PSA 78:69" />Ta ɗe u maꞋi A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin a̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:69">tsu gaɗi ko wannai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 78:69">u maꞋi ku ɗa n utsura</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:69">tsu na u shikpa̱i aduniyan ko wannai.<verse eid="PSA 78:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="PSA 78:70" />U zagbai kagbashi ka̱ ni Dawuda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:70">u ɗikai ni a̱ ubuta̱ u kaguɓa ko nkyon,<verse eid="PSA 78:70" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="PSA 78:71" />u ta̱wa̱i n a̱yi a̱ ubuta̱ u kaguɓa ko nkyon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:71">ɗa u zuwai ni maguɓi ma uma a̱ ni a Yakubu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:71">ɗaɗa Isaraila ili yi uka̱ni i ni<verse eid="PSA 78:71" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="PSA 78:72" />Dawuda tana u guɓai le</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:72">n ka̱ɗu ke te,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:72">n kuyeve kpamu.<verse eid="PSA 78:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 78" />
  <chapter number="79" style="c" sid="PSA 79" />
  <para style="s1">Avasa m ma̱shi adama a Urushelima</para>
  <para style="d">Vishipa vu Asafa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 79:1" />Ka̱shile, uduniyan u tuka̱ ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:1">uma a̱ nu n kuvon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:1">a natukpai A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin a ciɗa a̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:1">o bonokoi Urushelima agali.<verse eid="PSA 79:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 79:2" />A̱ ka̱sukpa̱i even a ikyamba ya agbashi a̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:2">o okpo ilikulyaꞋa yi nnu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 79:2">inyama i uma a ciɗa a̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:2">okpoi ilikulyaꞋa yi nnama n kakamba.<verse eid="PSA 79:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 79:3" />A̱ tsuwa̱in mpasa n uma a̱ nu tsu mini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:3">a̱ ubuta̱ ra̱ka̱ a Urushelima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:3">ko vuza u buwa a na wa̱ ciɗa̱ngu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:3">even a ikyamba a ba.<verse eid="PSA 79:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 79:4" />Tsu okpoi ili i ma̱ka̱n,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:4">wa aza a na i a ida̱shi ɗeɗevu n a̱tsu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 79:4">tsu okpoi ili yi izoshi n ulami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:4">wa aza a na i uka̱ra̱Ꞌi n a̱tsu.<verse eid="PSA 79:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 79:5" />Vuzavaguɗu ali n wannai ɗai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:5">vu kulyaꞋa ta̱ kelime n wupa ko wannai ɗa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 79:5">Ali n wannai ɗai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:5">wupa u nu u kuka̱na̱ ku kula̱ tsa akina?<verse eid="PSA 79:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 79:6" />Vu tsuwa̱n wupa u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:6">a uduniyan u na u kpa̱ɗa̱i ku cikpa wu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 79:6">N tsugono dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:6">tsu na tsu kpa̱ɗa̱i kuɗeke kula ku nu.<verse eid="PSA 79:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 79:7" />Adama a na a lyaꞋa ta̱ Yakubu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:7">a̱ la̱nga̱sa̱i iɗika i ni.<verse eid="PSA 79:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 79:8" />Ka̱ta̱ vu takacika tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:8">adama unushi wi ikaya i tsu ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 79:8">ama vu pana asuvayali a̱ tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:8">adama a na tsu takpa ta̱ asuvu a̱ tsu.<verse eid="PSA 79:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 79:9" />Vu ɓa̱nka̱ tsu, Ka̱shile kishi ka̱ tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:9">adama a tsugbayin tsu kula ku nu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 79:9">isa tsu ka̱ta̱ vu cinukpaka tsu unushi u tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:9">adama a kula ku nu.<verse eid="PSA 79:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 79:10" />Adama a̱ yiɗa̱i ɗa uduniyan u ku dana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:10">&lt;&lt;Te ɗai Ka̱shile ke le?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 79:10">YaꞋan tsu ene tsu na va kutakacika uduniyan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:10">adama a na vu tsupa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:10">mpasa ma agbashi a̱ nu n na a̱ tsuwa̱in.<verse eid="PSA 79:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 79:11" />Zuwa atsuvu vu pana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:11">yura̱ ya aza a na i ushiyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 79:11">n kukiye ku utsura ku nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:11">vu wawa aza a na a kiɗakai afada a̱ ukpa̱.<verse eid="PSA 79:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 79:12" />Vuzavaguɗu tsupa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:12">uduniyan u nanlo ali kucindere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:12">adama a kadanshi ka ishikushi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:12">ka na a yaꞋankai nu.<verse eid="PSA 79:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 79:13" />A̱tsu na ci uma a̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:13">nkyon mu ushiga u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:13">ci ta̱ a kucikpa wu ko wannai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 79:13">Tsukaya a kubana a tsukaya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:13">ci ta̱ a kucikpa wu.<verse eid="PSA 79:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 79" />
  <chapter number="80" style="c" sid="PSA 80" />
  <para style="s1">Avasa adama kusabaꞋasaka Isaraila</para>
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: A yaꞋan vu ɗa n ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ka Uzuwakpani u apulufa. Vishipa vu Asafa.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 80:1" />Zuwaka tsu atsuvu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:1">avu maguɓi mi Isaraila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:1">avu vu na vu tonoi n kumaci</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:1">ku Isufu tsu ushiga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 80:1">Avu na vi a̱ ida̱shi a kakuba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:1">ko tsugono ka̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:1">a gaɗi vu Corobi vu akana,<verse eid="PSA 80:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 80:2" />e kelime ka Ifirayimu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:2">m Bayami m Manasa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 80:2">yotsongu utsura u nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:2">ka̱ ta̱ vu ta̱wa̱ vu wawa tsu.<verse eid="PSA 80:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 80:3" />Ka̱shile, bonoko tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:3">vu pana asuvayali a̱ tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:3">ka̱ta̱ vu wawa tsu.<verse eid="PSA 80:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 80:4" />Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile MalaꞋimili,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:4">Ali n wannai ɗai va̱ ku ka̱na̱ wupa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:4">n avasa a uma a̱ nu?<verse eid="PSA 80:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 80:5" />N kujilya ku ɗa vu lyaꞋatangi tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:5">n kujilya ku ɗa vu nekei tsu moko ma̱ mini tsu soꞋi.<verse eid="PSA 80:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 80:6" />Vu bonokoi tsu ili i vishili</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:6">wa aza a na ci ida̱shi ɗeɗevu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:6">irala i tsu kpamu o ku zoꞋoso tsu.<verse eid="PSA 80:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 80:7" />Ka̱shile MalaꞋimili, bonoko tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:7">vu pana asuvayali a̱ tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:7">ka̱ta̱ vu wawa tsu.<verse eid="PSA 80:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 80:8" />Vu utuka̱i uma a̱ nu tsu maɗanga mi itacishi a Masar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:8">vu lokoi uduniyan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:8">u na wi ida̱shi a KanaꞋana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:8">ɗa vu shikpa̱i le.<verse eid="PSA 80:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 80:9" />Ɗa vu lapulakai le ubuta̱ adama a na o gbonguro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:9">aralu a̱ ni a uwai a iɗika ka̱u,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:9">a tatsai a palai ubuta̱ dem a iɗika ya.<verse eid="PSA 80:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 80:10" />A palai aginda n ululu e le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:10">a palai nɗanga m gbagbain n Sida n acaka e le.<verse eid="PSA 80:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 80:11" />Acaka a̱ ni a lazai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:11">a kubana a mala me mere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:11">ali a kubana a Mala ma Yufiretu.<verse eid="PSA 80:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 80:12" />Yiɗa̱i i zuwai ɗa vu ɓosoi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:12">nshilya n na mi uka̱ra̱Ꞌi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:12">n maɗanga mi itacishi ma?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:12">Adama a na irala i ni i na yi a kulaza lo dem</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:12">a uwa o boko umaci u ni.<verse eid="PSA 80:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 80:13" />Njuma mi ta̱ a kudasa le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:13">nnama n kakamba n takuma le.<verse eid="PSA 80:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 80:14" />Ka̱shile MalaꞋimili, bono wa̱ tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:14">la̱na̱ku ɗe gaɗi vu ene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 80:14">ta̱wa̱ vu wawa kashina ki itacishi ka̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 80:14" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 80:15" />Ta̱wa̱ vu wawa maɗanga mi itacishi ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:15">ma na avu n ka̱ci ka̱ nu vu shikpa̱i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:15">ma na vu ɗa̱ngusa̱i</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:15">adama a̱ ka̱ci ka̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 80:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 80:16" />Irala i tsu i kapai le i songi le n akina,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:16">vu yaꞋin wupa n ele</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:16">vu unai le ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 80:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 80:17" />YaꞋan kukiye ku singai ku nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:17">ku yongo n uma a̱ nu a na vu zagbai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:17">maku ma vuma ma na vu kumgbasai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:17">adama a̱ ka̱ci ka̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 80:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 80:18" />Ci a kukpatala tsu ka̱sukpa̱ wu ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:18">neke tsu wuma u savu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:18">adama a na tsu ɗeke a kula ku nu.<verse eid="PSA 80:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 80:19" />Ka̱shile MalaꞋimili, bonoko tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:19">vu pana asuvayali a̱ tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:19">ka̱ta̱ vu wawa tsu.<verse eid="PSA 80:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 80" />
  <chapter number="81" style="c" sid="PSA 81" />
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: A yaꞋan vu ɗa n ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ka, &lt;&lt;Gititi.&gt;&gt; Vishipa vu Asafa.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ishipa i ka̱ɗiva̱ ka̱ a̱pa̱m</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 81:1" />Cananai ishipa i ma̱za̱nga̱ u Ka̱shile katsura ka̱ tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:1">orukpoi ka̱u u Ka̱shile ka Yakubu.<verse eid="PSA 81:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 81:2" />Gita̱i ishipa n i kucuwai medelemishipa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:2">waꞋi umolu, waꞋi umolu u gbayin,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">81:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">umolu u gbayin </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Umolu u aꞋin kupa.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:2">n ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ka uyoꞋo.<verse eid="PSA 81:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 81:3" />I lika̱ kavana ka̱ ka̱giri o wotoi u savu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:3">i lika̱ kavana ka a makyan ma na wotoi u pecei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:3">i yaꞋan ka̱ɗiva̱ ka.<verse eid="PSA 81:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 81:4" />Na lo ili i kutono i ɗa wa aza a Isaraila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:4">wila̱ u ɗa u na wu uta̱i a̱ Ka̱shile ka Yakubu.<verse eid="PSA 81:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 81:5" />U neke ta̱ wila̱ u nanlo a̱ ubuta̱ uma a Isaraila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:5">a makyan ma na wu uta̱i u shilika̱i n uma a Masar.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:5">M panai ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ka na n saꞋwai kupana ba, a kudansa,<verse eid="PSA 81:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 81:6" />&lt;&lt;N cipa̱ka̱ ɗa̱ ta̱ ucanuku wa̱ a̱miki u na wi avangatsu a̱ ɗa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:6">mbana ma atakaci n na mi ekiye a̱ ɗa̱ n yaꞋan ta̱ wishi.<verse eid="PSA 81:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 81:7" />A makyan ma na yi o kusoꞋo atakaci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:7">i ɗeke mu ta̱, ɗa tana n wawai ɗa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:7">ɗa mu ushuki mpa punu eleshu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:7">n kondoi ɗa̱ a̱ mini ma Mariba.<char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 81:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 81:8" />Panai, a̱ɗa̱ uma a̱ va̱ aza a Isaraila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:8">n ciga ta̱ i panaka mu.<verse eid="PSA 81:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 81:9" />Ka̱ta̱ i cikpa a̱ma̱li ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:9">ka̱ta̱ kpamu i kuɗa̱ngu a omoci a̱ma̱li ba.<verse eid="PSA 81:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 81:10" />Mpa ɗa Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka̱ ɗa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:10">vuza na wu utuka̱i ɗa̱ a iɗika i Masar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:10">apukai una̱ u ɗa̱, mi ta̱ a ku lyatangu ɗa̱.<verse eid="PSA 81:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 81:11" />&lt;&lt;Ama uma a̱ va̱ a panaka mu ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:11">Isaraila u iwain kutono mu.<verse eid="PSA 81:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 81:12" />Adama a nannai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:12">n ka̱sukpa̱ le ta̱ a lyaꞋa kelime n ugbamukaci u le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:12">a yaꞋan ili i na i a kufuɗa kuyaꞋan.<verse eid="PSA 81:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 81:13" />Uma a̱ va̱ i baci a kupanaka mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:13">ishi baci aza a Isaraila o kutono uye u va̱,<verse eid="PSA 81:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 81:14" />mi ishi ta̱ o kuloko irala i le gogoꞋo lo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:14">n lyaꞋa aza a na a iwai le ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 81:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 81:15" />Aza a na a iwai Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:15">i ta̱ a̱ ku kuɗa̱ngu e kelime ka̱ ni adama o wovon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:15">atakaci e le ko wannai ɗa.<verse eid="PSA 81:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 81:16" />Ama mi ta̱ a ku lyaꞋatangu ɗa̱ n alkama i singai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:16">ka̱ta̱ n zuwa ɗa̱ i cuwa̱ n ishigi i na a jaꞋwain a katali.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 81:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 81" />
  <chapter number="82" style="c" sid="PSA 82" />
  <para style="d">Vishipa vu Asafa.</para>
  <para style="s1">Isa aza a unambi n aza a babu utsura</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 82:1" />Ka̱shile ka ɗika ta̱ tsugbayin ci ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:1">o koɓolo ka gbayin ka gaɗi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 82:1">Ka̱shile ka tsu kiɗa ta̱ afada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:1">a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka̱ a̱ma̱li.<verse eid="PSA 82:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 82:2" />&lt;&lt;Ali n wannai ɗai i ku ka̱na̱ kuyaꞋan afada a na i mejege ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:2">i ka̱na̱ kuɓa̱nka̱ aza a gbani-gbani? <char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 82:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 82:3" />I ɓa̱nka̱ aza a unambi nu mkpaꞋan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:3">i yaꞋanka aza a unambi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:3">n aza a na o doroi kasingai.<verse eid="PSA 82:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 82:4" />Wawai aza a na i n utsura ba n aza a unambi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:4">wawai le e ekiye aza a gbani-gbani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 82:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 82:5" />I n cicoꞋo ba, ko e yeve ili,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:5">i ta̱ a nwalu a̱ ka̱yimbi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:5">a̱miꞋi a ngon ma aduniyan m gba̱ɗa̱i.<verse eid="PSA 82:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 82:6" />N danai, &lt;&lt;A̱ɗa̱ a̱ma̱li a ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:6">ra̱ka̱ vu ɗa̱ muku m MalaꞋimili n ɗa,<verse eid="PSA 82:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 82:7" />Ama yi ta̱ a̱ ku kuwa̱ tsu vuma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:7">i yikpa̱ tsu ngono ra̱ka̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 82:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 82:8" />Ka̱shile, ta̱wa̱ vu yaꞋanka aduniyan afada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:8">adama a na uduniyan ra̱ka̱ ili yi uka̱ni i nu i ɗa.<verse eid="PSA 82:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 82" />
  <chapter number="83" style="c" sid="PSA 83" />
  <para style="d">Vishipa vu Asafa.</para>
  <para style="s1">Avasa adama a na una irala i Isaraila</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 83:1" />Ka̱shile, ka̱ta̱ vu paɗa bini, vu shamgba gbaɓa ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:1">Ka̱shile ka̱ta̱ vu kpa̱ɗa̱ kukeɓece ukuna ba.<verse eid="PSA 83:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 83:2" />Inda, tsu na irala i nu yi a̱ra̱ɗi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:2">la̱na̱, tsu na i a ugbamukaci.<verse eid="PSA 83:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 83:3" />A nsata adama a uma a̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:3">a gbaɓai aci e le a yaꞋan tsurala n uma a na vi a kinda.<verse eid="PSA 83:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 83:4" />Aza a ugbamukaci a kudansa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:4">&lt;&lt;Ta̱wa̱i tsu una aza a Isaraila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:4">adama a na a cinukpa n ele ko wannai.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 83:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 83:5" />N ka̱ɗu kete kaꞋa e sheshei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:5">a gbaɓai kaci a kuyaꞋan tsurala n avu.<verse eid="PSA 83:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 83:6" />Ele ɗa aza a Edom n aza a IshimaꞋilu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:6">n aza a Mowabu, n aza a Haga,<verse eid="PSA 83:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 83:7" />n aza a Gebalu n aza a Amona</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:7">n aza a Ameleki n aza a Filisitiya n aza a Taya,<verse eid="PSA 83:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 83:8" />Asiriya feu o ɓolongi kaci n ele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:8">o doki kumaci ku Lotu utsura. <char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 83:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 83:9" />YaꞋanka le tsu na vu yaꞋankai aza a Midiya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:9">yaꞋanka le tsu na vu yaꞋankai Sisera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:9">n Jabinu e kuyene ku Kishon,<verse eid="PSA 83:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 83:10" />a̱ kuwa̱i a Eni-doru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:10">even a ikyamba e le a shamai a iɗika.<verse eid="PSA 83:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 83:11" />YaꞋanka aza e kelime e le</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:11">tsu na vu yaꞋankai Orebu n Zeyibu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:11">vu lokoi aza o tsugono e le</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:11">tsu na vu lokoi Zeba n Zalumuna,<verse eid="PSA 83:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 83:12" />a danai, &lt;&lt;Ci ta̱ a ku isa iɗika i na yi i Ka̱shile</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:12">yi okpo i tsu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 83:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 83:13" />Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱, loko le tsu wunla̱i u kabatalikpau,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:13">vu loko le tsu na wunla̱i u tsu pura̱ngu kopo.<verse eid="PSA 83:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 83:14" />Tsu na akina a ci lyaꞋa kutsun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:14">tsu na kpamu melentsu ma akina me ci leɓece nsasan,<verse eid="PSA 83:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 83:15" />Vu loko le n wunla̱i wu utsura u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:15">vu rikpa̱sa̱ le n kabatalikpau ka utsura.<verse eid="PSA 83:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 83:16" />Vuzavaguɗu zuwa le okpo n wono,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:16">adama a na a̱ la̱nsa̱ kula ku ni.<verse eid="PSA 83:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 83:17" />YaꞋan okpo n wono ko wannai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:17">yaꞋan a bana ukpa̱ u wono,<verse eid="PSA 83:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 83:18" />Adama a na e yeve a na avu ɗa koci, Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:18">avu ɗa koci MalaꞋimili aduniyan ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 83:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 83" />
  <chapter number="84" style="c" sid="PSA 84" />
  <para style="s1">Uzuwi u ka̱ɗu u Ka̱shile</para>
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: A yaꞋan vu ɗa n ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ka &lt;&lt;Gititi.&gt;&gt;Vishipa vu muku n Kora.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 84:1" />Yiɗa̱i a kugisangu ku ugaꞋin wa̱ A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin a̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:1">Ka̱shile MalaꞋimili?<verse eid="PSA 84:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 84:2" />Wuma u va̱ wi ta̱ a mali</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:2">ma ulanga wa̱ A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin a Vuzavaguɗu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 84:2">Ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ n wuma u va̱ ra̱ka̱ a kucanana ishipa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:2">u Ka̱shile ka wuma.<verse eid="PSA 84:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 84:3" />Ali ojironjiron feu a̱ ciya̱ ta̱ ɗe kpaꞋa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:3">mbeɗukule n yaꞋan ta̱ ɗe cikinda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 84:3">ɗevu n katalikalyuka a tsu guɓa muku n le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:3">Vuzavaguɗu MalaꞋimili, mogono ma̱ va̱ Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 84:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 84:4" />Aza a una̱singai a ɗa aza a na i a ida̱shi a kpaꞋa ku nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:4">makyan dem i ta̱ a kucanana ishipa i kucikpa wu. <char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 84:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 84:5" />Aza a̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ a ɗa aza a na a̱ ciya̱i utsura wa̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:5">aza a na i a mali a bana a kusan ku Sihiyona.<verse eid="PSA 84:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 84:6" />Aza a̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ a ɗa a na o tonoi n ka̱ra̱Ꞌa̱ ke ɗekpu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:6">ɗa ko bonoi tsu a̱shi a̱ mini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:6">tsu na mini ma̱ ugiti ma̱ Ka̱shile ma tsu shatangu ayivan dem.<verse eid="PSA 84:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 84:7" />A̱ tsu ka̱na̱ ta̱ kutsurukpa a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka nwalu n le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:7">i ta̱ tana e kene Ka̱shile ka̱ a̱ma̱li a Sihiyona.<verse eid="PSA 84:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 84:8" />Pana avasa a̱ va̱, Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile MalaꞋimili,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:8">panaka mu, Ka̱shile ka Yakubu. <char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 84:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 84:9" />La̱na̱ Ka̱shile, avu ɗa ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku u tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:9">sa̱Ꞌa̱ mazagbi ma̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 84:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 84:10" />Kanna kete ka na a kuyaꞋan A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin a̱ nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:10">u laꞋa ta̱ ayin ka̱kpa̱n a na a kuyaꞋan a̱ ubuta̱ u yoku kau.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 84:10">n laꞋa ta̱ n kuciga m shamgba utsutsu u kpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:10">a na ma̱ kuda̱sa̱ngu a iꞋuwa i uma a gbani-gbani.<verse eid="PSA 84:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 84:11" />Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:11">a̱yi ɗa kutashi ku tsu m ma̱ra̱ga̱ ma̱ tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:11">u tsu zuwaka tsu ta̱ una̱singai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:11">n kasingai n tsugbayin,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 84:11">u sa̱nka̱ aza a na i a kuyaꞋan ili i mejege</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:11">ili singai ba.<verse eid="PSA 84:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 84:12" />Aza a una̱singai a ɗa aza a na e nekei a̱ɗu ele wa̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:12">Ka̱shile MalaꞋimili.<verse eid="PSA 84:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 84" />
  <chapter number="85" style="c" sid="PSA 85" />
  <para style="s1">Ma̱shi ma̱ kula̱nsa̱ kasingai adama a Isaraila</para>
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: Vishipa vu muku n Kora.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 85:1" />Vuzavaguɗu, vu yaꞋanka ta̱ iɗika i nu kasingai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:1">vu bonoko ta̱ Yakubu n una̱singai u ni.<verse eid="PSA 85:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 85:2" />Vu cinukpaka ta̱ uma a̱ nu unushi u le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:2">vu cinukpakai le unushi u le. <char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 85:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 85:3" />Vu ka̱sukpa̱i kuyaꞋan wupa n ele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:3">ɗa vu takpai wupa wu usuɗukpi u nu we le.<verse eid="PSA 85:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 85:4" />Bonoko tsu kpamu, Ka̱shile kishi ka̱ tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:4">vu ka̱sukpa̱ kupana wupa u tsu.<verse eid="PSA 85:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 85:5" />Vi ta̱ a kuyaꞋan wupa n a̱tsu ko wannai ɗa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:5">Vi a ku saꞋawa kuta̱na̱ ba?<verse eid="PSA 85:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 85:6" />Vi o kudoku tsu utsura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:6">vu ɗa̱ngusa̱ tsu kpamu ba?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:6">Adama a na ci cikpa wu ba?<verse eid="PSA 85:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 85:7" />Vuzavaguɗu vu yotsongu tsu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:7">ucigi u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:7">vu ɓa̱nka̱ tsu n wishi u nu.<verse eid="PSA 85:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 85:8" />Mi ta̱ a kuzuwa atsuvu wu ili i na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:8">Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ki a kudansa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:8">a̱tsu na ci uma a̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:8">u yaꞋanka tsu ta̱ uzuwakpani u ma̱ta̱na̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:8">tsu bono baci a ukuna u tsulau u tsu ba.<verse eid="PSA 85:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 85:9" />Mayun wi ta̱ ufoɓushi adama a na wu isa aza a na i e kuneke yi tsugbayin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:9">adama a na tsugbayin ci ni tsu yongo punu a iɗika ya.<verse eid="PSA 85:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 85:10" />Ucigi u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba n usuɓi i ta̱ o kugasa a̱ ubuta̱ u te,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:10">ma̱riki m ma̱ta̱na̱ i ta̱ kpamu o ku oɓongbonoi<verse eid="PSA 85:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 85:11" />Ma̱riki ma vuma mi ta̱ a̱ ku uta̱ aduniyan a kubana gaɗi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:11">usuɓi u Ka̱shile wi ta̱ a ku indana ɗe gaɗi.<verse eid="PSA 85:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 85:12" />Vuzavaguɗu wi ta̱ a ku zuwaka tsu una̱singai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:12">iɗika i tsu yi ta̱ a kumatsa ili i kashina n a̱bunda̱i.<verse eid="PSA 85:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 85:13" />Usuɓi wi ta̱ a kulyaꞋa kelime ka̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:13">u foɓusoko yi uye.<verse eid="PSA 85:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 85" />
  <chapter number="86" style="c" sid="PSA 86" />
  <para style="s1">Avasa a̱ kula̱nsa̱ uɓa̱nki</para>
  <para style="d">Avasa a Dawuda</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 86:1" />Vuzavaguɗu zuwaka mu atsuvu, vu ushuku mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:1">adama a na mpa vuza vu unambi ɗa n vuza yali.<verse eid="PSA 86:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 86:2" />Ere wuma u va̱ a̱ ubuta̱ ukpa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:2">adama a na mpa vuza vu usuɓi ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:2">wawa kagbashi ka̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:2">adama a na avu ɗa Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 86:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 86:3" />Pana asuvayali a̱ va̱, Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:3">mi ta̱ avasa wa̱ nu kanna dem.<verse eid="PSA 86:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 86:4" />Vuzavaguɗu, zuwa kagbashi ka̱ nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:4">ka yaꞋan ma̱za̱nga̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:4">adama a na n neke ta̱ wuma u va̱ wa̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 86:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 86:5" />Vuzavaguɗu, avu vuza vu kasingai ɗa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:5">n kacinukpi ka unushi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:5">vi ta̱ n ka̱bunda̱i ka ucigi u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:5">wa aza na i e meɗevile wa̱ nu ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 86:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 86:6" />Zuwa atsuvu wa avasa a̱ va̱, Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:6">pana ma̱shi ma̱ va̱ ma̱ kula̱nsa̱ uɓa̱nki.<verse eid="PSA 86:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 86:7" />Mi ta̱ e ɗeke wu a kanna ka atakaci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:7">adama a na vi ta̱ a̱ ku ushuku avasa a̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 86:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 86:8" />Vuzavaguɗu, a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka̱ a̱ma̱li</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:8">ko vuza te wi lo tsu nu ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:8">ko vuza te, wi a kufuɗa kuyaꞋan ili i na vi a kuyaꞋan ba.<verse eid="PSA 86:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 86:9" />Uduniyan u na vu yaꞋin ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:9">i ta̱ a̱ kuta̱wa̱ a̱ kuɗa̱ngu e kelime ka̱ nu, Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:9">i ta̱ e kuneke kula ku nu tsugbayin.<verse eid="PSA 86:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 86:10" />Adama a na avu vuza gbayin ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:10">vu na vu ci yaꞋan ili i mereve,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:10">avu endeꞋin avu ɗa Ka̱shile,<verse eid="PSA 86:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 86:11" />Vuzavaguɗu, piꞋisaka mu ili i na vu cigai n yaꞋan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:11">mpa tana mi ta̱ o kutono wu mayun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:11">zuwa mu n ga̱nda̱ka̱ wu n ka̱ɗu kete.<verse eid="PSA 86:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 86:12" />Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:12">mi ta̱ a kucikpa wu n ka̱ɗu kete,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:12">mi ta̱ a kusala tsugbayin tsu nu ko wannai.<verse eid="PSA 86:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 86:13" />Ucigi u gbayin u nu u na tsu sabaꞋa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:13">a kubana wa̱ va̱ wi kugisangu ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:13">adama a na vu isa mu a kasaun uga̱vi.<verse eid="PSA 86:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 86:14" />Aza a ugbamukaci a̱ tuka̱ mu ta̱ n vishili, Ka̱shile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:14">koɓolo ka uma a gbani-gbani a̱ kula̱nsa̱ wuma u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:14">uma a na e ci neke wu tsugbayin ba.<verse eid="PSA 86:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 86:15" />Ama avu Vuzavaguɗu, avu Ka̱shile ka asuvayali kaꞋa n kasingai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:15">vuza na u ci yaꞋan wupa gogo ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:15">vuza wu ucigi wa̱ a̱bunda̱i m ma̱riki,<verse eid="PSA 86:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 86:16" />La̱na̱ mu, vu pana asuvayali a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:16">vu neke kagbashi ka̱ nu utsura</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:16">vu wawa maku ma kagbashi ka vuka ka̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 86:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 86:17" />Vuzavaguɗu, yotsongu mu urotu u kasingai ka̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:17">aza a na iwain mu i ta̱ e kene, ka̱ta̱ a pana wono,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:17">ɗa baci enei vu nekei mu kadanshi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:17">vu ɓa̱nka̱i mu kpamu.<verse eid="PSA 86:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 86" />
  <chapter number="87" style="c" sid="PSA 87" />
  <para style="d">Vishipa vu muku n Kora.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 87:1" />Vuzavaguɗu u vara ta̱ kumiꞋi ku kumaꞋa ku ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:1">a gaɗi vu aginda a ciɗa,<verse eid="PSA 87:1" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 87:2" />Vuzavaguɗu u laꞋa ta̱ n kuciga utsutsu u Sihiyona</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:2">n ubuta̱ wi ida̱shi i Yakubu ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 87:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 87:3" />I ta̱ a kadanshi ka tsugbayin adama a̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:3">avu likuci i Ka̱shile. <char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 87:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 87:4" />Mi ta̱ a kuzuwa Masar m Babila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:4">a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka aza a na e yevei mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:4">Filisitiya n Taya n Habasha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:4">&lt;&lt;Ele feu ta ɗe a matsai le,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 87:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 87:5" />A Sihiyona tankpamu i ta̱ a kudana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:5">&lt;&lt;Ele na n ele nan ɗe a matsa le ta̱ punu.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:5">MalaꞋimili wi ta̱ a kuzuwa i ɗa.<verse eid="PSA 87:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 87:6" />Vuzavaguɗu wi ta̱ a kuɗana a katagarda ka ula a uma a̱ ni dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:6">&lt;&lt;A̱yi na a matsai ta̱ a Sihiyona.&gt;&gt;<char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 87:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 87:7" />A makyan ma na i a kuyaꞋan tsuwaꞋi i ta̱ a kucanana ishipa, ka̱ta̱ a dana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:7">&lt;&lt;Una̱singai u va̱ dem wi ta̱ Sihiyona.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 87:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 87" />
  <chapter number="88" style="c" sid="PSA 88" />
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: Vishipa vu muku n Kora. A yaꞋan vu ɗa n ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ka Leyonotu.VicuꞋu vu tsuwaꞋi tsu Heman vuza vu aza a Ezirahitu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 88:1" />Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile, vuza na u wawai mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:1">kanna n kayin mpa a̱ ma̱shi wa̱ nu,<verse eid="PSA 88:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 88:2" />YaꞋan avasa a̱ va̱ a̱ ta̱wa̱ wa̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:2">zuwa atsuvu vu pana ma̱shi ma̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 88:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 88:3" />Wuma u va̱ wi ta̱ tukpa n atakaci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:3">ali mi ɗevu n ukpa̱.<verse eid="PSA 88:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 88:4" />E kece mu ta̱ a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka aza a na a̱ gida̱la̱i</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:4">e kpenle ku ukpa̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:4">mo okpoi tsu vuza na wi n utsura ba,<verse eid="PSA 88:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 88:5" />A variki mu a̱ ubuta̱ wa̱ a̱kpisa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:5">tsa aza a na unai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:5">punu a ivaꞋin asaun e le,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 88:5">aza a na vu cinukpai n e le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:5">aza a na a buwai n u uɓa̱nki u nu ba.<verse eid="PSA 88:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 88:6" />Vu taɗuku mu ta̱ a kasaun ku uga̱vi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:6">m kpenle ku uga̱vi ku ka̱yimbi.<verse eid="PSA 88:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 88:7" />Vi ta̱ a wupa nu mpa ka̱u,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:7">vu vita̱la̱sa̱i mu n aɓau a mala. <char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 88:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 88:8" />Vu zuwai a̱ja̱Ꞌa̱ a̱ va̱ a variki mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:8">vu zuwai e pecei mu kau,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 88:8">mo okpoi a ukanji babu tsu na n kulaꞋaka.<verse eid="PSA 88:8" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 88:9" />A̱shi a̱ va̱ a̱ ga̱la̱i adama a una̱mgbuka̱tsuma̱.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 88:9">Vuzavaguɗu kanna dem mi ta̱ e kuɗekushe wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:9">n tsu ɗa̱ngusa̱ ta̱ ekiye a̱ va̱ wa̱ nu avasa.<verse eid="PSA 88:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 88:10" />Vu tsu yaꞋanka ta̱ a̱kpisa̱ ili i mereve?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:10">A̱kpisa̱ a̱ tsu ɗa̱nga̱ ta̱ a cikpa wu? <char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 88:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 88:11" />A ci yaꞋan ta̱ kadanshi ka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:11">ucigi u nu u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba a kasaun?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:11">Ko ma̱riki ma̱ nu a̱ ubuta̱ wa aza a na a unai.<verse eid="PSA 88:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 88:12" />I ta̱ e kene ili i mereve i nu a̱ ka̱yimbi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:12">Ko ukuna wu usuɓi u nu a̱ ubuta̱ wa̱ a̱kpisa̱.<verse eid="PSA 88:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 88:13" />Ama Vuzavaguɗu mi ta̱ e meɗevile a̱ kula̱nsa̱ uɓa̱nki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:13">n usana n ci yaꞋan ta̱ avasa a kubana wa̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 88:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 88:14" />Vuzavaguɗu, yiɗa̱i i zuwai ɗa vu variki mu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:14">Yiɗa̱i i zuwai ɗa vu sokongu ki mu a̱shi a̱ nu?<verse eid="PSA 88:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 88:15" />Ili i na i ɗikai mpa kenu ɗa mi atakaci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:15">ali a kubana ɗevu n ukpa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:15">ɗa n togbolyoi adama atakaci a̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 88:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 88:16" />Wupa u nu u lyaꞋa mu ta̱ tsu na mini ma tsu aya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:16">uɓarangi u nu wu una mu ta̱.<verse eid="PSA 88:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 88:17" />Kanna ka̱ɓula̱ a̱ ka̱ra̱Ꞌi mu tsu mini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:17">a kanza mu ta̱ a̱ ubuta̱ dem.<verse eid="PSA 88:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 88:18" />Vu zuwai a̱ja̱Ꞌa̱ va̱ n aza a na a cigai mu a iwain mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:18">ka̱yimbi kaꞋa koci ko okpoi ka̱ja̱Ꞌa̱ ka̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 88:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 88" />
  <chapter number="89" style="c" sid="PSA 89" />
  <para style="s1">Uzuwakpani u Ka̱shile n Dawuda</para>
  <para style="d">VicuꞋu vu tsuwaꞋi tsu Itan vuza va aza a Ezirahitu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 89:1" />Mi ta̱ a kucanana ishipa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:1">adama a ucigi u Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:1">u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba ko wannai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 89:1">Mi ta̱ a kusala ukuna u ma̱riki ma̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:1">tsukaya a kubana a tsukaya<verse eid="PSA 89:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 89:2" />Mi ta̱ a kudana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:2">&lt;&lt;Ucigi u nu u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba wi ta̱ o kuyongo ko wannai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:2">ma̱riki ma̱ nu mi ta̱ o kuyongo tsu gaɗi a̱da̱nga̱shile.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 89:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 89:3" />Vu danai, &lt;&lt;N yaꞋan ta̱ uzuwakpani m mazagbi ma̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:3">n yaꞋanka ta̱ kagbashi ka̱ va̱ Dawuda uzuwakpani n danai,<verse eid="PSA 89:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 89:4" />&lt;A ntsukaya u nu n ɗa a̱ kuciya̱ mogono ko wannai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:4">i ta̱ a̱ kuda̱sa̱ngu a kakuba ko tsugono ka̱ nu tsukaya n tsukaya.&gt; &gt;&gt; <char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 89:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 89:5" />Vuzavaguɗu, ili wuma i gaɗi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:5">yi ta̱ a kucikpa ili i mereve i na vu yaꞋin,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 89:5">koɓolo ka uma a ciɗa feu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:5">a kucikpa ma̱riki ma̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 89:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 89:6" />Adama a na ɗe e eleshu yayi a kugisanku n Vuzavagɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:6">yayi wi tsu Vuzavaguɗu a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ki ili wuma i gaɗi?<verse eid="PSA 89:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 89:7" />I ta̱ e kuneke wu tsugbayin a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ki ili i wuma i ciɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:7">aza a na i uka̱ra̱Ꞌi n avu i ta̱ o wovon u nu ka̱u.<verse eid="PSA 89:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 89:8" />Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile, MalaꞋimili,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:8">babu vuza vu utsura tsu nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:8">avu vuza vu ma̱riki ɗa a ili dem.<verse eid="PSA 89:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 89:9" />Avu ɗa vu tsu lyaꞋa tsugono tsu mala ma ujari,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:9">vu tsu vaꞋanku ta̱ aɓau.<verse eid="PSA 89:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 89:10" />Vu yokumoi ka̱ma̱li ka ugbamukaci ka nanlo vu unai ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:10">n utsura u kukiye ku nu ɗa vu wacuwai irala i nu.<verse eid="PSA 89:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 89:11" />Gaɗi a̱da̱nga̱shile a̱ nu a ɗa, aduniyan feu a̱ nu a ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:11">avu ɗa vu yaꞋin aduniyan n ili i na yi punu dem.<verse eid="PSA 89:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 89:12" />Avu ɗa vu yaꞋin uɓongaɗi n uɓonɗakai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:12">kusan ku Taboru n Hamonu i ta̱ a kuyaꞋanka wu ishipa adama a̱ ma̱za̱nga̱.<verse eid="PSA 89:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 89:13" />Kukiye ku nu ki ta̱ n tsugbayin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:13">kukiye ku usingai ku nu kpamu ki ta̱ n utsura.<verse eid="PSA 89:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 89:14" />Usuɓi n kamayun kaꞋa kumiꞋi ku kakuba ko tsugono ka̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:14">ucigi u nu u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba m ma̱riki i ta̱ e kelime ka̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 89:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 89:15" />Vuzavaguɗu, aza a una̱singai a ɗa aza a na i a kucikpa wu n ishipa i ma̱za̱nga̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:15">aza a na i a nwalu a kutashi ku nu.<verse eid="PSA 89:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 89:16" />I ta̱ a̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ a kanna dem adama a̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:16">i a̱ kuciya̱ ucikpi adama a usuɓi u nu.<verse eid="PSA 89:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 89:17" />Adama a na avu ɗa tsugbayin ci le n utsura u le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:17">n kasingai ka̱ nu kaꞋa ci ciya̱i ucikpi.<verse eid="PSA 89:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 89:18" />Adama a na mayun Vuzavaguɗu ɗa ma̱ra̱ga̱ ma̱ tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:18">mogono ma̱ tsu a̱yi ɗa vuza ciɗa vi Isaraila,<verse eid="PSA 89:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 89:19" />Vu saꞋwa ta̱ kuyaꞋan kadanshi tsa alatani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:19">u uma a̱ nu a usuɓi m makyan ɗe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:19">vu danai,&lt;&lt;N neke ta̱ kovonshi utsura</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:19">vuza na n ɗa̱ngusa̱i a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka uma.<verse eid="PSA 89:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 89:20" />N ciya̱ ta̱ Dawuda kagbashi ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:20">me erengi ta̱ m maniꞋin ma ciɗa,<verse eid="PSA 89:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 89:21" />Utsura u va̱ wi ta̱ o kuyongo n a̱yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:21">kukiye ku va̱ ki ta̱ a ku zuwa yi u tsurukpa.<verse eid="PSA 89:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 89:22" />Vurala vu ni vi a kusaꞋwa kulyaꞋa yi ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:22">uma a gbani-gbani i o kuloko yi ba.<verse eid="PSA 89:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 89:23" />A̱ a̱shi a̱ ni mi ta̱ o ku yokumo irala i ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:23">mu una aza a na a iwain ni.<verse eid="PSA 89:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 89:24" />Ukuna u ma̱riki u va̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:24">n ucigi u va̱ u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba wi ta̱ o kuyongo n a̱yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:24">mi ta̱ a ku zuwa yi u ciya̱ ulyaꞋi.<verse eid="PSA 89:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 89:25" />Mi ta̱ a kuzuwa tsugono ci ni ci lyaꞋa kelime,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:25">ili i na i ɗikai a mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:25">ali a kubana e kuyene ku Ifiritis.<verse eid="PSA 89:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 89:26" />Dawuda wi ta̱ a kudana mu,&lt;Avu esheku a̱ va̱ a ɗa n Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:26">avu ɗa vi e ku ere mu avu ɗa ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku u va̱ n kishi ka̱ va̱.&gt;<verse eid="PSA 89:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 89:27" />Mi ta̱ o kubonoko yi maku mu ugiti ma̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:27">vuza na u laꞋi ngono ma aduniyan m gbayin.<verse eid="PSA 89:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 89:28" />Ucigi u va̱ u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba wi o kuyongo n a̱yi ko wannai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:28">uzuwakpani u na n yaꞋin n a̱yi wi ta̱ a kushamgba ko wannai.<verse eid="PSA 89:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 89:29" />A ntsukaya n ni ɗa a̱ kuciya̱ mogono makyan dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:29">tsugono ci ni ci ta̱ a kushamgba tsa eleshu a gaɗi.<verse eid="PSA 89:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 89:30" />Ama ɗa baci muku n ni n kpa̱ɗa̱i kutono wila̱ u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:30">kpamu o tono ili i na n dansai ba,<verse eid="PSA 89:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 89:31" />Ɗa baci a̱ ka̱sukpa̱i wila̱ u kadanshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:31">a̱ kpa̱ɗa̱i kutono uneki u kadanshi ka̱ va̱,<verse eid="PSA 89:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 89:32" />mi ta̱ a kutakacika le adama a unushi u le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:32">n faba le adama a kawuya ke le.<verse eid="PSA 89:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 89:33" />Ama mi a̱ kukpa̱ɗa̱ ku ciga Dawuda ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:33">mi tana a̱ kukpa̱ɗa̱ kushatangu uzuwakpani u na n yaꞋanka ni ba.<verse eid="PSA 89:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 89:34" />Mi o ku koɗo uzuwakpani u na n yaꞋanka ni ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:34">mi tana a̱ ku sabaꞋa ko ili i te a kadanshi ku una̱ ka̱ va̱ ba.<verse eid="PSA 89:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 89:35" />N kula ku ciɗa ku va̱ ɗa n yaꞋin a kucina kute koci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:35">mi a kuyaꞋanka Dawuda aꞋuwa ba.<verse eid="PSA 89:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 89:36" />Ntsukaya n ni mi ta̱ o kuyongo ko wannai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:36">mi ta̱ a̱ kula̱na̱ tsugono ci ni kanna ki baci de n kutashi.<verse eid="PSA 89:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 89:37" />Ki ta̱ a kushamgba n utsura tsu wotoi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:37">tsu magan mu usuɓi ma na mi gaɗi.&gt;&gt;<char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 89:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 89:38" />Ama gogo na vu yaꞋan ta̱ wupa m mazagbi ma̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:38">vu iwain ni ɗa vu variki ni.<verse eid="PSA 89:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 89:39" />Vu koɗoi uzuwakpani u na vu yaꞋin n kagbashi ka̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:39">vu variki oroliko a̱ ni a̱ ka̱kiza̱.<verse eid="PSA 89:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 89:40" />Vu ɓosoi asaka a̱ likuci i ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:40">vu bonokoi ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku u ni agali.<verse eid="PSA 89:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 89:41" />Aza a na i a nwalu a uye i ta̱ o kuboko ucanuku u ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:41">aza a na i a̱ ida̱shi ɗeɗevu n a̱yi o ku zoꞋoso yi.<verse eid="PSA 89:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 89:42" />Vu zuwai irala i ni i lyaꞋi kelime,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:42">vu zuwai ra̱ka̱ vu le a yaꞋin ma̱za̱nga̱.<verse eid="PSA 89:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 89:43" />Vu zuwai ucanuku u kuvon u ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:43">wo okpoi ili i gbani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:43">vu ka̱sukpa̱i a lyaꞋi ni n kuvon.<verse eid="PSA 89:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 89:44" />Vu isai ni kalangu ko tsugono ci ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:44">vu lapai kakuba ko tsugono ci ni a iɗika.<verse eid="PSA 89:44" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 89:45" />Vu zuwai ni u kutsai babu ayin a̱ ni a yawa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:45">vu zuwai wono u kimba̱i ni.<char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 89:45" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 89:46" />Vuzavaguɗu, ali n wannai ɗai va ku sokongu ka̱ci ka̱ nu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:46">Ko wannai ɗa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:46">Ali n wannai ɗa̱i ka̱ɗu ka̱ nu ka̱ kuka̱na̱ ku kula̱ tsa akina?<verse eid="PSA 89:46" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 89:47" />Vuzavaguɗu, ciɓa a na ayin a vuma kenu ɗa a ɗa i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:47">ciɓa tsu na vu yaꞋin vuma dem vuza vu ukpa̱ ɗa,<verse eid="PSA 89:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 89:48" />Yayi u kuyongo n wuma ko wannai, u ku kuwa̱ ba?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:48">Nini ɗai vuma u kusa̱nka̱ ka̱ci ka̱ ni ku uwa a kasaun? <char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 89:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 89:49" />Vuzavaguɗu te ɗai ucigi u nu u tsu sabaꞋa ba u cau?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:49">Te ɗai uzuwakpani u nu u na vu yaꞋankai Dawuda?<verse eid="PSA 89:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 89:50" />Vuzavaguɗu, ka̱ta̱ vu cinukpa tsu na a shikusai mu ba, mpa kagbashi ka̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:50">n tsu na n ka̱na̱i ka̱ɗu n kawuya ka na uma i a kuyaꞋanka mu,<verse eid="PSA 89:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 89:51" />Vuzavaguɗu, ka̱ta̱ vu cinukpa tsu na irala i nu yi o ku zoꞋoso mogono ma na vu erengi ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:51">a̱ ka̱na̱i ku shika yi a̱ ubuta̱ u na u banai dem.<verse eid="PSA 89:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 89:52" />Tsu cikpai Vuzavaguɗu ko wannai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:52">Tananai! Tananai.<verse eid="PSA 89:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 89" />
  <chapter number="90" style="c" sid="PSA 90" />
  <para style="ms">Katagarda ka̱ na̱shi</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="PSA 90-106">Ishp 90--106</ref>)</para>
  <para style="d">Avasa a Musa, vuma vu Ka̱shile.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 90:1" />Vuzavaguɗu, makyan dem avu ɗa ubuta̱ wi ida̱shi i tsu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:1">Ali tsukaya n tsukaya.<verse eid="PSA 90:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ka̱shile vi ta̱ lo ko wannai</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 90:2" />Kafu vu yaꞋan nsasan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:2">kafu a iɗika</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:2">kafu kpamu vu yaꞋan aduniyan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:2">avu Ka̱shile kaꞋa ko wannai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 90:2">Vi n ugiti ba tana vi n ukocishi ba.<verse eid="PSA 90:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 90:3" />Vu tsu bonoko ta̱ uma tsu na ishi kubuta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:3">vu dana, &lt;&lt;O bono kubuta̱ a̱ ubuta̱ u na uta̱i.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 90:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 90:4" />A̱ya̱ ka̱kpa̱n wa̱ nu i ta̱ tsu kanna ke te,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:4">i ta̱ tsu kanna ke te ka na ka lazai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:4">tsu makyan ma kayin ma na ma lazai.<verse eid="PSA 90:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 90:5" />Vu tsu pura̱ngu ta̱ uma tsu alavu a̱ ukpa̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:5">i ta̱ tsu mita̱ ma na ma̱ tsu uta̱ n usana,<verse eid="PSA 90:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 90:6" />o gbonguro ali a yaꞋan a̱pa̱lu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:6">ka̱ta̱ n kulivi a lumba e ɗekpe.<verse eid="PSA 90:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 90:7" />Tsu kuwa̱ ta̱ adama a wupa u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:7">tsu dagaza ta̱ adama asuvu a usuɗukpi a̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 90:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 90:8" />Vu gere ta̱ unushi u tsu e kelime ka̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:8">unushi u tsu wu usokongi kpamu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:8">vu zuwai u ɗa a̱ ubuta̱ u na ve kene le.<verse eid="PSA 90:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 90:9" />Wupa u nu u jebe ta̱ ayin a wuma a̱ tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:9">wuma u tsu u kotsoi tsa ayinviki.<verse eid="PSA 90:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 90:10" />A̱ya̱ a wuma a̱ tsu ra̱ka̱ a ɗaɗa amangatatsunkupa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:10">ci baci m ma̱ta̱na̱ a̱ya̱ amanga̱na̱shi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:10">n nannai dem ili i na a̱ya̱ a nanlo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:10">a tsu tuka̱ tsu ɗaɗa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:10">atakaci n una̱mgbuka̱tsuma̱,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 90:10">gogoꞋo lo a laza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:10">a̱tsu tamkpamu tsu puwa̱nka̱.<verse eid="PSA 90:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 90:11" />Yayi u yevei utsura u wupa u nu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:11">Yayi u yevei wovon u na wupa u nu u kutuka̱?<verse eid="PSA 90:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 90:12" />PiꞋisaka tsu ci yeve a na wuma u tsu u makyan me kenu maꞋa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:12">adama a na tsu okpo aza a ugboji.<verse eid="PSA 90:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 90:13" />Vuzavaguɗu, bono,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:13">ali n wannai ɗai tsa̱ kuka̱na̱ kuvana wu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:13">Pana asuvayali agbashi a̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 90:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 90:14" />Usana dem yotsongu tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:14">ucigi u nu u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:14">adama a na tsu canana ishipa i ma̱za̱nga̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:14">a ayin a wuma a̱ u tsu ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 90:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 90:15" />Zuwa tsu ci yaꞋan ma̱za̱nga̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:15">tsu ka̱bunda̱i ka ayin a na ci atakaci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:15">tsu ka̱bunda̱i ka̱ a̱ya̱ a na tsu takacikai.<verse eid="PSA 90:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 90:16" />YaꞋan a̱tsu agbashi a̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:16">ci ene ulinga u gbayin u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:16">yaꞋan ntsukaya n tsu me ene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:16">utsura u tsugbayin tsu nu.<verse eid="PSA 90:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 90:17" />Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:17">yaꞋan una̱singai u nu u yongo n a̱tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:17">vu zuwa tsu ci lyaꞋa kelime a ili i na ci a kuyaꞋan dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:17">vu neke tsu ulyaꞋi a ili i na ci a kuyaꞋan dem.<verse eid="PSA 90:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 90" />
  <chapter number="91" style="c" sid="PSA 91" />
  <para style="s1">Ida̱shi a̱ kulu ku vuza vu utsura dem,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 91:1" />Vuza na baci wi a̱ ida̱shi a̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:1">a̱ ubuta̱ u MalaꞋimili dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:1">wi ta̱ a kuvuka a̱ kulu ku vuza vu utsura dem,<verse eid="PSA 91:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 91:2" />wi ta̱ a kufuɗa kudana Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:2">&lt;&lt;Avu ɗa ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:2">m mashilya ma utsura ma̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 91:2">avu ɗa vuza na vi a ku inda mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:2">avu ɗa Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:2">wa̱ nu u ɗa n zuwai ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 91:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 91:3" />Mayun wi ta̱ a̱ ku utuka̱ wu a maza ma uma a gbani-gbani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:3">kpamu wu utuka̱ wu atakaci a na a̱ kutuka̱ n ukpa̱.<verse eid="PSA 91:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 91:4" />Wi ta̱ a kupala wu tsu na motoku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:4">ma tsu pala muku n ni n evelyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:4">vi ta̱ a̱ kuda̱sa̱ngu m ma̱ta̱na̱ a ɗaka vi le.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 91:4">Ma̱riki ma̱ ni mi ta̱ ke ere wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:4">ka̱ta̱ u shamkpa wu.<verse eid="PSA 91:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 91:5" />Vi a kupana wovon wi ili i wovon i na i kuta̱wa̱ n kayin ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:5">ko vishili vu na a kuyaꞋan n avu n kanna,<verse eid="PSA 91:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 91:6" />ko ma̱dukpa̱ ma na ma̱ kuta̱wa̱ n kayin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:6">ko uma a gbani-gbani a na a ci yaꞋan munuka n kanna a kaci.<verse eid="PSA 91:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 91:7" />Uma ka̱kpa̱n i ta̱ a̱ kuyikpa̱ ɗevu n avu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:7">a̱kpa̱n kupa i ta̱ a̱ kuyikpa̱ e kukiye ku usingai ku nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:7">ama avu ko ili yi a̱ kuciya̱ wu ba.<verse eid="PSA 91:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 91:8" />Vi ta̱ a ku inda le n a̱shi a̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:8">vu ene tsu na a kutakacika aza asuvawuya.<verse eid="PSA 91:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 91:9" />A na wo okpoi avu vu danai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:9">Vuzavaguɗu ɗa ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:9">MalaꞋimili kpamu ubuta̱ wi ida̱shi i va̱.<verse eid="PSA 91:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 91:10" />Babu ma̱dukpa̱ ma na ma̱ kuciya̱ wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:10">ko kpamu ili i gbani-gbani i na i kuyaꞋan ɗevu n kpaꞋa ku nu.<verse eid="PSA 91:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 91:11" />Vuzavaguɗu wi ta̱ a kuzuwa alingata a̱ ni inda wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:11">kpamu i ta̱ e kere wu a̱ ubuta̱ u na vu banai dem,<verse eid="PSA 91:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 91:12" />i ta̱ e kukeɓe wu e ekiye e le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:12">adama a na ka̱ ta̱ vu ta̱ɗa̱tsa̱ a katali ba.<verse eid="PSA 91:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 91:13" />Vi ta̱ a kudasa ikawu m megu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:13">vi ta̱ a kudasa ikawu yi utsura n oko o tsukono.<verse eid="PSA 91:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 91:14" />adama a na u dana ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:14">&lt;&lt;Mi ta̱ a ki isa aza a na a cigai mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:14">mi ta̱ a ku inda aza a na e yeve mu.<verse eid="PSA 91:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 91:15" />Makyan ma na baci u ɗekei mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:15">mi ta̱ a̱ ku ushuku ku yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:15">mi ta̱ o kuyongo n a̱yi makyan ma na wi o kusoꞋo atakaci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:15">mi ta̱ a ku isa yi, ka̱ta̱ n neke yi tsugbayin.<verse eid="PSA 91:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 91:16" />Mi ta̱ a kuzuwa wuma u ni u geshe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:16">mayun tana mi ta̱ a ku wawa yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 91:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 91" />
  <chapter number="92" style="c" sid="PSA 92" />
  <para style="s1">Ishipa i kucikpa</para>
  <para style="d">Vishipa. Adama a kanna ka Ashibi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 92:1" />Ili singai i ɗa a cikpa Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:1">a canana ishipa a kula ku Ka̱shile MalaꞋimili.<verse eid="PSA 92:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 92:2" />Ili i singai i ɗa a sala ucigi u nu u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba n usana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:2">ma̱riki ma̱ nu n kayin<verse eid="PSA 92:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 92:3" />n ili yi iwashi yi umolu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:3">n ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ku umolu ku ugaꞋin.<verse eid="PSA 92:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 92:4" />Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:4">ulinga u gbayin u nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:4">u tsu zuwa mu ta̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ ka̱u,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 92:4">adama ili i na vu yaꞋin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:4">mi ta̱ ishipa i ma̱za̱nga̱.<verse eid="PSA 92:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 92:5" />Vuzavaguɗu, n yiɗa̱i a kugisanku ulinga u gbayin u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:5">kusheshe ku nu ki ta̱ n atakaci e kuyeve.<verse eid="PSA 92:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 92:6" />Ili i yoku i ɗa na i na kalau ki e kuyeve ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:6">kpamu ka̱ta̱m ki a kufuɗa ku zuwaka ba,<verse eid="PSA 92:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 92:7" />a na wo okpoi aza asuvawuya i ta̱ o kugbonguro tsu mita̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:7">aza a na i a kuyaꞋan ka gbani-gbani a̱ kuciya̱ uciyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 92:7">n nannai dem i ta̱ a ku una le ra̱ka̱-ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 92:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 92:8" />Adama a na avu, Vuzavaguɗu ɗa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 92:8">MalaꞋimili ko wannai.<verse eid="PSA 92:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 92:9" />Mayun, Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:9">irala i nu yi ta̱ a̱ ku kuwa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:9">i ta̱ a ku kuwacuwa aza a kuyaꞋan ka gbani-gbani.<verse eid="PSA 92:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 92:10" />Vu zuwai mu n tsurukpai tsu kanama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:10">vu zuwakai mu una̱singai m ma̱za̱nga̱.<verse eid="PSA 92:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 92:11" />A̱shi a̱ va̱ ene ta̱ tsu na irala i va̱ i yikpa̱i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:11">m pana ta̱ ma̱shi ma uma a gbani-gbani.<verse eid="PSA 92:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 92:12" />Aza a usuɓi i ta̱ o kutopo tsu nshuwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:12">o kugbonguro tsu nɗanga n sida a Lebano,<verse eid="PSA 92:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 92:13" />n na a̱ shikpa̱i a kpaꞋa ku Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:13">i ta̱ a kulyaꞋa kelime a kpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu.<verse eid="PSA 92:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 92:14" />Aza a na i a kumatsa n tsukutsa ci le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:14">makyan dem i ta̱ o kuyongo n kuta̱nu n tsuloboi.<verse eid="PSA 92:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 92:15" />A kusala Vuzavaguɗu wi ta̱ n usuɓi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:15">a̱yi na wi e kere mu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 92:15">wi n unushi ba.<verse eid="PSA 92:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 92" />
  <chapter number="93" style="c" sid="PSA 93" />
  <para style="s1">Ka̱shile mogono maꞋa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 93:1" />Vuzavaguɗu wi ta̱ o tsugono,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:1">wi ta̱ n tsugbayin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:1">Vuzavaguɗu wi ta̱ n tsugbayin kpamu wi ta̱ n utsura</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 93:1">Vu zuwa ta̱ aduniya a̱ ubuta̱ u na i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:1">i tana a̱ kugba̱ɗa̱ ba.<verse eid="PSA 93:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 93:2" />Vuzavaguɗu, kakuba ko tsugono ka̱ nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:2">ka yaꞋan ta̱ ushikpi mayin ali n ugiti ɗe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:2">vi ta̱ lo ali n ugiti.<verse eid="PSA 93:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 93:3" />Vuzavaguɗu, aɓau a̱ ɗa̱nga̱ ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:3">aɓau a̱ ɗa̱ngusa̱ ta̱ a̱la̱ka̱tsu e le</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:3">i ta̱ a̱ kuvuzukpa sa n yura̱.<verse eid="PSA 93:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 93:4" />Vuzavaguɗu wi ta̱ o tsugono gaɗi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:4">tsugono ci ni ci ta̱ n tsugbayin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:4">tsu laꞋa ta̱ yura̱ ya aɓau a mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:4">tsu laꞋi utsura wo oroꞋo a̱ mini.<verse eid="PSA 93:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 93:5" />Vuzavaguɗu, wila̱ u kadanshi u nu u shamgba ta̱ n utsura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:5">kpaꞋa ku nu ki ta̱ ciɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:5">ko wannai.<verse eid="PSA 93:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 93" />
  <chapter number="94" style="c" sid="PSA 94" />
  <para style="s1">Ka̱shile ki a kuvaruku uma a̱ ni ba</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 94:1" />Vuzavaguɗu, avu Ka̱shile ka kutsupa ili i na a yaꞋin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:1">Ka̱shile avu na vu tsu tsupa ili i na a yaꞋin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:1">utuka̱ wupa u nu,<verse eid="PSA 94:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 94:2" />kayaꞋinkafada ka aduniyan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:2">ɗa̱nga̱ vu tsupa aza a̱ra̱ɗi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:2">ili i na yu untsai le.<verse eid="PSA 94:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 94:3" />Ali n wannai ɗai aza a gbani-gbani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:3">a kulyaꞋa kelime n kuyaꞋan ma̱za̱nga̱?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:3">Ali n wannai ɗai, Vuzavaguɗu?<verse eid="PSA 94:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 94:4" />Ali n wannai ɗai a̱ kuka̱na̱ ku dansa kavama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:4">ali n wannai ɗai aza asuvawuya a kulyaꞋa kelime n a̱ra̱ɗi?<verse eid="PSA 94:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 94:5" />Vuzavaguɗu, i ta̱ o ku yokumo uma a̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:5">o kudoro uma a̱ nu ili yi uka̱ni i nu.<verse eid="PSA 94:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 94:6" />A ku una agapa a̱ma̱ci, n omoci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:6">nu mkpaꞋan kpamu,<verse eid="PSA 94:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 94:7" />a kudana, &lt;&lt;Vuzavaguɗu wi e kene tsu ba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:7">Ka̱shile ka Yakubu ka zuwaka n ili i na yi lo a̱ kugita̱ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 94:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 94:8" />Niniɗai yi okpoi a̱ta̱m,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:8">alau wannai ɗai i ku gbojo?<verse eid="PSA 94:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 94:9" />Ka̱shile ka na ka yaꞋin atsuvu, a̱yi wi a kupana ba?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:9">Ka̱shile ka na ka yaꞋin a̱shi a̱yi wi e kene ba?<verse eid="PSA 94:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 94:10" />A̱yi ɗa wi o kutono n uduniyan u na u buwai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:10">wi a kutakacika le ba?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:10">A̱yi na wi a kupiꞋisaka uma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:10">wi n kuyeve ba?<verse eid="PSA 94:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 94:11" />Vuzavaguɗu u yeve ta̱ kusheshe ku vuma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:11">u yeve ta̱ kusheshe ku ni gbani ɗa.<verse eid="PSA 94:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 94:12" />Vuzavaguɗu, vuza vu ma̱za̱nga̱ ɗa vuza na vu gbarai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:12">vuza na vi a kupiꞋisaka wila̱ u nu,<verse eid="PSA 94:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 94:13" />Adama a na u yongo asuvu a̱ ida̱shi a ayin atakaci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:13">ali a̱ ga̱va̱ka̱i aza asuvawuya asaun.<verse eid="PSA 94:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 94:14" />Adama a na Vuzavaguɗu wi a ku iwan uma a̱ ni ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:14">wi tana a̱ ku ka̱sukpa̱ uma a̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:14">ili yi uka̱ni i ni ba,<verse eid="PSA 94:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 94:15" />KuyaꞋan ka afada ki ta̱ o kubono a̱ ubuta̱ wa aza a usuɓi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:15">aza e mejege i ta̱ a̱ kushuku n a ɗa.<verse eid="PSA 94:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 94:16" />Yayi u kushamkpa ka mu u yaꞋan tsurala n aza a gbani-gbani?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:16">Yayi u kuɓa̱nka̱ mu adama a na n takacika aza a gbani-gbani?<verse eid="PSA 94:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 94:17" />Ishi baci Vuzavaguɗu u ɓa̱nka̱ mu ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:17">a na gogo na n yawa ta̱ ɗe a̱ ubuta̱ wa̱ a̱kpisa̱.<verse eid="PSA 94:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 94:18" />N danai, &lt;&lt;Mi ta̱ ukuna u kuyikpa̱,&gt;&gt; ama Vuzavaguɗu, ucigi u nu u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba u keɗe mu ta̱.<verse eid="PSA 94:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 94:19" />Ana atakaci a yaꞋin mu a̱bunda̱i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:19">ɗa vu kparasai mu, vu zuwai mu n yaꞋin ma̱za̱nga̱.<verse eid="PSA 94:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 94:20" />Wi ta̱ a kuyaꞋan vu ɓolongu tsugono n aza a gbani-gbani?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:20">Ko n aza a na a tsu zuwa wila̱ u kavama?<verse eid="PSA 94:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 94:21" />O tsu foɓusoko ta̱ uma a usuɓi ka gbani-gbani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:21">a tsu kiɗaka ta̱ vuza vu babu unushi afada a̱ ukpa̱.<verse eid="PSA 94:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 94:22" />Ama Vuzavaguɗu u tsu ere mu ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:22">Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱ a̱yi ɗa ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku u va̱.<verse eid="PSA 94:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 94:23" />A̱yi ɗa u kutakacika le adama a kawuya ke le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:23">wu una le adama a unushi u le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:23">Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu ki ta̱ a ku una le.<verse eid="PSA 94:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 94" />
  <chapter number="95" style="c" sid="PSA 95" />
  <para style="s1">Ishipa i kucikpa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 95:1" />Ta̱wa̱i ci yaꞋan ishipa i ma̱za̱nga̱ u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:1">ci cananai ishipa i ma̱za̱nga̱ u katali ka wishi ka̱ tsu.<verse eid="PSA 95:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 95:2" />YaꞋan tsu ta̱wa̱ e kelime ka̱ ni n kucikpa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:2">ci cananai ishipa i ma̱za̱nga̱ n kucikpa.<verse eid="PSA 95:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 95:3" />Adama a na Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka gbayin kaꞋa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:3">mogono ma gbayin maꞋa wa̱ a̱ma̱li ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 95:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 95:4" />Wi ta̱ o tsugono tsa aduniyan ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:4">a ɗaka va aɓatsu atali a kubana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:4">a nsasan mu ugaɗi.<verse eid="PSA 95:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 95:5" />Mala ma̱ ni maꞋa, adama a na a̱yi ɗa u yaꞋin maꞋa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:5">n ekiye a̱ ni a ɗa u yaꞋin iɗika i ɗekpu.<verse eid="PSA 95:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 95:6" />Ta̱wa̱i tsu kuɗa̱ngi ci yaꞋankai ni a̱ga̱nda̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:6">yaꞋan tsu kuɗa̱ngu e kelime,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:6">ka Vuzavaguɗu, vuza na u yaꞋin tsu.<verse eid="PSA 95:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 95:7" />Adama a na a̱yi ɗa Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:7">a̱tsu ɗa uma a na wi a kuguɓa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:7">a̱tsu ɗa ushiga wu nkyon u na wi a̱ kula̱na̱.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:7">I pana baci ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ka̱ ni anana,<verse eid="PSA 95:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 95:8" />ka̱ta̱ i yaꞋan ugbami u kaci tsu na ikaya i ɗa̱ i yaꞋin a Mariba ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:8">tsu na a yaꞋin e meremune,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:8">ma Masaha a kanna ka nanlo ba,<verse eid="PSA 95:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 95:9" />taɗe o tonoi mu kune-kune</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:9">ɗa o kondoi mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:9">ko a na wo okpoi ene ta̱ ili i na n yaꞋin adama e le.<verse eid="PSA 95:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 95:10" />Ali a̱ya̱ amangere mpa a wupa n tsukaya tsu nanlo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:10">n danai &lt;&lt;A̱ɗu a uma a nanlo i wa̱ a̱ va̱ ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:10">kpamu e yeve uye u va̱ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 95:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 95:11" />Adama a nannai n kucina ta̱ a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka wupa u va̱,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">95:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:20-23">Mkc 14:20-23</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 1:34-36">Wil 1:34-36</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 4:3">A Ib 4:3</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:11">n danai, &lt;&lt;I a ku uwa a̱ ubuta̱ u kuvuka u va̱ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 95:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 95" />
  <chapter number="96" style="c" sid="PSA 96" />
  <para style="s1">YaꞋin ishipa i savu u Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 16:23-33">1 Ar 16:23-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 96:1" />Cananai ishipa i savu u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:1">cananai ishipa u Vuzavaguɗu aduniyan ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 96:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 96:2" />Cananai ishipa u Vuzavaguɗu, cikpai kula ku ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:2">i sala ukuna u wishi u ni kanna lakam.<verse eid="PSA 96:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 96:3" />Salai tsugbayin ci ni a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ku uduniyan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:3">n ulinga wi ili i mereve i na u yaꞋin a̱ ubuta̱ u uma ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 96:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 96:4" />Adama a na Vuzavaguɗu vuza tsugbayin ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:4">mayun ɗa a cikpa yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:4">mayun ɗa kpamu a laꞋa n kupana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:4">wovon u ni n a̱ma̱li ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 96:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 96:5" />Adama a na a̱ma̱li aduniyan ra̱ka̱ ili i gbani ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:5">ama Vuzavaguɗu a̱yi ɗa u yaꞋin gaɗi.<verse eid="PSA 96:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 96:6" />Ucikpi n tsugbayin ci ta̱ uka̱ra̱Ꞌi n a̱yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:6">utsura n ugaꞋin u shana ta̱ ubuta̱ wu ida̱shi i ciɗa i ni.<verse eid="PSA 96:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 96:7" />Nekei Vuzavaguɗu tsugbayin, a̱ɗa̱ uma aduniyan ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:7">cikpai Vuzavaguɗu adama a tsugbayin n utsura u ni.<verse eid="PSA 96:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 96:8" />Nekei kula ku Vuzavaguɗu tsugbayin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:8">tuka̱i n kuneꞋe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:8">i uwa punu a ulanga u kpaꞋa ku ni,<verse eid="PSA 96:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 96:9" />i kuɗa̱ngu e kelime ka Vuzavaguɗu n ugaꞋin u ciɗa u ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:9">i jeꞋeke ikyamba e kelime ka̱ ni a̱ɗa̱ aduniyan ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 96:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 96:10" />Dansai a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ku uduniyan, &lt;&lt;Vuzavaguɗu wi ta̱ o tsugono,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:10">aduniyan a shamgba ta̱ mayin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:10">i a̱ ku gba̱ɗa̱ ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:10">wi ta̱ a kuyaꞋanka uma afada derere.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 96:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 96:11" />YaꞋan gaɗi u yaꞋan ma̱za̱nga̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:11">ka̱ta̱ iɗika i yaꞋan ma̱za̱nga̱ feu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:11">yaꞋan mala ma yaꞋan yura̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:11">n ili i na yi punu ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 96:11" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 96:12" />YaꞋan a̱pula̱ka̱ a yaꞋan ma̱za̱nga̱ n ili i na yi punu ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 96:12">yaꞋan nɗanga n kutsun ra̱ka̱ n yaꞋan ishipa i ma̱za̱nga̱,<verse eid="PSA 96:12" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 96:13" />e kelime ka Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:13">adama a na wi ta̱ a̱ kuta̱wa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:13">wi ta̱ a̱ kuta̱wa̱ u yaꞋanka aduniyan afada,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 96:13">wi ta̱ a kuyaꞋanka aduniyan afada a usuɓi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:13">n kuyaꞋan ka afada e mejege u uma ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 96:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 96" />
  <chapter number="97" style="c" sid="PSA 97" />
  <para style="s1">Ka̱shile kaꞋa vuza tsugono ra̱ka̱</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 97:1" />Vuzavaguɗu mogono maꞋa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:1">yaꞋan iɗika i yaꞋan ma̱za̱nga̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:1">yaꞋan uma a na i a iga̱Ꞌin i mala a yaꞋan ma̱za̱nga̱,<verse eid="PSA 97:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 97:2" />Eleshu n ka̱yimbi a̱ ka̱ra̱Ꞌi ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:2">n usuɓi n kamayun kaꞋa kumiꞋi ku kakuba ko tsugono ci ni.<verse eid="PSA 97:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 97:3" />Akina a kuwala e kelime ka̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:3">o kusongu irala i ni i na yi uka̱ra̱Ꞌi n a̱yi.<verse eid="PSA 97:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 97:4" />Ulaɗi u ni wa akana ta̱ aduniyan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:4">aduniyan tana enei ɗa e jeꞋekei ikyamba.<verse eid="PSA 97:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 97:5" />Nsasan n derikpei e kelime ka Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:5">tsa abashi ishigi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:5">e kelime ka Vuzavaguɗu ka aduniyan ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 97:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 97:6" />Gaɗi wi ta̱ a kusala usuɓi u ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:6">uma ra̱ka̱ i ta̱ e kene tsugbayin ci ni.<verse eid="PSA 97:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 97:7" />Aza a na i o kutono a̱ma̱li ra̱ka̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:7">i ta̱ a kuyaꞋan wono,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:7">aza a na i a̱ra̱ɗi n a̱ma̱li e le feu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 97:7">Ga̱nda̱ka̱i Vuzavaguɗu a̱ɗa̱ a̱ma̱li ra̱ka̱!<verse eid="PSA 97:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 97:8" />Uma a Sihiyona a panai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:8">ɗa a yaꞋin ma̱za̱nga̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:8">aza a̱ likuci i wawaꞋa i Yahuda a yaꞋin ma̱za̱nga̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:8">adama afada a̱ nu Vuzavaguɗu.<verse eid="PSA 97:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 97:9" />Vuzavaguɗu MalaꞋimili,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:9">avu ɗa vi a kulyaꞋa tsugono tsa aduniyan ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:9">vu laꞋa ta̱ a̱ma̱li ra̱ka̱ tsugbayin.<verse eid="PSA 97:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 97:10" />YaꞋan aza a na a cigai Vuzavaguɗu a iwain ka gbani-gbani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:10">adama a na u tsu ere ta̱ wuma u uma a̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:10">kpamu u tsu uta̱ka̱ le ta̱ ekiye a uma a gbani-gbani.<verse eid="PSA 97:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 97:11" />Ulaɗi wa akana ta̱ aza a usuɓi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:11">m ma̱za̱nga̱ wa aza e mejege.<verse eid="PSA 97:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 97:12" />Ra̱ka̱ vu ɗa̱ aza a usuɓi i yaꞋan ma̱za̱nga̱ u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:12">i cikpa kula ku ciɗa ku ni kpamu.<verse eid="PSA 97:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 97" />
  <chapter number="98" style="c" sid="PSA 98" />
  <para style="s1">Ucikpi adama usuɓi u Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 98:1" />Cananai ishipa i savu u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:1">adama ili i mereve i na u yaꞋin.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 98:1">Utsura u kukiye ku singai ku ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:1">n utsura u kukiye ku ciɗa ku ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:1">ku ciya̱ka̱i ni ulyaꞋi.<verse eid="PSA 98:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 98:2" />Vuzavaguɗu u yotsongu ta̱ utsura u wishi u ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:2">ɗa u yotsongi usuɓi u ni a uduniyan.<verse eid="PSA 98:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 98:3" />U ciɓa ta̱ n ucigi u ni u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba n usuɓi u ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:3">a kpaꞋa ki Isaraila.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 98:3">Aduniyan ra̱ka̱ ene ta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:3">ulyaꞋi u Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu.<verse eid="PSA 98:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 98:4" />YaꞋin ishipa i ma̱za̱nga̱ u Vuzavaguɗu, aduniyan ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:4">cananai ishipa i ma̱za̱nga̱ i ɗa̱ngusa̱ a̱la̱ka̱tsu<verse eid="PSA 98:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 98:5" />Cikpai Vuzavaguɗu n umolu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:5">n umolu n a̱la̱ka̱tsu a ugaꞋin.<verse eid="PSA 98:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 98:6" />I lika̱ ishari n avana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:6">i sala adama a̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ u Vuzavaguɗu mogono.<verse eid="PSA 98:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 98:7" />YaꞋan mala ma yaꞋan yura̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:7">n ili i na yi punu dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:7">aduniyan n aza a na i punu ida̱shi.<verse eid="PSA 98:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 98:8" />YaꞋan mala ma ɓasa ekiye adama a̱ ma̱za̱nga̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:8">aginda kpamu ra̱ka̱ a̱ ɗa̱ngusa̱ a̱la̱ka̱tsu a̱ ma̱za̱nga̱,<verse eid="PSA 98:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 98:9" />e kelime ka Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:9">adama a na wi ta̱ a̱ kuta̱wa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:9">u yaꞋanka aduniyan afada.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 98:9">Wi ta̱ a kuyaꞋanka aduniyan afada a usuɓi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:9">n kuyaꞋan ka afada e mejege u uma ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 98:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 98" />
  <chapter number="99" style="c" sid="PSA 99" />
  <para style="s1">Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu wi ta̱ ciɗa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 99:1" />Vuzavaguɗu mogono maꞋa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:1">yaꞋan uma e jeꞋeke ikyamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 99:1">u da̱sa̱ngu ta̱ a kakuba ko tsugono ci ni a Icorobi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:1">yaꞋan aduniyan a̱ gba̱ɗa̱.<verse eid="PSA 99:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 99:2" />Vuzavaguɗu vuzagbayin ɗa a Sihiyona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:2">a̱yi ɗa wi o tsugono tsu uma ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 99:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 99:3" />YaꞋan a cikpa kula ku gbayin ku nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:3">n ku utsura ku ni, a̱yi ɗa ciɗa.<verse eid="PSA 99:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 99:4" />Mogono a utsura u nu vi ta̱ a kuciga afada a na i derere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:4">vu zuwai ukuna u mejege,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 99:4">n usuɓi n kamayun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:4">a kumaci ku Yakubu.<verse eid="PSA 99:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 99:5" />Cikpai Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:5">kuɗa̱ngi e kelime ka̱ ni i cikpa yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:5">a̱yi ɗa ciɗa.<verse eid="PSA 99:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 99:6" />Musa n Haruna i ta̱ a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka anan ganu a̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:6">Samaila kpamu feu wi ta̱ a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka aza a na e ci ɗeke kula ku ni.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:6">a yaꞋin meɗevile u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:6">ɗa tana wu ushuki le.<verse eid="PSA 99:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 99:7" />U yaꞋin kadanshi n ele e keleshu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:7">ɗa o tonoi kadanshi ka̱ ni n kadanshi ka na u shamkpai.<verse eid="PSA 99:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 99:8" />Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:8">vu ushuku le ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:8">vu yotsongi le avu Ka̱shile ka kucinukpa unushi kaꞋa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:8">ko a na wo okpoi vu takacika le ta̱.<verse eid="PSA 99:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 99:9" />Cikpai Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:9">i ga̱nda̱ka̱ yi a aginda a ciɗa a̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:9">adama a na Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu vuza ciɗa ɗa.<verse eid="PSA 99:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 99" />
  <chapter number="100" style="c" sid="PSA 100" />
  <para style="d">Vishipa vu kucikpa.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 100:1" />YaꞋin ishipa i ma̱za̱nga̱ u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:1">a̱ɗa̱ aduniyan ra̱ka̱<verse eid="PSA 100:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 100:2" />YaꞋankai Vuzavaguɗu a̱ga̱nda̱ m ma̱za̱nga̱.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:2">Ta̱wa̱i e kelime ka̱ ni n ishipa i ma̱za̱nga̱.<verse eid="PSA 100:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 100:3" />I yeve a na Vuzavaguɗu a̱yi ɗa Ka̱shile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:3">a̱yi ɗa u yaꞋin tsu, a̱tsu aza a̱ ni a ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:3">a̱tsu uma a̱ ni a ɗa n ushiga u ni.<verse eid="PSA 100:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 100:4" />Uwai utsutsu wa̱ A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin a̱ ni n kucikpa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:4">ulanga u kpaꞋa ku ni n kucikpa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:4">I cikpa yi ka̱ta̱ i neke kula ku ni tsugbayin.<verse eid="PSA 100:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 100:5" />Adama a na Vuzavaguɗu vuza kasingai ɗa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:5">Ucigi u ni u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:5">wi ta̱ lo ko wannai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:5">ma̱riki ma̱ ni kpamu tsukaya n tsukaya.<verse eid="PSA 100:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 100" />
  <chapter number="101" style="c" sid="PSA 101" />
  <para style="d">Vishipa vu Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="s1">Uzuwakpani u Mogono</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 101:1" />Vuzavaguɗu, mi ta̱ a kucanana vishipa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:1">adama a ucigi u na u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 101:1">n kamayun ka̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:1">n canana ka wu vishipa vu kucikpa.<verse eid="PSA 101:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 101:2" />Mi ta̱ a kuzuwaka mayin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:2">n yongo ko unushi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:2">wannai ɗai va̱ kuta̱wa̱ wa̱ a̱ va̱?</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 101:2" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 101:2">Mi ta̱ o kuyongo a kpaꞋa ku va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:2">n ka̱ɗu ka ciɗa.<verse eid="PSA 101:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 101:3" />Mi a kuzuwa a̱shi a̱ va̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:3">a ukuna wi ili i wasasa ba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 101:3">N iwan ta̱ ulinga u uma a kavama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:3">i a kugbaga mu ba.<verse eid="PSA 101:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 101:4" />Mi ta̱ a kuyaꞋan daꞋangi n aza a̱ɗu a gbani-gbani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:4">babu i na i kugbaɓa mu n ka gbani-gbani.<verse eid="PSA 101:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 101:5" />Mi ta̱ a ku una,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:5">vuza na u tsu la̱nga̱sa̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:5">kula ku vuza na i a ida̱shi ɗeɗevu n ka̱bini.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 101:5">Vuza vu ugbamukaci n kugoyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:5">mi a kugbama asuvu n a̱yi ba.<verse eid="PSA 101:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 101:6" />A̱shi a̱ va̱ i ta̱ a kinda aza a̱ ma̱riki a iɗika ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:6">adama a na a̱ da̱sa̱ngu koɓolo nu mpa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 101:6">Vuza na u tsu yongo n kamayun a̱ ka̱ɗu ka̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:6">a̱yi ɗa u kuyaꞋanka mu a̱ga̱nda̱.<verse eid="PSA 101:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 101:7" />Vuza vu ma̱ya̱nsa̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:7">wi a̱ kuda̱sa̱ngu a kpaꞋa ku va̱ ba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 101:7">Vuza vu na u tsu dansa aꞋuwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:7">wi a kushamgba e kelime ka̱ va̱ ba.<verse eid="PSA 101:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 101:8" />Usana lakam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:8">mi ta̱ a ku una uma a gbani-gbani a̱ likuci ya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 101:8">adama a na n loko aza a gbani-gbani ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:8">punu a̱ likuci i Vuzavaguɗu.<verse eid="PSA 101:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 101" />
  <chapter number="102" style="c" sid="PSA 102" />
  <para style="s1">Ma̱shi ma̱ kushika̱ unushi ma vuza na wi atakaci.</para>
  <para style="d">Kavasa ka vuza va a atakaci a makyan ma na u nambai utsura a̱ ma̱shi e kelime ka Vuzavaguɗu.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 102:1" />Vuzavaguɗu pana avasa a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:1">yaꞋan ma̱shi ma̱ kula̱nsa̱ uɓa̱nki ma̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:1">ma̱ ta̱wa̱ wa̱ a̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 102:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 102:2" />Ka̱ta̱ vu sokongu ku mu a̱shi a̱ nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:2">a makyan ma na mi atakaci ba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 102:2">Zuwaka mu atsuvu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:2">a makyan ma na baci n yaꞋin meɗevile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:2">ushuku mu gogoꞋo.<verse eid="PSA 102:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 102:3" />Adama a na ayin a̱ va̱ i ta̱ a̱ kupuwa̱nka̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:3">tsu ka̱nga̱,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 102:3">etele a̱ va̱ a kutakuma n usuɗukpi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:3">tsa a akina.<verse eid="PSA 102:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 102:4" />Ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ ka̱ ka̱na̱ ta̱ mɓa̱la̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:4">ɗa ko okpoi an mita̱ mu uɗekpu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:4">ko mali mi ilikulya n tsu pana ba.<verse eid="PSA 102:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 102:5" />Adama a inka ya a̱bunda̱i i va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:5">n yambai ali etele a̱ va̱ uta̱i e keteshe.<verse eid="PSA 102:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 102:6" />Ɗa mo okpoi an ma̱kpa̱tuwa̱n ma kakamba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:6">an ma̱kpa̱tuwa̱n a kagali.<verse eid="PSA 102:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 102:7" />M asai a̱shi wuma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:7">mo okpoi an kojuronjuron endeꞋin a gaɗi vu kukpa̱Ꞌa̱.<verse eid="PSA 102:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 102:8" />Irala i va̱ i ka̱na̱i kushika mu ali kanna ka̱ɓula̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:8">a kuyaꞋanka mu ma̱ka̱n,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:8">o bonokoi kula ku va̱ ili yi uyaꞋanki wu una̱.<verse eid="PSA 102:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 102:9" />Adama a na n lyaꞋa ta̱ kokomo an tsuwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:9">ka̱ta̱ n satara ili i kusoꞋo i va̱ n kujilya<verse eid="PSA 102:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 102:10" />ɗa vu ɗa̱ngusa̱i mu gaɗi vu ɓasangi mu a iɗika,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:10">adama a wupa nu n asuvu a usuɗukpi u ka̱ɗu u nu.<verse eid="PSA 102:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 102:11" />Ayin a̱ va̱ i ta̱ an kulu ku kulivi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:11">n ɗekpei an mita̱.<verse eid="PSA 102:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 102:12" />Ama avu, Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:12">vi ta̱ a kakuba ko tsugono ko wannai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 102:12">i ta̱ a kuciɓa n kula ku nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:12">a tsukaya a kubana tsukaya.<verse eid="PSA 102:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 102:13" />Vi ta̱ a̱ kuɗa̱nga̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:13">ka̱ta̱ vu sa̱Ꞌa̱ a Sihiyona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 102:13">adama a na makyan maꞋa, ma na va kuɓa̱nka̱ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:13">makyan ma na o foɓoi ma yawa ta̱.<verse eid="PSA 102:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 102:14" />Agbashi a̱ nu i ta̱ a kuciga yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:14">ko a na wo okpoi una yi ta̱.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 102:14">I ta̱ a̱ kusa̱Ꞌa̱ yi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:14">ko a na wo okpoi agali.<verse eid="PSA 102:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 102:15" />Uduniyan wi ta̱ a kupana wovon u kula ku Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 102:15">ngono ma aduniyan ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:15">mi ta̱ a kupana wovon u tsugbayin tsu nu.<verse eid="PSA 102:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 102:16" />Adama a na Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:16">wi ta̱ a kumaꞋasaka Sihiyona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 102:16">ka̱ta̱ wu uta̱ a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka tsugbayin ci ni.<verse eid="PSA 102:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 102:17" />Wi ta̱ a kupana avasa aza a na i n utsura ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:17">kpamu u tsu goyo avasa e le ba.<verse eid="PSA 102:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 102:18" />Ka̱sukpa̱ a ɗana ili i nampa adama a tsukaya tsu na tsa kuta̱wa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:18">adama uduniyan u na ka̱ta̱ a matsai ba u cikpa Vuzavaguɗu,<verse eid="PSA 102:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 102:19" />a dana, Vuzavaguɗu u tsu inda ta̱ aduniyan ɗe gaɗi a̱ ubuta̱ u ciɗa u ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:19">ɗe gaɗi ɗa Vuzavaguɗu u tsu inda aduniyan,<verse eid="PSA 102:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 102:20" />adama a na u pana yura̱ ya aza a na i a tsugbashi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:20">ka̱ta̱ kpamu u shikpa aza a na a kiɗikai afada a̱ ukpa̱.<verse eid="PSA 102:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 102:21" />I ta̱ a kudansa ukuna u kula ku Vuzavaguɗu a Sihiyona</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:21">ka̱ta̱ a cikpa yi a Urushelima,<verse eid="PSA 102:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 102:22" />ana uma nu ngono o ɓolongi a̱ ubuta̱ u te,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:22">adama a cikpa Vuzavaguɗu.<verse eid="PSA 102:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 102:23" />U jebe mu ta̱ utsura kafu tsukutsa tsu va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:23">ɗa u gbatyai ka̱bunda̱i ka ayin a wuma u va̱.<verse eid="PSA 102:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 102:24" />Ɗa n danai, &lt;&lt;Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:24">ka̱ta̱ vu ɗika mu e mere ma ayin a wuma a̱ va̱ ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 102:24">avu na a̱ya̱ nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:24">tsukaya n tsukaya ɗa.<verse eid="PSA 102:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 102:25" />A ayin ɗe, an vu yaꞋin aduniyan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:25">ɗa gaɗi kpamu wo okpoi ulinga wa ekiye a̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 102:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 102:26" />I ta̱ a kukuwa̱, ama vi ta̱ a kulyaꞋa kelime,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:26">ra̱ka̱ vu le i ta̱ o ku oꞋoi an motogu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 102:26">ka̱ta̱ a sabaꞋasa le tsa a kashi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:26">ka̱ta̱ a̱ puwa̱nka̱.<verse eid="PSA 102:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 102:27" />Ama avu vi ta̱ lo tsu na vi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:27">kpamu a̱ya̱ nu i nu uteku ba.<verse eid="PSA 102:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 102:28" />Muku ma agbashi a̱ nu mi ta̱ o kuyongo m ma̱ta̱na̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:28">kumaci ku le ki ta̱ a kutsurukpa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 102:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 102" />
  <chapter number="103" style="c" sid="PSA 103" />
  <para style="s1">Vishipa vu ucikpi adama kasingai ka̱ Ka̱shile</para>
  <para style="d">Vishipa vu Dawuda</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 103:1" />Cikpa Vuzavaguɗu, ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:1">Ili ra̱ka̱ i na yi a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:1">cikpai kula ku ciɗa ku ni.<verse eid="PSA 103:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 103:2" />Cikpa Vuzavaguɗu, ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:2">ka̱ta̱ vu cinukpa n kasingai ka̱ ni ba.<verse eid="PSA 103:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 103:3" />A̱yi ɗa vuza na u kucinukpa nu unushi u nu dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:3">a̱yi ɗa vuza na u kupotsotongu m mɓa̱la̱ n nu dem.<verse eid="PSA 103:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 103:4" />A̱yi ɗa vuza na wa̱ kushiba̱ wuma u nu e kpenle ku ukpa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:4">ka̱ta̱ u kala wu nu ucigi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:4">u na u tsu sabaꞋa n asuvayali a̱ ni.<verse eid="PSA 103:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 103:5" />A̱yi ɗa vuza na wa ku cuwa̱ta̱ngu wu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:5">n ili i singai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 103:5">adama a na a sabaꞋa tsuloboi tsu nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:5">tsu kajimba.<verse eid="PSA 103:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 103:6" />Vuzavaguɗu u ci yaꞋan ta̱ kasingai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:6">ka̱ta̱ u ɓa̱nka̱ aza a na o doroi.<verse eid="PSA 103:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 103:7" />U yotsongu ta̱ Musa uye u ni dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:7">ulinga u ni kpamu wa aza a Isaraila.<verse eid="PSA 103:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 103:8" />Vuzavaguɗu vuza va asuvayali a ɗa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:8">vuza kasingai ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:8">u tsu yaꞋan wupa gogoꞋo ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:8">wi ta̱ tukpa n ucigi u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba.<verse eid="PSA 103:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 103:9" />U tsu ɓarangu ayin tutu ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:9">kpamu u tsu zuwa wupa u ni u yongo ali ayin ko wannai ba.<verse eid="PSA 103:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 103:10" />U tsu takacika tsu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:10">tsu unushi u tsu ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 103:10">kpamu u ci yaꞋan katsupu derere vu unushi tsu ba.<verse eid="PSA 103:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 103:11" />Tsu na gaɗi wi daꞋangi n iɗika,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 103:11">ta ka̱bunda̱i ku ucigi u ni u na u tsu sabaꞋa wi nannai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:11">wa aza a na i a kupana wovon u ni.<verse eid="PSA 103:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 103:12" />Uteku tsu na kasana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:12">ki daꞋangi n ka̱livi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:12">ta u takpai unushi u tsu nannai wa̱ a̱ tsu.<verse eid="PSA 103:12" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 103:13" />Uteku u na kesheku</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:13">ka tsu pana asuvayali a̱ muku ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 103:13">ta feu Vuzavaguɗu u tsu pana asuvayali</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:13">a uma a na a tsu pana wovon u ni nannai.<verse eid="PSA 103:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 103:14" />Adama a na a̱yi u yeve ta̱ tsu na a yaꞋin tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:14">ɗa kpamu wi a kuciɓaka tsu an a̱tsu kubuta̱ ku ɗa.<verse eid="PSA 103:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 103:15" />Vuma dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:15">wuma u ni wi ta̱ tsu mita̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:15">u tsu gbonguro ta̱ u yentukpe an a̱pa̱lu a kakamba,<verse eid="PSA 103:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 103:16" />ka̱ta̱ a̱ sa̱ruwa̱ ɗa baci wunla̱i u fabai le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:16">ka̱ta̱ a cinukpa n ubuta̱ u na ishi.<verse eid="PSA 103:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 103:17" />Ama ucigi u Vuzavaguɗu u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:17">wi n ugiti ba wi n ukocishi ba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:17">wa aza a na i a kupana wovon u ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 103:17">usuɓi u ni wi ta̱ o kuyongo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:17">a tsukaya n tsukaya,<verse eid="PSA 103:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 103:18" />koɓolo n aza a na i o kutono kadanshi ka̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:18">n aza a na a tsu ciɓa kutono wila̱ u ni.<verse eid="PSA 103:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 103:19" />Vuzavaguɗu u shikpa̱ ta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:19">kakuba ko tsugono ci ni gaɗi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 103:19">tsugono ci ni kpamu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:19">a gaɗi vi ili dem.<verse eid="PSA 103:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 103:20" />Cikpai Vuzavaguɗu, a̱ɗa̱ alingata a̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:20">a̱ɗa̱ aza a utsura, a na yu ushuki n kadanshi ka̱ ni.<verse eid="PSA 103:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 103:21" />Cikpai Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:21">a̱ɗa̱ ili i wuma i gaɗi ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:21">a̱ɗa̱ na yi a̱ kuga̱nda̱ka̱ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:21">ɗa yi o kutono kadanshi ka̱ ni.<verse eid="PSA 103:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 103:22" />Cikpai Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:22">a̱ɗa̱ ili i wuma</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 103:22">a̱ ubuta̱ u tsugono ci ni dem.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:22">Cikpa Vuzavaguɗu, avu ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 103:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 103" />
  <chapter number="104" style="c" sid="PSA 104" />
  <para style="s1">Vishipa vu ucikpi u Ka̱shile MalaꞋimili</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 104:1" />Cikpa Vuzavagɗu ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:1">Avu Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:1">avu vuzagbayin ɗa ka̱u,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 104:1">vu kala ta̱ ka̱ci ka̱ nu n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:1">ugaꞋin n tsugbayin.<verse eid="PSA 104:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 104:2" />Vu pala ta̱ ka̱ci ka̱ nu n kutashi tsu motogu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:2">ɗa vu kpa̱Ꞌi gaɗi tsu ma̱va̱li.<verse eid="PSA 104:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 104:3" />Vu maꞋin ubuta̱ wi ida̱shi i nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:3">a gaɗi vu mini ma gaɗi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 104:3">ɗa vu bonokoi eleshu ekeke odoku a̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:3">ɗa vu walai a gaɗi ve evelyu a̱ wunla̱i.<verse eid="PSA 104:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 104:4" />Vu bonokoi wunla̱i maku mu usuki ma̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:4">melentsu ma akina kpamu vuza va̱ a̱ga̱nda̱ a̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 104:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 104:5" />Vu shikpa̱i aduniyan a̱ kumiꞋi ku ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:5">kpamu i kumuɗa̱ ba ko wannai.<verse eid="PSA 104:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 104:6" />Ɗa vu zuwai mala ma palai aduniyan tsa aminya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:6">mini kpamu ma palai nsasan.<verse eid="PSA 104:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 104:7" />Ama a na vu ɓarangi mini ɗa ma sumai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:7">a na ma panai ulapi u kakpanga ka̱ nu ɗa ma sumai,<verse eid="PSA 104:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 104:8" />ɗa me yenei a gaɗi vu nsasan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:8">ma̱ gida̱la̱i a kubana a̱ a̱ra̱Ꞌa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:8">a̱ ubuta̱ u na vu zuwakai le.<verse eid="PSA 104:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 104:9" />Vu zuwakai le kureꞋe ku na a kupasa ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:9">adama a na ka̱ta̱ o doku a pala iɗika kpamu ba.<verse eid="PSA 104:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 104:10" />Vu zuwai mini me yenei a̱ nka̱riki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:10">ɗa me yenei e mere ma nsansa,<verse eid="PSA 104:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 104:11" />e kuneke nnama n kakamba ra̱ka̱ mini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:11">a̱ ubuta̱ u na mkparagi n tsu soꞋo mini ma takpaka le kakuli.<verse eid="PSA 104:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 104:12" />A̱ ka̱kina̱ ka̱ mini ka, ta ɗe nnu n kakamba n tsu da̱sa̱ngu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:12">e mere ma a nsaɓu a nɗanga a taɗe a ci yaꞋan ishipa i le.<verse eid="PSA 104:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 104:13" />Ɗe gaɗi a̱ ubuta̱ wi ida̱shi u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:13">ɗa vu tsu neke nsasan mini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:13">ka̱ta̱ iɗika i shana n kasingai ku ulinga u nu.<verse eid="PSA 104:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 104:14" />Vu zuwai mita̱ mo gbonguro adama a ilikuzuwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:14">ica̱Ꞌa̱shi kpamu adama a na vuma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:14">u ciya̱ ilikulya a iɗika,<verse eid="PSA 104:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 104:15" />ma̱kya̱n kpamu adama a na</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:15">u zuwa ka̱ɗu ka vuma ma̱za̱nga̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:15">m maniꞋin adama a na a̱shi a̱ ni a gaꞋan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:15">n ilikulya adama a na vuma u ciya̱ utsura wi ikyamba.<verse eid="PSA 104:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 104:16" />Nɗanga n na Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:16">u ca̱Ꞌi n ciya̱ ta̱ mini mayin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:16">tsu nɗanga n sida n Lebano,<verse eid="PSA 104:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 104:17" />a gaɗi vu le, taɗe nnunu n ci yaꞋan cikinda ci le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:17">ta ɗe feu mapapadan u ci yaꞋan ta̱ kpaꞋa ku ni.<verse eid="PSA 104:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 104:18" />Nsasan m gbagbaꞋin mi igeve n ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:18">aɓatsu kpamu ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku n rema n ɗa.<verse eid="PSA 104:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 104:19" />Vu yaꞋin wotoi adama a na vu yotsongu ayin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:19">kanna kpamu ke yeve ta̱ makyan ma na ki a̱ kuyikpa̱.<verse eid="PSA 104:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 104:20" />Vu yaꞋin kayin n ka̱yimbi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:20">a makyan ma nanlo maꞋa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:20">nnama n kakamba ra̱ka̱ n tsu uta̱.<verse eid="PSA 104:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 104:21" />Ikawu i tsu ura̱ ta̱ a makyan ma na i a kutambu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:21">a̱ kula̱nsa̱ i na a kulyaꞋa u Ka̱shile,<verse eid="PSA 104:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 104:22" />kanna ku uta̱ baci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:22">ka̱ta̱ o bono a vaku a enle e le,<verse eid="PSA 104:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 104:23" />vuma tankpamu wu uta̱ ulinga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:23">ali a kubana kulivi.<verse eid="PSA 104:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 104:24" />Vuzavaguɗu la̱na̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:24">ka̱bunda̱i ku ulinga u nu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 104:24">a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka kuyeve</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:24">ɗa vu yaꞋin ili i nampa ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:24">aduniyan a shana ta̱ tukpa ni i na vu yaꞋin.<verse eid="PSA 104:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 104:25" />Mala mi ta̱ n wanshi nu mgbayin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:25">tukpa n imacishi i na i laꞋi ku kece,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:25">ili i wuma, i gbagbaꞋin ni i kenkeꞋen dem.<verse eid="PSA 104:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 104:26" />Antsu a̱ mini i ta̱ lo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:26">a kubana n o bonoi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:26">oroꞋo a na vi yaꞋin,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 104:26">adama a na o yongo a̱ mini.<verse eid="PSA 104:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 104:27" />Ra̱ka̱ vu le avu ɗa i a kinda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:27">adama a na vu neke le ilikulya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:27">a makyan ma na a cikalai.<verse eid="PSA 104:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 104:28" />Vi neke le baci i na a cikalai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:28">ka̱ta̱ o ɓolongu i ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:28">vu neke le baci ili i na yi e kukiye ku nu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 104:28">ka̱ta̱ a lyaꞋa a̱ cuwa̱ mayin.<verse eid="PSA 104:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 104:29" />Ɗa baci vu sokongi a̱shi a̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:29">ka̱ta̱ a pana wovon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:29">vu ɗika baci ayinviki e le ka̱ta̱ a̱ kuwa̱.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:29">o bono a̱ kubuta̱ ubuta̱ u na uta̱i.<verse eid="PSA 104:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 104:30" />Ɗa baci vu suꞋuki n ayinviki a̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:30">ka̱ta̱ a matsa le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:30">kpamu vu tsu sabaꞋa ta̱ a̱shi aduniyan.<verse eid="PSA 104:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 104:31" />YaꞋan tsugbayin tsu Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:31">ci yongo ko wannai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:31">yaꞋan Vuzavaguɗu u yaꞋan ma̱za̱nga̱ n ulinga u ni.<verse eid="PSA 104:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 104:32" />A̱yi na wi inda baci aduniyan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:32">ka̱ta̱ a̱ gba̱ɗa̱,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 104:32">ɗa baci u saꞋwai nsasan m gbagbaꞋin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:32">ka̱ta̱ n ɗa mu utuka̱ n ka̱nga̱.<verse eid="PSA 104:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 104:33" />Mi ta̱ a kuyaꞋan vishipa u Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:33">a wuma u va̱ dem,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 104:33">mi ta̱ a kuyaꞋan vishipa vu kucikpa u Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:33">a ayin a wuma u va̱ dem.<verse eid="PSA 104:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 104:34" />YaꞋan kusheshe ku va̱ ku zuwa yi ma̱za̱nga̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:34">ka̱ta̱ mpa tamkpamu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:34">n yaꞋan ma̱za̱nga̱ u Vuzavaguɗu.<verse eid="PSA 104:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 104:35" />Ama yaꞋan aza a unushi a̱ puwa̱nka̱ punu a aduniyan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:35">ka̱ta̱ odoku ene aza a gbani-gbani ba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 104:35">Cikpa Vuzavaguɗu, avu ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:35">Cikpa Vuzavaguɗu.<verse eid="PSA 104:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 104" />
  <chapter number="105" style="c" sid="PSA 105" />
  <para style="s1">Ka̱shile n uma a̱ ni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 16:8-22">1 Ar 16:8-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 105:1" />Cikpai Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:1">ɗekei kula ku ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:1">salai ukuna wu ulinga u ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:1">a kumaci ku uduniyan dem.<verse eid="PSA 105:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 105:2" />YaꞋankai ni ishipa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:2">yaꞋankai ni ishipa yu ucikpi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:2">dansai ukuna wu ulinga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:2">u mereve u na u yaꞋin ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 105:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 105:3" />YaꞋin ma̱za̱nga̱ adama a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:3">kula ku ciɗa ku ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:3">yaꞋan a̱ɗu a aza a na a̱ la̱nsa̱i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:3">Vuzavaguɗu a yaꞋan ma̱za̱nga̱.<verse eid="PSA 105:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 105:4" />Zuwai a̱ɗu a̱ ɗa̱ u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:4">n utsura u ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:4">la̱nsa̱i a̱shi a̱ ni a makyan dem.<verse eid="PSA 105:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 105:5" />Ciɓai n ulinga u mereve u ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:5">nu urotu u mereve u ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:5">n afada a na u kiɗai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:5">ɗa u dansai n una̱ u ni,<verse eid="PSA 105:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 105:6" />a̱ɗa̱ ntsukaya n kagbashi ka̱ ni Ibirahi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:6">a̱ɗa̱ muku n Yakubu nzagbi n ni.<verse eid="PSA 105:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 105:7" />A̱yi ɗa Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:7">afada a̱ ni i ta̱ a ubuta̱ dem aduniyan.<verse eid="PSA 105:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 105:8" />U tsu ciɓa ta̱ n uzuwakpani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:8">u ni u ko wannai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:8">kadanshi ka na vu nekei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:8">a kubana tsukaya a̱kpa̱n,<verse eid="PSA 105:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 105:9" />uzuwakpani u na u yaꞋin n Ibirahi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:9">akucina a̱ ni a na u yaꞋan n Ishaku,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">105:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:7">Ugi 12:7</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 17:8">17:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="PSA 105:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 105:10" />u na u dansai u Yakubu mayun ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:10">uzuwakpani wa aza a Isaraila ko wannai,<verse eid="PSA 105:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 105:11" />u danai,&lt;&lt;Wa̱ a̱ nu ɗa n ku neke</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:11">iɗika ya aza a KanaꞋana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:11">yo okpo ubuta̱ wu uka̱ni u ɗa̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 105:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 105:12" />A ayin a na biꞋi i kenu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:12">kenu gbani, kpamu omoci a ɗa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:12">a iɗika ya,<verse eid="PSA 105:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 105:13" />a̱ ka̱ka̱ra̱sa̱ a iɗika-iɗika,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:13">o tsugono tsu nampa a kubana tsu nanɗe,<verse eid="PSA 105:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 105:14" />u ka̱sukpa̱ aza o yoku o doro le ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:14">kpamu ɗa u ɓarangi ngono adama e le,<verse eid="PSA 105:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 105:15" />a kudana &lt;&lt;Ka̱ta̱ i saꞋwa nzagbi n va̱ ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:15">ka̱ta̱ kpamu i uka eneki a̱va̱ muna ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 105:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 105:16" />U tuka̱i n kambulu a iɗika ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:16">ɗa u la̱nga̱sa̱i ubuta̱ u kuciya̱ ilikulyaꞋa dem,<verse eid="PSA 105:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 105:17" />ɗa u suki vuza e kelime ke le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:17">Isufu vu na e dengei tsu kagbashi.<verse eid="PSA 105:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 105:18" />A̱yi na a shiyai ene a̱ ni n ikani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:18">kuɗeku ku ni kpamu m kogboro ka̱ viyum,<verse eid="PSA 105:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 105:19" />ali makyan ma na kene ku na</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:19">a yaꞋin a kaci ka̱ ni ku shanai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:19">ali kadanshi ka Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:19">ko yotsongi ili i na u dansai va mayun ɗa.<verse eid="PSA 105:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 105:20" />Mogono ma̱ suki a̱ ka̱sukpa̱ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:20">vuza vu tsugono tsu aduniyan wu uta̱ka̱ ni.<verse eid="PSA 105:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 105:21" />Ɗa u zuwai ni wo okpo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:21">Vuzagbayin vu kpaꞋa ku ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:21">u bonokoi ni vuza kula̱na̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:21">ucanuku u kpaꞋa ku ni dem,<verse eid="PSA 105:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 105:22" />adama a na u ɓarangu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:22">aza o tsugono a̱ likuci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:22">tsu na u cikalai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 105:22">ka̱ta̱ kpamu u piꞋisaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:22">nkoshi m gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ kuyeve.<verse eid="PSA 105:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 105:23" />Ɗa Isaraila u uwai a Masar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:23">Yakubu tamkpamu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:23">u da̱sa̱ngi limoci a iɗika i Ham.<verse eid="PSA 105:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 105:24" />Vuzavaguɗu u zuwai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:24">uma a̱ ni a matsasakai n ka̱bunda̱i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:24">u zuwai a laꞋa irala i le utsura.<verse eid="PSA 105:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 105:25" />Ɗa Vuzavaguɗu u sabaꞋi a̱ɗu a irala i le,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 105:25">a iwan uma a̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:25">e sheshei ka gbani-gbani adama e le.<verse eid="PSA 105:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 105:26" />U suki kagbashi ka̱ ni Musa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:26">n Haruna aza na u zagbai.<verse eid="PSA 105:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 105:27" />A yaꞋansai ukuna u gbagbaꞋin e kelime ke le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:27">a yaꞋin ili i mereve a iɗika i Ham.<verse eid="PSA 105:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 105:28" />U suki n ka̱yimbi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:28">ɗa tana a yaꞋin ka̱yimbi a iɗika ya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 105:28">adama a na aza a Masar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:28">a yaꞋan ta̱ ugbamiwasuvu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:28">n kadanshi ka̱ ni.<verse eid="PSA 105:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 105:29" />U bonokoi mini me le mpasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:29">u zuwai adan e le a̱ kuwa̱i.<verse eid="PSA 105:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 105:30" />Iɗika i le i shanai n opoɗo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:30">ali a uwai anunu a ku asa o ngono n le.<verse eid="PSA 105:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 105:31" />U yaꞋin kadanshi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:31">ɗa ka̱kuma̱ ka ayun ka̱ ta̱wa̱i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:31">ɗa nkulaꞋin n shanai a iɗika ya.<verse eid="PSA 105:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 105:32" />U yoꞋokoi le mini ma atali,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:32">a na wo yoꞋokoi le m mini ma gaɗi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:32">n ulaɗi u na wu akanai iɗika i le ra̱ka̱,<verse eid="PSA 105:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 105:33" />ɗa ma lapai ashina a itacishi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:33">nu nɗanga n zaitu n le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:33">ɗa o koɗosoi nɗanga mi iɗika n le,<verse eid="PSA 105:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 105:34" />U yaꞋin kadanshi ɗa ka̱kuma̱ ka akyun ku uta̱i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:34">nta̱ɗa̱ma̱ci a na a laꞋi kukece.<verse eid="PSA 105:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 105:35" />A takumai ica̱Ꞌa̱shi yi iɗika i le ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:35">a takumai ili ya ashina e le dem.<verse eid="PSA 105:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 105:36" />Ɗa u lapai muku mu ugiti mi iɗika n le ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:36">muku mu ugiti mu utsura u le,<verse eid="PSA 105:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 105:37" />Wu uta̱ka̱i n aza a Isaraila</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:37">tukpa n azanariya n azurufa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 105:37">ko vuza te a kumaci ku le u ta̱ɗa̱tsa̱ ba.<verse eid="PSA 105:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 105:38" />Aza a Masar a yaꞋin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:38">ma̱za̱nga̱ n wu uta̱i u le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:38">adama a na i ta̱ a kupana wovon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:38">wa aza a Isaraila ka̱u.<verse eid="PSA 105:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 105:39" />U zuwai keleshu n kanna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:39">adama a na u neke le kulu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 105:39">akina kpamu n kayin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:39">adama a na u neke le kutashi.<verse eid="PSA 105:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 105:40" />O folonoi ɗa u nekei le nroni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:40">ɗa kpamu u nekei le ilikulyaꞋa i gaɗi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:40">a lyaꞋi a̱ cuwa̱i.<verse eid="PSA 105:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 105:41" />U ka̱ga̱lukpa̱i katali</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:41">ɗa mini mu uta̱i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:41">ɗa me yenei a kakamba tsu kuyene.<verse eid="PSA 105:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 105:42" />Adama a na u ciɓa ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:42">n uzuwakpani u ciɗa u ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:42">u na u yaꞋankai kagbashi ka̱ ni Ibirahi,<verse eid="PSA 105:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 105:43" />Wu utuka̱i uma a̱ ni m ma̱za̱nga̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:43">nzagbi n ni kpamu n ishipa i ma̱za̱nga̱.<verse eid="PSA 105:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 105:44" />Ɗa u nekei le iɗika ya aza a KanaꞋana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:44">ɗa u ka̱sukpa̱i le a lyaꞋa ili yu uka̱ni i le,<verse eid="PSA 105:44" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 105:45" />adama a na o tono wila̱ u ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:45">ka̱ta̱ kpamu o tono,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:45">kuyotsongusu ku ni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 105:45">Cikpai Vuzavaguɗu.<verse eid="PSA 105:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 105" />
  <chapter number="106" style="c" sid="PSA 106" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 106:1" />Cikpai Vuzavaguɗu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 106:1">Cikpai Vuzavaguɗu adama a na a̱yi vuza kasingai ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:1">ucigi u ni u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba wi ta̱ lo ko wannai.<verse eid="PSA 106:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 106:2" />Yayi u kusala ili i gbagbain</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:2">i na Vuzavaguɗu u yaꞋin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:2">ko u dansa ucikpi u ni?<verse eid="PSA 106:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 106:3" />Aza a̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ a ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:3">ele na a̱ ka̱na̱i ukuna wu usuɓi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:3">ele na a ci yaꞋan i na yi derere makyan dem.<verse eid="PSA 106:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 106:4" />Ciɓa nu mpa, Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:4">ayin a na baci vu yaꞋankai uma a̱ nu kasingai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 106:4">ɓa̱nka̱ mu Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:4">a ayin a na baci vu wawai le,<verse eid="PSA 106:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 106:5" />ciya̱ m pana uyoꞋo wu ulyaꞋi u kelime</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:5">wa aza a na vu zagbai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:5">ciya̱ n yaꞋan feu ma̱za̱nga̱ n uma a̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:5">ka̱ta̱ n uwa a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:5">ili yi uka̱ni i nu n kucikpa.<verse eid="PSA 106:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 106:6" />Tsu nusa ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:6">tsu na ikaya i tsu i yaꞋin,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 106:6">ci yaꞋan derere ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:6">ci yaꞋin ka gbani-gbani.<verse eid="PSA 106:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 106:7" />Ayin a na ikaya i tsu yi ishi a Masar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:7">a zuwaka n ukuna wu ili i mereve i nu ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:7">a ciɓa n ucigi u nu u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 106:7">ɗa a yaꞋin ugbamiwasuvu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:7">a Mala ma Shili.<verse eid="PSA 106:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 106:8" />N nannai dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:8">ɗa u wawai le adama a kula ku ni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 106:8">Ciya̱ u yotsongu utsura u ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:8">u gbayin u ɗa.<verse eid="PSA 106:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 106:9" />U ɓarangi Mala ma Shili,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:9">ɗa me ɗekpei.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 106:9">U tonoi n ele punu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:9">adanshi iɗika i ɗekpu i ɗa.<verse eid="PSA 106:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 106:10" />U wawai le</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:10">e ekiye a irala.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 106:10">U shiba̱i le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:10">e ekiye aza a na a iwain le.<verse eid="PSA 106:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 106:11" />Ɗa mini ma lyaꞋi irala i le.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:11">ko vuza te a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ke le u laꞋa ba.<verse eid="PSA 106:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 106:12" />Ɗa e nekei a̱ɗu n uzuwakpani u ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:12">ɗa a cikpai ni.<verse eid="PSA 106:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 106:13" />Ama gogoꞋo lo ɗa a cinukpai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:13">n ili i na u yaꞋankai le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:13">a vana odoki a̱ ni ba.<verse eid="PSA 106:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 106:14" />A̱shi a wuya a̱ ka̱na̱i le e meremune,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:14">ɗa o kondoi Ka̱shile a kakamba ka ɗe.<verse eid="PSA 106:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 106:15" />Ɗa u nekei le ili i na o folonoi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:15">ama ɗa u suꞋuki le nu mɓa̱la̱ m gbani-gbani.<verse eid="PSA 106:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 106:16" />A yaꞋin tsurala m Musa a̱ ka̱tsura̱ ka ɗe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:16">koɓolo n Haruna, a̱yi na Vuzavaguɗu we erengi.<verse eid="PSA 106:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 106:17" />Iɗika i ɓa̱yuwa̱i ɗa i soɗongi Datan.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:17">ɗa i ciɗa̱ngi uma a Abiram.<verse eid="PSA 106:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 106:18" />Akina a lyaꞋi aza a na i o kutono le.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:18">ɗa melentsu ma akina me leɓecei aza a gbani-gbani.<verse eid="PSA 106:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 106:19" />A yimai medendem</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:19">ma azanariya a Horebu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:19">ɗa a cikpai ka̱ma̱li ka na a̱ luwa̱i va.<verse eid="PSA 106:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 106:20" />O bonoi a ɗikai tsugbayin tsu Ka̱shile</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:20">e nekei ka̱ma̱li ko iyoci i kobomburon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:20">ka na ka tsu takuma ijanu.<verse eid="PSA 106:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 106:21" />A cinukpai n Ka̱shile ka na ka wawai le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:21">a̱yi vu na u yaꞋin ili i gbagbaꞋin a Masar,<verse eid="PSA 106:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 106:22" />ili i mereve i na u yaꞋin a iɗika i Ham</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:22">n ili i gbagbaꞋin kpamu i na u yaꞋin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:22">a Mala ma Shili.<verse eid="PSA 106:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 106:23" />Adama a nannai ɗa u danai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:23">wi ta̱ a ku una le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:23">ama Musa mazagbi ma̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 106:23">u uwai e mere me le n Ka̱shile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:23">adama a na u sa̱nka̱ wupa u ni ku una le.<verse eid="PSA 106:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 106:24" />Ɗa uma o goyoi iɗika i singai ya.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:24">e neke a̱ɗu n uzuwakpani u ni ba.<verse eid="PSA 106:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 106:25" />O yongoi o mololo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:25">punu a̱ a̱pa̱m e le.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 106:25">Ɗa a̱ kpa̱ɗa̱i kutono,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:25">kadanshi ka Vuzavaguɗu.<verse eid="PSA 106:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 106:26" />Ɗa u kucinakai le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:26">u ɗengusa̱i ekiye gaɗi u danai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 106:26">Wi ta̱ a kuzuwa le a̱ kuwa̱ e meremune,<verse eid="PSA 106:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 106:27" />ka̱ta̱ u zuwa ntsukaya n le</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:27">n wacuwa a uduniyan kakau,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:27">a̱ kuwa̱ a iɗika yi uduma.<verse eid="PSA 106:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 106:28" />A gbaɓai kaci n ka̱ma̱li ka BaꞋalu vu Piyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:28">ɗa a lyaꞋi alyuka a na a yaꞋankai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:28">ka̱ma̱li ka na ki n wuma ba,<verse eid="PSA 106:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 106:29" />a zuwai Vuzavaguɗu wupa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:29">adama a ili i gbani-gbani i na a yaꞋin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:29">ɗa ta na ma̱dukpa̱ ma uwai le.<verse eid="PSA 106:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 106:30" />Ama Finihasu u ɗa̱nga̱i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:30">ɗa u kiɗai kadanshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:30">ɗa ma̱dukpa̱ ma zuwakai uteku.<verse eid="PSA 106:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 106:31" />Adama a ili yi usuɓi i na u yaꞋin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:31">ɗa yo okpoi ili i kuciɓasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:31">ali a kubana a tsukaya n tsukaya.<verse eid="PSA 106:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 106:32" />Ɗevu n kuɗolu ku Meriba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:32">a zuwai Vuzavaguɗu wupa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:32">ɗa kadama ka cinai Musa adama e le,<verse eid="PSA 106:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 106:33" />adama a na a yaꞋanka ta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:33">Ayinviki a̱ Ka̱shile ugbamiwasuvu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 106:33">ali a zuwai Musa wupa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:33">ɗa u dansai wa̱u.<verse eid="PSA 106:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 106:34" />Una uma a ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:34">tsu na Vuzavaguɗu u danai le ba,<verse eid="PSA 106:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 106:35" />ama o bonoi a gbaɓai n uduniyan wa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:35">o tonoi kuyongo ku le.<verse eid="PSA 106:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 106:36" />A cikpai a̱ma̱li uduniyan a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:36">a na okpoi le maza.<verse eid="PSA 106:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 106:37" />A lyukai olobo n ni nkere n le</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:37">a̱ ubuta̱ u wunla̱i u gbani-gbani.<verse eid="PSA 106:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 106:38" />A̱ tsuwa̱in mpasa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:38">ma aza a na i n unushi ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:38">mpasa m muku le olobo ni nkere,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 106:38">aza a na a lyukai wa̱ a̱ma̱li a KanaꞋana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:38">ɗa iɗika i na̱mgba̱i</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:38">adama a mpasa n le.<verse eid="PSA 106:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 106:39" />A natukpai ka̱ci ke le</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:39">adama a ili i na a yaꞋin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:39">o tonoi a̱ma̱li o yoku.<verse eid="PSA 106:39" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 106:40" />Adama a nannai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:40">ɗa Vuzavaguɗu u yaꞋin wupa n uma a̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:40">ali u ka̱na̱i ku ene unata wi ili yi uka̱ni i ni.<verse eid="PSA 106:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 106:41" />U nekei le e ekiye uduniyan u yoku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:41">ɗa irala i le i lyaꞋakai le tsugono.<verse eid="PSA 106:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 106:42" />Irala i le i takacikai le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:42">a gutsakai le, a yaꞋanka le ulinga.<verse eid="PSA 106:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 106:43" />U tsu wawa le ta̱ ayin dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:43">ama ɗa a̱ ka̱na̱i kuyaꞋanka yi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:43">ugbamiwasuvu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:43">ali unushi u le u tuka̱i le n kugoyi.<verse eid="PSA 106:43" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 106:44" />Ama ɗa u zuwakai n atakaci e le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:44">ana u panai ma̱shi me le,<verse eid="PSA 106:44" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 106:45" />ɗa u ciɓai n uzuwakpani u ni n ele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:45">ɗa u panai asuvayali e le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:45">adama ucigi u ni u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba.<verse eid="PSA 106:45" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 106:46" />U zuwai aza a na a ɗikai le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:46">tsa agbashi a̱ sa̱Ꞌi le.<verse eid="PSA 106:46" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 106:47" />Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu, Wawa tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:47">ka̱ta̱ vu ɓolongu tsu a̱ ubuta̱ wu uduniyan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 106:47">adama a na tsu cikpa kula ku ciɗa ku nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:47">ci neke wu tsugbayin a̱ ubuta̱ u kucikpa wu.<verse eid="PSA 106:47" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 106:48" />Una̱singai a kubana u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:48">Ka̱shile ki Isaraila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:48">a tsukaya a kubana tsukaya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 106:48">YaꞋan uma a aduniyan dem a̱ ushuku a dana, &lt;&lt;Ta nannai&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 106:48">Cikpai Vuzavaguɗu.<verse eid="PSA 106:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 106" />
  <chapter number="107" style="c" sid="PSA 107" />
  <para style="d">KATAGARDA KA TAWUN</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="PSA 107-150">Ishp 107--150</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s1">Ishipa i kucikpa u Ka̱shila̱</para>
  <para style="s1">Ishipa i kucikpa adama a kasingai</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 107:1" />Cikpai Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:1">adama a na a̱yi vuza kasingai ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 107:1">ucigi u ni u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:1">ko wannai ɗa.<verse eid="PSA 107:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 107:2" />YaꞋan aza a na Vuzavaguɗu u shiba̱i</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:2">a dansa ukuna u nampa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 107:2">aza a na u shiba̱i e ekiye a irala,<verse eid="PSA 107:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 107:3" />n aza a na u ɓolongi a iɗika kakau,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:3">a kasana n ka̱livi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:3">a uɓon u gaɗi n uɓon u ɗakai.<verse eid="PSA 107:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 107:4" />Aza a Israila a̱ ka̱ra̱sa̱ ta̱ e meremune,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:4">a̱ ciya̱ uye a kubana a̱ likuci i na a̱ kuda̱sa̱ngu ba.<verse eid="PSA 107:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 107:5" />Kambulu ka̱ ka̱na̱i le n kakuli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:5">ɗa a takpai asuvu.<verse eid="PSA 107:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 107:6" />Ɗa a bankai m ma̱shi me le u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:6">a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka atakaci e le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:6">ɗa tana u wawai le, a kadama ke le.<verse eid="PSA 107:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 107:7" />U tonoi n ele n uye u na wu untsukai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:7">a kubana a̱ likuci i na a̱ kuda̱sa̱ngu.<verse eid="PSA 107:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 107:8" />YaꞋan a cikpa Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:8">a dama a ucigi u ni u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 107:8">n adama a ulinga wi ili i mereve i ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:8">a̱ ubuta̱ u uma,<verse eid="PSA 107:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 107:9" />adama a na u tsu neke ta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:9">aza a kakuli mini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:9">u tsu cuwa̱ta̱ngu ta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:9">aza a kambulu n ilikulya i singai.<verse eid="PSA 107:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 107:10" />Aza a Israila a̱ da̱sa̱ngi a̱ ka̱yimbi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:10">n ka̱yimbi ka kpaɓam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:10">aza a ugbashi atakaci n ikani,<verse eid="PSA 107:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 107:11" />adama a na a yaꞋanka ta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:11">kadanshi ka̱ Ka̱shile ugbamiwasuvu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:11">o ogoyoi odoki a MalaꞋimili.<verse eid="PSA 107:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 107:12" />Ɗa u zuwai le ulinga wa atakaci ka̱u,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:12">a̱ ka̱na̱i kuta̱ɗa̱tsa̱sa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:12">kpamu ko ka̱ɓa̱nki.<verse eid="PSA 107:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 107:13" />Ɗa a bankai m ma̱shi me le u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:13">a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka atakaci e le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:13">ɗa tana u wawai le, a kadama ke le.<verse eid="PSA 107:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 107:14" />Wu uta̱ka̱i le a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka̱ ka̱yimbi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:14">n ka̱yimbi ka kpaɓam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:14">ɗa u taɓai ikani i le.<verse eid="PSA 107:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 107:15" />YaꞋan a cikpa Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:15">adama a ucigi u ni u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 107:15">n adama a ulinga wi ili i mereve i ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:15">a̱ ubuta̱ u uma.<verse eid="PSA 107:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 107:16" />Adama a na u fa̱da̱ ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:16">ukungulu wi iyum i shili</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:16">ɗa u kiɗai agbaguratsu a̱ iyum.<verse eid="PSA 107:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 107:17" />Aza a Isaraila okpoi alau</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:17">a uye u gbani-gbani u le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:17">a takacikai adama unushi u le.<verse eid="PSA 107:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 107:18" />Ili i kulyaꞋa dem</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:18">i luwa le ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 107:18">ali ɗa a yawai ɗevu n kukuwa̱.<verse eid="PSA 107:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 107:19" />Ɗa a bankai m ma̱shi me le u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:19">a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka atakaci e le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:19">ɗa tana u wawai le, a kadama ke le.<verse eid="PSA 107:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 107:20" />U nekei kadanshi, ɗa ko potsokpoi le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:20">u wawai le a̱ ubuta̱ wa a asaun.<verse eid="PSA 107:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 107:21" />YaꞋan a cikpa Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:21">adama a ucigi u ni u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 107:21">n adama a ulinga wi ili i mereve i ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:21">a̱ ubuta̱ u uma.<verse eid="PSA 107:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 107:22" />YaꞋan a̱ tuka̱ n kuneꞋe ku ucikpi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:22">ka̱ta̱ kpamu a sala ulinga u ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:22">a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ki ishipa i ma̱za̱nga̱.<verse eid="PSA 107:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 107:23" />Aza o yoku a wala ta̱ a mala n antsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:23">ele aza a tsulaga a ɗa a̱ mini ma gbagbaꞋin.<verse eid="PSA 107:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 107:24" />Ene ta̱ ulinga u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:24">n ulinga u mereve u ni a mala ma uga̱vi.<verse eid="PSA 107:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 107:25" />Ana u nekei kadanshi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:25">ɗa wunla̱i wu utsura u ɗa̱nga̱i</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:25">ali u zuwai aɓau a̱ mini,<verse eid="PSA 107:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 107:26" />a̱ ɗa̱nga̱i a kubana gaɗi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:26">ɗa o bonoi punu a̱ mini ma̱ uga̱vi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 107:26">a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka atakaci e le</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:26">ɗa antiki a antsu a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:26">a panai wovon.<verse eid="PSA 107:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 107:27" />A̱ ka̱na̱i katangalasa n a̱ ta̱ɗa̱tsa̱i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:27">adanshi ma̱ra̱ ma maka le ta̱.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 107:27">kuyeve ku le ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:27">ko okpoi ukuna u gbani.<verse eid="PSA 107:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 107:28" />Ɗa a bankai m ma̱shi me le u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:28">a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka atakaci e le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:28">ɗa tana wu uta̱ka̱i le, a kadama ke le.<verse eid="PSA 107:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 107:29" />U vaꞋankai n wunla̱i wu utsura wa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:29">ɗa aɓau a̱ mini a kpamu a shamgbai bini.<verse eid="PSA 107:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 107:30" />Ɗa a yaꞋin ma̱za̱nga̱ a na ubuta̱ u shira̱i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:30">ɗa u tonoi n ele a kubana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:30">a̱ ubuta̱ u na antsu a ci shamgba.<verse eid="PSA 107:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 107:31" />YaꞋan a cikpa Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:31">adama a ucigi u ni u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 107:31">n adama a ulinga wi ili i mereve i ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:31">a̱ ubuta̱ u uma.<verse eid="PSA 107:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 107:32" />YaꞋan e neke yi tsugbayin o koɓolo ka uma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:32">ka̱ta̱ kpamu a cikpa yi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:32">a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ko koɓolo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:32">ko nkoshi m gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱.<verse eid="PSA 107:32" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 107:33" />U bonokoi nyeneke kakamba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:33">a̱shi a̱ mini tankpamu kayala ke ɗekpu,<verse eid="PSA 107:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 107:34" />iɗika i singai yo okpoi yi mkpaɗi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:34">adama a ka gbani-gbani ka uma a iɗika ya.<verse eid="PSA 107:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 107:35" />U bonokoi kakamba ko okpoi nyeneke m mini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:35">iɗika i ɗekpu kpamu a̱shi a̱ mini.<verse eid="PSA 107:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 107:36" />Ta ɗe u bankai aza a kambulu o yongo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:36">ɗa a maꞋin likuci i na a̱ ku da̱sa̱ngu ɗe.<verse eid="PSA 107:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 107:37" />A yaꞋin vica̱Ꞌa̱ ashina, ɗa a̱ shikpa̱i nɗanga mi itacishi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:37">ɗa a̱ ciya̱i ili n a̱bunda̱i.<verse eid="PSA 107:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 107:38" />U zuwakai le una̱singai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:38">ɗa ka̱bunda̱i ke le ko doki.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:38">u ka̱sukpa̱ ushiga wi ili kuzuwa i le i jebe ba.<verse eid="PSA 107:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 107:39" />Ana ka̱bunda̱i ke le ke jebei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:39">ɗa okpoi ili i kugoyi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 107:39">A̱ ubuta̱ u modoruko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:39">ma̱dukpa̱ n una̱mgbuka̱tsuma̱,<verse eid="PSA 107:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 107:40" />a̱yi na u tsu goyo aza a gbagbain,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:40">u zuwai le a̱ ka̱na̱i ka̱ ka̱ra̱sa̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:40">a kakamba ka na ki n uye ba.<verse eid="PSA 107:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 107:41" />Ama wu uta̱ka̱ ta̱ n aza a yali</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:41">a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka a atakaci e le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:41">kpamu u zuwai muku n le n yimkpai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:41">tsu ushiga wi ilikuzuwa.<verse eid="PSA 107:41" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 107:42" />Aza a̱ ka̱ɗu ka mayun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:42">enei ɗa a yaꞋin ma̱za̱nga̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:42">ama aza a gbani-gbani ra̱ka̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:42">i ta̱ a ku paɗa bini.<verse eid="PSA 107:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 107:43" />Vuza na baci wi n ugboji dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:43">u pana ukuna u nampa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:43">ka̱ta̱ kpamu u coꞋoko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:43">n ucigi u gbayin u Vuzavaguɗu.<verse eid="PSA 107:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 107" />
  <chapter number="108" style="c" sid="PSA 108" />
  <para style="s1">Ma̱shi ma̱ kula̱nsa̱ ulyaꞋi adama i irala</para>
  <para style="d">Vishipa vu Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 108:1" />Ka̱shile n foɓuso ta̱ ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ mayin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:1">n canana ishipa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:1">ka̱ta̱ n cikpa wu n utsura u va̱ dem.<verse eid="PSA 108:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 108:2" />Jimgbai umolu u va̱ n ugogi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:2">tsu jimgbasa kanna.<verse eid="PSA 108:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 108:3" />Vuzavaguɗu mi ta̱ kucikpa wu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:3">a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka uma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:3">mi ta̱ a ku canana ishipa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:3">a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ku uduniyan.<verse eid="PSA 108:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 108:4" />Ucigi u nu u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba u yawa ta̱ gaɗi a̱da̱nga̱shile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:4">ma̱riki ma̱ nu kpamu u yawa ta̱ a gaɗi ve eleshu.<verse eid="PSA 108:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 108:5" />Ka̱shile, yaꞋan ene ucikpi u nu a gaɗi ve eleshu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:5">yaꞋan tsugbayin tsu nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:5">ci yongo aduniyan dem.<verse eid="PSA 108:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 108:6" />Wawa tsu vu ɓa̱nka̱ tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:6">n kukiye ku usingai ku nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:6">adama a na ncigi n nu n ciya̱ uɓa̱nki.<verse eid="PSA 108:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 108:7" />Ka̱shile ka yaꞋan ta̱ kadanshi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:7">a̱ ubuta̱ u ciɗa u ni, u danai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:7">&lt;&lt;N ulyaꞋi mi ta̱ e kupece Shekem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:7">ka̱ta̱ n gisanku ka̱ra̱Ꞌa̱ ka Sukotu.<verse eid="PSA 108:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 108:8" />Giliyadu vu va̱ vu ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:8">Manasa feu vu va̱ vu ɗa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:8">Ifirayimu ɗa ma̱kuꞋun ma̱ viyum ma̱ va̱.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:8">Yahuda kalangu ko tsugono ka̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 108:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 108:9" />Mi ta̱ o kubonoko Mowabu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:9">tsu kasasu ka̱ kuza̱Ꞌa̱ ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:9">Edom wi ta̱ o ko okpo a ɗaka vu ene a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:9">Ka̱ta̱ n yaꞋan yoroli yi ulyaꞋi wa aza a Filisitiya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 108:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 108:10" />Yayi u kubanka mu a̱ likuci yi u ukanji?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:10">Yayi u kutono nu mpa a kubana a iɗika i Edom?<verse eid="PSA 108:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 108:11" />Ka̱shile, avu ɗa vu variki tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:11">Vu kpa̱ɗa̱i kudoku kuwala n osoji a̱ tsu ba?<verse eid="PSA 108:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 108:12" />Ɓa̱nka̱ tsu, tsu shilika̱ ni irala i tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:12">adama a na uɓa̱nki u vuma gbani ɗa.<verse eid="PSA 108:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 108:13" />N uɓa̱nki u Ka̱shile ci ta̱ a̱ kuciya̱ ulyaꞋi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:13">wi ta̱ a kulyaꞋa irala i tsu.<verse eid="PSA 108:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 108" />
  <chapter number="109" style="c" sid="PSA 109" />
  <para style="s1">Ufolu u vuza na wi a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka atakaci</para>
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: Vishipa vu Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 109:1" />Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱ ka na mi a kucikpa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:1">Ka̱ta̱ vu paɗa bini ba,<verse eid="PSA 109:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 109:2" />adama a na uma a gbani-gbani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:2">n aza ma̱ya̱nsa̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:2">a̱ ɓa̱yuwa̱ ta̱ una̱ u le adama a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:2">a kudansa ka aꞋuwa adama a̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 109:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 109:3" />A kanza mu ta̱ n kadanshi ka tsurala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:3">a kuzama mu vishili ko unushi.<verse eid="PSA 109:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 109:4" />Kucikpa i o kubonoko mu n ka gbani-gbani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:4">ama mpa vuza va avasa ɗa.<verse eid="PSA 109:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 109:5" />A tsupai mu n ka gbani-gbani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:5">a na a kutsupa mu n kasingai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:5">n cigai le, ama ɗa a iwain mu.<verse eid="PSA 109:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 109:6" />Ɗa a danai,&lt;&lt;Zuwa vuma vu gbani-gbani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:6">wo okpo yi vuza vu kanananai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:6">yaꞋan vuza na u shamkpa ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:6">u neke yi unushi.<verse eid="PSA 109:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 109:7" />Makyan ma na i a kuyaꞋanka yi afada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:7">yaꞋan a̱ ka̱na̱ yi n unushi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:7">yaꞋan avasa a̱ ni okpo unushi.<verse eid="PSA 109:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 109:8" />YaꞋan ayin a̱ ni okpo kenu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:8">yaꞋan vuza yoku u ɗika tsugbayin ci ni.<verse eid="PSA 109:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 109:9" />YaꞋan muku n ni mo okpo mkpaꞋan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:9">vuka vi ni kpamu vo okpo kagapa.<verse eid="PSA 109:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 109:10" />YaꞋan muku n ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:10">n ka̱na̱ kuka̱ra̱Ꞌa̱sa̱ a ufolu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:10">ka̱ta̱ kpamu o loko le a gali a ana i a̱ ida̱shi.<verse eid="PSA 109:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 109:11" />YaꞋan vuza na wi o kutono yi kutan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:11">wi isa i li i na wi n ɗa ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 109:11">omoci kpamu a̱ pura̱ ili i na u takacikai u ciya̱i.<verse eid="PSA 109:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 109:12" />Ka̱ta̱ vuza u yaꞋanka yi kasingai ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:12">ko u sa̱Ꞌa̱ a mkpaꞋan n ni ba.<verse eid="PSA 109:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 109:13" />YaꞋan ntsukaya n ni ra̱ka̱ n kuwa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:13">ura ula e le a tsukaya tsu na tsa̱ kuta̱wa̱.<verse eid="PSA 109:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 109:14" />YaꞋan Vuzavaguɗu u ciɓa n unushi wi ikaya i ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:14">ka̱ta̱ a cinukpa n unushi wa̱ a̱na̱ku a̱ ni ba.<verse eid="PSA 109:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 109:15" />YaꞋan Vuzavaguɗu u ciɓa n unushi u le ayin tutu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:15">adama a na a cinukpa n ula ele ra̱ka̱ aduniyan,<verse eid="PSA 109:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 109:16" />Adama a na u saꞋawa kusheshe kuyaꞋan ka singai ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:16">ama u tsu takacika ta̱ aza a unambi n aza a yali</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:16">n aza a na a takpai a̱ɗu e le ali a̱ kuwa̱i.<verse eid="PSA 109:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 109:17" />U tsu ciga ta̱ kuyaꞋanka vuza una̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:17">yaꞋan u ɗa u bono wa̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:17">u tsu ciga kuzuwaka vuza una̱singai ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:17">yaꞋan vuza u zuwaka yi una̱singai ba.<verse eid="PSA 109:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 109:18" />U bonokoi una̱wuya tsu motogu ma ku uka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:18">yaꞋan una̱wuya u tono yi tsu mini mo kusoꞋo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:18">u uwa etele a̱ ni tsu maniꞋin ma̱ kusukuya̱.<verse eid="PSA 109:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 109:19" />YaꞋan wo okpo tsu kalaba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:19">ka na a lapangi a kavangatsu ka̱ ni.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:19">tsu kaɗambura ka na a shiyaka ni ko wannai.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 109:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 109:20" />YaꞋan Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:20">u tsupa aza a na i a kushika mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:20">aza na i a kadanshi ka gbani-gbani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:20">adama a wuma u va̱.<verse eid="PSA 109:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 109:21" />Ama a vu Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:21">vuzagbayin ɓa̱nka̱ mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:21">adama a na e neke kula ku nu tsugbayin.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 109:21">Adama a kasingai ku ucigi u nu u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:21">wawa mu.<verse eid="PSA 109:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 109:22" />Adama a na mpa vuza vu unambi ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:22">vuza yali kpamu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:22">m pana ta̱ mɓa̱la̱ ka̱u a̱ ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 109:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 109:23" />M puwa̱nka̱i tsu kulu ku kulivi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:23">i a̱ ku ka̱pa̱tsa̱ mu tsu akyun a na uta̱ni u ka̱na̱i.<verse eid="PSA 109:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 109:24" />A̱ka̱nga̱tsu a̱ va̱ a̱ kuwa̱ ta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:24">adama a kakuli n kambulu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:24">n yamba ta̱ ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 109:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 109:25" />Mo okpoi ili yi izoshi wa aza ishikushi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:25">a̱ tsu fila̱ ta̱ aci e le e enei mu baci.<verse eid="PSA 109:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 109:26" />Ɓa̱nka̱ mu, Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:26">wawa mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:26">adama a ucigi u nu u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba.<verse eid="PSA 109:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 109:27" />Vuzavaguɗu! YaꞋan irala i va̱ e yeve</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:27">a na kukiye ku nu ku ɗa, ku yaꞋin nannai.<verse eid="PSA 109:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 109:28" />I ta̱ a kuyaꞋanka mu una̱wuya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:28">ama a vu vi ta̱ a kuzuwaka mu una̱singai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:28">i ta̱ a̱ kuta̱wa̱ n vishili, ka̱ta̱ okpo n wono</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:28">ka̱ta̱ mpa kagbashi ka̱ nu, n yaꞋan ma̱za̱nga̱.<verse eid="PSA 109:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 109:29" />YaꞋan wono u pala irala i va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:29">a pala le n akashi o wono.<verse eid="PSA 109:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 109:30" />N una̱ u va̱ u ɗa mi a kucikpa Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 109:30">mi ta̱ a kucikpa yi o koɓolo ka uma a̱bunda̱i,<verse eid="PSA 109:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 109:31" />Adama a na u tsu shamkpa ta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:31">vuza yali u wawa yi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:31">e ekiye aza na i a kukiɗaka yi afada a ukpa̱.<verse eid="PSA 109:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 109" />
  <chapter number="110" style="c" sid="PSA 110" />
  <para style="s1">Vuzavaguɗu m mazagbi ma̱ ni</para>
  <para style="d">Vishipa vu Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 110:1" />Vuzavaguɗu u danai Vuzagbayin vu va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:1">&lt;&lt;Da̱sa̱ngu e kukiye ku usingai ku va̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:1">ali a makyan ma na n zuwai irala i nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:1">yo okpoi a ɗaka vu ene a̱ nu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 110:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 110:2" />Ili i na i ɗikai a Sihiyona</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:2">Vuzavaguɗu wi ta̱ o kudoku wanshi tsugono tsu nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:2">vi lyaꞋa tsugono wa irala i nu.<verse eid="PSA 110:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 110:3" />Ka̱bunda̱i ko osoji ki ta̱ a kuciga kuyaꞋan kuvon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:3">a kanna ko kuvon ka̱ nu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 110:3">A uki nu ntogu n ciɗa n tsugbayin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:3">tsu na ciza tsu usana tsu uta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:3">nannai ɗa a̱ɗa̱nga̱ni a̱ kuta̱wa̱ wu.<verse eid="PSA 110:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 110:4" />Vuzavaguɗu u kucinai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:4">wi a̱ kusabaꞋa kusheshe ku ni kpamu ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 110:4">&lt;&lt;A vu ganu ɗa vu ayin ko wannai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:4">tsu Melikizedeku.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 110:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 110:5" />Vuzavaguɗu wi ta̱ e kukiye ku usingai ku nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:5">wi ta̱ a ku una ngono</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:5">a kanna ka wupa u ni.<verse eid="PSA 110:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 110:6" />Wi ta̱ a kukiɗaka uduniyan afada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:6">u shatangu le n even a ikyamba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:6">wi ta̱ o ku ɓososo aza o tsugono aduniyan.<verse eid="PSA 110:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 110:7" />Wi ta̱ o ku soꞋo mini mo kuɗolu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:7">ma na mi ɗevu n uye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:7">adama a nannai wi ta̱ a̱ kuɗengusa̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:7">ka̱ci ka̱ ni a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ku ulyaꞋi.<verse eid="PSA 110:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 110" />
  <chapter number="111" style="c" sid="PSA 111" />
  <para style="s1">Ulinga u Ka̱shile ili gbayin i ɗa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 111:1" />Cikpai Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:1">mi ta̱ a kucikpa Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:1">n ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:1">a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ko koɓolo ka uma a usuɓi.<verse eid="PSA 111:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 111:2" />Ulinga u Vuzavaguɗu ili gbayin i ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:2">aza a na a ci yaꞋan ma̱za̱nga̱ n u ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:2">i ta̱ a kuciɓasa n u ɗa.<verse eid="PSA 111:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 111:3" />Ulinga u ni wi ta̱ n tsugbayin n utsura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:3">kpamu usuɓi u ni wi ta̱ o kuyongo ko wannai.<verse eid="PSA 111:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 111:4" />U zuwai a ciɓa n ulinga u mereve u ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:4">Vuzavaguɗu wi ta̱ n kasingai n asuvayali.<verse eid="PSA 111:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 111:5" />U tsu neke ta̱ aza a na i a kupana wovon u ni ilikulyaꞋa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:5">u tsu ciɓa ta̱ n uzuwakpani u ni ko wannai.<verse eid="PSA 111:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 111:6" />U yotsongu ta̱ uma a̱ ni utsura wu ulinga u ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:6">u nekei le iɗika yu uduniyan u yoku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:6">yo okpo ili yi uka̱ni i le.<verse eid="PSA 111:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 111:7" />Ulinga wa ekiye a̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:7">wu usuɓi u ɗa n kamayun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:7">ili i kutono i ni kpamu i ku ushuku i ɗa ra̱ka̱,<verse eid="PSA 111:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 111:8" />u shikpa̱ kaꞋa ko wannai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:8">a yaꞋan kaꞋa, a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ku usuɓi n kamayun.<verse eid="PSA 111:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 111:9" />U tuka̱i n ushibi u uma a̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:9">u zuwai uzuwakpani u ni ko wannai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:9">kula ku ni ku Ciɗa ku ɗa n ili i wovon.<verse eid="PSA 111:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 111:10" />Wovon u Vuzavaguɗu u ɗa ugiti wu ugboji,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:10">aza a na o tsu tono wila̱ u ni dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:10">a̱ tsu ciya̱ ta̱ kuyeve ku singai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:10">YaꞋan a cikpa yi ko wannai.<verse eid="PSA 111:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 111" />
  <chapter number="112" style="c" sid="PSA 112" />
  <para style="s1">Ma̱za̱nga̱ ma vuza vu Usuɓi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 112:1" />Cikpai Vuzavaguɗu, vuza vu ma̱za̱nga̱ ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:1">a̱yi na u tsu pana wovon u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:1">a̱yi na u tsu pana uyoꞋo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:1">u kutono kadanshi ka̱ ni.<verse eid="PSA 112:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 112:2" />Muku n vuza vu usuɓi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:2">mi ta̱ a̱ kuciya̱ tsugbayin a i iɗika ya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:2">ntsukaya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:2">mi ta̱ a̱ kuciya̱ una̱singai.<verse eid="PSA 112:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 112:3" />Uciyi n udukuyan u kuyongo ta̱ a kpaꞋa ku ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:3">ka̱ta̱ ukuna wu usuɓi u ni u yongo ko wannai.<verse eid="PSA 112:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 112:4" />A̱yi kutashi ku ɗa a ku akana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:4">u vuza na wi o kutono mejege,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:4">u vuza kasingai n asuvayali</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:4">n vuza vu usuɓi.<verse eid="PSA 112:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 112:5" />Kasingai ki ta̱ o kuyongo n vuza na</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:5">u ci yaꞋan kuneꞋe n kuneke okopu n ka̱ɗu ba̱ri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:5">a̱yi na u ci yaꞋan ukuna u mayun.<verse eid="PSA 112:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 112:6" />Mayun wi ku gba̱ɗa̱sa̱ ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:6">a ku ciɓa ta̱ n vuza vu usuɓi ko wannai.<verse eid="PSA 112:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 112:7" />U tsu pana wovon wa arabali a gbani-gbani ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:7">ka̱ɗu ka̱ ni ka shamgba ta̱ mayin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:7">a̱ ubuta̱ u kutono Vuzavaguɗu.<verse eid="PSA 112:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 112:8" />Ka̱ɗu ka̱ ni ki ta̱ a̱ ida̱shi cika, ko wovon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:8">a ukocishi wi ta̱ a kulyaꞋa irala i ni.<verse eid="PSA 112:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 112:9" />U tsu neke ta̱ aza a yali kuneꞋe ba̱ri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:9">usuɓi u ni wi ta̱ o kuyongo ko wannai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:9">utsura u ni wi ta̱ kuciya̱ ucikpi n tsugbayin.<verse eid="PSA 112:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 112:10" />Vuza gbani-gbani wi ta̱ e kene</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:10">ka̱ta̱ u ka̱na̱ wupa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:10">n u lumai una̱ ali u na̱mgba̱.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 112:10">ka̱ta̱ kusheshe ku vuza gbani-gbani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:10">ko okpo ukuna u gbani.<verse eid="PSA 112:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 112" />
  <chapter number="113" style="c" sid="PSA 113" />
  <para style="s1">Ishipa i kucikpa kasingai ka Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 113:1" />Cikpai Vuzavaguɗu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 113:1">Cikpai ni, a̱ɗa̱ agbashi a̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:1">Cikpai kula ku Vuzavaguɗu.<verse eid="PSA 113:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 113:2" />YaꞋan kula ku Vuzavaguɗu ku ciya̱ ucikpi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:2">gogo na n kowanai.<verse eid="PSA 113:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 113:3" />I na i ɗikai a̱ wuti u kanna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:3">a kubana ubuta̱ u na ka̱ ci yikpa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:3">u yotso ta̱ a cikpa kula ku Vuzavaguɗu.<verse eid="PSA 113:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 113:4" />Tsugbayin tsu Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:4">tsu laꞋa ta̱ uduniyan ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:4">tsugbayin ci ni kpamu ci ta̱ a gaɗi va̱ a̱da̱nga̱shile.<verse eid="PSA 113:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 113:5" />Yayi wi lo tsu Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:5">a̱yi na wi a̱ ida̱shi a kakuba ko tsugono ci ni gaɗi?<verse eid="PSA 113:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 113:6" />Yayi wi lo ci nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:6">a̱yi na u tsu za̱lika̱ ka̱ta̱ u la̱na̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:6">gaɗi n aduniyan?<verse eid="PSA 113:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 113:7" />U tsu ɗa̱ngusa̱ ta̱ aza a unambi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:7">a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka unambi u le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:7">ka̱ta̱ u zuwa aza a na i a iɗika a̱ ɗa̱nga̱.<verse eid="PSA 113:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 113:8" />U zuwa le a lyaꞋa koɓolo m muku mu ngono,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:8">m muku mu ngono n uma e le<verse eid="PSA 113:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 113:9" />U tsu zuwa ta̱ madari ma da̱sa̱ngu a kpaꞋa ku ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:9">m ma̱za̱nga̱ tsu vuka vu na vi m muku.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 113:9">Cikpai Vuzavaguɗu.<verse eid="PSA 113:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 113" />
  <chapter number="114" style="c" sid="PSA 114" />
  <para style="s1">Vishipa vu ka̱ɗiva̱ ka kupasamgbanai</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 114:1" />Ana aza a Isaraila a̱ ka̱sukpa̱i iɗika i Masar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:1">kpaꞋa ku Yakubu ku ka̱sukpa̱i iɗika yo omoci,<verse eid="PSA 114:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 114:2" />Yahuda wo okpo ta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:2">ubuta̱ wi ida̱shi i ciɗa u Ka̱shile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:2">Isaraila kpamu ubuta̱ u tsugono ci ni.<verse eid="PSA 114:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 114:3" />Mala mashili me enei ɗa ma sumai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:3">ɗa kuyene ku Urudu ku bonoi n ka̱ca̱pa̱.<verse eid="PSA 114:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 114:4" />Nsansa a̱ ka̱na̱i ci ɗikpangi tsa̱ a̱giri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:4">aginda tankpamu tsu nkyon.<verse eid="PSA 114:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 114:5" />Yiɗa̱i i zuwai ɗa vu sumai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:5">avu mala mashili?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 114:5">Avu kuyene ku Urudu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:5">a na vu bonoi n ka̱ca̱pa̱?<verse eid="PSA 114:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 114:6" />A̱ɗa̱ nsansa a̱ɗa̱ na i ɗikpangi tsa̱ a̱giri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:6">aginda tankpamu tsu nkyon?<verse eid="PSA 114:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 114:7" />JeꞋekei ikyamba a̱ɗa̱ aduniyan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:7">e kelime ka Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:7">e kelime ka̱ Ka̱shile ka Yakubu,<verse eid="PSA 114:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 114:8" />a̱yi na u bonokoi kakpanlai kadaɓa ka̱ mini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:8">kpamu katali a̱shi a mini.<verse eid="PSA 114:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 114" />
  <chapter number="115" style="c" sid="PSA 115" />
  <para style="s1">Ishipa u Ka̱shile ka mayun</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 115:1" />Vuzavaguɗu, wa̱ a̱ tsu u ɗa ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:1">wa̱ a̱ tsu u ɗa ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:1">ama a kula ku nu ku ɗa e ku neke tsugbayin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:1">adama a ucigi u nu u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba n usuɓi u nu.<verse eid="PSA 115:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 115:2" />Yiɗa̱i i zuwai ɗa uduniyan wi a kudansa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:2">&lt;&lt;Te ɗai Ka̱shile ka̱ ɗa̱ ki?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 115:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 115:3" />Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu ki ta̱ ɗe gaɗi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:3">A kuyaꞋan ili i na u cikalai.<verse eid="PSA 115:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 115:4" />A yaꞋan ta̱ a̱ma̱li e le n azurufa n azanariya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:4">ulinga we ekiye u uma u ɗa.<verse eid="PSA 115:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 115:5" />I ta̱ nu una̱, ama a tsu dansa ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:5">i ta̱ n a̱shi, ama e ci ene ba.<verse eid="PSA 115:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 115:6" />I ta̱ n atsuvu, ama tsu pana ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:6">i ta̱ n yunu, ama a tsu tsumgba ili ba.<verse eid="PSA 115:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 115:7" />I ta̱ n ekiye, ama a̱ tsu ka̱na̱ ili ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 115:7">i ta̱ n ene, ama a tsu wala ba.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:7">ogboroli e le a tsu uta̱ka̱ a̱la̱ka̱tsu ba.<verse eid="PSA 115:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 115:8" />Aza a na a yaꞋin le va i ta̱ o ko okpo ci le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:8">ta feu wi o ko okpo nannai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:8">wa aza na i o kutono le.<verse eid="PSA 115:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 115:9" />A̱ɗa̱ kpaꞋa ki Isaraila, zuwai a̱ɗu u Vuzavaguɗu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:9">a̱yi ɗa ka̱ɓa̱nki ka̱ ɗa̱ m ma̱ra̱ga̱ ma̱ ɗa̱.<verse eid="PSA 115:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 115:10" />A̱ɗa̱ kpaꞋa ku Haruna, zuwai a̱ɗu u Vuzavaguɗu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:10">a̱yi ɗa ka̱ɓa̱nki ka̱ ɗa̱ m ma̱ra̱ga̱ ma̱ ɗa̱.<verse eid="PSA 115:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 115:11" />zuwai a̱ɗu u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:11">a̱ɗa̱ vu na yi o kutono yi ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:11">a̱yi ɗa ka̱ɓa̱nki ka̱ ɗa̱ m ma̱ra̱ga̱ ma̱ ɗa̱.<verse eid="PSA 115:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 115:12" />Vuzavaguɗu u tsu ciɓa ta̱ n a̱tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:12">wi ta̱ a kuzuwaka tsu una̱singai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:12">Wi ta̱ a kuzuwaka kpaꞋa ki Isaraila una̱singai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:12">wi ta̱ a kuzuwaka kpaꞋa ku Haruna, una̱singai<verse eid="PSA 115:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 115:13" />wi ta̱ a ku zuwaka yaba dem</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:13">vu na u tonoi Vuzavaguɗu una̱singai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:13">aza a wawaꞋa n aza gbagbaꞋin dem.<verse eid="PSA 115:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 115:14" />YaꞋan Vuzavaguɗu u doku ɗa̱ ka̱bunda̱i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:14">a̱ɗa̱ n muku n ɗa̱.<verse eid="PSA 115:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 115:15" />YaꞋan Vuzavaguɗu vu na u yaꞋin gaɗi n iɗika</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:15">u zuwa ka ɗa̱ una̱singai,<verse eid="PSA 115:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 115:16" />Gaɗi vu a̱da̱nga̱shile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:16">vu Vuzavaguɗu ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:16">ama ɗa u nekei vuma aduniya.<verse eid="PSA 115:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 115:17" />A̱kpisa̱ a ci cikpa Vuzavaguɗu ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:17">aza a na a̱ gida̱la̱i a kubana a kasaun.<verse eid="PSA 115:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 115:18" />Ama a̱tsu ɗa tsa kucikpa Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:18">gogo na a kubana ko wannai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 115:18">Cikpai Vuzavaguɗu.<verse eid="PSA 115:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 115" />
  <chapter number="116" style="c" sid="PSA 116" />
  <para style="s1">Avasa a ucikpi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 116:1" />N ciga ta̱ Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:1">adama a na u pana ta̱ ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:1">u pana ta̱ ma̱shi ma asuvayali ma̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 116:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 116:2" />Mi ta̱ e kuɗeke yi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:2">a ayin a wuma u va̱ dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:2">adama a na u tsu zuwaka mu ta̱ atsuvu,<verse eid="PSA 116:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 116:3" />Maza ma̱ ukpa̱ ma̱ ka̱na̱ mu ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:3">wovon u kasaun u kimba̱ mu ta̱.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:3">kadama n una̱mgbuka̱tsuma̱ u ciya̱ mu ta̱.<verse eid="PSA 116:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 116:4" />Ɗa n ɗekei kula ku Vuzavaguɗu, n danai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:4">&lt;&lt;Vuzavaguɗu, n folono wu ta̱, wawa mu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 116:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 116:5" />Vuzavaguɗu vuza kasingai ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:5">n vuza vu usuɓi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:5">Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu vuza va asuvayali ɗa.<verse eid="PSA 116:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 116:6" />Vuzavaguɗu u tsu ere ta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:6">aza a na o goyoi ka̱ci ke le.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 116:6">A makyan ma na mi a̱ kula̱nsa̱ uɓa̱nki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:6">u wawai mu.<verse eid="PSA 116:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 116:7" />Ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ vaꞋanku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:7">Vuzavaguɗu vuza kasingai ɗa wa̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 116:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 116:8" />Adama a na Vuzavaguɗu, vu wawa ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:8">wuma u va̱ a̱ ukpa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:8">a̱shi a̱ va̱ a̱ ubuta̱ u ku uta̱ka̱ kujilya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:8">ene a̱ va̱ adama a̱ kuta̱ɗa̱tsa̱.<verse eid="PSA 116:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 116:9" />Adama a na n fuɗa n wala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:9">e kelime ka Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:9">a iɗika ya aza a wuma.<verse eid="PSA 116:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 116:10" />Ko a na n danai, &lt;&lt;A takacika mu ta̱ ka̱u.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:10">n neke ta̱ ka̱ɗu,<verse eid="PSA 116:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 116:11" />A̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka̱ uripuli u va̱, n danai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:11">&lt;&lt;Uma ra̱ka̱ a yaꞋin a uwa ɗa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 116:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 116:12" />Ya̱ɗa̱i n kuneke u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:12">adama a kasingai ka̱ ni wa̱ va̱ ra̱ka̱?<verse eid="PSA 116:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 116:13" />Mi ta̱ a̱ kuɗa̱ngusa̱ kuneꞋe ku ma̱kya̱n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:13">tsu ucikpi adama a wishi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:13">ka̱ta̱ n ɗeke kula ku Vuzavaguɗu.<verse eid="PSA 116:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 116:14" />Mi ta̱ e kuneke Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:14">ili i na n kucinai kuneke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:14">e kelime ka uma a̱ ni dem.<verse eid="PSA 116:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 116:15" />Vuzavaguɗu u ɗika ta̱ wuma wa aza a usuɓi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:15">n ugaꞋin ka̱u.<verse eid="PSA 116:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 116:16" />Vuzavaguɗu, mayun mpa kagbashi ka̱ nu kaꞋa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:16">mpa kagbashi ka̱ nu kaꞋa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:16">maku ma kagbashi ka̱ nu vuka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:16">vu shikpa mu ta̱ a ikani.<verse eid="PSA 116:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 116:17" />Mi ta̱ e kuneke alyuka a ucikpi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:17">ka̱ta̱ n ɗeke kula ku Vuzavaguɗu.<verse eid="PSA 116:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 116:18" />Mi ta̱ e kuneke Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:18">ili i na n kucinai kuneke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:18">e kelime ka uma a̱ ni dem,<verse eid="PSA 116:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 116:19" />a ulanga u kpaꞋa ku Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:19">a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka Urushelima.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 116:19">Cikpai Vuzavaguɗu.<verse eid="PSA 116:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 116" />
  <chapter number="117" style="c" sid="PSA 117" />
  <para style="s1">Vishipa vu ucikpi u Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 117:1" />Cikpai Vuzavaguɗu, uduniyan ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 117:1">nekei ni tsugbayin, a̱ɗa̱ uma dem.<verse eid="PSA 117:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 117:2" />Adama a ucigi u ni u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 117:2">a kubana wa̱ tsu wi ta̱ n tsugbayin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 117:2">kamayun ka Vuzavaguɗu ko wannai ɗa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 117:2">Cikpai Vuzavaguɗu.<verse eid="PSA 117:2" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 117" />
  <chapter number="118" style="c" sid="PSA 118" />
  <para style="s1">Avasa a ucikpi adama a ulyaꞋi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 118:1" />Cikpai Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:1">adama a na a̱yi vuza singai ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:1">ucigi u ni u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba ko wannai ɗa.<verse eid="PSA 118:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 118:2" />YaꞋan aza a Isaraila a dana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:2">&lt;&lt;Ucigi u ni u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba ko wannai ɗa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 118:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 118:3" />YaꞋan aza a kpaꞋa ku Haruna a dana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:3">&lt;&lt;Ucigi u ni u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba ko wannai ɗa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 118:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 118:4" />YaꞋan aza a na i a kupana wovon u Vuzavaguɗu a dana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:4">&lt;&lt;Ucigi u ni u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba ko wannai ɗa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 118:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 118:5" />A̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka kadama ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:5">n ɗekei vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:5">ɗa wu ushuki, u ka̱sukpa̱i mu ba̱ri.<verse eid="PSA 118:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 118:6" />Vuzavaguɗu wi ta̱ koɓolo nu mpa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:6">mi a kupana wovon ba.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:6">yiɗa̱i vuma u kufuɗa kuyaꞋanka mu?<verse eid="PSA 118:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 118:7" />Vuzavaguɗu wi ta̱ koɓolo nu mpa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:7">a̱yi ɗa ka̱ɓa̱nki ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:7">mi ta̱ e kene tsu na a kulyaꞋa irala i va̱.<verse eid="PSA 118:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 118:8" />U laꞋa ta̱ n kugaꞋan vu sheɗeku u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:8">a na va ku lemece ke vuma ma̱tsa̱n.<verse eid="PSA 118:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 118:9" />U laꞋa ta̱ n kugaꞋan vu sheɗeku u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:9">a na va ku lemece ke muku mu ngono ma̱tsa̱n.<verse eid="PSA 118:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 118:10" />Uduniyan ra̱ka̱ u kanza mu ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:10">ama a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka kula ku Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:10">ɗa mu unai le.<verse eid="PSA 118:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 118:11" />A kanzai mu a̱ ubuta̱ dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:11">ama a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka kula ku Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:11">ɗa mu unai le.<verse eid="PSA 118:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 118:12" />A̱ kpa̱nta̱i mu ci ishigi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:12">ama ɗa a̱ kuwa̱i gogoꞋo lo tsu na awana a̱ tsu kula̱ akina,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:12">ama a ka̱tsuma̱ ka kula ku Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:12">ɗa mu unai le ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 118:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 118:13" />A yaꞋin tsu na a ku una mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:13">ama ɗa Vuzavaguɗu u ɓa̱nka̱i mu.<verse eid="PSA 118:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 118:14" />Vuzavaguɗu ɗa katsura ka̱ va̱ n vishipa vu va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:14">wo okpo ta̱ kishi ka̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 118:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 118:15" />Ishipa i ma̱za̱nga̱ n ulyaꞋi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:15">yi uta̱i a̱tsura̱ aza a usuɓi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 118:15">&lt;&lt;Kukiye ku usingai ku Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:15">kuyaꞋan ta̱ ili i gbagbaꞋin.<verse eid="PSA 118:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 118:16" />Kukiye ku usingai ku Vuzavaguɗu ku ɗa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:16">ku nekei tsu ulyaꞋi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:16">kukiye ku usingai ku Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:16">ku yaꞋin ili i gbagbaꞋin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 118:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 118:17" />Mpa mi a̱ kukuwa̱ ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:17">ama mi ta̱ o kuyongo n wuma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:17">ka̱ta̱ n neke arabali a ulinga u na Vuzavaguɗu u yaꞋin.<verse eid="PSA 118:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 118:18" />Vuzavaguɗu u gbara mu ta̱ ka̱u,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:18">ama wu una mu ba.<verse eid="PSA 118:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 118:19" />Ɓa̱yuwa̱ ka̱ mu utsutsu wa aza a usuɓi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:19">mi ta̱ a ku uwa punu n cikpa Vuzavaguɗu.<verse eid="PSA 118:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 118:20" />Na lo ɗa utsutsu u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:20">u na uma a usuɓi a ku uwa.<verse eid="PSA 118:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 118:21" />N cikpa wu ta̱ adama a na vu ushuku mu ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:21">vu okpoi kishi ka̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 118:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 118:22" />Katali ka na a maꞋi a iwain</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:22">ko okpo ta̱ kenene ke mere.<verse eid="PSA 118:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 118:23" />Na lo ulinga u Vuzavaguɗu ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:23">ili i mereve i ɗa kpamu a̱ a̱shi a̱ tsu.<verse eid="PSA 118:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 118:24" />Na ɗa kanna ka na Vuzavaguɗu u yaꞋin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:24">yaꞋan tsu pana uyoꞋo ci yaꞋin ma̱za̱nga̱ n ka a.<verse eid="PSA 118:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 118:25" />Vuzavaguɗu wawa tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:25">Vuzavaguɗu neke tsu u lyaꞋi.<verse eid="PSA 118:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 118:26" />Vuza vu una̱singai ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:26">a̱yi na wi a̱ kuta̱wa̱ a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka kula ku Vuzavaguɗu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:26">ɗe a kpaꞋa ku Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:26">tsu zuwaka wu una̱singai.<verse eid="PSA 118:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 118:27" />Vuzavaguɗu a̱yi ɗa Ka̱shile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:27">ɗa u zuwai kutashi ku akana tsu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 118:27">Gita̱i ka̱ɗiva̱, i dara n a̱vuku a nshuwa ekiye a̱ ɗa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:27">a kubana a katalikalyuka.<verse eid="PSA 118:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 118:28" />Avu ɗa Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:28">mi ta̱ a kucikpa wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:28">avu ɗa Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:28">mi ta̱ e kuneke wu tsugbayin.<verse eid="PSA 118:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 118:29" />Cikpai Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:29">adama a na a̱yi vuza singai ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 118:29">ucigi u ni u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba ko wannai ɗa.<verse eid="PSA 118:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 118" />
  <chapter number="119" style="c" sid="PSA 119" />
  <para style="s1">Una̱singai wa aza o kutono wila̱</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 119:1" />Aza a̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ a ɗa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:1">aza a na i n unushi ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:1">aza a na i o kutono wila̱ u Vuzavaguɗu.<verse eid="PSA 119:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 119:2" />Aza a̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ a ɗa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:2">aza a na a cinukpai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:2">n kadanshi ka̱ ni ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 119:2">aza a na i a̱ kula̱nsa̱ yi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:2">n a̱ɗu ele ra̱ka̱,<verse eid="PSA 119:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 119:3" />ele na i a kuyaꞋan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:3">ka gbani-gbani ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:3">ama i ta̱ an nwalu a uye u ni.<verse eid="PSA 119:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 119:4" />Vu zuwa ta̱ ili i kutono i nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:4">adama a na o tono i ɗa mayin.<verse eid="PSA 119:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 119:5" />Ishi baci ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ ki a sabaꞋa ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:5">a̱ ubuta̱ u kutono ili i na u dansai,<verse eid="PSA 119:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 119:6" />mi shi o ko okpo n wono ba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:6">ɗa baci m bonokoi ka̱ɗu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:6">a̱ ubuta̱ u kutono ili i na u dansai.<verse eid="PSA 119:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 119:7" />Mi ta̱ a kucikpa wu n ka̱ɗu ka mayun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:7">A makyan ma na n piꞋisai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:7">afada a̱ usuɓi u nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 119:8" />Mi ta̱ o kutono ili i na u dansai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:8">ka̱ta̱ vu varuku mu ra̱ka̱-ra̱ka̱ ba.<verse eid="PSA 119:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kutono wila̱ u Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 119:9" />Nini ɗai ka̱ɗa̱nga̱ni ko kuyongo ciɗa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:9">A̱ ubuta̱ u kutono kadanshi ka̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 119:10" />N ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ ra̱ka̱, n la̱nsa̱i nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:10">ka̱ta̱ vu ka̱sukpa̱ mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:10">n katsukpa kadanshi ka̱ nu ba.<verse eid="PSA 119:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 119:11" />N sokongu ta̱ kadanshi ka̱ nu a̱ ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:11">adama a na ka̱ta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:11">n yaꞋanka wu unushi ba.<verse eid="PSA 119:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 119:12" />Vuza vu una̱singai ɗa vi, avu Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:12">piꞋisaka mu ili i na vu dansai.<verse eid="PSA 119:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 119:13" />N una̱ u va̱ u ɗa n kecei</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:13">afada a na vu nekei tsu ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 119:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 119:14" />Mi ta̱ a̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ mo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:14">kutono kadanshi ka̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:14">tsu na vuma u ci yaꞋan ma̱za̱nga̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:14">ma̱ kuciya̱ udukuyan wa̱ a̱bunda̱i.<verse eid="PSA 119:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 119:15" />Mi ta̱ a̱ kuka̱na̱ kusheshe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:15">a̱ ukuna wi ili i kutono i nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:15">ka̱ta̱ n zuwaka n uye u nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 119:16" />Mi ta̱ a̱ ma̱za̱nga̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:16">n ili i na vu dansai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:16">mi a kucinukpa n kadanshi ka̱ nu ba.<verse eid="PSA 119:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Ma̱za̱nga̱ a̱ wila̱ u Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 119:17" />YaꞋanka kagbashi ka̱ nu kasingai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:17">adama a na u ciya̱ wuma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:17">u kutono kadanshi ka̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 119:18" />Ɓa̱yuwa̱ a̱shi a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:18">adama a na me ene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:18">ili i mereve i gbagbaꞋin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:18">a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka̱ wila̱ u nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 119:19" />Mpa komoci kaꞋa aduniyan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:19">ka̱ta̱ vu sokongu ku mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:19">kadanshi ka̱ nu ba.<verse eid="PSA 119:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 119:20" />Ili i na n laꞋi n kuciga ka̱u a makyan dem</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:20">ɗaɗa n tono afada a̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 119:21" />Vu tsu ɓarangu ta̱ aza a ugbamukaci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:21">ele na a katsukpai kadanshi nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 119:22" />Uta̱ka̱ mu o kugoyi ku le n a̱ra̱ɗi ele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:22">adama a na n tono ta̱ ili i na vu dansai.<verse eid="PSA 119:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 119:23" />Ko a na wo okpoi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:23">aza o tsugono a gbaɓa ta̱ kaci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:23">a̱ kula̱nga̱sa̱ mu kula,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:23">kagbashi ka̱ nu ki ta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:23">e kusheshe ili i na vu dansai.<verse eid="PSA 119:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 119:24" />Mayun, n tsu pana ta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:24">uyoꞋo u kadanshi ka̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:24">ke ci neke mu ta̱ odoki.<verse eid="PSA 119:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Uzuwi u ka̱ɗu o kutono wila̱ u Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 119:25" />Mi ta̱ ivaꞋin ma̱kpa̱ɓa̱ a̱ kubuta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:25">wawa wuma u va̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:25">tsu kadanshi ka̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 119:26" />Ana n tonokoi nu ukuna u va̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:26">ɗa vu ushuki mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:26">piꞋisaka mu ili i na vu dansai.<verse eid="PSA 119:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 119:27" />Ɓa̱nka̱ mu n yeve ili i kutono i nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:27">ka̱ta̱ n yongo a kuciɓasa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:27">n ulinga wi ili mereve i nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 119:28" />Ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ ka̱ kula̱ ta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:28">adama a una̱mgbuka̱tsuma̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:28">zuwa mu n tsurukpa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:28">tsu kadanshi ka̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 119:29" />Ere mu a uye wa aꞋuwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:29">yaꞋan n ciya̱ kasingai a̱ wila̱ u nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 119:30" />N zagba ta̱ uye u ma̱riki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:30">n zuwa ta̱ ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:30">a̱ ubuta̱ wa afada a̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 119:31" />Vuzavaguɗu, n ka̱na̱ ta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:31">kadanshi nu gbagu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:31">ka̱ta̱ vu ka̱sukpa̱ mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:31">n yaꞋan wono ba.<verse eid="PSA 119:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 119:32" />N ilaɗi i ɗa, mi o kutono</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:32">kadanshi ka̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:32">adama a na vu zuwa ta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:32">ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ ko yongo ba̱ri.<verse eid="PSA 119:32" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Avasa adama e kuyeve ku wila̱ u Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 119:33" />Vuzavaguɗu, piꞋisaka mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:33">ili i na vu dansai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:33">ka̱ta̱ n tono i ɗa ko wannai.<verse eid="PSA 119:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 119:34" />Neke mu kuyeve,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:34">adama a na n tono wila̱ u nu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 119:34">ka̱ta̱ ta na n tono u ɗa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:34">n ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ dem.<verse eid="PSA 119:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 119:35" />Tono nu mpa n tsu uye u kadanshi ka̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:35">adama a na ta ɗe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:35">mi a̱ kuciya̱ ma̱za̱nga̱.<verse eid="PSA 119:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 119:36" />Zuwa ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:36">a̱ ubuta̱ u kutono kadanshi ka̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:36">ba a̱ ubuta̱ u kula̱nsa̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:36">ku udukuyan ba.<verse eid="PSA 119:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 119:37" />Takpa a̱shi a̱ va̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:37">a̱ ubuta̱ wu ili i kavama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:37">ere wuma u va̱ tsu kadanshi ka̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 119:38" />Shatangu kadanshi ka̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:38">u kagbashi ka̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:38">u na vu yaꞋankai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:38">aza a na e nekei nu tsugbayin.<verse eid="PSA 119:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 119:39" />Takpa ka mu wono u na</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:39">mi a kupana wovon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:39">adama a na afada a̱ nu ili i singai i ɗa.<verse eid="PSA 119:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 119:40" />Mpa ɗa na a mali mi ili i kutono i nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:40">ere mu a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ku usuɓi u nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:40" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Kuneke katsura a̱ wila̱ u Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 119:41" />Vuzavaguɗu, yaꞋan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:41">ucigi u nu u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:41">u ta̱wa̱ wa̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:41">wishi u nu kpamu u ta̱wa̱ tsu uzuwakpani u nu,<verse eid="PSA 119:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 119:42" />ka̱ta̱ n ciya̱ ili i na n ku ushuku</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:42">vuza na wi a kushika mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:42">adama a na n zuwaka ta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:42">kadanshi ka̱ nu katsura.<verse eid="PSA 119:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 119:43" />Ka̱ta̱ vu takpa kadanshi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:43">ka̱ ma̱riki a̱ una̱ u va̱ ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:43">adama a na a afada a̱ nu u ɗa n keɗei a̱pa̱Ꞌa̱.<verse eid="PSA 119:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 119:44" />Mi ta̱ o kutono wila̱ u nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:44">a makyan dem, ko wannai,<verse eid="PSA 119:44" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 119:45" />ka̱ta̱ n yaꞋan nwalu n va̱ ba̱ri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:45">adama a na mi ta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:45">a̱ kula̱nsa̱ ili i kutono i nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:45" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 119:46" />Mi ta̱ a kudansa ukuna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:46">u kadanshi u nu e kelime ko ngono,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:46">mi ta na a kupana wono ba.<verse eid="PSA 119:46" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 119:47" />Adama a na n tsu pana ta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:47">uyoꞋo u kadanshi ka̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:47">adama a na n ciga ta̱ u ɗa.<verse eid="PSA 119:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 119:48" />Mi ta̱ e kuneke kadanshi ka̱ nu tsugbayin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:48">adama a na n ciga ta̱ kaꞋa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:48">kpamu ka̱ta̱ n ka̱ na̱ kusheshe a ili i na vu dansai.<verse eid="PSA 119:48" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Kuzuwa ka̱ɗu a̱ wila̱ u Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 119:49" />Ciɓa n kadanshi ka na</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:49">vu yaꞋankai kagbashi ka̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:49">adama a na vu zuwa mu ta̱ n keɗei a̱pa̱Ꞌa̱.<verse eid="PSA 119:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 119:50" />Ma̱za̱nga̱ ma̱ va̱ a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka atakaci</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:50">ɗaɗa uzuwakpani u nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:50">u tsu ere ta̱ wuma u va̱.<verse eid="PSA 119:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 119:51" />Aza a ugbamukaci a yaꞋanka mu ta̱ ulami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:51">ama n vadalukpuka wila̱ u nu kucina̱ ba.<verse eid="PSA 119:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 119:52" />N ciɓai n afada a Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:52">ɗa n ciya̱i uneki u kadanshi.<verse eid="PSA 119:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="PSA 119:53" />Wupa u tsu ka̱na̱ mu ta̱ ka̱u</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:53">adama a uma a gbani-gbani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:53">aza a na a̱ ka̱sukpa̱i wila̱ u nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="PSA 119:54" />Ili i kutono i nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:54">yo okpo mu ta̱ ishipa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:54">a kpaꞋa ku na mi o limoci.<verse eid="PSA 119:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="PSA 119:55" />Vuzavaguɗu, n ciɓa ta̱ n kula ku nu n kayin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:55">mi ta̱ ta na o kutono wila̱ u nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:55" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="PSA 119:56" />Nava ɗaɗa n kiwanai kuyaꞋansa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:56">adama a na n zuwaka ta̱ n ili i kutono i nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:56" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Uneki u kaci a̱ wila̱ u Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="PSA 119:57" />Vuzavaguɗu ɗa upecu u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:57">n yaꞋan ta̱ uzuwakpani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:57">n tono kadanshi ka̱ nu<verse eid="PSA 119:57" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="PSA 119:58" />N la̱nsa̱ wu ta̱ n ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:58">yaꞋan n ciya̱ mapasa ma singai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:58">tsu na vu yaꞋin kadanshi.<verse eid="PSA 119:58" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="PSA 119:59" />N coꞋoko ta̱ n uye u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:59">ɗa n kpatalai n tonoi kadanshi ka̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:59" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="PSA 119:60" />Ɗa n dakakai n la̱nga̱sa̱ makyan ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:60">n tonoi kadanshi ka̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:60" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="PSA 119:61" />Uma a gbani-gbani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:61">a shiya mu ta̱ n awin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:61">ama n cinukpa n wila̱ u nu ba.<verse eid="PSA 119:61" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="PSA 119:62" />Kayin ke pece baci n tsu ɗa̱nga̱ ta̱ n cikpa wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:62">adama afada a usuɓi a̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:62" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="PSA 119:63" />Mpa ka̱ja̱Ꞌa̱ kaꞋa u yaba dem</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:63">na wi a kupana wovon u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:63">n aza na a zuwakai n ili i kutono i nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:63" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="PSA 119:64" />Vuzavaguɗu, ucigi u nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:64">u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:64">u shana ta̱ aduniyan ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:64">piꞋisaka mu ili i na vu dansai.<verse eid="PSA 119:64" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">UgaꞋin u wila̱ u Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="PSA 119:65" />Vuzavaguɗu, vu yaꞋanka ta̱ kagbashi ka̱ nu kasingai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:65">tsu na vu yaꞋin kadanshi.<verse eid="PSA 119:65" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="PSA 119:66" />PiꞋisaka mu n yeve afada asingai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:66">adama a na n neke ta̱ katsura</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:66">a kadanshi ka̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:66" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="PSA 119:67" />Kafu vu takacika mu, n nusa ta̱ ɗe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:67">ama gogo na n tono ta̱ kadanshi ka̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:67" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="PSA 119:68" />Avu vuza singai ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:68">kpamu vi yaꞋan ta̱ kasingai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:68">piꞋisaka mu ili i na vu dansai.<verse eid="PSA 119:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="PSA 119:69" />Aza a ugbamukaci i ta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:69">a kudansa aꞋuwa adama a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 119:69">n zuwaka ta̱ n ili i kutono</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:69">i nu n ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 119:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="PSA 119:70" />A̱ɗu ele a kpanduku ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:70">ama mpa mi ta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:70">a̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ n wila̱ u nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:70" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="PSA 119:71" />UgaꞋan ta̱ a na n takacikai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:71">adama a na m piꞋisa ili i na vu dansai.<verse eid="PSA 119:71" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="PSA 119:72" />Wila̱ wu una̱ u nu u laꞋaka mu ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:72">n a̱kpa̱n a azanariya n azurufa.<verse eid="PSA 119:72" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Ma̱riki ma̱ wila̱ u Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="PSA 119:73" />Ekiye a̱ nu a ɗa a yaꞋin mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:73">o foɓusoi mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:73">neke mu kuyeve, adama a na</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:73">m piꞋisa kadanshi ka̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:73" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="PSA 119:74" />Aza a na i a kupana wovon u nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:74">yaꞋan ene mu ka̱ta̱ a yaꞋan ma̱za̱nga̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:74">adama a na n keɗe ta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:74">a̱pa̱Ꞌa̱ a kadanshi ka̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:74" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="PSA 119:75" />Vuzavaguɗu, n yeve ta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:75">wila̱ u nu derere ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:75">kpamu a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka̱ ma̱riki ka̱ nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:75">ɗa vu yaꞋankai mu afada a usuɓi.<verse eid="PSA 119:75" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="PSA 119:76" />YaꞋan ucigi u nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:76">u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 119:76">u neke mu utsura u ka̱ɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:76">tsu na vu danai kagbashi ka̱ nu,<verse eid="PSA 119:76" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="PSA 119:77" />YaꞋan vu sa̱Ꞌa̱ mu, adama a na n yongo n wuma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:77">adama a na mi ta̱ a̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ n wila̱ u nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:77" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="PSA 119:78" />YaꞋan aza a ugbamukaci a yaꞋan wono,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:78">adama a ka gbani-gbani ka na</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:78">a yaꞋankai mu ko unushi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 119:78">ama mi ta̱ e kusheshe a ukuna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:78">wi ili i na vu dansai.<verse eid="PSA 119:78" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="PSA 119:79" />YaꞋan aza a na i</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:79">a kupana wovon u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:79">o bono wa̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:79">ele na e yevei kadanshi ka̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:79" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="PSA 119:80" />YaꞋan ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ ko yongo ko unushi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:80">a ukuna wi ili i na vu dansai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:80">adama a na ka̱ta̱ mo okpo n wono ba.<verse eid="PSA 119:80" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Avasa a̱ kula̱nsa̱ wishi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="81" style="v" sid="PSA 119:81" />Vuzavaguɗu, wuma u va̱ wi ta̱ a mali ka̱u</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:81">a̱ kula̱nsa̱ wishi u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:81">n keɗe ta̱ a̱pa̱Ꞌa̱ a kadanshi ka̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:81" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="82" style="v" sid="PSA 119:82" />A̱shi a̱ va̱ a̱ ga̱la̱ ta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:82">a kuvana uzuwakpani u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:82">ɗa n danai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:82">&lt;&lt;Wannai ɗai va kuneke mu kadanshi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 119:82" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="83" style="v" sid="PSA 119:83" />Adama a na mo okpo ta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:83">tsu kedele ku ukpan ka na a saki a̱ ka̱nga̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:83">dem n nannai n cinukpa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:83">n ili i na vu dansai ba.<verse eid="PSA 119:83" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="84" style="v" sid="PSA 119:84" />Ali n wannai ɗai kagbashi ka̱ nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:84">ka kulyaꞋa kelime n kugbama asuvu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:84">Wannai ɗai va kuyaꞋanka aza a na</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:84">i a kutakacika mu afada?<verse eid="PSA 119:84" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="85" style="v" sid="PSA 119:85" />Aza a ugbamukaci a̱ ga̱va̱ ka̱ mu ta̱ kpenle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:85">adama a na n yikpa̱ punu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:85">o tono wila̱ u nu ba.<verse eid="PSA 119:85" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="86" style="v" sid="PSA 119:86" />Kadanshi ka̱ nu ra̱ka̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:86">ili i kuzuwaka katsura kaꞋa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:86">ɓa̱nka̱ mu, irala i va̱ i takacika mu ta̱ ko unushi,<verse eid="PSA 119:86" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="87" style="v" sid="PSA 119:87" />Kenu ɗa ubuwai o kotso nu mpa aduniyan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:87">ama mpa n ka̱sukpa̱ ili i kutono i nu ba.<verse eid="PSA 119:87" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="88" style="v" sid="PSA 119:88" />Adama a ucigi u nu u</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:88">na u tsu sabaꞋa ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:88">wawa wuma u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:88">ka̱ta̱ n tono kadanshi ka̱ una̱ u nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:88" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Uneki u ka̱ɗu a̱ wila̱ u Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="89" style="v" sid="PSA 119:89" />Vuzavaguɗu, kadanshi ka̱ nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:89">ki ta̱ lo ko wannai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:89">ka shamgba ta̱ n utsura gaɗi.<verse eid="PSA 119:89" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="90" style="v" sid="PSA 119:90" />Ma̱riki ma̱ nu a tsukaya a kubana tsukaya ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:90">vu shikpa̱i aduniyan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:90">ɗa tana a ɗa ashamgbai mayin.<verse eid="PSA 119:90" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="91" style="v" sid="PSA 119:91" />Ili ra̱ka̱ yi ta̱ lo ali n gogo na</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:91">adama afada a̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:91">adama a na ili ra̱ka̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:91">agbashi a̱ nu a ɗa.<verse eid="PSA 119:91" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="92" style="v" sid="PSA 119:92" />Ishi ba ci n ciya̱ ma̱za̱nga̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:92">a̱ wila̱ u nu ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:92">mi ishi ta̱ a̱ ku kuwa̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:92">a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka atakaci a̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 119:92" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="93" style="v" sid="PSA 119:93" />Mi a ku cinukpa n ili i kutono i nu ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:93">adama a i ɗa, ɗa vu erei wuma u va̱.<verse eid="PSA 119:93" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="94" style="v" sid="PSA 119:94" />Wawa mu, adama a na mpa wa̱ nu u ɗa mi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:94">n la̱nsa̱ ta̱ ili i kutono i nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:94" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="95" style="v" sid="PSA 119:95" />Uma a gbani-gbani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:95">i ta̱ a kuvana una mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:95">ama n ciɓa ta̱ n kadanshi ka̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:95" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="96" style="v" sid="PSA 119:96" />N zuwaka ta̱ a na ko ili,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:96">yi lo o kuyongo ko wannai ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:96">ama kadanshi ka̱ nu ki n uteku ba.<verse eid="PSA 119:96" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Ucigi u wila̱ u Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="97" style="v" sid="PSA 119:97" />Tsu na n cigai wila̱ u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:97">n tsu ka̱na̱ ta̱ kusheshe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:97">ku u ɗa kanna dem.<verse eid="PSA 119:97" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="98" style="v" sid="PSA 119:98" />Kadanshi ka̱ nu ka zuwa mu ta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:98">n ciya̱i ugboji n laꞋi irala i va̱,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 119:98">adama a na makyan dem</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:98">kaꞋa ki ta̱ nu mpa.<verse eid="PSA 119:98" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="99" style="v" sid="PSA 119:99" />N ciya̱ ta̱ kuyeve n laꞋi nlum n va̱ ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:99">adama a na mi ta̱ e kusheshe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:99">a ukuna u kadanshi ka̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:99" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="100" style="v" sid="PSA 119:100" />N laꞋa ta̱ nkoshi m gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ kuyeve,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:100">adama a na n zuwaka ta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:100">n ili i kutono i nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:100" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="101" style="v" sid="PSA 119:101" />N tsu suma ta̱ kuyongo ku gbani-gbani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:101">adama a na n tono kadanshi ka̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:101" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="102" style="v" sid="PSA 119:102" />N vadalukpa ka afada a̱ nu kucina̱ ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:102">adama a na avu ɗa vu piꞋisakai mu.<verse eid="PSA 119:102" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="103" style="v" sid="PSA 119:103" />UyoꞋo u kadanshi ka̱ nu a̱ una̱ u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:103">u laꞋa ta̱ ishigi uyoꞋo.<verse eid="PSA 119:103" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="104" style="v" sid="PSA 119:104" />A̱ ubuta̱ wi ili i kutono i nu ɗa n ciya̱i kuyeve,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:104">adama a nannai n iwan ta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:104">uye wa aꞋuwa ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 119:104" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Wila̱ u Vuzavaguɗu kutashi ku ɗa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="105" style="v" sid="PSA 119:105" />Kadanshi ka̱ nu ki ta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:105">tsu ma̱kuni e ene a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:105">kutashi kpamu a uye u va̱.<verse eid="PSA 119:105" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="106" style="v" sid="PSA 119:106" />N kucina ta̱ kpamu ka shamgba ta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:106">a na ma kuzuwaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:106">n afada a̱ usuɓi u nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:106" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="107" style="v" sid="PSA 119:107" />Vuzavaguɗu n takacika ta̱ ka̱u,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:107">bonoko wuma u va̱ tsu kadanshi ka̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:107" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="108" style="v" sid="PSA 119:108" />Vuzavaguɗu isa ili i na n kucinakai nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:108">piꞋisaka mu afada a̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:108" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="109" style="v" sid="PSA 119:109" />A makyan dem wuma u va̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:109">wi ta̱ a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka̱ ma̱da̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:109">ama n cinukpa wila̱ u nu ba.<verse eid="PSA 119:109" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="110" style="v" sid="PSA 119:110" />Uma a gbani-gbani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:110">a zuwaka mu ta̱ maza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:110">ama n katsukpa a ili i kutono i nu ba.<verse eid="PSA 119:110" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="111" style="v" sid="PSA 119:111" />Ili i na vu dansai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:111">ili yu uka̱ni i va̱ i ɗa ko wannai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:111">ka ɗaɗa ma̱za̱nga̱ ma̱ ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 119:111" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="112" style="v" sid="PSA 119:112" />N coꞋoko ta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:112">n ili i na vu dansai ko wannai.<verse eid="PSA 119:112" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Wila̱ u Vuzavaguɗu Ma̱ta̱na̱ maꞋa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="113" style="v" sid="PSA 119:113" />N iwan ta̱ uma a̱ una̱ ure,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:113">ama n ciga ta̱ wila̱ u nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:113" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="114" style="v" sid="PSA 119:114" />Avu ɗa ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku u va̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:114">m ma̱ra̱ga̱ ma̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:114">n keɗe ta̱ a̱pa̱Ꞌa̱ a kadanshi ka̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:114" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="115" style="v" sid="PSA 119:115" />YaꞋin daꞋangi nu mpa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:115">a̱ɗa̱ uma a gbani-gbani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:115">adama a na n tono</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:115">kadanshi ka̱ Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 119:115" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="116" style="v" sid="PSA 119:116" />Neke mu wuma tsu na</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:116">vu yaꞋin kadanshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:116">adama a na n ciya̱ wuma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:116">ka̱ta̱ vu ka̱sukpa̱ mu n yaꞋan wono</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:116">a̱ a̱pa̱Ꞌa̱ a na n keɗei ba.<verse eid="PSA 119:116" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="117" style="v" sid="PSA 119:117" />Ka̱na̱ mu, adama a na n ciya̱ wishi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:117">N tono ili i na vu dansai ko wannai.<verse eid="PSA 119:117" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="118" style="v" sid="PSA 119:118" />Vu iwan ta̱ aza a na a katsukpai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:118">ili i na vu dansai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:118">adama a na ma̱ya̱nsa̱ka̱ me le gbani ɗa.<verse eid="PSA 119:118" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="119" style="v" sid="PSA 119:119" />Vu tsu vakangu ta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:119">uma a gbani-gbani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:119">aduniyan ra̱ka̱ tsa̱ a̱shinda̱,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 119:119">ɗaɗa i zuwai ɗa n cigai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:119">kadanshi ka̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:119" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="120" style="v" sid="PSA 119:120" />Ikyamba i va̱ i jeꞋe ta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:120">adama o wovon u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:120">kpamu mi ta̱ a kupana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:120">wovon wa afada a̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:120" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Kutono ku wila̱ u Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="121" style="v" sid="PSA 119:121" />N yaꞋan ta̱ ili yu usuɓi m mejege,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:121">ka̱ta̱ vu ka̱sukpa̱ mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:121">ekiye a irala i va̱ ba.<verse eid="PSA 119:121" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="122" style="v" sid="PSA 119:122" />Ka̱sukpa̱ kagbashi ka̱ nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:122">ko yongo m ma̱ta̱na̱,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 119:122">ka̱ta̱ vu ka̱sukpa̱ aza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:122">a ugbamukaci o doro mu ba.<verse eid="PSA 119:122" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="123" style="v" sid="PSA 119:123" />A̱shi a̱ va̱ a̱ ga̱la̱ ta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:123">a kuvana wishi u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:123">n kadanshi ku usuɓi ka̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:123" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="124" style="v" sid="PSA 119:124" />yaꞋanka kagbashi ka̱ nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:124">tsu ucigi u nu u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:124">vu piꞋisaka mu ili i na vu dansai.<verse eid="PSA 119:124" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="125" style="v" sid="PSA 119:125" />Mpa kagbashi ka̱ nu kaꞋa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:125">neke mu cicoꞋo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:125">adama a na n yeve kadanshi ka̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:125" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="126" style="v" sid="PSA 119:126" />Vuzavaguɗu makyan ma yaꞋan ta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:126">a na va kuyaꞋan ili,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:126">adama a na uma o koɗo ta̱ wila̱ u nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:126" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="127" style="v" sid="PSA 119:127" />Adama a na n cigai ta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:127">kadanshi ka̱ nu ali u laꞋi azanariya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:127">u laꞋi azanariya koci.<verse eid="PSA 119:127" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="128" style="v" sid="PSA 119:128" />Adama a na kpamu mi ta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:128">a kuzuwaka n ili i kutono i nu mayin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:128">n iwan ta̱ ukuna wa aꞋuwa ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 119:128" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Mali mo kutono wila̱ u Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="129" style="v" sid="PSA 119:129" />Kadanshi ka̱ nu ili i mereve i ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:129">ɗaɗa i zuwai ɗa n zuwai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:129">kadanshi ka̱ nu a̱ ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 119:129" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="130" style="v" sid="PSA 119:130" />Ku utuka̱ kadanshi ka̱ nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:130">e keteshe ku tsu neke ta̱ kutashi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:130">ku tsu neke ta̱ kuyeve u vuza na wi n kuyeve ba.<verse eid="PSA 119:130" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="131" style="v" sid="PSA 119:131" />M apukai una̱ u va̱ ka̱u,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:131">n ka̱na̱i ayinviki gaɗi-gaɗi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:131">adama a ucigi u kadanshi ka̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:131" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="132" style="v" sid="PSA 119:132" />Kpatala wa̱ va̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:132">vu yaꞋanka mu kasingai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:132">tsu na wu untsukai vu yaꞋanka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:132">aza a na a cigai kula ku nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:132" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="133" style="v" sid="PSA 119:133" />Tono nu nwalu n va̱ tsu na vi yaꞋin kadanshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:133">ka̱ta̱ vu ka̱sukpa̱ ka gbani-gbani ka̱ ciya̱ mu ba.<verse eid="PSA 119:133" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="134" style="v" sid="PSA 119:134" />Shiba̱ mu ekiye aza o modoruko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:134">ka̱ta̱ n zuwaka n ili i kutono i nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:134" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="135" style="v" sid="PSA 119:135" />YaꞋan kutashi ku nu ku akana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:135">a̱shi a kagbashi ka̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:135">ka̱ta̱ vu piꞋisaka mu ili i na vu dansai.<verse eid="PSA 119:135" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="136" style="v" sid="PSA 119:136" />Kujilya a̱ kutsuwa̱n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:136">a̱ a̱shi a̱ va̱ tsu mini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:136">adama a na uma o tono wila̱ u nu ba.<verse eid="PSA 119:136" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Ma̱riki ma̱ wila̱ u Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="137" style="v" sid="PSA 119:137" />Vuzavaguɗu, avu vuza vu usuɓi ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:137">afada a̱ nu kpamu i ta̱ mejege.<verse eid="PSA 119:137" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="138" style="v" sid="PSA 119:138" />Kadanshi ka na vu nekei ra̱ka̱, ku usuɓi kaꞋa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:138">kpamu ili i kuzuwaka katsura kaꞋa.<verse eid="PSA 119:138" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="139" style="v" sid="PSA 119:139" />Mali ma̱ va̱ wa̱ nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:139">ma takacika mu ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:139">adama a na irala i va̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:139">i iwan ta̱ kadanshi ka̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:139" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="140" style="v" sid="PSA 119:140" />O kondo ta̱ kadanshi ka̱ nu mayin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:140">kpamu mpa kagbashi ka̱ nu n ciga ta̱ kaꞋa.<verse eid="PSA 119:140" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="141" style="v" sid="PSA 119:141" />Mpa ili i yoku i ɗa ba, ili i kugoyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:141">ama n cinukpa n ili i kutono i nu ba.<verse eid="PSA 119:141" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="142" style="v" sid="PSA 119:142" />Usuɓi u nu, usuɓi u ɗa ko wannai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:142">wila̱ u nu mayun ɗa ayin dem.<verse eid="PSA 119:142" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="143" style="v" sid="PSA 119:143" />Mi ta̱ n atakaci</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:143">n una̱mgbuka̱tsuma̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:143">ama kadanshi ka̱ nu ke</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:143">ci neke mu ta̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ a̱ ka̱ɗu.<verse eid="PSA 119:143" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="144" style="v" sid="PSA 119:144" />Kadanshi ka̱ nu ki ta̱ mejege ko wannai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:144">ke ci neke mu ta̱ kuyeve</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:144">adama a na n ciya̱ wuma.<verse eid="PSA 119:144" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Avasa a̱ kula̱nsa̱ wishi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="145" style="v" sid="PSA 119:145" />Vuzavaguɗu, ushuku mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:145">n ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ kaꞋa ra̱ka̱ mi a̱ ma̱shi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:145">mi ta̱ o kutono ili i na vu dansai.<verse eid="PSA 119:145" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="146" style="v" sid="PSA 119:146" />Mi ta̱ e meɗevile wa̱ nu, wawa mu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:146">Ka̱ta̱ n tono kadanshi ka̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:146" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="147" style="v" sid="PSA 119:147" />Kafu kayin ka asa n shika̱ ta̱ a̱ kula̱nsa̱ uɓa̱nki</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:147">n keɗe ta̱ a̱pa̱Ꞌa̱ a kadanshi ka̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:147" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="148" style="v" sid="PSA 119:148" />Kayin ra̱ka̱ n lata ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:148">e kusheshe a ukuna wu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:148">uzuwakpani u Vuzavaguɗu.<verse eid="PSA 119:148" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="149" style="v" sid="PSA 119:149" />Pana ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ka̱ va̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:149">adama a ucigi u nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:149">u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:149">ere wuma u va̱ tsu afada a̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:149" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="150" style="v" sid="PSA 119:150" />Aza a gbani-gbani a na</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:150">a takacikai mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:150">a yawa ta̱ ɗevu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:150">uma a na i daꞋangi n wila̱ u nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:150" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="151" style="v" sid="PSA 119:151" />Ama avu Vuzavaguɗu, vi ta̱ ɗevu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:151">kadanshi ka̱ nu kpamu mayun ɗa.<verse eid="PSA 119:151" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="152" style="v" sid="PSA 119:152" />Ali n cau ɗa n yevei a kadanshi ka̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:152">vu zuwa ta̱ kaꞋa ko wannai.<verse eid="PSA 119:152" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Ufolu adama a̱ uɓa̱nki</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="153" style="v" sid="PSA 119:153" />Indana atakaci a̱ va̱ ka̱ta̱ vu isa mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:153">adama a na n cinukpa n wila̱ u nu ba.<verse eid="PSA 119:153" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="154" style="v" sid="PSA 119:154" />Shamkpa mu ka̱ta̱ vu shiba̱ mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:154">ere mu tsu na vu dansai.<verse eid="PSA 119:154" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="155" style="v" sid="PSA 119:155" />Wishi wi ta̱ daꞋin n aza agbani-gbani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:155">adama a na a̱ la̱nsa̱ e yeve ili i na vu dansai ba.<verse eid="PSA 119:155" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="156" style="v" sid="PSA 119:156" />Vuzavaguɗu, asuvayali a̱ nu a gbayin a ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:156">ere wuma u va̱ tsu afada a̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:156" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="157" style="v" sid="PSA 119:157" />Irala i na yi a kutakacika mu, i ta̱ n a̱bunda̱i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:157">ama n katsukpa kadanshi ka̱ nu ba.<verse eid="PSA 119:157" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="158" style="v" sid="PSA 119:158" />Mi indai aza a kavama</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:158">ɗa m panai unata u le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:158">adama a na o tono</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:158">kadanshi ka̱ nu ba.<verse eid="PSA 119:158" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="159" style="v" sid="PSA 119:159" />Vuzavaguɗu la̱na̱ tsu na</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:159">n cigai ili i kutono i nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:159">ere wuma u va̱ tsu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:159">ucigi u nu u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba.<verse eid="PSA 119:159" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="160" style="v" sid="PSA 119:160" />Kadanshi ka̱ nu ra̱ka̱ mayun ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:160">afada a usuɓi a̱ nu ko wannai ɗa.<verse eid="PSA 119:160" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Kubonoko ku ka̱ɗu a̱ wila̱ u Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="161" style="v" sid="PSA 119:161" />Aza o tsugono a kutakacika mu ko unushi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:161">ama ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ ki ta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:161">o wovon u kadanshi ka̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:161" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="162" style="v" sid="PSA 119:162" />Mi ta̱ a̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ n a̱bunda̱i</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:162">n kadanshi ka̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:162">tsu vuza na u ciya̱i ucanuku</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:162">u gbani n a̱bunda̱i.<verse eid="PSA 119:162" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="163" style="v" sid="PSA 119:163" />N kovo ta̱ aza aꞋuwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:163">kpamu n tsu pana ta̱ unata u le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:163">ama n ciga ta̱ wila̱ u nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:163" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="164" style="v" sid="PSA 119:164" />A kanna lakam n ci cikpa wu ta̱ kucindere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:164">adama afada a usuɓi u nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:164" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="165" style="v" sid="PSA 119:165" />Aza a na a cigai wila̱ u nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:165">a̱ ciya̱ ta̱ ida̱shi i ma̱ta̱na̱ ka̱u,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:165">kpamu ko ili yi lo a kuzuwa le a̱ ta̱ɗa̱tsa̱ ba.<verse eid="PSA 119:165" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="166" style="v" sid="PSA 119:166" />vuzavaguɗu, mi ta̱ a kuvana wishi u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:166">mi ta̱ o kutono kadanshi ka̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:166" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="167" style="v" sid="PSA 119:167" />N tono ta̱ kadanshi ka̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:167">n ciga ta̱ kaꞋa n ka̱ɗu ke te.<verse eid="PSA 119:167" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="168" style="v" sid="PSA 119:168" />N zuwaka ta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:168">n ili i kutono i nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:168">n kadanshi ka̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:168">adama a na vu yeve ta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:168">ili i na mi a kuyaꞋan ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 119:168" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Avasa a̱ kula̱nsa̱ uɓa̱nki</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="169" style="v" sid="PSA 119:169" />Vuzavaguɗu, yaꞋan ma̱shi ma̱ va̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:169">ma yawa wa̱ nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:169">neke mu kuyeve tsu na vu dansai<verse eid="PSA 119:169" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="170" style="v" sid="PSA 119:170" />YaꞋan ufolu u va̱ u ta̱wa̱ wa̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:170">isa mu tsu na vu yaꞋin kadanshi.<verse eid="PSA 119:170" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="171" style="v" sid="PSA 119:171" />YaꞋan nla̱ba̱ ma̱ una̱ u va̱ u cikpa wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:171">adama a na vu piꞋisaka mu ili i na vu dansai.<verse eid="PSA 119:171" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="172" style="v" sid="PSA 119:172" />YaꞋan kelentsu ka̱ va̱ ka canana kadanshi ka̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:172">adama a na kadanshi ka̱ nu ra̱ka̱ ku usuɓi kaꞋa.<verse eid="PSA 119:172" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="173" style="v" sid="PSA 119:173" />YaꞋan kukiye ku nu kuyongo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:173">ufoɓushi kuɓa̱nka̱ mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:173">adama a na n zagba ta̱ ili i kutono i nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:173" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="174" style="v" sid="PSA 119:174" />Vuzavaguɗu, mi ta̱ a mali ma wishi u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:174">n ci ciya̱ ta̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ n wila̱ u nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:174" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="175" style="v" sid="PSA 119:175" />Ka̱sukpa̱ mu n wuma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:175">adama a na n cikpa wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:175">kpamu yaꞋan afada a̱ nu a̱ ɓa̱nka̱ mu.<verse eid="PSA 119:175" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="176" style="v" sid="PSA 119:176" />M puwa̱nka̱ ta̱ tsu mokyon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:176">ma na ma̱ puwa̱nka̱i.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 119:176">La̱nsa̱ kagbashi ka̱ nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:176">adama a na n cinukpa n kadanshi ka̱ nu ba.<verse eid="PSA 119:176" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 119" />
  <chapter number="120" style="c" sid="PSA 120" />
  <para style="s1">Ma̱shi ma̱ kula̱nsa̱ uɓa̱nki</para>
  <para style="d">Vishipa vu kugaɗukpa a kubana a̱ ubuta̱ wa̱ a̱ga̱nda̱.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 120:1" />N ɗekushe ta̱ Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:1">ana mi a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka atakaci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:1">ɗa tana wu ushuki mu.<verse eid="PSA 120:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 120:2" />Vuzavaguɗu, wawa wuma u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:2">we elentsu aza a uwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:2">n wa aza o modoruko.<verse eid="PSA 120:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 120:3" />Yiɗa̱i u kuyaꞋanka ɗa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:3">afada e ne a ɗai u kuyaꞋanka ɗa̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:3">a̱ɗa̱ aza o modoruko?<verse eid="PSA 120:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 120:4" />Wi ta̱ a kutakacika ɗa̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:4">n ayaꞋa a lyalyaꞋan o osoji</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:4">koɓolo n a̱ga̱ruwa̱shi akina.<verse eid="PSA 120:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 120:5" />Ili ya atakaci i ɗa wa̱ a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:5">a na mi a̱ ida̱shi a̱ likuci i Mesheku</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:5">punu a̱pa̱m e Kedaru.<verse eid="PSA 120:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 120:6" />N geshe ta̱ ida̱shi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:6">a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka aza a na a cigai ida̱shi i ma̱ta̱na̱ ba.<verse eid="PSA 120:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 120:7" />Mpa vuza vu kuciga ida̱shi i ma̱ta̱na̱ i ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:7">ama n dansa baci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:7">ka̱ta̱ a yaꞋan ukuna u kuɗa̱ngusa̱ vishili.<verse eid="PSA 120:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 120" />
  <chapter number="121" style="c" sid="PSA 121" />
  <para style="s1">Vuzavaguɗu ɗa ka̱ɓa̱nki ka̱ va̱</para>
  <para style="d">Vishipa vu kugaɗukpa a kubana a̱ ubuta̱ wa̱ a̱ga̱nda̱.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 121:1" />N ɗengusa̱i a̱shi a̱ va̱ a uɓon wa aginda me ene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:1">teɗai uɓa̱nki u va̱ wi a̱ ku uta̱?<verse eid="PSA 121:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 121:2" />Uɓa̱nki u va̱ wi ta̱ a̱ ku uta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:2">a̱ ubuta̱ u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:2">a̱yi na u yaꞋin gaɗi n iɗika.<verse eid="PSA 121:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 121:3" />Wi a̱ ku ka̱sukpa̱ wu vu yikpa̱ ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:3">maguɓi ma nu mi a ku gbaɗika ba.<verse eid="PSA 121:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 121:4" />Maguɓi ma aza a Israila</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:4">ma tsu gbaɗika ko u lata ba.<verse eid="PSA 121:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 121:5" />Vuzavaguɗu ɗa ke eri ka̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:5">Vuzavaguɗu kulu ku ɗa wa̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 121:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 121:6" />Vi o kusoꞋo kanna ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:6">ko kutashi ku wotoi n kayin ba.<verse eid="PSA 121:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 121:7" />Vuzavaguɗu wi ta̱ e ku ere wu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:7">a ka gbani-gbani dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:7">wi ta̱ a̱ ku la̱na̱ wuma u nu.<verse eid="PSA 121:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 121:8" />Vuzavaguɗu wi ta̱ e ku ere</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:8">ku uwa ku nu n ku uta̱ ku nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:8">gogo na a kubana ko wannai.<verse eid="PSA 121:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 121" />
  <chapter number="122" style="c" sid="PSA 122" />
  <para style="s1">Vishipa adama a Urushelima</para>
  <para style="d">Ishipa i kugaɗukpa a kubana a̱ ubuta̱ wa̱ a̱ga̱nda̱. Vishipa vu Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 122:1" />N yaꞋan ta̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ ana a danai mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:1">&lt;&lt;YaꞋan tsu bana A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin a Vuzavaguɗu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 122:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 122:2" />A̱tsu ɗa na ci yawai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:2">ci ta̱ kashani a̱ utsutsu u Urishelima.<verse eid="PSA 122:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 122:3" />A maꞋa ta̱ Urishelima tsu likuci i na</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:3">yi ugbaɓi a̱ ubuta̱ u te,<verse eid="PSA 122:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 122:4" />ubuta̱ u na kumaci kakau ku tsu bana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:4">kumaci ki Isaraila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:4">adama a na a cikpa Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:4">tsu na e nekei aza a Isaraila kadanshi.<verse eid="PSA 122:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 122:5" />Adama a na ta ɗe akuba afada i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:5">akuba o tsugono tsu kpaꞋa ku Dawuda.<verse eid="PSA 122:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 122:6" />YaꞋankai Urushelima avasa a̱ ma̱ta̱na̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:6">&lt;&lt;YaꞋan aza na a cigai nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:6">a̱ ciya̱ ulyaꞋi u kelime.<verse eid="PSA 122:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 122:7" />YaꞋan ma̱ta̱na̱ mo yongo a Urushelima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:7">ida̱shi i ma̱ta̱na̱ kpamu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:7">e efeku o tsugono a̱ nu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 122:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 122:8" />Adama a̱ja̱Ꞌa̱ a̱ va̱ n aza a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:8">n danai Urishelima, &lt;&lt;Ma̱ta̱na̱ mo yongo n avu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 122:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 122:9" />Adama a kpaꞋa ku Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:9">mi ta̱ avasa vu lyaꞋa kelime.<verse eid="PSA 122:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 122" />
  <chapter number="123" style="c" sid="PSA 123" />
  <para style="s1">Ma̱shi ma asuvayali</para>
  <para style="d">Vishipa vu kugaɗukpa a kubana a̱ ubuta̱ wa̱ a̱ga̱nda̱.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 123:1" />Vuzavaguɗu, wa̱ nu ɗa n zuwai a̱shi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 123:1">gaɗi a̱ ubuta̱ u na vi o tsugono.<verse eid="PSA 123:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 123:2" />Tsu na a̱shi a agbashi i</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 123:2">a ku inda vuza kpaꞋa vu le</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 123:2">tsu na a̱shi kagbashi ka vuka ki</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 123:2">a ku inda vuzagbayin vu ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 123:2">ta a̱shi a̱ tsu i nannai u Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 123:2">ali a makyan ma na u panai asuvayali a̱ tsu.<verse eid="PSA 123:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 123:3" />Pana asuvayali a̱ tsu Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 123:3">pana asuvayali,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 123:3">adama a na kugoyi ka, ku yawa tsu ta̱.<verse eid="PSA 123:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 123:4" />Aza a uciyi e geshe ta̱ o kugoyo tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 123:4">aza a gbani-gbani n ugbamukaci</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 123:4">o goyo tsu ta̱.<verse eid="PSA 123:4" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 123" />
  <chapter number="124" style="c" sid="PSA 124" />
  <para style="s1">Ka̱shile kaꞋa kawawi ka uma a̱ ni</para>
  <para style="d">Vishipa vu kugaɗukpa a kubana a̱ ubuta̱ wa̱ a̱ga̱nda̱. Vishipa vu Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 124:1" />Ishi baci Vuzavaguɗu wi koɓolo n a̱tsu ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:1">yiɗa̱i yi ishi a̱ kuciya̱ tsu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:1">YaꞋan Isaraila a dana.<verse eid="PSA 124:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 124:2" />Ishi baci Vuzavaguɗu wi koɓolo n a̱tsu ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:2">ana uma a̱ tuka̱i tsu n vishili,<verse eid="PSA 124:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 124:3" />ishi o kusoɗongu tsu n wuma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:3">a makyan ma nanlo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:3">adama asuvusuɗukpi a na i a kuyaꞋan n a̱tsu.<verse eid="PSA 124:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 124:4" />Ishi a̱ kupura̱ngu tsu n wupa tsu mini ma na ma ayai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:4">mini ma, mi ishi a kulyaꞋa tsu,<verse eid="PSA 124:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 124:5" />mini mi ilaɗi mi ishi a kulyaꞋa tsu ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 124:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 124:6" />Ucikpi u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:6">ana u ka̱sukpa̱i irala i tsu i lyaꞋi tsu ba.<verse eid="PSA 124:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 124:7" />Tsu laꞋakai tsu manunu a maza ma vuza kutambu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:7">maza ma, ma kasai ɗa tsu laꞋakai.<verse eid="PSA 124:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 124:8" />Uɓa̱nki u tsu wi ta̱ a̱ ku uta̱ u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:8">a̱yi na u yaꞋin gaɗi n iɗika.<verse eid="PSA 124:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 124" />
  <chapter number="125" style="c" sid="PSA 125" />
  <para style="s1">Ka̱shile ki ta̱ e ku ere uma a̱ ni</para>
  <para style="d">Vishipa vu kugaɗukpa a kubana a̱ ubuta̱ wa̱ a̱ga̱nda̱.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 125:1" />Aza a na a zuwai katsura ke le u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:1">i ta̱ tsu kusan ku gbayin ku Sihiyona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:1">ku na ku tsu kugba̱ɗa̱ ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:1">ki ta̱ lo ko wannai.<verse eid="PSA 125:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 125:2" />Tsu na nsansa m gbagbaꞋin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:2">mi uka̱ra̱Ꞌi n Urushelima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:2">ta feu Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:2">u kanzai uma a̱ ni nannai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:2">gogo na a kubana ko wannai.<verse eid="PSA 125:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 125:3" />Aza a gbani-gbani i a kulyaꞋa tsugono</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:3">a iɗika i uma a̱ Ka̱shile ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:3">ɗa baci a lyaꞋi tsugono,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:3">yoku ba uma a̱ Ka̱shile a feu i ta̱ a ku nusa.<verse eid="PSA 125:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 125:4" />Vuzavaguɗu, yaꞋanka aza a usuɓi kasingai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:4">ele na i o kutono wila̱ u nu.<verse eid="PSA 125:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 125:5" />Ama aza a na a vadalukpai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:5">o tonoi uye u gbani-gbani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:5">yaꞋan Vuzavaguɗu wu utuka̱ le</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:5">koɓolo n aza a gbani-gbani.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 125:5" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 125:5">YaꞋan ma̱ta̱na̱ mo yongo n aza a Isaraila.<verse eid="PSA 125:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 125" />
  <chapter number="126" style="c" sid="PSA 126" />
  <para style="s1">Vishipa va aza a na a̱ uta̱i a̱ ubuta̱ u tsugbashi</para>
  <para style="d">Vishipa vu kugaɗukpa a kubana a̱ ubuta̱ wa̱ a̱ga̱nda̱.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 126:1" />Ana Vuzavaguɗu u bonokoi tsu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:1">n una̱singai u tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:1">a̱tsu na ci o kubono a Sihiyona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:1">ɗa wo okpoi tsu tsa alatani.<verse eid="PSA 126:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 126:2" />Ɗa tsu ɓosoi izoshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:2">ci yaꞋin ishipa i ma̱za̱nga̱.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 126:2">Ɗa uduniyan u yoku u danai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:2">&lt;&lt;Vuzavaguɗu u yaꞋanka le ta̱ ili i gbayin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 126:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 126:3" />E mayun ɗa, Vuzavaguɗu u yaꞋanka tsu ta̱ ili i gbagbaꞋin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:3">ɗa tana ci shanai m ma̱za̱nga̱.<verse eid="PSA 126:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 126:4" />Avu Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:4">bonoko tsu n tsugbayin tsu tsu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:4">tsu na o ci yoꞋo mini ma utsura</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:4">a iɗika i na yi ishi i ɗekpei.<verse eid="PSA 126:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 126:5" />Aza a na i a̱ vica̱Ꞌa̱ m ma̱shi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:5">i ta̱ a kuyaꞋan vikyaꞋa m ma̱za̱nga̱.<verse eid="PSA 126:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 126:6" />A̱yi na wu uta̱i m ma̱shi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:6">ucaniki n icuꞋu i vica̱Ꞌa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:6">wi ta̱ o kubono n vishipa vu ma̱za̱nga̱.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:6">ucaniki nu nta̱ka̱ mi ili i kashina.<verse eid="PSA 126:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 126" />
  <chapter number="127" style="c" sid="PSA 127" />
  <para style="s1">Ucikpi u kasingai ka̱ Ka̱shile</para>
  <para style="d">Vishipa vu kugaɗukpa a kubana a̱ ubuta̱ wa̱ a̱ga̱nda̱.Vishipa vu Sulemanu.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 127:1" />Vuzavaguɗu ɗa baci u maꞋin kpaꞋa ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:1">ulinga wa aza a kumaꞋa gbani ɗa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 127:1">Vuzavaguɗu ɗa baci we erei likuci ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:1">gbani ɗa a zuwa aza a kindi.<verse eid="PSA 127:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 127:2" />Gbani ɗa i ci ɗa̱nga̱ n usana ka̱li-ka̱li</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:2">yi kpamu o kubono a kpaꞋa ga̱ba̱ ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:2">yi atakaci adama a ilikulyaꞋa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 127:2">Adama a na u tsu zuwa ta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:2">aza na u cigai a uvuka mayin.<verse eid="PSA 127:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 127:3" />Mayun, muku mo olobo kuneꞋe ku ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:3">a̱ ubuta̱ u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:3">muku katsupu kaꞋa wa̱ ni.<verse eid="PSA 127:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 127:4" />Tsa ayaꞋa ekiye o kosoji,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:4">nannai ɗa muku mo olobo n na</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:4">a matsakai vuza a ayin a utsura u ni.<verse eid="PSA 127:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 127:5" />Vuza vu ma̱za̱nga̱ ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:5">a̱yi na majiki ma̱ ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:5">ma shanai tukpa n ele.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 127:5">Wi a kuyaꞋan wono ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:5">a makyan ma na wi a̱ vishili n irala i ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:5">n ubuta̱ u koɓolo, a̱ utsutsu u likuci.<verse eid="PSA 127:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 127" />
  <chapter number="128" style="c" sid="PSA 128" />
  <para style="s1">Una̱singai wa aza a ukuna u mayun</para>
  <para style="d">Vishipa vu kugaɗukpa a kubana a̱ ubuta̱ wa̱ a̱ga̱nda̱.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 128:1" />Aza a̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ a ɗa ra̱ka̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:1">aza a na i a kupana wovon u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:1">aza a na i a nwalu a uye u ni.<verse eid="PSA 128:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 128:2" />Vi ta̱ a kulyaꞋa mele ma ulinga ma̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:2">m ma̱za̱nga̱ n kasingai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:2">i ta̱ o ko okpo wa̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 128:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 128:3" />Vuka vu nu vi ta̱ o ko okpo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:3">tsu maɗanga mi itacishi ma limata a kpaꞋa ku nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:3">muku n nu kpamu tsu n nɗanga n zaitu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:3">uka̱ra̱Ꞌi n kirukpa ku nu.<verse eid="PSA 128:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 128:4" />Nannai ɗa a kuzuwaka vuma una̱singai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:4">vuza na u tsu pana wovon u Vuzavaguɗu.<verse eid="PSA 128:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 128:5" />YaꞋan Vuzavaguɗu u zuwaka wu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:5">una̱singai a Sihiyona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:5">a ayin a wuma u nu dem</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:5">yaꞋan vu ene ulyaꞋi u kelime u Urushelima.<verse eid="PSA 128:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 128:6" />YaꞋan vi yongo n wuma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:6">vu ene ntsukaya n nu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:6">Ma̱ta̱na̱ mo yongo koɓolo n aza a Isaraila.<verse eid="PSA 128:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 128" />
  <chapter number="129" style="c" sid="PSA 129" />
  <para style="s1">Avasa a kuyaꞌan tsurala ya aza a Isaraila</para>
  <para style="d">Vishipa vu kugaɗukpa a kubana a̱ ubuta̱ wa̱ a̱ga̱nda̱.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 129:1" />A̱ɗa̱ aza a Isaraila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:1">yaꞋin n i dansai ukuna u nampa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 129:1">&lt;&lt;Ali biꞋi mpa kenu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:1">ɗa i a kutakacika mu ka̱u.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 129:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 129:2" />&lt;&lt;Ali biꞋi mpa kenu, ɗa i a kutakacika mu ka̱u,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:2">ama a̱ ciya̱ ulyaꞋi wa̱ a̱ va̱ ba.<verse eid="PSA 129:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 129:3" />Ɗa a yaꞋankai mu muna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:3">a ɓatsai mu a̱ kucina̱ ka̱u</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:3">o bonokoi ku ɗa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:3">tsu kashina ka na a nimai.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 129:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 129:4" />Ama Vuzavaguɗu vuza kasingai ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:4">u wawai mu a̱ ubuta̱ u tsugbashi.<verse eid="PSA 129:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 129:5" />YaꞋan aza a na a iwain Sihiyona ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:5">yaꞋan o bono n wono.<verse eid="PSA 129:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 129:6" />YaꞋan okpo an mita̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:6">ma na mu uta̱i a gaɗi vu kukpa̱Ꞌa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:6">ma ci ɗekpe ta̱ kafu mo gbonguro,<verse eid="PSA 129:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 129:7" />ma na ma ci shana ureci</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:7">u kukiye ku vuza vu vikya ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:7">ko ekiye aza o kuɓolongu nta̱ka̱ ba.<verse eid="PSA 129:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 129:8" />Ka̱ta̱ aza a nwalu a dana ba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 129:8">&lt;&lt;YaꞋan una̱singai u Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:8">u yongo a kaci ka̱ ɗa̱.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 129:8">ci ta̱ a ku zuwaka ɗa̱ una̱singai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:8">a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka kula ku Vuzavaguɗu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 129:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 129" />
  <chapter number="130" style="c" sid="PSA 130" />
  <para style="s1">Ma̱shi ma vuza na u shika̱i unushi u ni</para>
  <para style="d">Vishipa vu kugaɗukpa a kubana a̱ ubuta̱ wa̱ a̱ga̱nda̱.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 130:1" />Avu Vuzavaguɗu, n ɗeke wu ta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:1">a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka atakaci a̱bunda̱i a̱ va̱,<verse eid="PSA 130:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 130:2" />Avu Vuzavaguɗu, pana ma̱shi ma̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:2">zuwa atsuvu, vu pana ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:2">ka̱ kula̱nsa̱ uɓa̱nki.<verse eid="PSA 130:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 130:3" />Avu Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:3">vi baci e kukece unushi u tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:3">yayi wa ku shamgba?<verse eid="PSA 130:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 130:4" />Ama vu tsu cinukpaka ta̱ uma unushi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:4">adama a na a pana wovon u nu.<verse eid="PSA 130:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 130:5" />N zuwa ta̱ ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:5">wuma uva̱ wa̱ ni ɗa u ɗa wi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:5">kpamu a kadanshi ka̱ ni ka n zuwai ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 130:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 130:6" />Wuma u va̱ wi ta̱ a mali ma Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:6">ali u laꞋa tsu na aza a kindi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:6">a ci yaꞋan mali ma na ene usana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 130:6">mayun, u laꞋa ta̱ tsu na aza a kindi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:6">a ci yaꞋan mali ma na ene usana.<verse eid="PSA 130:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 130:7" />Avu Isaraila, zuwa katsura u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:7">adama a na a̱ ubuta̱ u Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:7">ucigi wi ta̱ lo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:7">a̱ ubuta̱ u ni kpamu wishi wi ta̱ lo.<verse eid="PSA 130:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 130:8" />A̱yi tana wi ta̱ a ku wawa aza a Isaraila</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:8">a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ku unushi u le dem.<verse eid="PSA 130:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 130" />
  <chapter number="131" style="c" sid="PSA 131" />
  <para style="s1">Vishipa vu ku zuwa katsura u Ka̱shile</para>
  <para style="d">Vishipa vu kugaɗukpa a kubana a̱ ubuta̱ wa̱ a̱ga̱nda̱. Vishipa vu Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 131:1" />Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 131:1">mpa vuza vu a̱ra̱ɗi ɗa ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 131:1">mi tana feu n ugbamukaci ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 131:1">ili i bura mu n ukuna u gbagbaꞋin ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 131:1">ko kpamu i na i laꞋi utsura u va̱ ba.<verse eid="PSA 131:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 131:2" />Ama mpa, n ka̱na̱ ta̱ ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 131:2">n vaꞋanka ta̱ n kaꞋa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 131:2">an maku me kenu ma na a kasai mani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 131:2">an maku me kenu ekiye a̱na̱ku a̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 131:2">ta ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ ki ida̱shi nannai.<verse eid="PSA 131:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 131:3" />Avu Isaraila, zuwa ka̱ɗu ka̱ nu u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 131:3">gogo na a kubana ko wannai.<verse eid="PSA 131:3" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 131" />
  <chapter number="132" style="c" sid="PSA 132" />
  <para style="s1">Vishipa adama a̱ likuci i Dawuda</para>
  <para style="d">Vishipa vu kugaɗukpa a kubana a̱ ubuta̱ wa̱ a̱ga̱nda̱.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 132:1" />Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:1">ciɓa n Dawuda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:1">n tsu na u lulukpa̱i a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka atakaci a̱ ni.<verse eid="PSA 132:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 132:2" />Ciɓa n tsu na u kucinakai Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:2">n akucina a̱ ni u MalaꞋimili ma Yakubu, u danai,<verse eid="PSA 132:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 132:3" />&lt;&lt;Mpa mi a kubana a kpaꞋa ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:3">ko n vaku a kajiba ka̱ va̱ ba,<verse eid="PSA 132:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 132:4" />mi a̱ ku ka̱sukpa̱ a̱shi a̱ va̱ a̱ yimba̱tsa̱ka̱ ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:4">mi e kuneke a̱ga̱la̱ a̱shi a̱ va̱ wuvuki ba,<verse eid="PSA 132:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 132:5" />ali n la̱nsa̱ka̱ Vuzavaguɗu ubuta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:5">ubuta̱ wi ida̱shi adama a MalaꞋimili ma Yakubu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 132:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 132:6" />Ɗanna tsu panai arabali, a danai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:6">akpati vu uzuwakpani vi ta̱ a Efarata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:6">ɗa ci cinai vu ɗa a̱pula̱ka̱ a Kiriyatu-jerimu.<verse eid="PSA 132:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 132:7" />Ɗa tsu danai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:7">&lt;&lt;YaꞋan tsu bana a̱ ubuta̱ wi ida̱shi i Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:7">yaꞋan tsu kuɗa̱ngu e kelime ka̱ ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 132:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 132:8" />Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:8">ɗa̱nga̱ vu bana ubuta̱ u kuvuka u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:8">avu n akpati vu uzuwakpani a utsura a̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 132:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 132:9" />YaꞋan anan ganu a̱ nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:9">a yaꞋan ukuna wu usuɓi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 132:9">YaꞋan ncigi n nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:9">n ɗa̱ngusa̱ a̱la̱ka̱tsu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:9">a canana ishipa i ma̱za̱nga̱.<verse eid="PSA 132:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 132:10" />Adama a kagbashi ka̱ nu Dawuda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:10">ka̱ ta̱ vu kpatala a̱shi a̱ nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:10">u vuza na vu erengi ba.<verse eid="PSA 132:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 132:11" />Vuzavaguɗu u yaꞋanka ta̱ Dawuda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:11">uzuwakpani u ma̱riki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:11">uzuwakpani u na u kukotso ba, u danai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 132:11">&lt;&lt;Vuza te a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka̱ muku mo olobo n nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:11">ɗa n kuzuwa a kakuba ko tsugono tsu nu.<verse eid="PSA 132:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 132:12" />Ɗa baci muku mo olobo n nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:12">n tonoi uzuwakpani u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:12">n kadanshi ka̱ va̱ ka na m piꞋisakai le,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 132:12">muku mo olobo ma feu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:12">i ta̱ a kuda̱sa̱ngu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:12">a kakuba ko tsugono tsu nu ko wannai.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 132:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 132:13" />Adama a na Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:13">u zagba ta̱ Sihiyona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:13">u yaꞋin mali ma na wo okpo yi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:13">ubuta̱ wi ida̱shi i ni.<verse eid="PSA 132:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 132:14" />U danai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:14">&lt;&lt;Na va kpaꞋa ku kuvuka ku va̱ ku ɗa ko wannai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:14">ta punu ma ku da̱sa̱ngu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:14">adama a na mi ta̱ a mali ma ku ɗa.<verse eid="PSA 132:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 132:15" />Mi ta̱ a kuzuwaka Sihiyona una̱singai n ili ba̱ri</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:15">aza a unambi i ta̱ a̱ kucuwa̱ n ilikulyaꞋa.<verse eid="PSA 132:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 132:16" />Mi ta̱ a kuzuwa anan Ganu a̱ ni a dana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:16">mi ta̱ a ku wawa uma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:16">uma a̱ va̱ kpamu i ta̱ a kucanana ishipa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:16">a̱ ɗa̱ngusa̱ a̱la̱ka̱tsu e le adama a̱ ma̱za̱nga̱.<verse eid="PSA 132:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 132:17" />Ta punu n kuzuwa vuza te</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:17">a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka ntsukaya n Dawuda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:17">wo okpo mogono ma gbayin,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 132:17">ta punu kpamu n kuzuwa tsugono tsu mazagbi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:17">ci lyaꞋa kelime ko wannai.<verse eid="PSA 132:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 132:18" />Mi ta̱ a kuzuwa irala i ni yi okpo n wono,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:18">ama tsugono ci ni ci ta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:18">a kulyaꞋa kelime ci shamgba mayin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 132:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 132" />
  <chapter number="133" style="c" sid="PSA 133" />
  <para style="d">Ishipa i kugaɗukpa a kubana a̱ ubuta̱ wa̱ a̱ga̱nda̱. Vishipa vu Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 133:1" />Mayun, ili i singai i ɗa m ma̱za̱nga̱ kpamu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 133:1">uma a̱ da̱sa̱ngu koɓolo an vuza te.<verse eid="PSA 133:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 133:2" />Wi ta̱ an maniꞋin me kerengu ma singai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 133:2">ma na mi e kuyene a̱ kucipa̱</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 133:2">a gaɗi vu kaci ka Haruna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 133:2">a̱ kuta̱wa̱ a̱ ntsa̱ka̱ n ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 133:2">ali a kubana e kuɗeku ku motogu ma̱ ni.<verse eid="PSA 133:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 133:3" />Wi ta̱ an ciza tsu Hamon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 133:3">tsu na ci e kuyene a̱ kucipa̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 133:3">a gaɗi vu kusan ku Sihiyona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 133:3">adama a na ta ɗe Vuzavaguɗu u yaꞋin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 133:3">uzuwakpani wu una̱singai u ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 133:3">wuma u ko wannai.<verse eid="PSA 133:3" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 133" />
  <chapter number="134" style="c" sid="PSA 134" />
  <para style="d">Ishipa i kugaɗukpa a kubana a̱ ubuta̱ wa̱ a̱ga̱nda̱.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 134:1" />Cikpai Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 134:1">a̱ɗa̱ agbashi Vuzavaguɗu ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 134:1">a̱ɗa̱ na yi a kuyaꞋanka yi a̱ga̱nda̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 134:1">a kpaꞋa ku Vuzavaguɗu n kayin.<verse eid="PSA 134:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 134:2" />Ɗa̱ngusa̱i ekiye a̱ ɗa̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 134:2">a kubana a̱ ubuta̱ u ciɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 134:2">i cikpa Vuzavaguɗu.<verse eid="PSA 134:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 134:3" />YaꞋan Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 134:3">a̱yi na u yaꞋin gaɗi n iɗika</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 134:3">u zuwaka ɗa̱ una̱singai a Sihiyona.<verse eid="PSA 134:3" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 134" />
  <chapter number="135" style="c" sid="PSA 135" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 135:1" />Cikpai Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:1">cikpai kula ku Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:1">cikpai ni, a̱ɗa̱ agbashi a Vuzavaguɗu,<verse eid="PSA 135:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 135:2" />a̱ɗa̱ na yi a̱ga̱nda̱ a kpaꞋa ku Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:2">a ulanga u kpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu.<verse eid="PSA 135:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 135:3" />Cikpai Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:3">adama a na Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:3">vuza kasingai ɗa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 135:3">Cananai vishipa adama a kula ku ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:3">adama a na nannai va u gaꞋan ta̱.<verse eid="PSA 135:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 135:4" />Vuzavaguɗu u zagba ka ta̱ ka̱ci ka̱ ni Yakubu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:4">Isaraila tana wo okpo ta̱ upecu u singai u ni.<verse eid="PSA 135:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 135:5" />Adama a na n yeve ta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:5">Vuzavaguɗu vuza gbayin ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:5">Vuzavaguɗu vu tsu u laꞋa ta̱ a̱ma̱li dem.<verse eid="PSA 135:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 135:6" />Ili i na Vuzavaguɗu u cikalai dem</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:6">i ɗaɗa u ci yaꞋan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:6">ko ɗe gaɗi ko a iɗika,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:6">punu a mala ko a ɗaka vu uga̱vi u mini dem.<verse eid="PSA 135:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 135:7" />A̱yi ɗa u tsu ɗa̱ngusa̱ eleshu a uteku wa aduniyan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:7">u tsu suku ta̱ kutashi m mini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:7">ka̱ta̱ wu utuka̱ n wunla̱i a̱ a̱nu a kuzuwa a̱ ni.<verse eid="PSA 135:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 135:8" />A̱yi ɗa wu unai muku mu ugiti mi iɗika i Masar,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">135:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:29-30">Kut 12:29-30</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:8">muku mu ugiti n uma m mu nnama<verse eid="PSA 135:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 135:9" />U suki iyoci n ili i mereve</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:9">a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka̱ ɗa̱ a Masar</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:9">u FiriꞋauna n agbashi a̱ ni ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 135:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 135:10" />Wu unai uduniyan wa̱ a̱bunda̱i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:10">ɗa wu unai ngono m gbagbaꞋin.<verse eid="PSA 135:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 135:11" />Sihon mogono ma aza a Amoriya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:11">n Ogu, mogono ma Bashan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:11">n tsugono tsu KanaꞋana ra̱ka̱,<verse eid="PSA 135:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 135:12" />ɗa u nekei iɗika i le tsu ili yu uka̱ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:12">ili yu uka̱ni wa aza a Isaraila.<verse eid="PSA 135:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 135:13" />Vuzavaguɗu, kula ku nu ko wannai ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:13">kula ku nu ili kuciɓa i ɗa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:13">tsukaya a kubana a tsukaya.<verse eid="PSA 135:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 135:14" />Adama a na Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:14">wi ta̱ o kuyotsongu uma a̱ ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:14">a na i n unushi ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:14">ka̱ta̱ u sa̱Ꞌa̱ agbashi a̱ ni.<verse eid="PSA 135:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 135:15" />A̱ma̱li a uduniyan wa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:15">azurufa a ɗa n azanariya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:15">a na uma a yaꞋin n ekiye e le.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">135:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 115:4-8">Ishp 115:4-8</ref>; <ref loc="REV 9:20">Ken 9:20</ref></char></note><verse eid="PSA 135:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 135:16" />I ta̱ n una̱, ama a tsu dansa ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:16">i ta̱ n a̱shi, ama e ci ene ba.<verse eid="PSA 135:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 135:17" />I ta̱ n atsuvu, ama a tsu pana ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:17">a ci yinvuka ba.<verse eid="PSA 135:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 135:18" />Aza a na a yaꞋin le i ta̱ o ko okpo ci le</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:18">aza a na e nekei katsura ke le we le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:18">i ta̱ o ko okpo ci le,<verse eid="PSA 135:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 135:19" />Cikpai Vuzavaguɗu kpaꞋa ki Isaraila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:19">cikpai Vuzavaguɗu kpaꞋa ku Haruna.<verse eid="PSA 135:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 135:20" />Cikpai Vuzavaguɗu kpaꞋa ku Levi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:20">a̱ɗa̱ na yi a kupana wovon u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:20">cikpai Vuzavaguɗu.<verse eid="PSA 135:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 135:21" />Una̱singai u ɗa u Vuzavaguɗu a Sihiyona</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:21">a̱yi na wi ida̱shi a Urishelima.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 135:21">Cikpa Vuzavaguɗu.<verse eid="PSA 135:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 135" />
  <chapter number="136" style="c" sid="PSA 136" />
  <para style="s1">Ishipa i kucikpa Ka̱shile MalaꞋimili</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 136:1" />Cikpai Vuzavaguɗu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:1">adama a na a̱yi vuza kasingai ɗa,</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 136:1">
    <char style="tl">Ucigi u ni u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba wi ta̱ lo ko wannai.</char><verse eid="PSA 136:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 136:2" />Cikpai Ka̱shile</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:2">a̱yi na u laꞋi a̱ma̱li dem.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 136:2">
    <char style="tl">Ucigi u ni u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba wi ta̱ lo ko wannai.</char><verse eid="PSA 136:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 136:3" />Cikpai Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:3">a̱yi na u laꞋi a̱ma̱li dem,</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 136:3">
    <char style="tl">Ucigi u ni u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba wi ta̱ lo ko wannai.</char><verse eid="PSA 136:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 136:4" />a̱yi ɗa koci u ci yaꞋan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:4">ili i mereve i gbagbaꞋin,</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 136:4">
    <char style="tl">Ucigi u ni u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba wi ta̱ lo ko wannai.</char><verse eid="PSA 136:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 136:5" />a̱yi na n kuyeve ku ni ɗa u yaꞋin gaɗi,</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 136:5">
    <char style="tl">Ucigi u ni u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba wi ta̱ lo ko wannai.</char><verse eid="PSA 136:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 136:6" />a̱yi na u zuwai aduniyan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:6">a gaɗi vu mini mu uga̱vi,</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 136:6">
    <char style="tl">Ucigi u ni u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba wi ta̱ lo ko wannai.</char><verse eid="PSA 136:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 136:7" />a̱yi na u yaꞋin kutashi ku gbagbaꞋin,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">136:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:16">Ugi 1:16</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 136:7">
    <char style="tl">Ucigi u ni u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba wi ta̱ lo ko wannai.</char><verse eid="PSA 136:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 136:8" />kanna adama a na ka lyaꞋa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:8">tsugono tsu kanna,</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 136:8">
    <char style="tl">Ucigi u ni u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba wi ta̱ lo ko wannai.</char><verse eid="PSA 136:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 136:9" />wotoi n azangata adama a na</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:9">a lyaꞋa tsugono tsu kayin,</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 136:9">
    <char style="tl">Ucigi u ni u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba wi ta̱ lo ko wannai.</char><verse eid="PSA 136:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 136:10" />a̱yi ɗa wu unai muku mu ugiti ma aza a Masar,</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 136:10">
    <char style="tl">Ucigi u ni u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba wi ta̱ lo ko wannai.</char><verse eid="PSA 136:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 136:11" />wu utuka̱i aza a Isaraila a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ke le</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 136:11">
    <char style="tl">Ucigi u ni u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba wi ta̱ lo ko wannai.</char><verse eid="PSA 136:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 136:12" />n kukiye ku utsura n ili i mereve,</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 136:12">
    <char style="tl">Ucigi u ni u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba wi ta̱ lo ko wannai.</char><verse eid="PSA 136:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 136:13" />a̱yi na u pecei mala ma shili ugboku ure,</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 136:13">
    <char style="tl">Ucigi u ni u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba wi ta̱ lo ko wannai.</char><verse eid="PSA 136:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 136:14" />u tonoi n aza a Isaraila a walai e mere ma̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 136:14">
    <char style="tl">Ucigi u ni u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba wi ta̱ lo ko wannai.</char><verse eid="PSA 136:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 136:15" />ama ɗa u niꞋwa̱ta̱ngi FiriꞋauna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:15">n osoji a̱ ni a mala ma shili,</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 136:15">
    <char style="tl">Ucigi u ni u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba wi ta̱ lo ko wannai.</char><verse eid="PSA 136:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 136:16" />a̱yi na u tonoi n uma a̱ ni e meremune,</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 136:16">
    <char style="tl">Ucigi u ni u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba wi ta̱ lo ko wannai.</char><verse eid="PSA 136:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 136:17" />a̱yi na u lapai ngono m gbagbaꞋin,</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 136:17">
    <char style="tl">Ucigi u ni u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba wi ta̱ lo ko wannai.</char><verse eid="PSA 136:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 136:18" />ɗa wu unai ngono m gbagbaꞋin,</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 136:18">
    <char style="tl">Ucigi u ni u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba wi ta̱ lo ko wannai.</char><verse eid="PSA 136:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 136:19" />Sihon, mogono ma aza a Amoriya,</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 136:19">
    <char style="tl">Ucigi u ni u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba wi ta̱ lo ko wannai.</char><verse eid="PSA 136:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 136:20" />n Ogu, mogono ma Bashan,</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 136:20">
    <char style="tl">Ucigi u ni u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba wi ta̱ lo ko wannai.</char><verse eid="PSA 136:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 136:21" />U nekei iɗika i le ci iliyuka̱ni,</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 136:21">
    <char style="tl">Ucigi u ni u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba wi ta̱ lo ko wannai.</char><verse eid="PSA 136:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 136:22" />iliyuka̱ni u kagbashi ka̱ ni Isaraila,</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 136:22">
    <char style="tl">Ucigi u ni u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba wi ta̱ lo ko wannai.</char><verse eid="PSA 136:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 136:23" />a̱yi na u cinukpai n a̱tsu ba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:23">a makyan ma na a lyaꞋi tsu.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 136:23">
    <char style="tl">Ucigi u ni u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba wi ta̱ lo ko wannai.</char><verse eid="PSA 136:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 136:24" />Wi isai tsu e ekiye a Irala i tsu,</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 136:24">
    <char style="tl">Ucigi u ni u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba wi ta̱ lo ko wannai.</char><verse eid="PSA 136:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 136:25" />a̱yi na u ci neke ili i wuma ra̱ka̱ ilikulyaꞋa,</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 136:25">
    <char style="tl">Ucigi u ni u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba wi ta̱ lo ko wannai.</char><verse eid="PSA 136:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 136:26" />Cikpai Ka̱shile ka gaɗi,</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 136:26">
    <char style="tl">Ucigi u ni u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba wi ta̱ lo ko wannai.</char><verse eid="PSA 136:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 136" />
  <chapter number="137" style="c" sid="PSA 137" />
  <para style="s1">Ma̱shi ma aza a Isaraila a iɗika i tsugbashi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 137:1" />A̱kina̱ e nyeneke m Babila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:1">ta ɗe tsu da̱sa̱ngi ci shika̱i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:1">a na ci ciɓai n Sihiyona.<verse eid="PSA 137:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 137:2" />A gaɗi vu a nsaɓu a nɗanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:2">ta ɗe tsu saɓangi omolu u tsu,<verse eid="PSA 137:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 137:3" />adama a na ta ɗe aza a na a̱ ka̱na̱i tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:3">a zuwai tsu ishipa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:3">a danai ci yaꞋan ka le ishipa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 137:3">Aza a na a tsu takacika tsu a danai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:3">ci yaꞋanka le ishipa i ma̱za̱nga̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:3">a danai,&lt;&lt;YaꞋankai tsu vishipa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:3">vi te a̱ ka̱tsa̱ma̱ ki ishipa i Sihiyona.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 137:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 137:4" />Nini ɗai tsa kucanana vishipa vu Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:4">a iɗika yo omoci?<verse eid="PSA 137:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 137:5" />N cinukpa baci n avu Urushelima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:5">yaꞋan kukiye ku usingai ku va̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:5">ku cinukpa n kufuɗa ku ni.<verse eid="PSA 137:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 137:6" />YaꞋan kelentsu ka̱ va̱ ka paɗa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:6">a kalakpani ku una̱ u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:6">ɗa baci n ciɓai n avu ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 137:6">n ciga baci Urushelima</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:6">u laꞋi ili i na ya kuzuwa mu ma̱za̱nga̱ ba.<verse eid="PSA 137:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 137:7" />Vuzavaguɗu, ciɓa n unushi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:7">wa aza a Edom</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:7">a kanna ka na Urishelima u yikpa̱i.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 137:7">Orukpoi a danai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:7">&lt;&lt;A̱ fa̱da̱i, a̱ fa̱da̱i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:7">ali a kubana a̱ kumiꞋi ku ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 137:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 137:8" />Avu Babila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:8">iɗika i munuka.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:8">Vuza vu una̱singai ɗa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:8">vuza na u kuyaꞋanka wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:8">tsu na vu yaꞋankai tsu.<verse eid="PSA 137:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 137:9" />Vuza vu una̱singai ɗa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:9">a̱yi na wu isai nreɓu n nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:9">u ɓasangi le atali.<verse eid="PSA 137:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 137" />
  <chapter number="138" style="c" sid="PSA 138" />
  <para style="d">Vishipa vu Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 138:1" />Vuzavaguɗu, mi ta̱ a kucikpa wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:1">n ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:1">mi ta̱ a kucanana vishipa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:1">n cikpa wu e kelime ka̱ a̱ma̱li.<verse eid="PSA 138:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 138:2" />Mi ta̱ a̱ kuɗa̱ngu a ku inda A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin a̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 138:2">n cikpa kula ku nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:2">adama ucigi u nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:2">u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba m ma̱riki ma̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 138:2">adama a na vu neke ta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:2">kula ku nu n kadanshi ka̱ nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:2">tsugbayin a laꞋi ili dem.<verse eid="PSA 138:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 138:3" />Kanna ka na n ɗekei nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:3">vu ushuku mu ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:3">vu nekei mu utsura u ka̱ɗu n utsura.<verse eid="PSA 138:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 138:4" />Vuzavaguɗu, yaꞋan ngono ma aduniyan ra̱ka̱ n cikpa wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:4">a makyan ma na a panai kadanshi ka̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 138:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 138:5" />YaꞋan a canana ishipa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:5">adama a uye u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:5">adama a na tsugbayin tsu Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:5">tsu gbangam tsu ɗa.<verse eid="PSA 138:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 138:6" />Ko a na wo okpoi Vuzavaguɗu wi ta̱ ɗe gaɗi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:6">u tsu zuwaka ta̱ aza a na o goyoi ka̱ci ke le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:6">ama u tsu yeve ta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:6">aza a ugbamukaci e le daꞋin.<verse eid="PSA 138:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 138:7" />Ko ɗa baci mi a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka atakaci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:7">vi ta̱ e ku ere wuma u va̱.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 138:7">vi shilika̱ n irala i va̱ i na yi a wupa nu mpa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:7">vi tana a ku wawa mu n utsura u nu.<verse eid="PSA 138:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 138:8" />Vuzavaguɗu wi ta̱ a kushatangu kusheshe ku ni wa̱ a̱ va̱.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:8">Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 138:8">ucigi u nu u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:8">wi ta̱ lo ko wannai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:8">Ka̱ta̱ vu ka̱sukpa̱ ulinga we ekiye a̱ nu ba.<verse eid="PSA 138:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 138" />
  <chapter number="139" style="c" sid="PSA 139" />
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: Vishipa vu Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 139:1" />Vuzavaguɗu vu la̱na̱ mu ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:1">kpamu vu yeve ta̱ ko mpa ɗa ya.<verse eid="PSA 139:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 139:2" />Vu yeve ta̱ makyan ma na n da̱sa̱ngi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:2">m makyan ma na n ɗa̱nga̱i</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:2">vu tsu yeve ta̱ kusheshe ku va̱ avu daꞋin.<verse eid="PSA 139:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 139:3" />Vu tsu zuwaka ta̱ n nwalu n va̱ n ivaꞋin i va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:3">vu yeve ta̱ ili i na n ci yaꞋansa.<verse eid="PSA 139:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 139:4" />Vuzavaguɗu, kafu kadanshi ka̱ uta̱ una̱ u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:4">vu yeve ta̱ ɗe kaꞋa dem.<verse eid="PSA 139:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 139:5" />Vu ka̱ra̱Ꞌa̱ mu ta̱ a̱ ubuta̱ dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:5">vu zuwai kukiye ku una̱singai ku nu a kaci ka̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 139:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 139:6" />IcuꞋu i kuyeve ku nanlo adama a̱ va̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:6">ku laꞋa ta̱ utsura u kadanshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:6">ku laꞋa ta̱ utsura u kuyeve ku va̱.<verse eid="PSA 139:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 139:7" />Teɗai n kubana n katsukpa ayinviki a̱ nu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:7">Teɗai n kusuma a kubana e kelime ka̱ nu?<verse eid="PSA 139:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 139:8" />N kumba baci gaɗi ta ɗe vi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:8">n vaku baci a̱ ubuta̱ wa̱ ukpisa̱ vi ta̱ ɗe.<verse eid="PSA 139:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 139:9" />N imkpa baci gaɗi tsu manunu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:9">n lazai a uɓon u kasana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:9">ko m banai n telei a uɓon u ka̱livi,<verse eid="PSA 139:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 139:10" />ko ɗe va kukiye ku nu ki ta̱ o kutono nu mpa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:10">kukiye ku usingai ku nu ki ta̱ e kureme mu mayin.<verse eid="PSA 139:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 139:11" />Ishi baci mi a kufuɗa kudana ka̱yimbi ka pala mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:11">ka̱ta̱ kutashi uka̱ra̱Ꞌi nu mpa ko okpo kayin,<verse eid="PSA 139:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 139:12" />ko ka̱yimbi feu ki o ko okpo ka̱yimbi wa̱ nu ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:12">kayin ki ta̱ an kutashi ku kanna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:12">adama a na ka̱yimbi n kutashi ili i te i ɗa wa̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 139:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 139:13" />Avu ɗa vu yaꞋin ili i ka̱tsuma̱ i va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:13">avu ɗa vu yaꞋin mu a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka̱ a̱na̱ku a̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 139:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 139:14" />N cikpa wu ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:14">adama a tsu na vu yaꞋin mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:14">ili wovon i ɗa n ili mereve.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 139:14">Ulinga u nu ili i mereve i ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:14">n yeve ta̱ n ka nanlo mayin.<verse eid="PSA 139:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 139:15" />Etele a ikyamba a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:15">i usokongi wa̱ a̱ nu ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 139:15">ana a yaꞋin mu usokongi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:15">ana a yaꞋin mu a̱ ka̱yimbi.<verse eid="PSA 139:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 139:16" />Vu ene mu ta̱ kafu a matsa mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:16">ayin a na a zuwakai mu n kuyaꞋan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 139:16">i ta̱ uɗani a katagarda ka̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:16">kafu a̱ gita̱ kuyaꞋan vuza te a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ke le.<verse eid="PSA 139:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 139:17" />Ka̱shile yiɗa̱i a kugisanku</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:17">n kusheshe ku singai ku nu wa̱ va̱.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:17">n yiɗa̱i a kugisanku ka̱bunda̱i ke le.<verse eid="PSA 139:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 139:18" />Mi baci e kukece le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:18">i ta̱ a ku laꞋa kayala a̱bunda̱i.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:18">ko ɗa baci n jimgbai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:18">mi ta̱ koɓolo n avu.<verse eid="PSA 139:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 139:19" />Ka̱shile, ishi baci va̱ a̱ ku ushuku vu una</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:19">aza a gbani-gbani ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:19">ka̱sukpa̱i mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:19">a̱ɗa̱ aza a munuka,<verse eid="PSA 139:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 139:20" />aza a na i a kadanshi ka gbani-gbani adama a̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:20">irala i nu i na yi a kadanshi ka gbani-gbani.<verse eid="PSA 139:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 139:21" />Vuzavaguɗu, n iwan aza a na a iwain nu ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:21">mi kpamu e ke ne unata wa aza a na i a kuyaꞋanka wu ugbamukaci ba.<verse eid="PSA 139:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 139:22" />N iwan le ta̱ n ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ ra̱ka̱-ra̱ka̱.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:22">irala i va̱ i ɗa n iɗika le.<verse eid="PSA 139:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 139:23" />Vuzavaguɗu, la̱na̱ mu vi ta̱ e kuyeve ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:23">kondo mu vi ta̱ e kuyeve kusheshe ku va̱.<verse eid="PSA 139:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 139:24" />La̱na̱ ko mi ta̱ n unushi a wuma u va̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:24">ubuta̱ wi ta̱ lo una n nusakai nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:24">ka̱ta̱ vu tono nu mpa a uye u ko wannai.<verse eid="PSA 139:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 139" />
  <chapter number="140" style="c" sid="PSA 140" />
  <para style="s1">Avasa a̱ kula̱nsa̱ wishi wa aza a gbani-gbani</para>
  <para style="d">Kadanshi a kubana u vuza vu kelime vi ishipa: Vishipa vu Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 140:1" />Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:1">uta̱ka̱ mu e ekiye a aza a gbani-gbani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:1">ere mu e ekiye a aza a na</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:1">a̱ ci ɗa̱ngusa̱ vishili,<verse eid="PSA 140:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 140:2" />aza a na a̱ɗu ele i tukpa n kusheshe ku gbani-gbani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:2">makyan dem a̱ kuɗa̱ngusa̱ vishili.<verse eid="PSA 140:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 140:3" />Elentsu ele an oko o tsukono,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 140:3">kadanshi ka na ka tsu uta̱ una̱ u le</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:3">ki ta̱ an tsukono tsu kagbaji. <char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 140:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 140:4" />Vuzavaguɗu uta̱ka̱ mu e ekiye aza a gbani-gbani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:4">ere mu e ekiye a aza a na a̱ ci ɗa̱ngusa̱ vishili,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:4">aza a na o foɓusoi a varuku mu.<verse eid="PSA 140:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 140:5" />Aza a̱ra̱ɗi azuki mu ayakuru</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:5">a zuwakai mu maza a uye u le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:5">adama a na a̱ ka̱na̱ mu. <char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 140:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 140:6" />Ɗa n danai, Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:6">&lt;&lt;Avu ɗa Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:6">Pana ma̱shi ma̱ va̱, ma̱ kula̱nsa̱ uɓa̱nki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:6">Vuzavaguɗu.<verse eid="PSA 140:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 140:7" />Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:7">kishi ka̱ va̱ ku utsura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:7">a̱yi na wu erei mu m ma̱ra̱ga̱ a kanna ko kuvon.<verse eid="PSA 140:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 140:8" />Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:8">ka̱ta̱ vu neke aza a gbani-gbani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:8">ili i na a cigai ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 140:8">ka̱ta̱ vu ka̱sukpa̱ a̱ ciya̱ ulyaꞋi e kusheshe ku le ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:8">ta lo a kuyaꞋan a̱ra̱ɗi. <char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 140:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 140:9" />Ka̱ta̱ vu ka̱sukpa̱ irala i va̱ i ciya̱ ulyaꞋi ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:9">yaꞋan ka gbani-gbani ka na</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:9">i a kuyaꞋanka mu ko bono a kaci ke le.<verse eid="PSA 140:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 140:10" />YaꞋan a̱ga̱ruwa̱shi akina</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:10">a̱ tsuwa̱nka̱ le aci,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 140:10">yaꞋan a taɗuku le akina</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:10">punu e kpenle ku uga̱vi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:10">ka̱ta̱ o doku ku uta̱ ba.<verse eid="PSA 140:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 140:11" />Ka̱ta̱ aza a̱ kula̱nga̱su a̱ ciya̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:11">katsura a iɗika ya ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 140:11">yaꞋan wunla̱i u gbani-gbani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:11">u tamba aza a na a̱ ci ɗa̱ngusa̱ vishili.<verse eid="PSA 140:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 140:12" />N yeve ta̱ Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:12">wi ta̱ a̱ kuɓa̱nka̱ aza a unambi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:12">ka̱ta̱ kpamu u yaꞋanka aza a yali kasingai.<verse eid="PSA 140:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 140:13" />Mayun aza a̱ ma̱riki</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:13">i ta̱ a kucikpa kula ku nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:13">ka̱ta̱ aza a ukuna u mayun a̱ɗu e le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:13">a̱ da̱sa̱ngu e kelime ka̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 140:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 140" />
  <chapter number="141" style="c" sid="PSA 141" />
  <para style="d">Vishipa vu Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 141:1" />Vuzavaguɗu, n ɗeke wu ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:1">ta̱wa̱ gogoꞋo vu ɓa̱nka̱ mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:1">pana ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ka̱ va̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:1">a makyan ma na baci n yaꞋin meɗevile.<verse eid="PSA 141:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 141:2" />YaꞋan avasa a̱ va̱ okpo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:2">ci ili i ma̱gula̱ni wa̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:2">uɗa̱ngushi we ekiye u va̱ tsa alyuka a̱ kulivi.<verse eid="PSA 141:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 141:3" />Vuzavaguɗu, zuwa mu n ka̱na̱ una̱ u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:3">vu la̱na̱ nla̱ba̱ mu una̱ n va̱.<verse eid="PSA 141:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 141:4" />Ka̱ta̱ vu ka̱sukpa̱ ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ ka yaꞋan mali,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:4">ma ka gbani-gbani ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:4">ko n gbaɓa kaci a ka gbani-gbani ke le ba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 141:4">vu zuwa mu n yongo n ele a̱ ka̱ɗiva̱ ke le ba.<verse eid="PSA 141:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 141:5" />YaꞋan vuza vu usuɓi u ɓarangu mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:5">u dansuka mu n kasingai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:5">wi ta̱ o ku okpo mu a danshi a putala ta̱ maniꞋin a kaci ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:5">adama a na makyan dem mi ta̱ avasa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:5">adama a ka gbani-gbani.<verse eid="PSA 141:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 141:6" />A ayin a na baci a ɓasangi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:6">azafada e le a katali,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:6">uma a gbani-gbani i ta̱ e kuyeve</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:6">a na kadanshi ka̱ va̱ mayun ɗa.<verse eid="PSA 141:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 141:7" />Tsu katali ka na vuma u ɓosoi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:7">ɗa u wacuwai kaꞋa a iɗika,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:7">ta a̱ kutsuwa̱n etele e le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:7">nannai a̱ una̱ u kasaun.<verse eid="PSA 141:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 141:8" />Ama n zuwa ta̱ a̱shi a̱ va̱ wa̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:8">Vuzavaguɗu MalaꞋimili,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:8">wa̱ nu ɗa n la̱nsa̱i ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:8">ka̱ta̱ vu ka̱sukpa̱ mu n takacika ba.<verse eid="PSA 141:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 141:9" />Ere mu a maza ma na a zuwakai mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:9">a maza ma na aza a gbani-gbani azuki.<verse eid="PSA 141:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 141:10" />Zuwa uma a gbani-gbani a̱ yikpa̱ a maza me le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:10">ama yaꞋan mpa n wala m ma̱ta̱na̱.<verse eid="PSA 141:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 141" />
  <chapter number="142" style="c" sid="PSA 142" />
  <para style="d">VicuꞋu vu tsuwaꞋi tsu Dawuda. Avasa a Dawuda a makyan ma na wi a kaɓatsu.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 142:1" />Vuzavaguɗu, wa̱ nu ɗa n shika̱i ka̱u,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:1">n ɗa̱ngusa̱i ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ka̱ va̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:1">u Vuzavaguɗu u pana asuvayali a̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 142:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 142:2" />M banka ta̱ m mavura ma̱ va̱ wa̱ ni ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:2">n danai ni atakaci a̱ va̱.<verse eid="PSA 142:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 142:3" />Ana utsura u va̱ u kotsoi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:3">avu ɗa vu yevei uye u va̱.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 142:3">A uye u na mi a nwalu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:3">irala i va̱ i zuwakai mu maza usokongi.<verse eid="PSA 142:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 142:4" />La̱na̱ku usingai u va̱ ka̱ta̱ vu ene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:4">ko vuza u zuwaka nu mpa ba.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:4">mi n ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:4">ko vuza u la̱na̱ mu ba.<verse eid="PSA 142:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 142:5" />Vuzavaguɗu, n shika̱ ta̱ wa̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:5">n danai, &lt;&lt;Avu ɗa ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:5">upecu u va̱ a iɗika ya aza a wuma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 142:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 142:6" />Pana ma̱shi ma̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:6">adama a na mi ta̱ a kutakpa asuvu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 142:6">Isa mu ekiye aza a na i a kutakacika mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:6">adama a na a laꞋa mu ta̱ utsura.<verse eid="PSA 142:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 142:7" />Uta̱ka̱ mu a̱ kunu ku ugbashi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:7">adama a na n cikpa kula ku nu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 142:7">Aza a usuɓi i ta̱ a̱ kuka̱ra̱Ꞌa̱ mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:7">adama a na vi ta̱ a kuyaꞋanka mu kasingai ka̱u.<verse eid="PSA 142:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 142" />
  <chapter number="143" style="c" sid="PSA 143" />
  <para style="d">Vishipa vu Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 143:1" />Vuzavaguɗu, pana avasa a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:1">pana ma̱shi ma asuvayali a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:1">avu vuza vu usuɓi ɗa n vuza vu ma̱riki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:1">adama a nannai ushuku mu.<verse eid="PSA 143:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 143:2" />Ka̱ta̱ vu yaꞋanka kagbashi ka̱ nu afada ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:2">adama a na ko vuza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:2">wi lo babu u nushi wa̱ nu ba.<verse eid="PSA 143:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 143:3" />Vurala vu va̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:3">vu guva mu ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:3">u ɓasangi mu a iɗika,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 143:3">u zuwai mu ida̱shi a̱ ka̱yimbi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:3">tsa aza a na a̱ kuwa̱i ɗe m megeshe.<verse eid="PSA 143:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 143:4" />Adama a nannai mi ta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:4">a ukuna u kutakpa ka̱ɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:4">mi ta̱ a una̱mgbuka̱tsuma̱ ka̱u.<verse eid="PSA 143:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 143:5" />N ciɓa ta̱ n ayin a cau,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:5">n ka̱na̱i kusheshe a ili i na vu yaꞋin ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:5">n ciɓa ta̱ n ulinga we ekiye u nu ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 143:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 143:6" />N ɗa̱ngusa̱ ta̱ ekiye a̱ va̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:6">wa̱ nu a kavasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:6">mi ta̱ a kakuli ka̱ nu ci iɗika i na i cigai mini. <char style="qs">Kuvuka</char><verse eid="PSA 143:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 143:7" />Vuzavaguɗu, ushuku mu gogoꞋo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:7">mi ta̱ ɗevu n kutakpa asuvu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:7">ka̱ta̱ vu sokongu mu a̱shi a̱ nu ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:7">ka̱ ta̱ mo okpo a na aza na a̱ kuwa̱i ɗe ba.<verse eid="PSA 143:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 143:8" />Zuwa mu n ciɓa n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:8">ucigi u nu u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:8">adama a na n zuwa ta̱ katsura wa̱ nu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 143:8">Yotsongu mu uye u na n kutono</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:8">n neke ta̱ wuma u va̱ wa̱ nu.<verse eid="PSA 143:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 143:9" />Vuzavaguɗu, isa mu ekiye a irala i va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:9">n ta̱wa̱ ta̱ wa̱ nu kula̱nsa̱ ubuta̱ sheɗeku.<verse eid="PSA 143:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 143:10" />PiꞋisaka mu n tono kusheshe ku nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:10">yaꞋan ayinviki a singai a̱ nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:10">o tono nu mpa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:10">a uye u na wi n a̱ga̱vushi ba.<verse eid="PSA 143:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 143:11" />Vuzavaguɗu, adama a kula ku nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:11">ere wuma u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 143:11">a ukuna wu usuɓi nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:11">utuka̱ wuma u va̱ atakaci.<verse eid="PSA 143:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 143:12" />Adama a ucigi u nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:12">u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:12">una irala i va̱ ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:12">adama a na mpa kagbashi ka̱ nu ka a.<verse eid="PSA 143:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 143" />
  <chapter number="144" style="c" sid="PSA 144" />
  <para style="d">Vishipa vu Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 144:1" />Ucikpi u Vuzavaguɗu a̱yi na wi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:1">katali ke kusheɗeku ka̱ va̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:1">u piꞋisaka mu ta̱ vishili</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:1">ɗa u foɓusoi mu adama o kuvon,<verse eid="PSA 144:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 144:2" />a̱yi ɗa Ka̱shile macigi ma̱ va̱ n ke ere ka̱ va̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:2">mashilya ma̱ va̱ n kawawi ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:2">ma̱ra̱ga̱ ma̱ va̱ ma na</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:2">mi a̱ kula̱nsa̱ ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku wa̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:2">a̱yi ɗa u zuwai uduniyan o tsugono tsu va̱.<verse eid="PSA 144:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 144:3" />Vuzavaguɗu, yayi vuma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:3">ali ɗa vi a̱ kula̱na̱ yi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:3">Maku ma vuma, ali ɗa vi e kusheshe adama a̱ ni?<verse eid="PSA 144:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 144:4" />Vuma wi ta̱ tsu ayinviki</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:4">ayin a̱ ni a kulaza tsu kulu.<verse eid="PSA 144:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 144:5" />Vuzavaguɗu ɓa̱yuwa̱ gaɗi ka̱ta̱ vu cipa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:5">saꞋawa nsansa i ta̱ a kuyaꞋan ka̱nga̱.<verse eid="PSA 144:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 144:6" />Zuwa kutashi ku ulaɗi u nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:6">ku wacuwa irala i nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:6">taku ayaꞋa a̱ nu vu zuwa le a wacuwa n ilaɗi.<verse eid="PSA 144:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 144:7" />Ba̱rukpa̱ kukiye ku nu ɗe gaɗi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:7">vu uta̱ka̱ mu a̱ mini u uga̱vi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:7">vu isa mu e ekiye omoci.<verse eid="PSA 144:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 144:8" />Aza a na una̱ u le</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:8">u tsu dansa ukuna u mayun ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:8">a ci yaꞋan ta̱ akucina aꞋuwa. <verse eid="PSA 144:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 144:9" />Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱ mi ta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:9">a kucanana vishipa vu savu wa̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:9">n umolu u aꞋin kupa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:9">mi ta̱ a kucanana ka wu ishipa i kucikpa,<verse eid="PSA 144:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 144:10" />avu na vu ci neke ngono ulyaꞋi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:10">vuza na u wawai kagbashi ka̱ ni Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:10">o kotokobi ka munuka.<verse eid="PSA 144:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 144:11" />Uta̱ka̱ mu, vi isa mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:11">e ekiye o omoci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:11">ele na a ci yaꞋan kucina aꞋuwa.<verse eid="PSA 144:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 144:12" />Zuwa muku mo olobo n tsu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:12">okpo tsu nɗanga n na</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:12">mi o kugbonguro gogoꞋo lo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 144:12">muku mu nkere n tsu mo okpo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:12">tsa ashamkpatsu a na a yaꞋin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:12">adama e kefeku ko mogono,<verse eid="PSA 144:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 144:13" />Zuwa mpon n tsu n shana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:13">n ili ya ashina ra̱ka̱.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 144:13">Zuwa nkyon n tsu n yimkpa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:13">ushiga a̱ a̱kpa̱n-a̱kpa̱n a shana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:13">a̱ ubuta̱ u kaguɓa u tsu.<verse eid="PSA 144:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 144:14" />Zuwa anaka a̱ tsu a matsa n a̱bunda̱i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:14">ka̱ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ tsuwa̱n le ko a̱ puwa̱nka̱ ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:14">ka̱ta̱ a pana ma̱shi ma̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:14">una̱mgbuka̱tsuma̱ wa̱ tsu ba.<verse eid="PSA 144:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 144:15" />Aza a una̱singai a ɗa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:15">ele na a̱ ciya̱i ka nampa ka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:15">aza a una̱singai a ɗa uma a na Ka̱shile ke le kaꞋa Vuzavaguɗu.<verse eid="PSA 144:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 144" />
  <chapter number="145" style="c" sid="PSA 145" />
  <para style="d">Vishipa vu kucikpa vu Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 145:1" />Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱ mogono mi ta̱ a kucikpa tsugbayin tsu nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:1">mi ta̱ a kucikpa kula ku nu ko wannai.<verse eid="PSA 145:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 145:2" />Kanna lakam mi ta̱ a kucikpa wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:2">ka̱ta̱ n cikpa kula ku nu ko wannai.<verse eid="PSA 145:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 145:3" />Vuzavaguɗu vuzagbayin ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:3">mayun ɗa u yotsoi a cikpa yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:3">tsugbayin ci ni tsu laꞋa ta̱ utsura u kuyeve.<verse eid="PSA 145:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 145:4" />Tsukaya a kubana a tsukaya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:4">i ta̱ a kucikpa ili i na vi yaꞋin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:4">ka̱ta̱ a dansa ili i gbagbaꞋin i na vi yaꞋin.<verse eid="PSA 145:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 145:5" />Uma i ta̱ a kudansa ukuna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:5">wu ucikpi u tsugbayin tsu nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:5">mpa kpamu mi ta̱ e kusheshe a ukuna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:5">wi ili i mereve i na vi yaꞋin.<verse eid="PSA 145:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 145:6" />I ta̱ a kudansa ukuna wu ulinga u gbagbaꞋin u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:6">mi ta̱ kpamu e kuneke arabali a tsugbayin tsu nu.<verse eid="PSA 145:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 145:7" />I ta̱ a kudansa ukuna u tsugbayin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:7">n kasingai ka̱ nu ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:7">ka̱ta̱ a canana ishipa a ukuna wu usuɓi u nu.<verse eid="PSA 145:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 145:8" />Vuzavaguɗu vuza kasingai ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:8">vuza va asuvayali,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:8">u ci yaꞋan wupa gogoꞋo ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:8">n ucigi u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba.<verse eid="PSA 145:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 145:9" />Vuzavaguɗu vuza kasingai ɗa a uma ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:9">u tsu sa̱Ꞌa̱ ta̱ ili i na u yaꞋin ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 145:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 145:10" />Vuzavaguɗu, ili i na vu yaꞋin ra̱ka̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:10">yi ta̱ a kucikpa wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:10">uma a̱ nu kpamu ra̱ka̱ i ta̱ a kucikpa wu.<verse eid="PSA 145:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 145:11" />I ta̱ a kusala tsugbayin tsu tsugono tsu nu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:11">ka̱ta̱ a dansa ukuna wu utsura u nu,<verse eid="PSA 145:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 145:12" />adama a na muku n vuma ra̱ka̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:12">e yeve ulinga ugbayin u nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:12">n ucikpi u tsugbayin u tsugono tsu nu.<verse eid="PSA 145:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 145:13" />Tsugono tsu nu tsu ko wannai tsu ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:13">avu mogono maꞋa tsukaya a kubana a tsukaya.<verse eid="PSA 145:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 145:14" />Vuzavaguɗu, u tsu keɗe ta̱ aza a na i a̱ kuyikpa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:14">u tsu ɗa̱ngusa̱ ta̱ aza a na a̱ yikpa̱i.<verse eid="PSA 145:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 145:15" />A̱shi a uma ra̱ka̱ i ta̱ wa̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:15">vu ci neke le ta̱ ilikulyaꞋa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:15">a makyan ma na ma untsai.<verse eid="PSA 145:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 145:16" />Vu tsu neke le ta̱ ili n a̱bunda̱i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:16">ili i na a cigai dem.<verse eid="PSA 145:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 145:17" />Vuzavaguɗu vuza vu usuɓi ɗa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:17">a̱ uye u ni ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:17">vuza vu ma̱riki kpamu a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka ulinga u ni ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 145:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 145:18" />Vuzavaguɗu wi ta̱ ɗevu n aza a na e ɗekei ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:18">aza a na e ɗekei ni n ka̱ɗu n ke te.<verse eid="PSA 145:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 145:19" />U tsu neke ta̱ aza a na</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:19">i a kupana wovon u ni ili i na a cigai ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:19">u tsu pana ta̱ ma̱shi me le, ka̱ta̱ u wawa le.<verse eid="PSA 145:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 145:20" />Vuzavaguɗu u tsu ere ta̱ aza a na a cigai ni ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:20">ama u tsu una ta̱ aza a gbani-gbani ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 145:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 145:21" />Vuzavaguɗu, ayin tutu mi ta̱ a kucikpa wu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:21">yaꞋan uma ra̱ka̱ a cikpa kula ku ciɗa ku ni ko wannai.<verse eid="PSA 145:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 145" />
  <chapter number="146" style="c" sid="PSA 146" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 146:1" />Cikpa Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:1">cikpa Vuzavaguɗu, wuma u va̱.<verse eid="PSA 146:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 146:2" />Mi ta̱ a ku cikpa Vuzavaguɗu ayin a wuma u va̱ ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:2">Mi ta̱ a kucanana vishipa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:2">vu kucikpa Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱ ali mi baci n wuma.<verse eid="PSA 146:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 146:3" />Ka̱ta̱ vu zuwa katsura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:3">wa aza o tsugono ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:3">ko u vuma vuza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:3">wi a kufuɗa ku wawa wu ba.<verse eid="PSA 146:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 146:4" />Ayin ana baci a̱ kuwa̱i</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:4">ka̱ta̱ o bono a iɗika,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:4">kusheshe ku le ko okpo ta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:4">ili i gbani a kanna ka nanlo.<verse eid="PSA 146:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 146:5" />Vuza vu una̱singai ɗa vuza na</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:5">Ka̱shile ka Yakubu kaꞋa ka̱ɓa̱nki ka̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:5">vuza na u keɗei a̱pa̱Ꞌa̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:5">u Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka̱ ni.<verse eid="PSA 146:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 146:6" />Vuza na u yaꞋin gaɗi n aduniyan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:6">n kuyene n ili i na yi punu dem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:6">a̱yi na u tsu ka̱na̱ ma̱riki ma̱ ni ko wannai.<verse eid="PSA 146:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 146:7" />U tsu kiɗa ta̱ afada e mejege wa aza a na o doroi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:7">u ci neke ta̱ ilikulyaꞋa wa aza a kambulu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:7">Vuzavaguɗu u tsu uta̱ka̱ ta̱ aza a ugbashi.<verse eid="PSA 146:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 146:8" />Vuzavaguɗu u tsu zuwa ta̱ a̱yimba̱ ene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:8">Vuzavaguɗu u tsu ɗa̱ngusa̱ ta̱ aza a na o doroi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:8">Vuzavaguɗu wi ta̱ a kuciga aza a usuɓi.<verse eid="PSA 146:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 146:9" />Vuzavaguɗu u tsu ere ta̱ omoci</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:9">u tsu la̱na̱ ta̱ mkpaꞋan n agapa a̱ma̱ci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:9">ama u tsu la̱nga̱sa̱ ta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:9">ukuna wa aza a gbani-gbani.<verse eid="PSA 146:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 146:10" />Vuzavaguɗu wi ta̱ a kulyaꞋa tsugono ko wannai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:10">Avu Sihiyona, Ka̱shile ka̱ nu ki ta̱ a kulyaꞋa tsugono</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:10">tsukaya a kubana a tsukaya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 146:10">Cikpai Vuzavaguɗu.<verse eid="PSA 146:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 146" />
  <chapter number="147" style="c" sid="PSA 147" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 147:1" />Cikpai Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:1">adama a na u gaꞋan ta̱ a canana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:1">vishipa vu ucikpi u Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:1">ili i uyoꞋo i ɗa kpamu derere ɗa a cikpa yi.<verse eid="PSA 147:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 147:2" />Vuzavaguɗu ɗa u maꞋi Urushelima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:2">ɗa u ɓolongi aza a Isaraila a na</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:2">ishi a tsugbashi a iɗika i yoku,<verse eid="PSA 147:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 147:3" />U tsu neke ta̱ kadanshi wa aza a na a takpai a̱ɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:3">tsa aza na i n untsu ka̱ta̱ a shiya le.<verse eid="PSA 147:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 147:4" />U tsu kece ta̱ ka̱bunda̱i ka azangata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:4">u tsu ɗeke le ta̱ n ula ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 147:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 147:5" />Vuzavaguɗu vu tsu vuza gbayin ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:5">vuza vu utsura ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:5">kuyeve ku ni ki kugisanku ba.<verse eid="PSA 147:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 147:6" />U tsu ɗa̱ngusa̱ ta̱ aza a na o doroi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:6">ama u tsu cipa̱ka̱ ta̱ aza a gbani-gbani a iɗika.<verse eid="PSA 147:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 147:7" />Cananai vishipa vu kuneke ucikpi u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:7">cikpai Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu n umolu.<verse eid="PSA 147:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 147:8" />U pala ta̱ gaɗi n eleshu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:8">u yoꞋokoi iɗika mini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:8">ɗa kpamu u zuwai mita̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:8">mo gbonguroi a kaginda.<verse eid="PSA 147:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 147:9" />U tsu neke ta̱ nnama ijanu i le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:9">m muku ma agawun a makyan ma na a̱ shika̱i.<verse eid="PSA 147:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 147:10" />U tsu zuwa katsura wo odoku a utsura ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:10">ko u yaꞋan ma̱za̱nga̱ n utsura u vuma.<verse eid="PSA 147:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 147:11" />Vuzavaguɗu u tsu pana ta̱ u yoꞋo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:11">wa aza na i a kupana wovon u ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:11">aza a na e keɗei a̱pa̱Ꞌa̱ e le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:11">a ucigi u ni u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba.<verse eid="PSA 147:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 147:12" />Cikpa Vuzavaguɗu, avu Urishelima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:12">cikpa Ka̱shile ka̱ nu, avu Sihiyona.<verse eid="PSA 147:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 147:13" />A̱yi ɗa wi a ku inda utsutsu u nu mayin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:13">u tsu zuwaka ta̱ uma a na i punu una̱singai.<verse eid="PSA 147:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 147:14" />U tsu zuwa ta̱ kureꞋe ki iɗika i nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:14">kuyongo m ma̱ta̱na̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:14">u tsu lyaꞋatangu wu ta̱ n alkama vu singai.<verse eid="PSA 147:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 147:15" />U tsu suku ta̱ n kadanshi ka̱ ni aduniyan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:15">gogoꞋo lo ɗa kadanshi ka̱ ni ka tsu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:15">bana a̱ ubuta̱ u na a̱ suki kaꞋa.<verse eid="PSA 147:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 147:16" />U tsu suku ta̱ egele a pala iɗika tsu tsugbere tsu a̱ri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:16">u tsu vishangu ta̱ a ɗa an kokomo.<verse eid="PSA 147:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 147:17" />U tsu suku ta̱ m mini ma atali,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:17">tsu atali a wawaꞋa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:17">yayi u kufuɗa kugbama asuvu n uta̱ni u ni.<verse eid="PSA 147:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 147:18" />Utsu neke ta̱ kpamu kadanshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:18">ka̱ta̱ atali a, a̱ niꞋwa̱n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:18">utsu suku ta̱ n wunla̱i, ka̱ta̱ mini me yene.<verse eid="PSA 147:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 147:19" />U tsu suku ta̱ n kadanshi ka̱ ni u Yakubu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:19">u tsu yotsongu ta̱ ili i kutono i ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:19">n afada a̱ ni wa aza a Isaraila.<verse eid="PSA 147:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 147:20" />U yaꞋanka uduniyan u yoku ili i nanlo ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:20">adama a na e yeve wila̱ u ni ba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 147:20">Cikpai Vuzavaguɗu.<verse eid="PSA 147:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 147" />
  <chapter number="148" style="c" sid="PSA 148" />
  <para style="s1">YaꞋan ili i na Ka̱shile ka yaꞋin i cikpa yi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 148:1" />Cikpai Vuzavaguɗu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:1">Cikpai Vuzavaguɗu na ɗe gaɗi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:1">cikpai ni a̱ɗa̱ na yi ɗe a̱da̱nga̱shile.<verse eid="PSA 148:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 148:2" />Cikpai ni a̱ɗa̱ alingata a̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:2">cikpai ni ili i wuma i gaɗi.<verse eid="PSA 148:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 148:3" />Cikpai ni, kanna n wotoi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:3">cikpai ni a̱ɗa̱ azangata a kutashi ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="PSA 148:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 148:4" />Cikpai ni, a̱ɗa̱ gaɗi a̱da̱nga̱shile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:4">Cikpai ni, a̱ɗa̱ mini ma gaɗi a̱da̱nga̱shile.<verse eid="PSA 148:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 148:5" />YaꞋan a cikpa kula ku Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:5">tsu na u dansai, ta ka yaꞋin nannai.<verse eid="PSA 148:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 148:6" />N kadanshi ka̱ ni ɗa a zuwai le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:6">a̱ ubuta̱ u le ko wannai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:6">u nekei le kadanshi ka na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:6">ka̱ kupuwa̱nka̱ ba.<verse eid="PSA 148:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 148:7" />Cikpai Vuzavaguɗu a aduniyan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:7">a̱ɗa̱ oroꞋo a mala n ili i na yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:7">a mala mu uga̱vi,<verse eid="PSA 148:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 148:8" />ulaɗi, m mini ma atali,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:8">egele n eleshu, n wunla̱i wu utsura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:8">u na wi o kutono kadanshi ka̱ ni,<verse eid="PSA 148:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 148:9" />nsasan n aginda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:9">nɗanga mu umaci nu nɗanga n sida ra̱ka̱,<verse eid="PSA 148:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 148:10" />nnama n kakamba nu m kpaꞋa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:10">ili i wuma i na yi o kurono a̱tsuma̱ nu nnunu,<verse eid="PSA 148:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 148:11" />ngono ma aduniyan n uduniyan ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:11">a̱ɗa̱ nkoshi m gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:11">n aza afada aduniyan ra̱ka̱,<verse eid="PSA 148:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 148:12" />muku mo olobo nu nkere n a̱ma̱ci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:12">nkoshi m muku.<verse eid="PSA 148:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 148:13" />YaꞋan ra̱ka̱ vule a cikpa kula ku Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:13">adama a na kula ku ni ku ɗa koci ku ciya̱i ucikpi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:13">tsugbayin ci ni tsu laꞋa ta̱ tsa aduniyan n tsu gaɗi.<verse eid="PSA 148:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 148:14" />U zuwai mogono ma utsura adama a uma a̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:14">adama a na uma a na i a kuciga yi ra̱ka̱ a cikpa yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:14">uma Isaraila, aza a na i ɗevu n a̱yi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 148:14">Cikpai Vuzavaguɗu.<verse eid="PSA 148:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 148" />
  <chapter number="149" style="c" sid="PSA 149" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 149:1" />Cikpai Vuzavaguɗu, cananai vishipa vu savu u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:1">cikpai ni o koɓolo ka uma a̱ ma̱riki.<verse eid="PSA 149:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 149:2" />YaꞋan aza Isaraila a yaꞋan ma̱za̱nga̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:2">n vuza na u yaꞋin le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:2">yaꞋan aza a Sihiyona a yaꞋan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:2">ma̱za̱nga̱ m mogono me le.<verse eid="PSA 149:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 149:3" />YaꞋan a cikpa kula ku ni n kujeꞋe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:3">a waꞋa umolu m medelemishipa,<verse eid="PSA 149:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 149:4" />Vuzavaguɗu wi ta̱ a kupana uyoꞋo u uma a̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:4">u ci neke ta̱ aza a na o goyoi ka̱ci ke le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:4">tsugbayin n ulyaꞋi.<verse eid="PSA 149:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 149:5" />YaꞋan uma a̱ ma̱riki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:5">a yaꞋan ma̱za̱nga̱ adama a tsugbayin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:5">tsu na u nekei le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:5">a canana vishipa vu ma̱zanga̱ a iꞋuwa i le.<verse eid="PSA 149:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 149:6" />YaꞋan ucikpi u Ka̱shile u yongo a̱ una̱ u le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:6">n kotokobi ka una̱ ure ekiye e le,<verse eid="PSA 149:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 149:7" />adama a na a tsupa ili i na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:7">uduniyan u yaꞋankai le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:7">ka̱ta̱ kpamu a takacika uma,<verse eid="PSA 149:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 149:8" />ka̱ta̱ a shiya ngono n ikani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:8">aza a gbagbaꞋin e le n ikani yi iyum,<verse eid="PSA 149:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 149:9" />adama a na a yaꞋan afada tsu na wi uɗani.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:9">Na ɗa tsugbayin tsu uma a̱ ma̱riki a̱ ni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 149:9">Cikpai Vuzavaguɗu.<verse eid="PSA 149:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 149" />
  <chapter number="150" style="c" sid="PSA 150" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 150:1" />Cikpai Vuzavaguɗu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 150:1">Cikpai Ka̱shile a̱ ubuta̱ u ciɗa u ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 150:1">cikpai utsura u ni ɗe gaɗi, a̱ ubuta̱ wi ida̱shi i ni.<verse eid="PSA 150:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 150:2" />Cikpai ni adama</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 150:2">a ili i gbagbaꞋin i na u yaꞋin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 150:2">cikpai ni adama a tsugbayin tsa̱ a̱bunda̱i ci ni.<verse eid="PSA 150:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 150:3" />Cikpai ni n ciliki ci ishari,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 150:3">cikpai ni n ugogi n umolu.<verse eid="PSA 150:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 150:4" />Cikpai ni n agundari n kujeꞋe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 150:4">cikpai ni n aꞋin a umolu n igbala.<verse eid="PSA 150:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 150:5" />Cikpai ni n ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ka̱ ma̱ka̱nla̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 150:5">cikpai ni nu nka̱nla̱ m mashi ka̱u.<verse eid="PSA 150:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 150:6" />YaꞋan ili ya ayinviki ra̱ka̱ i cikpa Vuzavaguɗu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 150:6">Cikpai Vuzavaguɗu.<verse eid="PSA 150:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 150" />
</usx>